window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2401,"title":"Chapter 2401 What is This? Who Created It?","paragraphs":["The eyes of the Scholarly Sage had a unique, intimidating effect on certain Immortals. Back in the day, when competing for the position of the Wielder of the Will, the Sage had practically dominated the powerful beings from countless realms and earned the title of the strongest in the world.","Among the many powerful beings who had faced his might, quite a few had witnessed the terrifying power of the Sage's twin pupils that left them with psychological scars. Just like King Kun, who, after being struck by this familiar icy light, they had all exhibited an exaggerated reaction.","Unfortunately, Song Shuhang's experiment had failed. Even if he were to implant the Eyes into the eye sockets of an Immortal-level giant's skeleton, it wouldn't be able to unleash its original effect.","Top-tier Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals who had transcended their own 'Dao' were still immune to expert appraisal techniques.","What a missed opportunity it was!","If the experiment had succeeded, Pavilion Master Chu, with her unique hairstyle, the Scholarly Sage's Eyes, the Hair Thrust, and the Scarlet Heaven Sword's Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique, would have been able to take on numerous formidable adversaries.","However, Song Shuhang chose not to retrieve the Scholarly Sage's Eyes.","The expert appraisal technique was just a minor function of the Scholarly Sage. Its true utility went far beyond this simple instructional skill.","Under Song Shuhang's full control, the Scholarly Sage's Eyes began to cooperate with the Beast God White Bone Giant in battle. Under the gaze of the Sage, King Kun's combat data was laid bare!","Inside the giant skeleton, Immortal Fairy White Bones felt her eyes suddenly being refreshed. It was as if she had applied eye drops to relieve dryness.","Immediately afterward, a wealth of battle information appeared before her eyes. She could see which parts of King Kun's body were vulnerable to the next hammer strike, the optimal positions for attacking, the strength and angle of the attack, and more.","The Scholarly Sage's Eyes guided her step by step in combat.","Moreover, these data were not static. As King Kun shifted his posture, the information was constantly updated in real-time.","It was astonishing!","Immortal Fairy White Bones had never imagined that battles could be conducted with such precision.","At that moment, King Kun was still in shock.","Although the Expert Appraisal Technique had no effect on him, the appearance of the Scholarly Sage's Eyes had unsettled him. King Kun had challenged the Scholarly Sage in the past and seemed to have been traumatized by the experience.","Naturally, Immortal Fairy White Bones wouldn't let this golden opportunity slip through her fingers.","With the assistance of the Scholarly Sage's Eyes, she piloted the mecha of bone and charged forward. The Hammer of Withering Death in her hand was hurled from a distance. Then, she gripped the hammer with both hands and struck King Kun's abdomen from the right.","King Kun had finally managed to suppress the trauma in his heart and forcibly willed himself back into the battle. However, in the end, the Hammer of Withering Death descended from the heavens and struck his back. The Withering Death energy within it was like a malignant infection that invaded his body and caused his already parched skin to become even more desiccated.","Subsequently, Immortal Fairy White Bones directed the Beast God White Bone Giant to charge to King Kun's side and deliver a powerful blow to his abdomen.","The massive hammer, which had expanded in size, covered King Kun's entire chest and abdomen!","\"Ah ~\" Kun King felt an intense churning in his abdomen and the cracking of his sternum. The pain was excruciating.","However, this level of pain still fell within his threshold.","King Kun tightly gripped his ruler and retaliated.","The ruler struck the breastplate of the Beast God White Bone Giant, but it only generated sparks.","The Beast God White Bone Giant's chestplate appeared to have a protective shield, and when the ruler struck it, the force was deflected.","King Kun was at a loss.","This defensive capability did not resemble that of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender's magical treasure at all. The shield-like force field on it was particularly unique.","King Kun attempted to analyze the structure of this force field shield. However, as he was about to begin his analysis, he felt his head throbbing and nearly exploding.","What in the world was this thing? Who had created it? Was there a way out of this for King Kun?","Instinctively, King Kun raised his head and gazed at the Beast God White Bone Giant.","As he looked up, he saw the gigantic skull peering down at him. The Scholarly Sage's Eyes emitted an icy light from behind the mask that exerted immense pressure on him.","There was no way to continue this battle!","\"Ho ~ hoho!\" Immortal Fairy White Bones couldn't contain her delight.","Today, she intended to utterly defeat King Kun.","The Beast God White Bone Giant swung its hammers once more, and the sound of thunder and wind accompanied their movements.","King Kun's expression darkened.","He realized that he couldn't defeat Immortal Fairy White Bones today. The individual who had secretly aided Immortal Fairy White Bones had too many tricks up his sleeve, and he was exceptionally cunning.","He had a technique on the level of a force field shield, yet he had deceptively presented the armor as an Eighth Stage magical treasure.","Furthermore, even the Scholarly Sage's Eyes were under his control.","What was the point of continuing the battle?","With this enigmatic figure lurking in the shadows, if King Kun continued to fight Immortal Fairy White Bones, he might meet his demise.","Since he couldn't continue battling Immortal Fairy White Bones, he decided to flee.","Fortunately, he knew that neither Immortal Fairy White Bones nor the hidden figure could stop him from leaving.","Whoosh. A pair of wings suddenly sprouted from King Kun's back.","Immortal Fairy White Bones swung the hammer of the Beast God White Bone Giant, but it struck empty air.","King Kun unfurled his wings and transformed into a roc.","With a graceful flap of his purple grape-colored wings, King Kun's figure swiftly disappeared into the distance and vanished in the blink of an eye.","\"Pah, coward,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones muttered.","She waved her hand and dispelled the effects of the Withering and Decaying laws. She stood silently in the void.","She was waiting.","She was waiting for Song to come out.","...","...","Beneath the sea's surface, Pavilion Master Chu's hair swayed gently as she collected the spoils of war. After King Kun was repeatedly pummeled, he had shed numerous scales.","These were the scales of an Immortal-level King Kun. They were prime materials for refining artifacts in the myriad worlds.","It was a pity that Immortal Fairy White Bones hadn't managed to sever a portion of","King Kun's flesh, or they could have enjoyed Kun meat hotpot tonight.","Pavilion Master Chu's hair gathered all the scales, then happily looked toward Immortal Fairy White Bones in the void.","Pavilion Master Chu naturally knew who Immortal Fairy White Bones was waiting for.","But, unfortunately, the person she was waiting for wasn't there.","\"Shuhang, open the door,\" Pavilion Master Chu called out.","The entrance to the Inner World swung open, and Pavilion Master Chu returned with her spoils of war.","Simultaneously, the two sets of Combined Magical Treasures that adorned Immortal Fairy White Bones in the void automatically disassembled and returned to the Inner World.","Immortal Fairy White Bones' eyes sparkled.","Swiftly, she followed the stream of light to descend beneath the sea's surface.","Within the Inner World, Pavilion Master Chu approached Song Shuhang.","\"What a shame, King Kun wasn't strong enough,\" Pavilion Master Chu lamented. Although Song Shuhang had bolstered Immortal Fairy White Bones's combat abilities, the battle had concluded rather swiftly.","\"If it were up to me, I'd probably have escaped as well,\" the sword mused. The combined Beast God White Bone Giant had given King Kun a beating unlike any other.","\"Senior Song, Immortal Fairy White Bones is heading towards the Inner World,\" Soft Feather reminded him.","\"Yes, I've noticed, Soft Feather,\" Song Shuhang replied while standing up and brushing off his clothes. \"Let's go and welcome Fairy White Bones.\""]},{"number":2402,"title":"Chapter 2402 Is This World Swelling Up?","paragraphs":["Immortal Fairy White Bones dispelled the secret technique of the White Bone Giant and stowed away her twin hammers. She closely trailed behind the radiant stream of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure toward the depths of the ocean.","As the battle rush wore off, waves of information flooded her senses. This was all the accumulated broadcast information of this year's Profound Sage Speeches.","For over a year, Immortal Fairy White Bones had been engaged in a relentless battle with King Kun. She couldn't afford to divert her attention to watch the live broadcasts of the Profound Sage Speeches. Only today, after King Kun had retreated far away and Immortal Fairy White Bones had the leeway to calm down, she received numerous broadcasts of the Profound Sage Speeches.","\"Hmm, why are there so many?\" As she began to receive the broadcasts of the Profound Sage Speeches, Immortal Fairy White Bones was taken aback. She had received sixteen broadcasts in one go!","Profound Sages, who hadn't appeared for nearly a thousand years, seemed to be popping up like ripe carrots this year. They were all prominent speeches.","\"Sixteen Profound Sages appearing in just over a year? Even in ancient times, this was unheard of,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones mused.","Even in ancient times, there was a period when Profound Sages appeared frequently, but it was still only three or four Profound Sages in a year. It was a far cry from the surplus of Prominent Divine Profound Sages this year.","...","...","\"Has the world of cultivation turned on its head?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones flew towards the ocean floor while rapidly receiving the contents of the Profound Sage Speeches.","As an Immortal, she could perform some advanced operations while watching the Profound Sage Speeches. For example, she could speed up the broadcast by ten or even a hundredfold. It allowed her to watch the speeches in the shortest amount of time possible. With the potent mental energy of Immortals, even at a hundred times speed, it wouldn't affect their comprehension of the speech.","However, when Fairy White Bones received the first Profound Sage Speech, she couldn't help but exclaim.","The first Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, took the stage to display his divinity and give a speech.","However, four Profound Sages were actually displaying their divinity together.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, Profound Sage Seven Lives Talisman, Profound Sage Eternity, and Profound Sage Horizon.","Four Profound Sages were on the same stage, with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song at the center standing tall and proud. Behind him, two Profound Sages were crouching with their hands on their heads, while the other one kneeled with hands on his head. It was unclear what kind of special formation they were in.","\"What's going on? Why are four Profound Sages displaying their divinity together? Could it be... an attempt to face a tribulation together?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones speculated.","However, forming a group to face a tribulation would mean their bodies would perish, and their Dao would dissipate!","As she pondered, the divinity display gradually zoomed in. Behind the first Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, was a lifelike lamia composed of virtue.","\"Fairy @#%×!\" Immortal Fairy White Bones almost thought her vision was ailing.","The beauty of the ancient Heavenly City, the publicly acclaimed beauty of that time... In terms of beauty and demeanor, not many fairies in the ancient Heavenly City could compare.","Why had Fairy @#%× become the light of virtue for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?","What exactly had happened this year? It felt like the world had undergone significant changes.","Just as she was thinking, the divinity display screen descended once more and revealed the face of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, who had awed the myriad worlds.","Immortal Fairy White Bones couldn't help but exclaim, \"Pfft~ Slow-Witted Song!\"","However, after taking a closer look, she immediately realized something was amiss. He didn't look like Slow-Witted Song at all.","At first glance, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song resembled Slow-Witted Song, but upon closer inspection, they were entirely different.","\"I must have been mistaken.\" Immortal Fairy White Bones thought to herself.","Perhaps she had been thinking of Slow-Witted Song the whole time, so when she saw Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, she mistook him for someone else.","After the four sages had completed their divinity display, the first Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, began his speech.","As soon as he started speaking, Immortal Fairy White Bones couldn't help but burst out, \"Shameless! Isn't that just Empress Cheng Lin explaining the Daoist Canon? In the past, when I interacted with Empress Cheng Lin, I heard bits and pieces of her explanations about the Daoist Canon.\"","\"His light of virtue is Fairy @#%×, and the content of the speech is Empress Cheng Lin's script. Could this first Sage in a thousand years, Tyrannical Song, be Empress Cheng Lin's backup plan?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones speculated as she flew towards the ocean floor.","In the subsequent three Profound Sage Speeches, except for Profound Sage Eternity, who seemed to be courting trouble, the others behaved relatively well.","After quickly scanning through the speeches of the other three Sages, Immortal Fairy White Bones continued to open the fifth Profound Sage Speech.","The fifth Profound Sage, Sage Monarch Winter Melon, was a well-behaved Sage. He didn't form a group to face a tribulation. Instead, he focused on the path of defense.","The defense path didn't resonate with White Bones Immortal Fairy, so she quickly swept it aside once more.","Then, she brought up the speech of the Sixth Profound Sage, the popular Sage White.","Just as Immortal Fairy White Bones was about to watch Sage White's speech, an entrance to a small world opened in front of her.","A masked man walked out of the small world with a long-legged fairy and greeted them.","Immortal Fairy White Bones looked at the man with joy.","However, just as she opened her mouth, she paused.","Because the man in front of her wasn't Slow-Witted Song.","Immortal Fairy White Bones frowned and stared at the man in front of her.","Song Shuhang slightly lifted the mask on his face to reveal the lower half of his face. He smiled at Immortal Fairy White Bones. \"Hello, Fairy White Bones.\"","\"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar, Ancient Sage Tyrant Dragon, Sage Monarch Tyrant Demon\"","Four prestigious Sage Names appeared on Song Shuhang's body.","The reason he revealed his Sage Name was to remind Immortal Fairy White Bones that he was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, not Slow-Witted Song.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones furrowed her brow.","What was with the four Sage Names?","Her consciousness quickly pulled up the list of all the Profound Sage Speech broadcasts she hadn't finished watching. As expected, among the next dozen or so broadcasts, she found Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar, Ancient Sage Tyrant Dragon, and the most recent one, Sage Monarch Tyrant Demon.","This guy showed his divinity four times?","What was this?","What had happened to the world in just a year?","After seeing that Immortal Fairy White Bones had already recognized his Daoist name and wouldn't touch him again, Song Shuhang smiled and opened his mouth to speak.","\"I am Tyrannical Song, eighteen years old. If I have offended you in any way, why don't you come and beat me up?\" Right at that moment, Fairy Creation, who was already prepared, jumped out and quickly snatched Song Shuhang's lines.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Fairy Creation made a victory gesture and said, \"Taadaa!\"","The scene was deathly silent.","There was a long pause.","\"Your pendant is very unique.\" Immortal Fairy White Bones forced herself to praise him.","\"Thank you,\" Song Shuhang calmly replied.","Then, there was another bout of silence.","There was a long pause.","Immortal Fairy White Bones couldn't help but ask, \"Um, may I ask... Is Slow-Witted Song here?\"","If you're looking for Slow-Witted Song, unfortunately, he's not here.\" At that moment, Song Shuhang's hair spun leisurely on top of his head and replied.","\"Pavilion Master Chu's hair?\" Fairy White Bones said in surprise.","Pavilion Master Chu reached out and supported her. Fairy White Bone was currently in an extremely weak state after the eruption of power. Moreover, she didn't have any intention of resisting, so she allowed Pavilion Master Chu to string her up.","A moment later, Fairy White Bones went slack...She had fainted.","Song Shuhang was speechless."]},{"number":2403,"title":"Chapter 2403 Not Yours, Not Mine","paragraphs":["She just fainted like that?","Fairy White Bones was at the Immortal level, right?","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at Pavilion Master Chu's bewildering hair. Had her hair gained power as her body recovered?","\"Don't look at me. I was gentle,\" replied Pavilion Master Chu while sounding rather nonchalant.","Fairy Creation chimed in. \"She just fell!\"","Pavilion Master Chu sighed.","Song Shuhang reached out and grabbed Fairy Creation before gently putting her back in the room. He couldn't help but wonder why Fairy Creation seemed so lively today. Had something joyful happened?","Pavilion Master Chu, on the other hand, flicked her hair casually and gently laid the unconscious Immortal Fairy White Bones on the ground.","\"Is this an insurance scam?\" questioned the sword.","\"No, she really fainted,\" Pavilion Master Chu replied in a somewhat absentminded manner. \"But it's not because of me. It's purely due to her excessive exhaustion. She had been hanging on through sheer willpower and fumes.\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet examined Immortal Fairy White Bones's body. \"She only has minor injuries. A good night's sleep will do the trick. Immortals aren't that fragile.\"","\"In that case, let her rest for a while. I originally wanted to ask her about her gigantic skeleton mecha,\" Song Shuhang mused. He used his telekinetic energy to move Immortal Fairy White Bones to the side of the living spring.","This place had the most abundant spiritual energy in the Inner World and was the perfect spot for Fairy White Bones to recover.","Song Shuhang gently placed Immortal Fairy White Bones on the ground.","Soft Feather took out her own sheet and covered Immortal Fairy White Bones with it. Then, she asked, \"Senior Song, do you want to learn the White Bone Giant Secret Technique?\"","Song Shuhang shook his head and explained, \"I just have a feeling that her giant skeleton pairs well with the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure. I simply wanted to learn more about it.\"","Of course, it would be even better if he could learn this White Bone Giant Secret Technique from Fairy White Bones herself. If he could use both the White Bone Giant and the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure simultaneously, transcending the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation would be a piece of cake.","Pavilion Master Chu's real body blew a bubble and added, \"I'll ask her about it after she wakes up. You saved her life, so it's only fair to ask for a reward.\"","\"No need, no need. I didn't do it expecting any reward,\" Song Shuhang replied with a smile. \"Anyway, I'll talk to Immortal Fairy White Bones once she wakes up.\"","He stood up and put his mask back on. \"Soft Feather, let's go!\"","Soft Feather turned to him and asked, \"Where to?\"","\"Let's head to the Su Clan in the Spirit River. We'll find a spot to get started,\" Song Shuhang said while extending his hand and summoning the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure and the Old Lord Giant Deer's Bow.","\"Are you planning to fly using the bow?\" inquired the puzzled hamster.","\"No, no, no. I want to try shooting myself out,\" Song Shuhang replied. His expression was serious as he held the massive bow.","The hamster was baffled.","\"From here to the Spirit River Su Clan?\" asked the sword. \"Are you trying to overcome your fear of speed?\"","Song Shuhang chuckled, \"No, I'm just feeling a bit nervous. I thought this dramatic entrance might help me relax and ease the tension in my heart.\"","With that, he opened an exit to the Inner World.","This exit led directly to the Spirit River Su Clan. These were the coordinates of the wooden saber that Song Shuhang had asked Su Kongyun to retrieve last time. Unfortunately, Su Clan's Sixteen was still inside the secret realm. Otherwise, Song Shuhang could have placed the coordinates right next to her.","\"Let's go!\" Song Shuhang waved his hand, and the Old Lord Giant Deer's Bow automatically stretched itself open.","He jumped onto the bow, and with a twang, he shot himself out of the Inner World toward the Spirit River Su Clan.","The hamster and sword stared at the vibrating bowstring in silence.","\"Senior Song, wait for me!\" Soft Feather called out and leaped onto the massive bow. With a whoosh, she was launched right after Song Shuhang.","\"Black-skinned Soft Feather, are you coming too?\" the sword inquired.","Butterfly Song, in her white and yellow attire, quickly shook her head. She gracefully lifted the hem of her skirt, stepped into the air, and chased after Song Shuhang and her main body.","The sword followed closely behind.","Next came the hamster, Lady Onion, and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","In the blink of an eye, the Inner World's living spring returned to its peaceful state. There were only Fairy White Bones and Pavilion Master Chu, both sleeping soundly.","Fairy White Bones did not rest for long.","After regaining some of her strength, she regained consciousness and opened her eyes.","\"Yo, you're awake,\" Pavilion Master Chu said lazily.","Fairy White Bones sat up and looked at the beauty, who was soaking in the spring.","\"Pavilion Master Chu of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion?\" Fairy White Bones tried to confirm her identity.","\"Do you know me?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked in puzzlement. She had never interacted with Fairy White Bones before.","\"Yes, after the destruction of the ancient Heavenly City, I secretly investigated many things, so I know some insider information,\" Fairy White Bones said as she sat down while hugging her knees.","The Pavilion Master Chu in front of her had significant connections to the collapse of the ancient Heavenly City, according to her covert investigations.","According to her findings, Cheng Lin, the mastermind behind the ancient Heavenly City's collapse, had originally targeted Pavilion Master Chu of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion. Additionally, Slow-Witted Song had been enigmatic during the city's destruction. He had played a role in many events.","But in the end, Fairy Cheng Lin took the blame while Slow-Witted Song was overlooked.","Pavilion Master Chu was speechless.","\"Where's Slow-Witted Song? I distinctly sensed his aura earlier,\" Fairy White Bones asked.","\"I don't know where he is,\" Pavilion Master Chu replied calmly. \"He hasn't appeared since the beginning.\"","Fairy White Bones furrowed her brow. \"Impossible. I clearly sensed him earlier... Wait, could it be...\"","\"That's right. The person who saved you wasn't Slow-Witted Song, but Shuhang... It was Tyrannical Song who welcomed you earlier. The two sets of Combined Magical Treasures are his magical treasures.\" Pavilion Master Chu replied.","Fairy White Bones was speechless.","The scene fell into an awkward silence.","What's the relationship between Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and Slow-Witted Song?\" Fairy White Bones looked at Pavilion Master Chu.","\"About time.\" Pavilion Master Chu had been waiting for Fairy White Bones to ask this question for a long time.","\"He's an illegitimate child.\" Pavilion Master Chu replied.","Fairy White Bones was stunned.","\"He told me about this personally.\" After Pavilion Master Chu said that, she waved her hair and pinched out an image.","In the video, Pavilion Master Chu only showed her head. Opposite her was a golden man.","The two of them were in the middle of a question-and-answer session.","\"What is your relationship with him?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked.","\"Looks like you've discovered it. I don't intend to hide this matter from everyone anymore,\" the golden man said with a sigh.","\"In truth, little Daoist Song is my illegitimate son. Don't tell anyone.\" The golden man sighed.","The video ended.","Although the golden man's appearance was different from what she remembered, Immortal Fairy White Bones was sure of his identity with a single glance.","\"Illegitimate son? With whom?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones took out her divine sword and gently stroked it.","\"It doesn't look like it's yours.\" Pavilion Master Chu didn't answer directly.","\"So, it's the ancestral golden dragon's?\"","\"Not hers, not yours, and not mine.\" Pavilion Master Chu nodded.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","The silence lasted for a while.","\"I'll ask him myself,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones stood up.","\"I'm really joking,\" Pavilion Master Chu said lazily.","\"I still want to meet Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones said.","In fact, it was best to ask Slow-Witted Song, but that guy couldn't be found so soon, so she could only settle for the next best thing and ask one of the people involved, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song."]},{"number":2404,"title":"Chapter 2404 What Are You Up To on Spirit Butterfly Island?","paragraphs":["Whoosh! Song Shuhang was launched out of the Inner World by his own bow. He aimed to land near the Branded Wooden Saber.","True to his word, Su Kongyun had positioned Song Shuhang's Branded Wooden Saber at the Vermilion Bird Gate near the Spirit River Su Clan. An inn nearby, used by the clan to welcome esteemed guests, was his intended landing spot.","Besides the 'Branded Wooden Saber,' Su Kongyun and his companions also carried a coordinate saber. However, as it was Song Shuhang's first visit and he was not yet acquainted with the area, he had to enter through the main gate instead of directly infiltrating the Spirit River Su Clan.","Moments later, Song Shuhang was precisely fired into the coordinates and achieved a perfect landing.","\"Not bad... As long as it's brief enough, my fear of speed won't kick in.\" Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","\"Has your fear of heights improved?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired.","Song Shuhang nodded. \"My fear of heights is pretty much gone. After all, I can fly now!\"","\"Ahhh!\" As they spoke, Soft Feather's thrilled scream echoed from behind.","Soft Feather laughed in between her screams.","\"Senior Song, watch out!\" Soft Feather yelled from a distance.","\"No worries, I'll catch you,\" Song Shuhang responded while extending his hand as his mental energy formed a soft, large hand to catch Soft Feather.","But, when his telekinetic hand touched Soft Feather, it shattered.","Soft Feather's body directly collided with the telekinetic hand and broke through without any resistance.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"We're going to crash, Senior Song!\" Soft Feather seemed unaware she had just destroyed Song Shuhang's telekinetic hand and kept charging ahead.","Song Shuhang's primordial spirit quickly extended his hand to catch Soft Feather and gently spun her around to dissipate the force of impact.","\"Senior Chu, what just happened?\" Song Shuhang immediately inquired of Pavilion Master Chu.","Why did the telekinetic hand shatter upon contact with Soft Feather's head? Since when had Soft Feather become so headstrong?","\"For a moment there... A massive force erupted from Soft Feather's body. The source of that power is peculiar, as if transmitted from afar,\" Pavilion Master Chu explained.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","After a moment of thought, Pavilion Master Chu speculated, \"It might be a power transmitted from an entity bound to her by a contract, or one with her.\"","\"Celestial Thearch?\" Song Shuhang immediately thought of the being who possessed Soft Feather's ghost spirit.","But why would the Celestial Thearch suddenly unleash power and even transfer energy to Soft Feather?","What was she trying to pull?","\"What's wrong, Senior Song?\" Soft Feather asked, puzzled.","\"I'm fine,\" Song Shuhang replied with a faint smile. \"Did you enjoy that?\"","Soft Feather nodded. \"It was fun! But the distance was too short this time. Next time we travel a longer distance, we should try again.\"","\"Sure,\" Song Shuhang agreed.","Meanwhile, he secretly sent a private message to the Celestial Thearch. \"What just happened?\"","\"Don't worry, Senior Song. With me here, nothing bad will happen on Spirit Butterfly Island! With my power, I can even rescue someone from death's door if there's an accident,\" the Celestial Thearch swiftly responded.","Song Shuhang silently nodded. Indeed, with the Celestial Thearch's strength and her countless treasures, not only serious injuries, but even accidental deaths could be reversed.","\"By the way, what are you planning on Spirit Butterfly Island?\" Song Shuhang asked again.","Initially, he hadn't intended to probe further, but since he was chatting with the Celestial Thearch, he asked casually.","\"I can't tell you that, Senior Song. I'm afraid you'll come and meddle. However, my target isn't Spirit Butterfly Island, so don't worry,\" the Celestial Thearch replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","I'm not a troublemaker, I'm just unlucky. Disasters seem to find me and not the other way around.","The more the Celestial Thearch kept from him, the more curious he became. After the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting, he'd consider visiting Spirit Butterfly Island with Soft Feather to see what the Celestial Thearch was up to.","\"Talk to you later, I'm busy now,\" the Celestial Thearch replied.","She seemed genuinely occupied. She was too busy even to transfer any energy today.","...","Song Shuhang ended his conversation with the Celestial Thearch.","At that moment, the black-skinned Soft Feather, Scarlet Heaven Sword, Lady Onion, the hamster, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, and the others all gathered around.","Song Shuhang donned his mask and neatly arranged all the pendants. \"Let's go to the inn ahead and check in. Soft Feather, have you been to the Spirit River Su Clan before?\"","\"Not really. I seldom left Spirit Butterfly Island,\" Soft Feather shook her head.","In traditional cultivator sects, they did not permit cultivators below the Third Stage to leave the mountain. Generally, sect elders would accompany them on outings.","\"That's perfect. We'll get to know the Spirit River Su Clan and familiarize ourselves with the surroundings,\" Song Shuhang laughed.","As they conversed, a middle-aged man with a kindly demeanor emerged from the inn. He exuded the aura of a friendly neighbor.","The numerous auras released by Song Shuhang, Soft Feather, and the pendants, aside from Song Shuhang himself, had naturally attracted the attention of the Spirit River Su Clan members inside the inn.","\"I am Su Moying. I apologize for not welcoming you earlier upon your arrival from afar,\" Su Moying greeted Song Shuhang and the others with a bow.","Lady Onion's eyes sparkled. \"This is so exciting. It's just like a TV drama!\"","Su Moying was at a loss for words.","He quietly observed the figures before him.","First was a man wearing a mask, his identity indiscernible.","Next to him were twin girls, one in black and the other in white. They looked somewhat familiar.","\"Ancient Sage Ling Die Zi!\" When Su Moying focused on Soft Feather, he immediately recognized her due to the effect of her Sage Name, 'No one in the world doesn't know you.'","The identity of the masked man then became apparent.","\"Su Moying greets Lord Spirit Butterfly and Ancient Sage Spirit Butterfly,\" Su Moying said while bowing to Song Shuhang and Soft Feather.","\"Senior Spirit Butterfly?\" Song Shuhang looked around in confusion.","But he didn't see Senior Spirit Butterfly.","\"I think he might have mistaken you for Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly,\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","\"Hehe,\" Soft Feather giggled while looking at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was momentarily stunned.","He recalled a wish he had the previous day.","In the future, he hoped to have a daughter as cute and beautiful as Soft Feather."]},{"number":2405,"title":"Chapter 2405 The Impact of Being Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["\"Cough, Fellow Daoist Su Moying, you've misunderstood. I am Tyrannical Song... the Profound Sage,\" Song Shuhang awkwardly introduced himself.","Su Moying was initially startled.","Then, his body exaggeratedly recoiled as he put some distance between himself and Song Shuhang. \"Tyrannical... Senior Tyrannical Song!\"","Witnessing the other party's surprised reaction, Song Shuhang felt a slight sting in his heart. After all, his aspiration wasn't to become a fearsome emperor capable of silencing crying children.","\"We'd like to visit a few friends at the Spirit River Su Clan before their annual meeting. Is Senior Su Clan's Seven available now?\" Song Shuhang tried to soften his voice.","Su Moying was momentarily taken aback.","\"Su Clan's Seven, Senior?\"","\"Tyrannical Song actually called Seven 'Senior'?\"","\"Seven is here. I'll connect you with him right away so he can guide you into the Spirit River Su Clan territory,\" Su Moying said while taking out his phone to contact Seven.","He decided not to dwell on the confusing aspects. After all, if Tyrannical Song was seeking Seven, it was for the best.","The pressure was immense for cultivators across the universe when facing Tyrannical Song, the Profound Sage.","The phone call connected quickly.","\"Hey, Mo Ying, what's up?\" Su Clan's Seven's voice sounded.","\"Seven, Senior Tyrannical Song is here. He's at the Vermilion Bird Gate and he's looking for you. Could you escort him into the Su Clan territory?\" Su Moying relayed swiftly.","\"Understood, I'll be right there,\" Su Clan's Seven responded.","Hearing his clan member call Song Shuhang 'Senior Tyrannical Song,' Su Clan's Seven couldn't help but chuckle...","Who would have thought that this 'Senior Tyrannical Song' was actually a genuine youngster?","However, in the world of cultivators, one's rank and cultivation level determined their seniority. Now that Song Shuhang was at the Seventh Stage, he rightfully deserved the title 'senior.'","However, the dynamics within the Nine Provinces Number One Group were different from those in the regular cultivation world, so they didn't adhere to such formalities.","...","\"It will take a little while for Seven to arrive. Why don't you rest at the inn for a bit, Senior Tyrannical Song?\" Su Moying suggested to Song Shuhang.","\"Thank you for your kindness,\" Song Shuhang replied with a nod.","He couldn't just have Soft Feather and her black-skinned counterpart stand idly on the street. Sitting down at the inn seemed like a good idea.","Su Moying led them to the inn and personally served them immortal tea.","Then, he stood silently behind Song Shuhang—mainly because he didn't dare stand in front of Senior Tyrannical Song.","Additionally, Tyrannical Song, the Profound Sage, truly lived up to his reputation as the first Sage in a thousand years. Rumors even suggested that he was a Transcending Tribulation senior who had carved his own path!","Today's encounter proved he was indeed extraordinary.","For example, Su Moying found that just by standing behind Tyrannical Song, his mental energy began to stir.","Thoughts of 'enlightenment' continuously surfaced in his mind.","Previously unclear aspects of his cultivation suddenly began to make sense, as if illuminated.","This was an opportunity! Just standing near Senior Tyrannical Song brought so many benefits.","Su Moying couldn't help but admire Tyrannical Song.","Having such a prestigious figure at the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting was truly a blessing. Just having Senior Tyrannical Song present on stage would provide endless benefits to all the disciples of the Spirit River Su Clan.","Song Shuhang, puzzled, turned to look at Su Moying. It seemed like this senior from the Spirit River Su Clan had suddenly developed a sense of admiration for him.","What had he done? He had only come in for a cup of tea, right?","At that moment, Song Shuhang was unaware of his own presence's effect.","The pendants and treasures on him were incredibly abundant.","For instance, the least significant treasure he wore was the Enlightenment Stone that Lady Onion was rooted in. This stone could clarify one's spirit and potentially accelerate cultivation for those nearby.","Lady Onion had once sold herself for the Enlightenment Stone, but now she no longer cared about its effects—the teachings of Senior Turtle and Pavilion Master Chu in the Inner World far surpassed it.","In addition to that, Pavilion Master Chu, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Fairy Creation, and Scarlet Heaven Sword were all formidable figures. These pendants alone were more effective than any Dao Comprehension Stone.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, originally a stele, later inscribed by the Netherworld's ruler, had a terrifyingly powerful effect.","Behind him, Su Moying's numerous thoughts became clear and coherent.","Unknowingly, the bottleneck that had troubled him for so long began to loosen.","Being on duty at the inn today and meeting Senior Tyrannical Song was indeed a stroke of fortune.","\"Senior Tyrannical Song, may I ask you a question?\" Su Moying seized the opportunity to engage with Tyrannical Song. Su Clan's Seven hadn't arrived yet.","\"Is it about cultivation?\" Song Shuhang asked, somewhat sheepishly—luckily, his mask concealed his expression.","\"No.\" Su Moying shook his head.","\"Ask away. Let's hear what your question is,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Su Moying eagerly inquired, \"Senior Tyrannical Song, what topic will you cover in your sermon this month?\"","Song Shuhang was momentarily speechless.","Discussing the content of this month's sermon seemed a bit odd.","But the month was nearly over.","\"Don't worry, I have no plans to make a divine appearance this month,\" Song Shuhang reassured him. He felt he was still far from advancing to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm.","Ascending wasn't so straightforward.","\"We're really looking forward to your sermon, Senior Tyrannical Song,\" Su Moying said eagerly.","Back when Senior Tyrannical Song delivered his first sermon on the Daoist Canon, cultivators across the universe had been captivated.","As Tyrannical Song's sermon neared its end, practitioners from across the universe begged for more in hopes it wouldn't conclude so soon.","Some even wished for Tyrannical Song to continue his discourse indefinitely.","Then... their wishes came true.","\"Haha, if possible, I hope my next sermon will be a bit more special,\" Song Shuhang said while still smiling.","As they were speaking, Su Clan's Seven arrived on his saber.","\"Senior Seven,\" Song Shuhang and Soft Feather stood up to greet him.","Su Clan's Seven waved to Su Moying to dismiss him.","Then, turning to Song Shuhang, he asked, \"Why the sudden decision to visit the Su Clan so early? You could have given me a heads-up to prepare.\"","\"Hehe, since it's my first visit to the Spirit River Su Clan, I thought of arriving early. Also, I'm planning to choose a location to distribute my wealth. I've prepared the treasures from the Wealth Throne. I'll find an opportunity to share them,\" Song Shuhang replied.","He had traded almost half a can of soda water for these treasures from the seniors in the group. He planned to keep some and distribute the rest.","\"Okay, I'll arrange it for you,\" Su Clan's Seven said.","He intended to organize an impressive entrance for Song Shuhang. Ideally, Song Shuhang's wealth-sharing segment would be featured during the opening ceremony of the annual meeting."]},{"number":2406,"title":"Chapter 2406 Tyrannical Song’s Side Hustle","paragraphs":["\"How are you going to arrange it?\" Song Shuhang asked.","Though he had been keeping a low profile recently to avoid drawing the attention of certain power players, this was the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting. Since there were no outsiders, a high-profile entrance wouldn't be out of place.","\"Give me a moment to think about how to incorporate you into the opening sequence of the annual meeting,\" Su Clan's Seven responded.","He had been pondering whether to construct a spiraling stage to elevate Song Shuhang during the last part of the Spirit River Su Clan's opening ceremony and lead him into the Wealth Throne segment.","However, the more he thought about it, the more he felt this approach was somewhat old-fashioned and lacked the desired impact.","Thus, regarding Tyrannical Song's entrance, he decided it was best to discuss it with the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting committee. More minds might generate a better idea.","Song Shuhang laughed. \"I'll cooperate with whatever plan you and the other seniors come up with.\"","\"I'll take you to a rest area first. Oh, and here's a token for you,\" Su Clan's Seven said, handing out two tokens to Song Shuhang and Soft Feather. \"Feel free to explore the Spirit River Su Clan. As long as the token shows the area is clear, you can go anywhere without hindrance. If it sends out a red alert, avoid that area. Those are typically where clan members are in seclusion, and it's best not to disturb them.\"","\"Don't worry, Senior Seven. We'll be careful to steer clear,\" Soft Feather assured him.","In the cultivator world, it was well-known not to disturb areas where cultivators were in seclusion. The need for quiet was paramount—unlike Song Shuhang, who would have his primordial spirit wander while in seclusion.","Song Shuhang nodded while appreciating the convenience the token would provide for scouting the area.","...","Su Clan's Seven led Song Shuhang and Soft Feather to a pre-arranged rest area, specially designated for members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","He planned to meet up with his fellow group members before the annual meeting.","\"You can rest here for now or explore the Spirit River Su Clan. I'll come find you later and introduce you to the culinary arts of the Su Clan's Immortal Chefs,\" Su Clan's Seven said.","Being one of the main organizers of the annual meeting, he was too busy to stay.","\"Go ahead with your tasks, Senior Seven,\" Song Shuhang replied cheerfully.","They would be more relaxed exploring without Senior Su Clan's Seven around.","\"Contact me if you need anything,\" Su Clan's Seven said while waving to Song Shuhang before leaving confidently.","Song Shuhang was still a figure of trust for the seniors in certain respects.","...","After Su Clan's Seven departed, Song Shuhang, along with Soft Feather and all the pendants, began to explore the vast Spirit River Su Clan territory.","Lacking a guide, Song Shuhang randomly picked a direction and started walking.","The spiritual energy in the Spirit River Su Clan was abundant, likely due to the clan's spiritual veins.","About half an hour later, as they passed a small mountain, Song Shuhang and Soft Feather's waist tokens emitted red lights and vibrated slightly as a warning.","\"There must be members of the Spirit River Su Clan in seclusion here. Let's go around,\" Song Shuhang suggested.","Soft Feather nodded in agreement.","As they were about to leave, a puzzled voice came from a cave abode at the mountain's base.","\"Eh?\" It was a woman's voice, low and questioning.","Just a few steps away from the cave abode, the fairy's voice rang out again.","Then, she quickly transmitted a message to Soft Feather and Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","\"Could you two Fellow Daoists please come back for a moment?\" the woman's voice was filled with hope.","Song Shuhang and Soft Feather exchanged glances and then returned to the edge of the cave abode, but they did not enter the cave's area to avoid any potential mishaps.","\"Ah, that's the feeling,\" the woman's voice softened.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"Fellow Daoists, would you mind staying here for a short while? Just about five minutes should do,\" the woman's voice was hopeful.","Before Song Shuhang could respond, Fairy Creation suddenly appeared. \"What's happening?\"","\"I know this request is quite bold, and I'm aware it will take up your time... I can compensate you with spirit stones, though I don't have many left—just a small box with a little over thirty spirit stones of the Sixth and Seventh Stages,\" the woman's voice sounded increasingly guilty as she felt her offer was insufficient.","\"Do we just need to stand here?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"Five minutes?\" Soft Feather asked while blinking.","\"Yes, if that's alright... I apologize for the scarcity of spirit stones. If it's too much, three minutes will suffice,\" the woman's voice grew fainter.","\"No problem, we can stay for five minutes,\" Song Shuhang agreed.","\"Senior Song, are you in need of spirit stones?\" Soft Feather asked, curious.","\"Well, it's always good for a man to have some spirit stones on hand,\" Song Shuhang remarked.","\"Then I'll stay here with you for a bit,\" Soft Feather decided.","\"Thank you, Fellow Daoists,\" the woman exclaimed joyfully.","After speaking, she resumed her secluded cultivation and made the most of the opportunity.","Outside the cave.","\"Pavilion Master Chu,\" Song Shuhang reached out and lightly touched Pavilion Master Chu's hair. \"Why do you think the fairy in the cave wants Soft Feather and me to stay here?\"","\"I'd guess that the cultivation techniques you or Soft Feather practice are positively influencing her. Fire borrows the power of the wind, wood from the earth. Sometimes, cultivation techniques resonate with each other. She's likely at a bottleneck in her seclusion and could use your strength for a breakthrough,\" Pavilion Master Chu speculated.","About four minutes later, the fairy's voice, filled with excitement, echoed from the cave. \"Thank you, Fellow Daoists. Please accept these spirit stones!\" A small box flew out of the cave and gently landed in Song Shuhang's hands. \"I wish I could thank you in person, but I'm in a critical phase of my seclusion. Please understand.\"","\"You're welcome,\" Song Shuhang replied while opening the box to find ten Seventh Stage spirit stones and over twenty Sixth Stage ones.","The amount was perfect for him and Soft Feather to share equally.","\"Earning a little extra like this is surprisingly easy,\" Song Shuhang mused while holding the spirit stones, his eyes brimming with happiness.","He had never imagined earning spirit stones could be so effortless.","Interestingly, this was his first time earning a legitimate side income in spirit stones."]},{"number":2407,"title":"Chapter 2407 Pendants Return!","paragraphs":["Soft Feather looked at the spirit stones divided between them. Initially, she thought of refusing, as she wasn't short on spirit stones. After all, she, Soft Feather, was quite affluent.","But then she pondered the fact that this was the first time she and Senior Song had teamed up to earn spirit stones, and she found the whole experience quite amusing. Thus, she nodded and accepted her share of the spirit stones.","Song Shuhang, who had been 'penniless,' felt his mood lift as he acquired a new batch of spirit stones. He carefully distributed them between his Universal Bracelet and Inner World—never putting all his eggs in one basket, nor his money in one place.","In the Inner World, the Inner Assistant quietly observed where Song Shuhang had hidden the spirit stones and noted down the location. If Mister Tyrannical Song ever needed to use the One Hit of Krypton Gold again, she would be ready to dig out these spirit stones and transfer them as a sacrifice to convert them into power.","\"Let's go, Soft Feather. Let's check out some other places,\" Song Shuhang suggested while feeling upbeat.","Together with the two Soft Feathers, he resumed his leisurely exploration along the paths of the Spirit River Su Clan.","Half a day later, Song Shuhang and Soft Feather were sitting by a large lake, silently fishing.","\"Thank you, Fellow Daoists. Though I wish to thank you personally, I am in a critical phase of my seclusion. Please accept these small spirit stones as a token of my gratitude,\" a deep voice of a Daoist emanated from the center of the lake.","Subsequently, a box landed beside Song Shuhang and Soft Feather.","The duo set aside their fishing rods and quietly opened the box. They poured out the spirit stones, counted them, and divided them evenly.","Their efficiency was unmatched!","Throughout the morning, Song Shuhang and Soft Feather had encountered nearly 30 locations where Su Clan members were in seclusion, signaled by their tokens flashing red.","The scenario of the Su Clan fairy in seclusion, with her voice so soft it seemed to melt into water, repeated itself nearly 30 times. Each time, the Su Clan members in seclusion requested Song Shuhang and Soft Feather to stay for varying durations.","The requests ranged from three-minute stays to ten-minute ones.","By the end of their tour, Song Shuhang and Soft Feather had each earned nearly 600 spirit stones of the Fifth, Sixth, and Seventh Stages.","Song Shuhang realized for the first time that money could be earned in such a manner.","Though the value of what they received was less than a bottle of Heavenly Dao Eye Drops, the joy of acquiring spirit stones provided an experience that money couldn't buy. Well, technically, this joy was purchased with money.","\"You two are like bullies from movies who collect protection fees. You stroll around, and then everyone gives you money,\" Lady Onion commented.","\"Hahaha,\" Song Shuhang laughed heartily while handing ten Fifth Stage spirit stones to Lady Onion. \"Here, Lady Onion. This is your salary for last month.\"","Lady Onion was shocked. Song Shuhang had actually remembered to pay her salary!","\"You don't want it?\" Song Shuhang asked, curious.","\"Yes, yes, I do!\" Lady Onion quickly stashed away the spirit stones. It was a day to remember. It was the first time she had received a salary from Song Shuhang. Though its value didn't match the pile of green onion sprouts she had gathered.","\"Is it about time to contact Senior Su Clan's Seven for some food?\" Song Shuhang proposed.","\"Sounds good,\" Soft Feather agreed while picking up the bucket of fish and returning them to the lake.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang transferred the fish into his Inner World.","Just as he was about to close the Inner World, a voice emerged from within: \"Wait, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song! Let me out first!\"","It was the voice of Immortal Fairy White Bones.","Initially, White Bones had intended to follow Song Shuhang with the Black-skinned Soft Feather but found herself locked in the Inner World after the hamster and Black-skinned Soft Feather left.","Left with no alternative, she returned to the living spring to meditate and recover the energy she had expended.","Finally seeing Song Shuhang open the Inner World, she quickly called out to him.","\"Eh? Fairy White Bones, you're awake,\" Song Shuhang said, smiling.","\"Please, come out,\" he said while opening the Inner World passage.","Considering they were on the Spirit River Su Clan's territory, would the sudden appearance of an immortal cause an alarm?","Fairy White Bones rose and swiftly headed towards the exit of the Inner World. Just as she was about to step through, another Inner World exit suddenly appeared before her.","Stepping into the new passage, White Bones vanished from sight.","Simultaneously, Fairy @#%× emerged from the new entrance.","The Inner World's exit closed again.","\"Eh?\" The virtuous lamia cocked her head. She sensed someone had just brushed past her.","Song Shuhang was speechless. Could it really be such a coincidence? Just as White Bones was about to exit, the virtuous lamia returned. The two passages had overlapped and sent White Bones to Senior White's location.","\"Hmm?\" The virtuous lamia turned her head, her gaze meeting Song Shuhang's expressive eyes through the mask's opening.","\"Grandpa, I'm back~\" The virtuous lamia played a line from an unknown movie, then slithered her tail and leaped.","Her long tail spun and transformed into a propeller.","The sound of a diver entering the water — also produced by the virtuous lamia—accompanied her return to Song Shuhang's body.","\"Welcome back. Did you finish with Senior White's tasks?\" Song Shuhang asked while addressing his chest.","\"Yes,\" the virtuous lamia responded as she reached for the Scarlet Heaven Sword at Song Shuhang's waist.","\"Wait a moment!\" the sword pleaded.","Despite its protest, it was captured and swallowed by the virtuous lamia.","The sword felt utterly exhausted and contemplated retirement.","\"How far along is Senior White's project to create a god?\" Soft Feather inquired, curious.","\"We'll send a message to Senior White later to ask,\" Song Shuhang said, smiling.","As he spoke, a new entrance to his Inner World opened.","Song Shuhang was puzzled. Neither he nor the virtuous lamia had opened their Inner Worlds, so why the new entrance?","Could it be Senior White Two arriving?","As he contemplated, two figures appeared in his Inner World.","One was a handsome man with an aura reminiscent of a hermit from ancient poems, ethereal and otherworldly.","The other was a beautiful fairy, also carrying a distinctive hermit-like aura.","They were Song Shuhang's ghost spirit and Scholar Drunken Spear!","Fairy Ghost Spirit and Heavenly Sword Scholar had successfully completed their cultivation and returned!"]},{"number":2408,"title":"Chapter 2408 The Confused Ball","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang's primordial spirit quickly whipped out his mobile phone and scanned his contact list. He greeted with a smile, \"Senior Drunken Moone, welcome back!\"","\"Little friend Shuhang, you too have remembered my Daoist name incorrectly. I am Scholar Drunken Star,\" Scholar Drunken Star sighed.","Song Shuhang expressed confusion and double-checked his phone. He focused on the word 'Drunken' in his contact list. He remained just as confused.","Looking up at the scholar, Song Shuhang offered a kind smile. \"Please, feel free to speak, Senior.","\"Your current cultivation technique will lead you nowhere, Senior. Have you considered pursuing other techniques?\" Song Shuhang advised.","As he spoke, the scholar stepped out of Song Shuhang's Inner World, but in the next moment, he disappeared into thin air.","Stunned, Song Shuhang quickly scanned the area with his divine sense but found nothing.","\"Scholar? Senior Scholar Drunken Moone?\" Song Shuhang called out.","However, there was no response from Senior Drunken Moone.","\"Pavilion Master Chu, can you see Senior Drunken Moone?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Yes, you can see him if you concentrate. If you don't pay attention, though, you'll miss him. He's about five meters to your left,\" Pavilion Master Chu replied lazily.","Song Shuhang looked and finally saw the blurry figure of Senior Drunken Moone. Evidently, the Senior's strength had significantly improved.","\"Congratulations on your remarkable progress, Senior,\" Song Shuhang said, albeit reluctantly.","\"Little friend Shuhang, don't worry about me. As my strength increases, my day of divine revelation draws nearer. When I reveal my divinity to others, it will be my most glorious moment. This is the Spirit River Su Clan, right? I'll go find Fellow Daoist Seven. We'll meet again later, little friend Shuhang.\"","With those words, the scholar's figure gradually blurred and disappeared.","\"If the scholars' lineage were to become assassins, they'd be unmatched,\" Song Shuhang mused.","He then turned his attention to the ghost fairy spirit within the Inner World. The Inner World was indeed exceptional.","When the scholar was inside, Song Shuhang could clearly sense his presence, but once he left, Song Shuhang found himself overlooking him. The Inner World seemed to offer a degree of immunity to the scholar's cultivation technique.","Song Shuhang looked at the ghost fairy spirit, and she returned his gaze. A moment later, she smiled, brought her palms together, and used her innate ability for spatial transposition.","The stone tablet on Song Shuhang was replaced by the ghost fairy, who then hung from his belt.","\"Why me again?\" The stone tablet wondered aloud. \"Can't she choose a different target?\"","The ghost fairy merged into Song Shuhang's body, and they became one. Her unique constitution began to influence his state, making his existence more obscure.","\"Books... What was the name again?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet tried to call out Song Shuhang's name but found he couldn't remember it.","Song Shuhang clenched his fists, familiar with the sensation. As a man frequently in and out of the Heavenly Dao's small black room, he knew the feeling of being forgotten by the world all too well.","\"In this state, even the heavenly tribulation will be affected during transcendence resulting in a weakening of its impact.\"","This was the message the ghost fairy spirit imparted to Song Shuhang upon merging.","She had successfully cultivated a special divine body belonging to the scholars' lineage. This body could weaken the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulations and even interfere with those of the Ninth Stage, a critical secret to the scholars' tribulation transcendence.","\"Thank you, ghost spirit fairy,\" Song Shuhang softly said. With a thought, he deactivated the special divine body fusion.","Thirty meters away, Scholar Drunken Star, who had intended to find Su Clan's Seven, witnessed this scene. He felt a sudden sense of regret. Perhaps he shouldn't have pursued this technique from the beginning. Instead, he should find a ghost spirit and cultivate a technique like little friend Tyrannical Song and achieve a special divine body through fusion.","Curled up inside Song Shuhang's body, the ghost spirit fairy began sharing information about her experiences in the secret realm with the scholar.","Shortly after entering the realm with the scholar and the bearded elder, another powerful entity forced its way in. This entity clashed with the realm's attributes and threatened to collapse the entire mystic realm.","The elder, after leaving behind cultivation methods and details about the realm, confronted the uninvited powerful entity and activated the realm's time attribute. A day outside equated to a year within the realm.","Under the influence of temporal power, the ghost spirit fairy stayed in the realm for years while focusing on cultivation. Today, she finally condensed a special divine body of the scholar's lineage.","\"A powerful entity?\" Song Shuhang's heart skipped a beat. \"A clone of the fat ball?\"","He pondered if the fat ball's avatar, using divination to track his location, had mistaken the ghost fairy for him and charged into the realm with the intention of killing him.","After forming a contract, a ghost spirit and cultivator become one. Song Shuhang's ghost spirit was unique, but using divination, it was still likely to be mistaken for Song Shuhang!","\"Did your elder and that powerful entity emerge?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","The ghost fairy was uncertain. After cultivating the special divine body, she was transferred out by the realm's power and didn't know the outcome of the battle between the scholar's elder and the powerful entity.","\"It seems it really was the fat ball's smurf account,\" Song Shuhang mused, concerned about the elder's ability to withstand the fat ball's assault.","---","Elsewhere, in the scholar's secret realm, a ball was engulfed in confusion.","\"Who am I? Why am I here? What is this place?\" The ball pondered these existential questions."]},{"number":2409,"title":"Chapter 2409 Is This My True Self?","paragraphs":["The fear of memory loss is profound, as memories are not just data but a vital part of our emotions and soul. The ball, having forgotten everything, was left bewildered, unsure of its origin, purpose, and even its location.","\"Why am I here?\" it wondered while rolling aimlessly through the secret realm. It felt an innate need for a goal, a quest, a crucial task, but its memory provided no answers.","\"What's happened to me?\" The ball rolled on while pondering its existence—a question crucial to its very soul and emotions. It felt incomplete, as though it was searching for its 'main body' or a missing piece. This instinctive hunch suggested it was seeking its 'main body' or 'missing part,' hence its presence in this strange place.","\"Yes, that must be it,\" the ball resolved, finally discovering its life's purpose. And so, confident that it would recognize its target upon encountering it, it continued rolling through the realm.","Rolling endlessly, it eventually entered a peculiar space. \"Residual power of time? And... has someone been here before?\" the ball mused, though how it knew about 'time power' was a mystery even to itself.","In this space, devoid of the dangers of time's power, the sphere began to search. Despite lacking eyes or nose, it sensed the world through a special system and picked up familiar scents from past inhabitants.","As it rolled, collecting and reconstructing these scents, fragments of information began to form. First, an unfamiliar woman appeared, but deeper analysis revealed more. Eventually, the image of a black-haired man emerged, with a face capable of speaking!","\"It's him! The one I've been looking for!\" the ball realized excitedly. This man was its missing part or its main body. Finding him would restore all it had forgotten. It would be the first step to completing and perfecting it.","\"How wonderful to have found my true target so quickly. I'll soon find a way to reach you, my missing part or main body,\" the ball declared joyously, convinced the man was also searching for it. It envisioned surprising him with its sudden appearance.","But first, it had to escape the secret realm, a labyrinthine challenge. \"No worries, I have all the time I need,\" the ball reassured itself as it rolled off to find the exit.","**********","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang shivered unexpectedly. \"What's wrong, Senior Song?\" Soft Feather asked.","\"I think some big shot just tried to track me using divination,\" Song Shuhang replied while pressing down on his mask that could disrupt heavenly secrets and interfere with divination attempts.","\"I'm okay, the cultivation chat virus alarm didn't go off. They haven't tracked me,\" he reassured, then closed the Inner World.","\"Be cautious. If the entity that followed your ghost spirit fairy into the secret realm was indeed the fat ball, it might have emerged already,\" Pavilion Master Chu warned.","\"I'll keep an eye on the Inner World. If it starts showing signs of fear, we'll be ready,\" Song Shuhang agreed.","\"Let's go find Senior Su Clan's Seven for a meal. Afterwards, we'll continue exploring the Su Clan,\" Song Shuhang proposed.","\"Are you searching for something specific, Senior Song?\" Soft Feather inquired.","\"Partly, but mainly I'm looking to make some extra money,\" Song Shuhang replied earnestly. He hoped to find a significant figure of the Spirit River Su Clan he met in a dream.","\"I'll join you in your search this afternoon. What kind of place are you looking for, Senior Song?\" Soft Feather's curiosity was piqued.","**********","Elsewhere, Senior White, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Xuan Nu Sect's Skylark were busy in a laboratory when Immortal Fairy White Bones appeared suddenly.","\"Eh? Where am I?\" White Bones Immortal Fairy asked, confused.","\"Eh?\" Senior White looked up at her. He sensed a fated treasure in this unfamiliar fairy maiden.","\"White Emperor Scripture,\" he noted."]},{"number":2410,"title":"Chapter 2410 Probably Because He’s Handsome","paragraphs":["\"What is this place? Did Fairy @#%× just float past me? Where's Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones queried as confusion laced her tone.","\"This is our laboratory,\" Senior White clarified.","\"Fairy @#%× went home to recharge. As a materialized light of virtue, she can't always stay away from her main body. After a while, she'll return to recharge beside Shuhang,\" Xuan Nu Sect's Skylark interjected while placing a black top hat back on her head.","\"We're currently unaware of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's whereabouts,\" Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue stated while positioning himself protectively near Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue. He eyed the suddenly appearing fairy with caution.","Immortal Fairy White Bones paused. Her unexpected arrival here was a result of her encounter with Fairy @#%×.","\"Um, I didn't realize this was your laboratory. Apologies for the intrusion,\" she apologized while performing a courteous fist-and-palm salute. Knowing these daoists were acquainted with Fairy @#%×, and thus friends of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, she maintained etiquette and suppressed her Immortal aura.","Yet, upon observing the fellow daoists, she noticed her Immortal Realm suppression seemed ineffective. Senior White, Xuan Nu Sect's Skylark, and Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue each possessed unique qualities that made them immune to such pressure.","\"Do you need something from Shuhang?\" Senior White inquired.","\"I wanted to ask him something... However, I ended up here after an encounter with Fairy @#%× in his private world,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones replied.","The group nodded in understanding—she had emerged from Song Shuhang's small world.","\"If it's about Shuhang, we might be able to help,\" offered Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue.","\"I'm curious about Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's father,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones said somewhat shyly.","\"Shuhang's father? He's a decent person. He's somewhat similar to Shuhang in temperament, though he's an ordinary non-cultivator,\" Senior White explained.","\"Is Shuhang's father named Song One?\" she inquired, a bit startled.","\"No, his father's name is quite normal, not Song One,\" Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue corrected.","\"Aren't Song One and Song Shuhang the same person?\" Skylark added while raising seven fingers and listing several of Shuhang's daoist names.","\"Also, there's Scholar Mountain of Books, a name Song Shuhang likes, but it doesn't suit him,\" Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue added.","Senior White chimed in, \"There are two more: Path-seeking Scholar and Kind-hearted Cultivator.\"","\"Daoist names?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones looked perplexed.","\"Yes, all are Song Shuhang's, or Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's daoist names,\" Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue affirmed.","\"Seven daoist names? Why the frequent change?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones queried, bemused.","Skylark mentioned Soft Feather's quest for 365 daoist names while lamenting the absence of Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly.","\"I suspect he might not make it today,\" Senior White speculated.","\"Tyrannical Song is just his Sage Name. He also has Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, and Tyrannical Demon as Sage Names,\" Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue noted.","Reflecting on the names she recalled, Immortal Fairy White Bones sought confirmation about Tyrannical Saber Song One being Shuhang's daoist name.","\"Yes, I gave him that name,\" Senior White confirmed.","Immortal Fairy White Bones frowned. If Song One was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song...","\"No, I have to confirm it with my own eyes.\" she decided.","\"Fairy, are you in a hurry?\" At this time, Senior White suddenly said.","\"I am a little anxious...I'm still a little nervous.\" Immortal Fairy White Bones replied.","\"Then, Fairy, why don't you stay and help me complete the experiment? Fellow Daoist Spirit Butterfly didn't come today, so I'm lacking a helper. After I finish my experiment, I'll take you to the Spirit River Su Clan to look for Shuhang. What do you think?\" Senior White asked.","Immortal Fairy White Bones subconsciously wanted to refuse. She didn't want to waste time. But suddenly, she remembered something-was the daoist name Tyrannical Saber Song Tyrannical given to Tyrannical Song by Sage Monarch White?","\"I'll help with the experiment if you can share more about Tyrannical Song,\" she proposed.","\"Non-private matters, I can discuss,\" Senior White agreed.","\"Deal.\""]},{"number":2411,"title":"Chapter 2411 The Worthy Tyrannical Song, Supreme Sage","paragraphs":["On the other side, in the modern world of the Spirit River Su Clan, Song Shuhang and Soft Feather, who had originally set out to find Su Clan's Seven, found themselves lost.","Soft Feather wasn't great with directions, but Song Shuhang was absolutely confident in his sense of direction. There was no 'directionally challenged' trait about him.","Nevertheless, they managed to get lost.","\"That's why I envy the Spirit River Su Clan the most. Their backyard is like a labyrinth, and you can easily get lost if you're not careful,\" Song Shuhang commented while gazing up at the sky.","At some point, the sky had become shrouded in pure white mist—mist, not smog. This mist was filled with abundant spiritual energy. If a Foundation Establishment cultivator were to inhale it, the effect would rival that of consuming a qi and blood pill.","Song Shuhang realized that they were dealing with more than just being lost; they must have accidentally stumbled into a forbidden area of the Spirit River Su Clan or the residence of a prominent figure in the clan.","Oddly, their waist tokens hadn't triggered a red alert.","\"I sense something. Something is about to happen here!\" Soft Feather declared while donning her baseball cap and striking a cool pose with one hand gripping the brim.","The black-skinned Soft Feather tidied her disheveled hair and said, \"I feel a bit uneasy.\"","This place wasn't welcoming to a 'demon' like her.","\"Ditto,\" came the voice of the sword from within Song Shuhang's stomach. It observed the outside world through the virtuous lamia's vision.","\"Pavilion Master Chu, can you guide us to the exit?\" Song Shuhang reached out and gently stroked Pavilion Master Chu's hair.","\"Pa~\" Chu Daofou swatted the back of Song Shuhang's hand. \"Don't be so casual. Besides, the exit here keeps shifting. Every step you take changes its location, and it's quite troublesome. If you want to leave, you can directly use the Inner World for spatial teleportation.\"","Song Shuhang pointed into the air. \"The Inner World is ready for teleportation at any time.\"","Moreover, they were in the Spirit River Su Clan's territory, and as long as they didn't act recklessly, their lives should be safe.","After that, Song Shuhang looked at Soft Feather... Soft Feather was thrilled to have encountered this 'event.'","\"Since we can leave anytime, Senior Song, let's continue exploring for a while. If we don't come across anything interesting, we'll leave,\" Soft Feather suggested.","\"Agreed,\" Song Shuhang replied calmly.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chimed in, \"Don't just 'agree.' Every time you say that, something bad happens.\"","\"Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, no need to worry. Song Shuhang has two resurrection methods on him. Fellow Daoist Chu's crystal statue and the demon resurrection array from White of the Netherworld Realm are both potent. Even if something goes awry, he has at least two lives to spare,\" the sword added.","\"It's futile, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword. Under the training of the seniors, my heart has become tougher than superalloy. This level of heart-piercing has no effect on me,\" Song Shuhang boasted.","He was gradually becoming an invincible man.","Whether it was physical pain or mental anguish, they couldn't harm him. No matter what kind of heart-wrenching trash talk was thrown at him, it couldn't stir his emotions.","This way, he would be invulnerable in battle!","Physical attacks, mental attacks, trash talk, or sarcastic remarks—they were all like a gentle breeze to him.","Sometimes, in battles among experts, a single sentence could create an opportunity for victory. However, the future Song Shuhang would be immune to all kinds of psychological attacks!","Pavilion Master Chu sighed. Behind Song Shuhang's proud demeanor lay a heap of melancholy.","\"I'll guide your steps forward. Follow my instructions and synchronize your movements,\" Pavilion Master Chu advised.","\"Do Senior Song and I have to do the same thing? It's challenging for two people to stay in sync,\" Soft Feather pointed out.","\"It's okay. I can coordinate with you,\" Song Shuhang assured.","As a Seventh Stage Venerable, handling such a task was still manageable. Additionally, he had the Scholarly Sage's eye and Senior Three-Eyed's divine third eye to help synchronize their movements.","\"Get ready. Try taking three steps in the two o'clock direction...\" Pavilion Master Chu began her guidance.","Song Shuhang and Soft Feather moved in unison, following Pavilion Master Chu's instructions.","\"Next, take two steps in the three o'clock direction.\"","\"Keep going...\"","Pavilion Master Chu led the way, with Song Shuhang and Soft Feather following her cues.","Soft Feather smiled like a blossoming flower; she found this 'event' rather enjoyable.","After a while, Song Shuhang inquired, \"Pavilion Master Chu, are we there yet?\"","\"The person who set up this formation is quite clever. It's interesting. Using conventional methods, it would take at least two to three days to break the array,\" Pavilion Master Chu mused.","\"An immortal expert?\" Song Shuhang questioned.","\"Not necessarily, but the person who arranged this array isn't weak,\" Pavilion Master Chu replied with a smile. \"Conventional methods are time-consuming. Let's employ some tricks. Shuhang, use the secret technique World Refining Holy Ape, but keep its range limited to a one-meter diameter. Can you do that?\"","\"I'll give it a try.\" With a thought, Song Shuhang activated the World Refining Holy Ape technique.","Above him, numerous holy apes appeared. They formed a circle while holding hands.","Just as Song Shuhang was about to use the secret technique, the maze formation around them suddenly dissipated, and the mist vanished from the air.","It was the one who had set up the array who voluntarily deactivated it.","\"Hehe~\" Pavilion Master Chu faintly smiled; this outcome was within her expectations. \"Alright, Shuhang, maintain the World Refining Holy Ape secret technique.\"","Song Shuhang was at a loss.","He held his hands high and remained motionless.","After a while, he asked, \"Pavilion Master Chu, how do I dismiss this?\"","\"If you're asking me, who should I ask?\" Pavilion Master Chu felt goosebumps rising.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the group of holy apes holding hands above him.","The leading ape nodded slightly.","Then, all the holy apes released their hands.","Boom~~~","A deafening explosion resounded.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Right at that moment, a figure streaked across the sky.","The figure reached out and caught the explosion caused by Holy Ape World Refining. Simultaneously, the figure used Spatial Energy to transfer the explosion's force away.","\"Hu~~\" The figure heaved a sigh of relief.","Then, he turned to face Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and nodded with a smile. As expected of the first Sage in a thousand years, he was a man who had stepped onto his own Dao.","Song Shuhang awkwardly cupped his fists. \"I'm Tyrannical Song. Greetings, Fellow Daoist.\""]},{"number":2412,"title":"Chapter 2412 A Familiar Encounter","paragraphs":["Just as the words left Song Shuhang's lips, the lamia, who had gone home to recharge, seized the opportunity and leaped into view.","Her radiant form materialized on Song Shuhang's left side, and she began to sing, \"At the tender age of eighteen...\"","\"In the blink of an eye!\" Song Shuhang waved his sleeve, deftly tucking away the lamia.","His sleeve contained a vast universe. It was a handy trick for daily life.","However, right after he tucked away the virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation emerged once more while singing, \"Please, enlighten me~\"","As she finished her line, she suddenly sensed that something was amiss. Her opponent, the virtuous lamia, who had appeared before her, had vanished...","Fairy Creation lowered her gaze and glanced at the raised edge of Song Shuhang's sleeve while comprehending the situation.","\"Farewell!\" Fairy Creation saluted the gathering of beings.","With that, she leaped into Song Shuhang's sleeve on her own accord.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and lightly tapped his chest—this scene bore a striking resemblance to something he had seen before. Senior Three-Eyed's enormous eye butler had similarly taken the initiative to jump onto a grill and sprinkle cumin on himself after stabbing Senior Three-Eyed's heart.","No, he couldn't afford to indulge Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia any longer. Allowing them to evolve further would turn today's Senior Three-Eyed into his future self.","Senior Three-Eyed only had a single eyeball as his butler, but he had two Fairies accompanying him, not to mention a black-skinned Soft Feather currently under training, and Scarlet Heaven Sword, who persistently attempted to pierce his heart.","The issue was, how could he halt the progress of the lamia and Fairy Creation?","These two fairies were truly impeccable women, and Song Shuhang lacked the means to 'not indulge' them.","Contemplating this, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song raised his head and let out a deep sigh.","Meanwhile, on the other side, the corner of the Su Clan elder's mouth, who had suddenly appeared, twitched uncontrollably.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song alone was a spectacle.","At this moment, Pavilion Master Chu, perched atop Song Shuhang's head, swiveled to face the figure in front of her and inquired, \"Fellow Daoist, how should I address you?\"","Pavilion Master Chu could still be relied upon in critical moments. Indeed, her experience as the master of a pavilion had instilled her with a professional demeanor in important situations!","The Su Clan elder across from her smiled faintly while gesturing to his throat, then waved his hand.","\"Can't speak?\" Daoist Stone Tablet asked, puzzled.","\"Is your throat injured?\" The hamster chimed in.","\"Silent Meditation?\" Lady Onion ventured.","The Su Clan elder across from them nodded slightly.","Curiously, Black-Skinned Soft Feather asked, \"If it's not Silent Meditation, couldn't Senior transmit secret sounds?\"","Using his spiritual energy as a pen, the Su Clan elder inscribed in the air, 'Lately, I've been experimenting with a secret technique. It is one related to spiritual energy and sound waves.'","\"I see,\" Daoist Stone Tablet said in understanding. \"Then, how should we address you, Fellow Daoist?\"","The Su Clan elder produced a spirit tablet from his belongings.","On it were the words 'Ancestor Su Clan's Knot'.","The Su Clan elder wore a bright smile as he indicated the memorial tablet and then himself.","He was the knot from the Su Clan engraved on the spirit tablet!","\"So, you're Fellow Daoist Su Clan's Knot. I've heard much about you,\" Pavilion Master Chu said while adopting an adult's polite tone.","\"!!!\" When Song Shuhang noticed that this Su Clan elder carried his own spirit tablet, he felt an inexplicable sense of familiarity.","\"So, you're Senior Knot!\" he exclaimed.","Su Clan's Knot was confused","\"Senior, when I saw you, I felt a sense of familiarity. We must have something in common.\"","Su Shi's Knot was alarmed.","\"Senior, look.\" Song Shuhang reached out and patted Daoist Stone Tablet's body to reveal its original form.","A massive stone tablet stood upright.","Engraved on it were the words: 'Song Shuhang's Tomb'. However, Senior White Two's signature had been concealed. That signature possessed tremendous power, and if it were to manifest openly within the Su Clan, it might attract the malevolent energies of the Netherworld and cause needless trouble.","One carried a spirit tablet, the other a tombstone.","This was destiny.","\"Hahaha~\" Su Clan's Knot inscribed a string of laughter in the air.","Human relationships were complex, yet sometimes remarkably simple. A peculiar commonality could foster increased affinity between individuals.","\"I've nearly reached the crucial stage of my research on this secret technique. If you and the fairies are interested, why not accompany me? I'll explain this secret technique to you. If we're destined, perhaps you and the fairies will gain something from it,\" Su Clan's Knot was in high spirits. He not only overlooked Song Shuhang and the others' intrusion into the formation but also extended an invitation for them to witness his creation of the secret technique.","\"Senior Knot... would this be appropriate? After all, every secret technique is exceedingly valuable,\" Song Shuhang offered politely.","\"Don't be so formal. I had originally intended to unveil this secret technique at the Spirit River Su Clan's annual gathering. Consider it a New Year's gift from me, an old-timer, to the younger generation,\" Su Clan's Knot wrote in the air.","\"Then, we'll have to trouble you,\" Song Shuhang replied with a smile. He possessed fewer than twenty secret techniques in total, a stark contrast to his Eighth Stage Profound Sage status.","It was as though he was dragging down the overall proficiency level of an Eighth Stage Profound Sage.","To become a qualified senior, Song Shuhang wouldn't pass up the opportunity to acquire a powerful secret technique. Even if he couldn't master it personally, he could keep it to enrich his 'knowledge repository.' In the future, with Senior Knot's permission, he could pass the secret technique on to his disciples.","\"No, I suddenly recalled that Young Friend Tyrannical Song, you're not from the Spirit River Su Clan,\" Su Clan's Knot abruptly wrote in the air.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","Su Clan's Knot sported a mischievous grin. \"Oh, never mind.\"","Mid-sentence, Knot wiped away his words.","Then, he rewrote: \"I heard that you possess a unique technique for dealing with 'inner demons'? I have a peculiar hobby in life. I enjoy consuming unusual entities, and among them, the flavor of inner demons suits my palate the most.\"","Black-Skinned Soft Feather was so frightened that she took refuge in Song Shuhang's shadow. She had felt uneasy since entering this place, and now it seemed that the source of her unease was the Su Clan's ancestor.","\"How did you know that I have the ability to deal with inner demons?\" Song Shuhang asked, intrigued.","\"I heard it from a friend. We old folks also communicate privately. We aren't all so isolated from the world,\" Su Clan's Knot wrote in the air. \"So, can I exchange my secret technique for the Inner Demon Set?\"","\"Deal,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile. In his Inner World, he still had some fresh 'inner demon ingredients' that he had extracted and sealed from the bodies of the two juniors.","\"Please come in. In fact, the secret technique I'm about to successfully research is highly suitable for Profound Sage Lectures. It allows the caster and the recipient to experience the same feelings and immerse themselves in the same experiences. Young Friend Tyrannical Song, you'll surely appreciate it.\"","Young Friend Tyrannical Song's lectures were clearly meant to blaze his own path.","If he could master this secret technique, he would undoubtedly astonish all cultivators in the universe during his next Profound Sage Lecture."]},{"number":2413,"title":"Chapter 2413 With a Snap, Tyrannical Song Disappeared","paragraphs":["As soon as he heard that Senior Su Clan's Knot had developed a secret technique that could enhance the effectiveness of his Profound Sage Speech, Song Shuhang's eyes gleamed beneath his mask.","If he were to ascend to the Eighth Rank, it would be his true moment of divinity on display before the masses. It would also mark his final appearance on stage to address practitioners from countless realms. Therefore, for his last speech, Song Shuhang hoped for perfection.","\"As long as it's a secret technique that can aid in my Profound Sage Speech, I believe I will appreciate it,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Su Clan's Knot also smiled.","He led Song Shuhang, Soft Feather, and Song Shuhang with all his hanging pendants into the central formation's immortal cave.","Then, he found a seat and sat down while using his finger as a pen to begin explaining the principles, effects, and creative concepts behind the secret technique he was developing.","Soft Feather, Lady Onion, the hamster, and even Pavilion Master Chu, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, and Scarlet Heaven Sword all fell silent and listened attentively.","Not far away, Song Shuhang multitasked. He extracted raw materials for the inner demon tribulation from his Inner World while absorbing Su Clan's Knot's explanation. He began crafting the inner demon tribulation set meal.","Inherited from the Heavenly Tribulation Feast of the Demon Emperor, there were several cooking methods for the Inner Demon Tribulation Set Meal. The most basic ones were Inner Demon Tribulation Sashimi Slicing and Smoked Inner Demon Tribulation.","But today, Song Shuhang was up for the challenge of the more difficult Roasted Milk Heart Demon. The raw materials for the inner demon tribulation in his hand were from a lower-level cultivator and were considered delicate milk inner demons among inner demons that were suitable for this cooking method. Moreover, he had previously traded with the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group for a large quantity of heavenly and earthly treasures which conveniently provided all the ingredients needed for Roasted Milk Heart Demon.","Su Clan's Knot's words flowed like the voice of the Great Dao. While explaining the secret technique he had created, it triggered waves of strange phenomena.","Heaven and earth phenomena enveloped Su Clan's Knot's cave abode and attracted the attention of most members of Spirit River Su Clan.","Moments later, a delightful aroma wafted out of the cave abode.","\"What is Old Ancestor Knot up to?\" Su Clan's Fourth, who was busy, asked in puzzlement.","Why was there a delightful aroma accompanying the voice of the Great Dao?","Could it be that the old ancestor was delving into some kind of Immortal Chef Technique? This Immortal Chef's method involved the Great Dao Law, which could explain this peculiar phenomenon?","His explanations were simple and easy to comprehend. However, even with this simplicity, the secret technique he had created could not be fully explained in a short amount of time.","Time flew by swiftly as Knot concluded his three-day-long 'secret technique lecture.'","Deep in the universe, the battle between Senior White Two's projected clone and the fat ball's clone continued.","\"You've grown weaker. It seems that this clone of yours has many limitations. Over time, you've become progressively weaker, while I haven't expended much energy,\" Senior White Two said with satisfaction.","\"Die, die, die!\" the fat ball's clone roared angrily.","\"Right, my main body has been studying your corpse recently. I've compiled a lot of data on the 'Heaven Harmony Destruction Orb,'\" Senior White Two continued to taunt the fat ball.","The fat ball clone was rendered speechless.","\"When it comes to research, I have something interesting to share. When I used your corresponding Heaven Harmony Destruction Orb for study, I employed equipment that you had created. Yes, it was your steel nest that I relocated. The magical equipment used for research was quite user-friendly. Actually, if you hadn't been my initial adversary, we might have become friends,\" Senior White Two continued.","The fat ball's clone exclaimed, \"You die or I die, we can't coexist!\"","\"That's true. If we were friends, I'd have no one to engage in combat with for thousands of years. How dull would that be?\" Senior White Two laughed.","Senior White Two was a skilled ruler of the Netherworld who attacked his foes physically, mentally, and psychologically.","The fat ball's clone couldn't keep up in terms of eloquence; it was far inferior to Bai Youyou.","It held its tongue and employed all its methods to assail Bai Youyou.","Senior White Two silently bolstered his defenses and deflected some of the attacks that breached his defense with his sword.","\"The fat ball's clone is becoming even weaker, and this weakness extends back to its main body,\" Senior White Two noted.","Senior White Two peered into the depths of the universe.","Several months ago, a signal indicating the imminent collapse of the Heavenly Dao was detected by all beings above the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm in the universe.","This month, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball appeared in the primary world.","Now, even the fat ball's main body in the Netherworld Realm was weakening.","\"Perhaps I should visit the fat ball's true body,\" Senior White Two murmured.","Lately, his main body had been collaborating with Song Shuhang's main world and provided experimental data for the God Creation Plan. Now that the data had been supplied, the rest could be left to his research avatar.","\"Fatty ball, in which coordinate of the Netherworld Realm is your main body located?\" Senior White Two suddenly called out.","\"Bai Youyou, you damn bastard!\" the fat ball's clone roared.","\"Forget it, my main body will find it on its own,\" Senior White Two chuckled.","Maybe... this would be the last time they ever met.","As the mortal enemy of the fat ball in the Netherworld Realm, he would silently watch over it during the final stages of its life.","The time for the speech slipped through Song Shuhang's fingers while quietly passing by, imperceptible to others.","When he looked back, three days had already gone by.","Knot retracted his finger and concluded his three-day-long 'secret technique lecture.'","Coincidentally, the Roasted Milk Heart Demon that Song Shuhang had carefully prepared with the assistance of the Demon Emperor's Demon Sect's Chef's Heart was successfully completed at that very moment.","Two wonderful accomplishments coincided and brought double the joy to everyone present.","Song Shuhang took out a kitchen knife, sliced a piece of the Roasted Milk Heart Demon, and placed it on a plate. He offered it to Knot. \"Senior Knot, please try the Roasted Milk Heart Demon.\"","Knot took a deep whiff of the fragrance and wrote, \"Excellent!\"","He extended his hand and accepted the roasted breast inner demon from Song Shuhang while wearing a smile that evoked pity for all living beings.","Just as the Ancient was about to take a bite, he suddenly heard a thousand-mile voice transmission from Su Clan's Fourth. \"Old Ancestor, are you finished? If so, come to Su Xing's Book Pavilion. The clan's disciples have already gathered and are awaiting your words of wisdom for the younger generation.\"","Knot gazed silently at the heart demon in his hand.","Moments later, Knot snapped his fingers.","Song Shuhang disappeared."]},{"number":2414,"title":"Chapter 2414 The Dominance of Genetics","paragraphs":["At Spirit River Su Clan, there was Su Xing Book Pavilion.","The name Book Pavilion might conjure images of a library or a bookstore, both places where Song Shuhang enjoyed spending time. Under normal circumstances, he could find a quiet corner and stay there for quite a while.","But today was different. He had no desire to linger even a moment longer in this Su Xing Book Pavilion.","The situation was too awkward. He didn't want to say anything now. He just wanted to leave as soon as possible.","Just a moment ago, with a sudden snap of his fingers, he had disappeared from Knot's cave abode and was teleported.","\"Welcome, Patriarch!\" A solemn voice sounded in his ears. \"Welcome, Patriarch!\"","Before he could react, he heard a series of welcoming voices from men and women, old and young.","Then, Song Shuhang appeared. At that moment, he was wearing a kitchen apron and holding an immortal chef's kitchen knife in his right hand. He appeared in front of the Su Clan's clansmen.","With his appearance, the entire Su Xing Book Pavilion fell silent.","It was as if fate had grabbed their throats, and they could not make a sound.","It was so awkward.","How was he going to continue this scene?","Song Shuhang silently pushed the mask on his face. Fortunately, he had the mask that Su Clan's Sixteen had given him, which not only covered his face that could speak, but also covered his awkwardness and unnatural expression.","His gaze swept across the gathered clansmen of the Su Clan.","Then, several familiar figures appeared in his line of sight.","For example, Sixteen's younger brother, 'Wanting to Touch Everything,' Su Kongyun, as well as Su Xiao Xiao and Su Ni, who came to the Jiangnan area with Su Kongyun to deliver invitations.","Beside these little fellows was Su Moying, the fellow daoist who had welcomed them at the Vermilion Bird Gate of the Spirit River Su Clan a few days ago. At this moment, Su Moying stood frozen with eyes wide open.","He shifted his gaze to the side, where the most important member of the Spirit River Su Clan stood. For example, the important elders and deacons of various positions, as well as the strongest genius of the Spirit River Su Clan—the Su Clan + number combination.","The corner of Senior Su Clan's Seven's mouth twitched as he stared at Song Shuhang.","And standing next to Seven was that petite and cute figure—Su Clan's Sixteen.","The White Dragon was still wrapped around Sixteen's neck like a scarf. The lifelike real dragon scarf forcefully added a few strokes of nobility that didn't match Su Clan's Sixteen's style.","Ever since she was influenced by the laws of time and had a lecture with Sixteen in the past, the White Dragon seemed to have gotten used to her identity as a scarf pendant. She had been wearing a scarf and hanging it around Sixteen's neck.","Song Shuhang and Sixteen looked at each other.","Sixteen winked at him.","It seemed like she had safely exited the secret trial realm.","Sixteen, who had just returned from the secret realm, seemed to have been relieved of a huge burden. The feeling she gave off was even lighter.","\"About that. Where's the ancestor?\" the man who spoke first asked.","Song Shuhang followed the voice and looked at the man.","It was a man with long bangs that covered his eyes.","\"This is Senior Su Clan's Four...The reason why he had such long bangs was because he felt that his eyes were useless a few days ago, so he donated them. However, with his strength, he will be able to grow a new pair of eyes after some time, so there's no need to worry.\" Su Clan's Sixteen secretly transmitted her voice to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","So it was Senior Su Clan's A'San. As expected, he lived up to his reputation.","As expected, the number three was cursed in this universe.","Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, Senior Copper Trigram, who was ranked third among the Gold, Silver, and Bronze Sages, Senior Three-Eyed, the third Sage in a thousand years who courted love during the 'show of divinity' segment, and so on...","Any cultivator whose daoist name or ranking had a 'three' in it seemed to have been kissed by some kind of virus.","\"Cough, it's like this. Senior Knot had just finished his work, so he needed to rest for a while and eat something to replenish his stamina. So, he sent me here to greet everyone.\" Song Shuhang braced himself and replied.","\"I knew it! On the surface, the ancestor was in seclusion, but he was actually secretly eating. I was puzzled. When I kept smelling the alluring fragrance from his cave abode, I thought he was comprehending some Immortal Chef secret technique.\" Su Clan's Four slapped the table.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"For the sake of a little food, he left all of our Su Clan's disciples hanging here. It's too unpresentable. This kind of behavior has caused the hearts of all of our Su Clan's disciples to turn cold. You guys wait here. I'll go correct the ancestor's mistake now,\" Su Clan's Four said loudly.","After saying that, he wiped the corner of his mouth and got up to fly to Knot's cave abode.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","However, just as Su Clan's Four jumped into the air, before he could take off, a small hand grabbed his calf and pulled him down from the air, smashing him onto the ground.","\"Four, don't mess around.\" The owner of the small hand, a fairy maiden who was as petite as Su Clan's Sixteen, frowned.","\"This is Fairy Su Wu, also known as Su Clan's Five. She is a great senior of the Spirit River Su Clan and has a very high seniority.\" Su Clan's Sixteen secretly sent a voice transmission to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang glanced at the petite Fairy Su Wu, and then secretly glanced at Su Clan's Sixteen from the corner of his eye.","It seemed like this was a powerful inheritance.","Su Clan's Four got up and coughed lightly. Then, he cupped his fists at Song Shuhang and entered a polite mode. \"Fellow Daoist, may I ask who you are?\"","Although he had donated his eyes, it didn't affect Su Clan's Four's actions in the slightest. To a cultivator of his level, it didn't make much of a difference whether he had eyes or not.","\"I am Tyrannical Song.\" Song Shuhang put away the kitchen knife and returned the greeting with cupped fists.","The reason why he chose to use the Sage Name 'Tyrannical Song' was mainly because this Sage Name was the most well-known, and most people in the cultivation world would recognize it and made it easier to communicate.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?\" Su Clan's Four was stunned for a moment when he heard this title, but his surprise quickly turned into enthusiasm. \"I've heard a lot about you! Let's not beat around the bush. Did Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song come to the Spirit River Su Clan this time to research the issue of Profound Sage sterilization?\"","Song Shuhang blinked. He did not know how to respond to this unexpected question."]},{"number":2415,"title":"Chapter 2415 The Su Clan Annual Meeting","paragraphs":["At this moment, concealed beneath his mask, Song Shuhang wore a thoroughly bewildered expression. Su Clan's Four's words carried an enormous amount of information, and Song Shuhang's mind was busy processing numerous thoughts.","\"Why is he getting involved with the topic of researching and solving the issue of Profound Sage sterilization? Could it be related to the Expert Appraisal Technique he used during his speech?\"","\"And what exactly does Profound Sage sterilization mean? Right, those pendants on his body and Senior White seemed to have mentioned it before. As a cultivator's realm advances, the stronger they become, the more challenging it is for them to conceive the next generation.\"","\"The current record in the Nine Provinces Number One Group is that Senior Spirit Butterfly, when he was at the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, managed to conceive Soft Feather with his wife.\"","\"Could it be that reaching the Eighth Stage Realm means complete sterilization?\"","As Song Shuhang contemplated this, a sense of unease crept in. He was currently at the Seventh Stage Realm, and his primary body in the artificial small world was continuously absorbing primordial energy and data from the small world after merging with the enigmatic White 1-33. His cultivation seemed to be speeding up.","If he couldn't control this acceleration, he might reach the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm in a very short time. Could he truly be facing sterilization?","Frowning, Song Shuhang began to consider something crucial.","Why did the Scholarly Sage research the Impregnating Gaze back then?","Song Shuhang didn't understand why his thoughts had circled back to this topic. Nevertheless, he entertained a possibility: Did the Scholarly Sage research the Impregnating Gaze because he had faced rapid cultivation and accidentally reached the Eighth Stage Realm? Could it be that he intentionally began researching techniques like the Impregnating Gaze to solve the issue of Eighth Stage Profound Sage sterilization?","The more Song Shuhang thought about it, the more plausible it seemed.","It wasn't until the Fairy of Creation, hidden in his sleeve, issued a threatening chirp that he was jolted from his thoughts.","Clearing his throat, Song Shuhang said to Su Clan's Four, \"Senior Four, let's save the discussion on Profound Sage sterilization for after the annual party.\"","\"No need to call me 'senior.' We're equals here. Just call me Su Four,\" replied Su Clan's Four.","Song Shuhang was taken aback by this informality.","He exchanged glances with Su Clan's Seven and Sixteen while signaling for their help.","\"Don't play around, Four,\" Sixteen interjected while pulling Su Clan's Four away.","Seizing the opportunity, Su Clan's Seven stepped forward and smiled, saying, \"Actually, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is here at our Su Clan Annual Meeting for a special reason. He intends to distribute a batch of treasures in the Spirit River Su Clan.\"","Su Clan's Seven didn't mention the Wealth Throne. It was Song Shuhang's treasure, and whether or not to disclose it was his prerogative.","\"Distributing treasures?\" Su Clan's Four looked at Song Shuhang, puzzled.","\"The main reason is that I made an agreement with a senior. I obtained a batch of treasures from him, and according to our agreement, I will distribute these treasures on his behalf,\" Song Shuhang explained with a smile.","To be precise, the value of the distributed treasures was approximately a quarter of the value of the eye drops.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you truly live up to being the first Sage in a thousand years,\" Su Clan's Four acknowledged. \"Alright, then you should make the necessary arrangements with Seven.\"","\"I originally planned to surprise everyone. In fact, I've already made the preparations. Once all the guests have arrived, I will include Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in the opening segment,\" Su Clan's Seven added while reaching out to pull Song Shuhang along. \"Now is a good time. I'll take you for a rehearsal. You guys can handle receiving the ancestor.\"","Song Shuhang found himself being led away by Su Clan's Seven.","Su Clan's Sixteen quietly exited the group and followed them.","Meanwhile, Su Clan's Four rested his chin on his hand and watched the three departing figures with a thoughtful expression.","\"As expected, let's go find the ancestor. Something smells delicious,\" Su Clan's Four remarked.","Rumble!","Just then, amid a burst of dazzling light effects, Knot made a grand entrance.","The ancestor exuded a rich fragrance, and the corners of his mouth seemed a bit oily.","Su Clan's Four cleared his throat.","\"Greetings, Patriarch!\" chorused all the Su Clan disciples.","At the same time, many onlookers raised their heads in astonishment. This ancestor, rumored to have passed away long ago, was still alive!","Patriarch Knot smiled and began to write in the air while speaking.","---","In the distance, Su Clan's Seven led Song Shuhang further away.","\"Senior Seven, is the annual party about to start?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Yes, today is the day of the annual meeting. Originally, they were waiting for the ancestor to make an appearance and say a few words before welcoming the guests and officially starting the annual meeting. They just didn't expect that the one to appear suddenly would be you,\" Su Clan's Seven replied with a smile.","\"Have the seniors from the group arrived?\" Song Shuhang asked.","Su Clan's Seven nodded.","\"Has Senior White also arrived?\" Song Shuhang wondered how far Senior White's God Creation Plan had progressed.","\"I contacted Senior White. He will be here shortly,\" Su Clan's Seven replied."]},{"number":2416,"title":"Chapter 2416 Wishing to Guard This Scene","paragraphs":["\"I hope Senior White can make it in time for the annual meeting,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile.","As soon as he finished speaking, the sword chimed in, \"No need to worry, even if Senior White isn't here, as long as you're here, Shuhang, the Su Clan's annual meeting will definitely be safe.\"","Song Shuhang was confused.","Su Clan's Seven, who was behind him, burst into laughter, instantly understanding the situation.","After conducting some research in the Nine Provinces Number One Group, they had noticed a pattern. Whenever Senior White and Song Shuhang teamed up for an adventure, the process would be remarkably smooth and trouble-free.","\"Oh, Shuhang, Seven, Little Sixteen, you've finally arrived,\" the voice of Thrice Reckless Mad Saber sounded from behind.","Su Clan's Sixteen turned her head and saw Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber holding a large wine jar that emitted a rich fragrance.","Su Clan's Seven took a whiff and let out a satisfying sigh. \"Where did this wine come from?\"","The Spirit River Su Clan had never encountered this type of wine before, so it seemed that Thrice Reckless Mad Saber had brought it from elsewhere.","\"It's Copper Trigram. He acquired this fine wine from that mysterious island. He might come later, so he asked me to bring the wine over first,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber patted the wine jar. \"Let's go inside. Most of the fellow Daoists from the group are already here.\"","Su Clan's Seven took a step forward and pushed open the courtyard's large gate.","Behind the gate lay an expansive classical courtyard.","There were pavilions, small bridges, and flowing water.","Bamboo rafts drifted on the lake, and plum blossoms bloomed on the shore.","Every detail in the courtyard showcased the Spirit River Su Clan's opulence and wealth!","Most members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were gathered in the central pavilion on the lake.","A melodious tune emanated from Dharma King Creation, who sat on the railing with an ancient zither resting on his knees. The harmonious melody flowed from his fingertips. Dharma King Creation excelled in lyrics, composition, and musical instruments. As long as he didn't speak, he was a grandmaster in the world of music.","Fairy Susu and Fellow Daoist Celestial Guest Cloudsoar, who had just emerged from seclusion this year, held a pipa and played a flute to accompany Dharma King Creation.","On the bamboo raft in the middle of the lake, Fairy Dongfang Six wore a red immortal robe, while Fairy Lychee donned a light blue immortal robe. The two fairies danced barefoot on the bamboo raft, graceful and enchanting.","The scenery was picturesque, the fairies were captivating, and it was a sight to behold.","In the small bamboo pavilion by the lake, True Monarch Eternal Fire composed poems on the couplets hanging from the wall. Each stroke was like a sword, and each word held the artistic concept of rebirth. This portrayed the recent resurgence of the scholarly faction!","Fairy Dongfang Quiet Snow hung couplets for True Monarch Eternal Fire beside him. She resembled a young lady from a wealthy family. True Monarch Eternal Fire had promised to write ten different character styles for her after completing the required couplets for the day. It was a new song composed by Fairy Dongfang Snow for True Monarch Yellow Mountain, and its artistic concept was certainly on par with the 'Song of the Stupid Yellow Mountain.'","Venerable Yellow Mountain and Northern River's Loose Cultivator played chess with chess pieces in hand.","Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist leaned against each other, and the plum blossoms by their side were exceptionally vibrant.","Venerable Nuclear Explosion, Scholar Xian Gong, True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon, Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman, and Cave Lord Snow Wolf raised their glasses and toasted while laughing heartily.","The fairy-like white crane, dressed in a neutral purple Daoist robe, smiled as she poured wine for the fellow Daoists in the group. Her mood was excellent because she had heard that Senior White would be attending the annual meeting today.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer lay lazily on the roof of the building. The two cat ears on his head swayed gently.","Beside him was Doudou, who was constantly chattering about various things. Doudou shared its recent troubles with Young Master Phoenix Slayer, such as how Stupid Yellow Mountain had prepared an immortal cave for it and wanted it to venture out on its own.","The things that couldn't be obtained were often the best. In the past, Doudou had been closely guarded by Stupid Yellow Mountain and wasn't allowed to go out freely. As a result, it would often run away from home secretly. But now, it was about to venture out on its own, and no one would stop it anymore. It should have been the day it had dreamed of, but as it approached, it felt an emptiness inside.","On the small bridge, Shi, Zhu, and Cherry ran around, laughing heartily...","After Song Shuhang and Su Clan's Sixteen entered the courtyard, a warm smile appeared on their faces beneath their masks.","When the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group gathered together, there was a comforting atmosphere. There were no conflicts, and regardless of their backgrounds, the relationships among the group members were surprisingly harmonious.","Song Shuhang was grateful that his introduction to the path of cultivation had been through the Nine Provinces Number One Group. In the vast world, finding a group like the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group was exceedingly rare. Perhaps there would never be another group like this.","It was precisely this unique group of seniors that had shaped the current Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","\"Would you like a drink, Shuhang?\" Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman called out upon seeing Song Shuhang's arrival. Even though he wore a mask, the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were all too familiar with Song Shuhang and could recognize him at a glance.","\"Do you drink?\" Su Clan's Seven inquired.","\"Under normal circumstances, having a few drinks is fine,\" Song Shuhang replied.","He was already an adult, so he could have a few cups in moderation. However, the issue was that he was currently in a primordial spirit state. If he truly wanted to drink, he would have to transfer the wine to the main body of the artificial small world through the Inner World and let the main body taste it.","\"In that case, let's have a few drinks,\" Su Clan's Seven said. He took the lead and brought him to the side of their drinking companions.","\"Senior Thrice Reckless, allow me to pour you some wine,\" Su Clan's Sixteen offered while turning to Thrice Reckless Mad Saber and reaching out to receive the jar.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber handed the wine jar to Su Clan's Sixteen and winked at her, \"Tell young friend Shuhang to drink more. Last time, he left the banquet halfway to pick you up. This time, you must make up for it.\"","Su Clan's Sixteen was speechless.","\"Haha,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber laughed heartily and, together with Su Clan's Seven and Song Shuhang, sat down beside Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman.","True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon handed them wine cups.","Su Clan's Sixteen came over with the wine jar in her arms and took on the task of pouring wine, replacing True Monarch White Crane. She filled everyone's cups.","\"Cheers to the Su Clan's annual meeting,\" Scholar Xian Gong said, his face flushed as he laughed heartily.","Song Shuhang's primordial spirit raised his wine cup, not knowing whether to laugh or cry.","At this point, he couldn't stop the seniors from enjoying themselves, so he lifted his mask slightly, and his primordial spirit made a 'drinking' gesture.","In fact, all the fine wine had been transferred to his Inner World and stored there.","His main body was still in seclusion, so he couldn't drink it even if he wanted to.","Although he couldn't taste the wine, his primordial spirit could smell the rich wine fragrance.","Song Shuhang raised his wine cup and looked at the seniors beside him. Then, he looked at Su Clan's Sixteen behind him, the fairy dancing in the lake, Phoenix Slayer, Doudou, Senior Yellow Mountain, and Senior Northern River in the distant pavilion.","This scene calmed everyone's hearts.","Song Shuhang didn't even want to make a sound at this moment. He was afraid of ruining this picturesque scene.","On the other side, in Patriarch Rope's cave abode.","Soft Feather stretched out her hand and picked up Lady Onion and Hamster Number One.","\"It's about time. Let's go find Senior Song.\"","She placed Lady Onion and Hamster Number One on her shoulder and walked out of the cave abode with elegant and ladylike steps."]},{"number":2417,"title":"Chapter 2417 Strengthening the Primordial Spirit +1","paragraphs":["The previously lively Lady Onion and hamster were now exceptionally well-behaved.","They perched on the shoulders of Soft Feather, serving as mascots.","\"Strange, why am I behaving so obediently?\" Hamster wondered.","It felt like there was an energy field around Soft Feather that resembled a 'lady aura.' Under the influence of this aura, their every move became calm and obedient, beyond their control.","With this in mind, hamster turned its head to look at Lady Onion beside it.","Sure enough, Lady Onion was also affected, just like them.","Previously, Lady Onion would watch dramas, play games, and shop whenever she had free time. But now, she sat on Soft Feather's shoulder in a very ladylike posture while gazing ahead intently.","Even when Lady Onion spoke, her voice became melodious.","\"Soft Feather, do you know where Song Shuhang is?\" Lady Onion asked, lowering her voice unconsciously to give it a 'young lady' feel.","This ladylike tone made the hamster's fur stand on end. The voice was nothing like Lady Onion's.","Even Lady Onion herself felt uncomfortable. However, her voice had great potential. This soft voice, when listened to closely, had a certain charm, very enticing, with a high level of sexiness.","\"Yeah, I've detected Senior Song's presence,\" Soft Feather said while taking her graceful steps away from Knot's cave.","Behind her, there was an invisible force holding a large plate of Roasted Demon of the Milk Heart, which followed Soft Feather automatically.","...","...","Soon, Soft Feather arrived at the courtyard where the members of 'Nine Provinces Number One Group' were gathering.","She gently pushed open the courtyard's gate.","At the entrance, there was a man with a ethereal aura, as if he had merged with nature. He held a wine glass and leaned against a rockery.","He wore a gentle smile similar to 'Song Shuhang's signature smile' while watching the scene where the members of the group gathered harmoniously.","Even if he had been accidentally ignored by the group members, he still revealed his gentlest side when seeing everyone in harmony.","He believed that as long as he silently watched from the side, guarding the moment when the members were together, it would be enough.","When Soft Feather entered the courtyard, this man turned his head to look at her and raised the wine glass in his hand.","\"Scholar, aren't you going to join everyone for a drink?\" Soft Feather blinked at him.","\"No... My cultivation technique is at a critical stage right now. Even if I go up, the fellow daoists in the group will subconsciously ignore me. But it's okay, once I display my 'saintly presence' in the next step, I'll regain my presence,\" the man explained gently.","But just as he finished speaking, he suddenly realized something—Soft Feather had noticed him?","\"Come on, I'll support you, Senior,\" Soft Feather smiled and said, then turned and closed the courtyard gate, walking towards the location where Song Shuhang was.","...","...","\"Hey? Soft Feather, are you here too? Where's Senior Spirit Butterfly?\" Fairy Firefly, dressed in a bright red ancient costume, asked when she saw Soft Feather, but couldn't find Senior Spirit Butterfly.","\"Dad might come later. I came with Senior Song a few days ago,\" Soft Feather replied softly.","\"I see.\" Fairy Firefly nodded.","\"I'll go to Senior Song now and give Lady Onion and Hamster back to him,\" Soft Feather politely said and gave Fairy Firefly a nod.","\"Go ahead,\" Fairy Firefly smiled and passed by Soft Feather.","After taking a few steps, she suddenly remembered something and turned to look at Soft Feather's retreating figure.","At this moment, every step Soft Feather took with her long legs seemed to have been measured with a ruler, perfectly precise. Her walking posture was particularly pleasing.","Fairy Firefly rubbed her eyes. She must have had too much to drink, as she saw a fake Soft Feather.","Could it be the 'Heart Devil Soft Feather' in disguise and covered in thick makeup?","...","...","At the same time, Song Shuhang, who was drinking with his seniors, received a message from Black-Skinned Soft Feather.","He turned around and saw Soft Feather, the original one, holding a plate and approaching.","\"Senior Song, I've brought some food for everyone,\" Soft Feather arrived in front of the group of senior members while slightly bending over and placing the plate with slices of 'Roasted Demon of the Milk Heart' on the table.","A tempting aroma filled the air.","\"Isn't this the fragrance that came from Ancestor Knot's cave?\" Su Clan's Seven asked, looking at Soft Feather.","\"Yes, this is the 'Heart Devil Tribulation' that Senior Song has been roasting these days,\" Soft Feather replied.","Song Shuhang couldn't help but smile.","While talking, Soft Feather reached out and handed Lady Onion and Hamster back to Song Shuhang.","Lady Onion and Hamster inexplicably breathed a sigh of relief.","\"You've worked hard, Soft Feather,\" Song Shuhang said.","\"You're welcome, Senior,\" Soft Feather replied politely.","Then, she turned and looked at the scene where the members of Nine Provinces Number One Group were gathered.","It was a calm and peaceful scene.","\"Senior members, I'll go chat with Senior Yellow Mountain for a moment,\" Soft Feather stood up and said.","Thrice Reckless looked at Soft Feather in confusion—could Soft Feather and Senior Yellow Mountain really have a common topic to discuss?","\"I'll be right back,\" Soft Feather said, and then she cast a secret glance at Su Clan's Sixteen behind Song Shuhang.","As a result, when she sneakily glanced at Sixteen, Sixteen was also looking at her.","Soft Feather smiled and blinked at Little Sixteen, then turned and walked on the water towards the lakeside pavilion.","...","...","Meanwhile, Su Clan's Sixteen, after filling the wine glasses of the senior members, also looked at Soft Feather's retreating figure.","The white dragon on her neck moved slightly.","\"It doesn't seem like the usual Soft Feather, right?\" Su Clan's Sixteen transmitted.","\"It feels a bit... like... the Celestial Thearch. To be more precise, it has the scent of 'Time',\" the White Dragon replied.","\"Maybe Soft Feather's spiritual ghost is being possessed by the Celestial Thearch, or she's being influenced?\" Su Clan's Sixteen suggested.","\"Ask Song Shuhang about it. He has a private chat with the Soft Feather,\" the White Dragon suggested.","On the side, Song Shuhang's primordial spirit held a wine glass and was also deep in thought.","He had naturally noticed the difference in Soft Feather. After all, he had experienced something similar before.","\"It seems like Soft Feather has changed modes again?\" Song Shuhang thought to himself.","As he pondered, he elegantly drank the wine in the glass.","The fiery liquid, like a burning flame, flowed down his throat.","\"Ahem~\" Song Shuhang suddenly coughed violently.","Oh no, he forgot that he was in primordial spirit mode.","Would there be any adverse reactions from drinking this way?","Countless thoughts and ideas crossed Song Shuhang's mind.","At the same time, his finger pressed on the wine glass, and he used the Appraisal Secret Technique.","He wanted to know what was special about this wine and why his primordial spirit could directly drink it.","After a while, the appraisal results appeared in Song Shuhang's mind: [Metal Gua Series Exclusive Immortal Wine: This is a type of immortal wine specially brewed for Copper Gua Immortal Master by Silver Gua Immortal Venerable, used to nourish the primordial spirit of Copper Gua Immortal Masters.]","At the same time as the appraisal was completed, Song Shuhang felt a warm sensation surging from his abdomen that nourished his primordial spirit.","His primordial spirit was significantly strengthened.","\"Good wine!\" Song Shuhang's primordial spirit exclaimed while releasing a burst of alcohol-scented breath.","Then... his body collapsed to the ground.","Thrice Reckless on the side was startled. \"What happened?\"","Su Clan's Sixteen squatted down and gently pressed her hand on Song Shuhang's body.","After a while, she cried and laughed, \"Shuhang, you're drunk.\"","How did he suddenly get drunk when he had drunk so much before?","\"Maybe he had been enduring it earlier because he saw Little Sixteen pouring the wine,\" Mad Saber Thrice Reckless guessed.","\"Nutrient for the primordial spirit~\" the drunk Song Shuhang muttered.","Even though he was drunk, he still wanted to remind the senior members that this wine could nourish the primordial spirit, so they shouldn't waste it.","...","...","Some time passed.","The intoxication in Song Shuhang's body dissipated.","\"Oh, what a shame. I should have drunk more of that wine,\" he said while rubbing his head. This was a precious treasure that could nourish the primordial spirit, a rare opportunity.","He looked around and saw Su Clan's Seven and Soft Feather sitting on either side of him.","Also, the place where he was sitting now was not the courtyard where the group members gathered, nor was it a resting room—right now, he felt like he was stuffed inside a box.","\"Shuhang, you're finally awake. If you had slept longer, I would have thought of a way to wake you up forcibly,\" Thrice Reckless said. \"Sober up and get ready. It's our turn to make an appearance soon.\"","It was December 31, 2019, 9:00 PM.","The Su Clan's New Year's annual meeting had officially begun.","In a little while, it would be the turn of the members of Nine Provinces Number One Group to make their appearance.","And then, it would be the grand event of Song Shuhang's Wealth Throne scattering ceremony.","The annual meeting of the Su Clan would continue until January 1, 2020.","Song Shuhang rubbed his face and put on his mask. \"How are we going to make our appearance?\"","\"Seventh Sister said she arranged a show-stopping entrance for us,\" Su Clan's Sixteen said.","A show-stopping entrance?","Were they going to blast them into the sky or something?","\"Senior Song, enjoy the next moments to the fullest,\" Soft Feather transmitted with a smile.","\"Why do I feel like I'm being treated like a critically ill patient?\" Song Shuhang did not know whether to laugh or cry.","At this moment, with a loud noise, the large box space began to rise.","Vaguely, Song Shuhang heard Senior Seven introducing the members of Nine Provinces Number One Group loudly."]},{"number":2418,"title":"Chapter 2418 Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s Brilliant Appearance!","paragraphs":["\"We're about to make our entrance. Keep your image in mind,\" Northern River's Loose Cultivator reminded Thrice Reckless. At this crucial moment, it was essential not to tarnish the image of the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group in the eyes of the Spirit River Su Clan's juniors and avoid any negative impact on Seven's reputation.","\"Hehehehe,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber chuckled as he turned around and revealed his transformation into a gigantic monkey. He had been eagerly awaiting this moment for several days! For this Spirit River Su Clan annual meeting, he had custom-made the Seven Monkey Set specifically for this occasion.","Northern River's Loose Cultivator was speechless.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"By the way, dear seniors, since we're about to take the stage, why don't we make a stylish entrance?\" At that moment, Soft Feather, standing beside Song Shuhang, suggested.","\"No need for that. Seven promised us a spectacular entrance,\" Young Master Phoenix Slayer hurriedly intervened. His strong feline instincts urged him to avoid any unnecessary risks.","However, Venerable Yellow Mountain unexpectedly spoke up. \"Let's do it your way, Soft Feather.\"","Song Shuhang was taken aback. Senior Yellow Mountain was actively supporting Soft Feather's idea?","\"Very well, Senior Yellow Mountain,\" Soft Feather replied with a smile.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer was confused.","Northern River's Loose Cultivator was confused.","All the fellow cultivators of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were confused.","Everyone looked at Senior Yellow Mountain with bewilderment.","Had the world turned upside down today? Senior Yellow Mountain was endorsing Soft Feather's plan? What kind of persuasive magic had Soft Feather used on Senior Yellow Mountain?","Venerable Yellow Mountain crossed his arms and grinned. \"Don't think of me as too rigid. Occasionally, I crave a livelier atmosphere. Life would be rather dull without a bit of excitement.\"","\"Senior Yellow Mountain, this is quite unexpected coming from you,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber remarked, somewhat disheartened.","Venerable Yellow Mountain sighed and then retrieved a small disposable flying sword from his pocket and placed it on his back. He explained, \"Don't overthink it. As the group leader, I'll always take the lead in any situation. This flying sword is the 'mother' sword, and the ones on your bodies are the 'child' swords. I'll lead the way when the time comes.\"","Song Shuhang couldn't help but think that if he had a physical body, he could have handed his head to Senior Yellow Mountain and allow him to truly 'lead the way.'","Just as Song Shuhang pondered this, Senior Su Clan's Seven's booming voice echoed from outside to signal that he was ready to bring the Nine Provinces Number One Group members onto the stage.","The space above them gradually opened up.","The entire space lifted and floated upwards.","\"It's about time, Senior Yellow Mountain,\" Soft Feather reminded him.","Venerable Yellow Mountain clenched his teeth and infused his spiritual energy into the 'mother' 'secondary flying sword' on his back.","Swoosh!","A seven-colored divine light enveloped Venerable Yellow Mountain.","In the next instant, Senior Yellow Mountain's figure shot into the sky like a firework. Though he couldn't vouch for the other attributes of Senior White's flying sword, it was undoubtedly the fastest in the world.","Senior Yellow Mountain felt a slight bounce in his body as he was launched into the air. If it weren't for maintaining his dignified appearance as a senior, he might have screamed in surprise.","Furthermore, Venerable Yellow Mountain's trajectory wasn't a straight line but a graceful parabola.","Behind him, seven-colored sword lights descended continuously. They condensed and remained, forming a dazzling 'seven-colored staircase' trailing behind Venerable Yellow Mountain.","This entrance was both stunning and awe-inspiring.","Once at the highest point, Senior Yellow Mountain's body was stabilized, and he began to spin in circles. Each rotation produced a rainbow-colored sword light and maintained the structure of the rainbow-colored staircase below.","\"It's our turn next, seniors. Please smile,\" Soft Feather signaled to all the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Below, Soft Feather in her black attire discreetly emerged while holding a camera professionally as she recorded this scene from a perfect angle!","As soon as Soft Feather finished speaking, one by one, the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were lifted into the air by the 'secondary flying sword.'","Each member was placed on a specific step of the Seven-Colored Stairway and began to rotate slowly.","Even Scholar, who had merged with nature, wasn't overlooked. He was positioned next to Northern River's Loose Cultivator. Looking at the Spirit River Su Clan's juniors' admiring gazes, Scholar felt a warm sensation in his heart.","\"Sixteen, it's our turn next,\" Soft Feather said as she grabbed Su Clan's Sixteen's arm.","With Soft Feather's words, the sword lights on their bodies flickered and carried them up the Heavenly Stairway.","\"Sixteen, you're so light now,\" Soft Feather remarked softly.","\"Yes,\" Su Clan's Sixteen replied while feeling a bit embarrassed by Soft Feather's grip on her arm.","Soft Feather then whispered, \"In the end, it's Senior Song. His luck is truly exceptional. He drew the flying sword meant for the grand finale.\"","\"Wasn't the finale flying sword predetermined?\" Su Clan's Sixteen asked, puzzled.","\"It's random! One of the flying swords in that bundle is designated for the finale. The flying effect is also quite extravagant. Senior White probably intended to keep it for himself when you consider his luck. However, since Senior White couldn't make it to the opening ceremony, Senior Song ended up drawing the final flying sword,\" Soft Feather explained while chuckling.","Su Clan's Sixteen couldn't help but feel that Soft Feather was somehow behind this arrangement.","As they spoke, the seven-colored light surrounding Song Shuhang's body began to flicker.","Whoosh ~ The seven-colored divine light expanded dramatically to form a sphere that enveloped Song Shuhang.","Shortly after, an illusory image of a pair of giant hands appeared and grabbed Song Shuhang, who had turned into a sphere, and hurled him into the sky.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, the grand finale!"]},{"number":2419,"title":"Chapter 2419 Wealth Throne and the Reward","paragraphs":["Honestly, Song Shuhang wasn't looking forward to such a flamboyant entrance.","After being thrown into the air by the pair of illusory giant hands, he let out a deep sigh and tried his best to maintain the composure expected of a Venerable. If this had happened half a year ago, he might not have been able to endure the combination of extreme speed and high altitude without letting out a pitiful scream.","But the current him was not the same as he was half a year ago.","Now that his virtuous lamia had returned to her original position, he didn't need to personally engage in something as energy-draining as screaming.","The virtuous lamia cooperated and appeared behind Song Shuhang. Her hands were raised in a 'shouting' position, and her body twisted like a snake while she emitted a long \"ahhh.\"","\"That's the way.\" Song Shuhang confidently pushed his mask aside. In fact, he had gradually accepted this setup. He believed that one day, his communication with others, cultivation, eating, and even speaking could all be done through the pendants on his body.","Everything was under his control!","The massive Song Clan's Rainbow Ball ascended into the sky.","In general, the speed of the seven-colored ball remained within the range that Song Shuhang could tolerate. It was estimated that he would successfully reach the top of the rainbow staircase in three seconds.","\"In that case, why not make the entrance of the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group more interesting?\" Song Shuhang calculated the time in his mind.","Once the time was up, he would activate the Wealth Throne and take the atmosphere to its peak.","Three seconds passed.","Song Shuhang quickly activated the imprint of the Wealth Throne on his palm.","The immense projection of the Wealth Throne materialized in the sky above the Spirit River Su Clan.","The iconic entrance with the enormous whirlpool, the inverted stairs inside the whirlpool, the celestial treasures adorning each step, the throne atop the stairs, and the small wooden door behind the throne—all were there!","Legend had it that the Wealth Throne, which appeared only once every few hundred or even a thousand years, emerged in the ancestral land of the Spirit River Su Clan.","Coincidentally, the Wealth Throne that Song Shuhang had opened happened to be at the top of the rainbow stairway formed by the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","It seemed as if everything had been carefully choreographed.","The special effects of the entrance of the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group exceeded Su Clan's Seven's expectations. Seven was left dumbfounded.","After a while, Seven's anger surged once more—because he saw a large monkey on the third step of the rainbow staircase that was spinning round and round while provocatively getting on his nerves. It was as though the monkey was constantly challenging him by saying, \"Hit me, hit me!\"","\"After the annual party ends, I must find an opportunity to take down this big monkey!\" Su Clan's Seven secretly made a vow on Fellow Daoist Seven Lives Talisman's small notebook.","...","...","\"Is this the Wealth Scattering Throne?\" The numerology cultivators of the Spirit River Su Clan immediately recognized the massive whirlpool in the sky and the inverted stairs within it.","To top-level experts, the Throne of Wealth held little significance. Based on their past experience, the quality of treasures within the Throne of Wealth was limited, and the number of treasures that could truly impact cultivators of the Eighth and Ninth Stages was minimal.","However, for most ordinary cultivators, the Wealth Throne represented a rare opportunity. Even disciples of the Spirit River Su Clan, who were part of a large and prosperous clan, couldn't resist the allure of the Wealth Scattering King-level expert.","\"Strange, didn't the Wealth Scattering King-level expert appear just two months ago?\"","In the past, it would only emerge once every several hundred or even a thousand years, right?","\"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is in charge of the Wealth Throne this time!\"","One sharp-eyed disciple of the Spirit River Su Clan spotted Profound Sage Tyrannical Song floating in the center of the vortex created by the Wealth Throne.","\"In other words, this time, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is overseeing the distribution of wealth?\"","\"Senior Tyrannical Song is indeed generous.\"","Some of the Spirit River Su Clan's juniors had developed a favorable opinion of Song Shuhang.","The First Sage in a thousand years was truly exceptional!","They hoped that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would visit the Spirit River Su Clan more frequently.","\"Do I need to explain the rules of the Wealth Throne? It's still the same old rules. Everyone will enter the Wealth Throne based on their own cultivation realm and fate, selecting treasures that resonate with them! Your rewards will be determined by your destiny!\" The 'ball' formed by the seven-colored sword lights beside Song Shuhang remained intact.","This seven-colored ball served as a visual effect and hovered around Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang, enclosed within the ball, raised his hands high, and the immense whirlpool emitted a gravitational pull.","The members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, positioned on the rainbow stairs, were drawn into the vortex of the Throne of Wealth.","Shortly after, the gravitational force of the whirlpool intensified and enveloped all the members of the Spirit River Su Clan below.","The Spirit River Su Clan disciples present followed this attraction and stepped into the Wealth Throne, ready to claim the treasures destined for them.","Having accomplished all this, Song Shuhang retreated to the wooden door behind the throne. He intended to discreetly transmit the spatial magical treasure that Senior Spirit Butterfly had left for Soft Feather to her.","...","...","\"Good evening, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.\" The eyeball butler approached and served Song Shuhang a fragrant tea.","\"Thank you.\" Song Shuhang accepted the immortal tea. Each visit to Senior Three-Eyed's small world allowed him to amass a small fortune just from enjoying this immortal tea. Unfortunately, he was currently in his primordial spirit state, so Lady Onion and the hamster were the fortunate recipients of this immortal tea.","\"Are you preparing for another advancement?\" Senior Three-Eyed was not lounging on his rocking chair today. Instead, he squatted in front of a box, tinkering with and adjusting the miniature world inside it.","\"Not yet. Eighth Stage Profound Sages are highly significant, so I'm planning to delay my advancement. Besides, Senior, you previously advised me to utilize my current cultivation level to explore the illusory reality. I'm diligently studying it.\" Song Shuhang replied.","Senior Three-Eyed raised his head.","\"Senior, I'm currently in the midst of a wealth distribution ceremony,\" Song Shuhang said in puzzlement. \"Didn't you sense it?\"","\"You've distributed the eye drops?\" Senior Three-Eyed was taken aback.","Song Shuhang explained, \"I'll exchange the eye drops and some items with fellow seniors for various treasures. Then, I'll transfer these treasures to the Wealth Throne and commence the wealth distribution ceremony.\"","\"Well done, Tyrannical Song. You're more astute than I thought. By the way, this is the first time you've truly distributed your wealth after acquiring so many treasures from me, isn't it?\" Senior Three-Eyed said with a smile.","In the previous instances, Song Shuhang didn't employ the usual method of wealth distribution and didn't perform the Wealth Throne Ritual.","\"Does it hurt to see so many treasures scattered?\" Senior Three-Eyed asked with a smile.","\"Don't worry, Senior.\" Song Shuhang casually waved his hand. \"My heart is tough now. This level of heartache can't pierce it.\"","Song Shuhang was now the unflappable man.","The three-eyed youth was rendered speechless.","How could I, the former ruler of the Netherworld, be happy if you don't cooperate?","\"My Lord, since Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song has initiated the Wealth Throne ceremony, we should prepare a hidden reward for him.\" The eyeball butler leaned closer to the three-eyed youth's ear and reminded him in a voice that Song Shuhang could hear.","Song Shuhang's eyes sparkled. A hidden reward for the wealth distribution ceremony?"]},{"number":2420,"title":"Chapter 2420 Fifty Percent Discount Coupon","paragraphs":["All hidden rewards were treasures, and in most cases, hidden rewards tended to be even more valuable than the ones given openly.","Song Shuhang looked at the three-eyed youth with anticipation while wondering what surprise the senior had in store for him.","As he eagerly awaited the revelation, a slight pang of regret tugged at his heart. In the previous bets with Senior Three-Eyed, the winnings had been precious items that couldn't be easily divided and rendered the use of the Wealth Throne for distribution impossible.","When he did the math, he realized that he had missed out on several rounds of hidden rewards. It was a loss of a whopping hundred million!","\"Is your heart aching?\" Senior Three-Eyed asked with a mischievous grin.","\"A bit,\" Song Shuhang admitted candidly.","\"Unfortunately, no matter how much your heart aches, I won't be able to reimburse you for the hidden rewards from the previous rounds,\" Senior Three-Eyed said as he stored away the pocket dimension.","\"In that case, I'll spare myself the heartache,\" Song Shuhang responded succinctly. There was no point in regretting missed opportunities when there was no way to rectify them.","Instead of allowing the heartache to torment him, he chose to let it go and allow it to become a thing of the past.","Senior Three-Eyed was left speechless.","This young man was becoming less endearing with each encounter. He was a far cry from the person he had first met. What had he gone through during this period that had hardened his mentality to such an extent?","\"Congratulations, Tyrannical Song, on developing a stronger and more resilient mindset,\" the elderly butler congratulated him.","Song Shuhang respectfully thanked the old butler and remarked, \"A fragile heart becomes stronger after enduring numerous trials.\"","Senior Three-Eyed remained silent.","\"Senior, what exactly is the hidden reward?\" Song Shuhang inquired with anticipation.","\"What do you desire?\" Senior Three-Eyed replied with a question of his own.","\"Perhaps a means of resurrection?\" Song Shuhang suggested. Despite having Pavilion Master Chu's red crystal figurine and the resurrection array prepared by Senior White Two, he felt the need for additional opportunities to resurrect in case he had to face the formidable Fat Ball.","Moreover, a valuable treasure like the Resurrection Array could be passed down to his disciples, making it more practical than any family heirloom.","\"Dream on. To revive you, I'd need a resurrection treasure at the 'peak of the Eighth Stage' or even 'Ninth Stage.' The value of such a reward would far exceed the total worth of the treasures you've distributed this time. Do you really think I'm running a charity here?\" Senior Three-Eyed rolled his three eyes, which was a challenging feat.","\"Senior, haven't you always been engaged in charity work? The Wealth Throne is one of the most renowned charity events in the multiverse,\" Song Shuhang reminded him.","Senior Three-Eyed was rendered speechless.","The eyeball butler nodded with a smile and brought forth a tray of exquisite pastries—treasures of the same caliber as immortal tea, each capable of extending one's lifespan with a single bite.","\"Thank you,\" Song Shuhang graciously accepted the pastries and continued, \"If obtaining a resurrection method is not feasible, how about obtaining 'knowledge' instead?\"","Senior Three-Eyed possessed the means to forcibly transfer knowledge and information.","Knowledge had always been a valuable asset, an enduring truth.","\"Do you seek the answer to the last 'Show of Divinity' discourse?\" Senior Three-Eyed inquired.","\"No, I desire the 'Ancient Language Set'!\" Song Shuhang declared his objective.","While the answers to the discourses were undoubtedly valuable, they contained a complex amalgamation of knowledge from countless universes and systems. If Song Shuhang had already reached the Ninth Stage Realm, he might have chosen the 'answer to a discourse' as a reward to expand his knowledge. However, his current priority was obtaining the Ancient Language Set, a linguistic tool soon to be utilized in the Eighth Stage Realm.","Senior Three-Eyed remained contemplative.","He found today's conversation with Song Shuhang to be quite taxing. It wasn't solely because Song Shuhang's heart had become impervious, but also because of the mask he wore.","This mask concealed Song Shuhang's expressive face and made it impossible for Senior Three-Eyed to glean answers from his expressions. This hindered their communication and slowed down their interactions.","\"Remove your mask so that we can converse more freely,\" Senior Three-Eyed suggested.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and stylishly pushed the mask aside. \"No, this mask is a gift from Little Sixteen. In the coming days, I won't take it off, not even for meals or sleep. At most, I'll reveal half of my face to you, Senior.\"","Senior Three-Eyed was left speechless.","On the side, the eyeball butler chimed in, \"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, the Ancient Language is a rather unique tongue. You won't be able to grasp its essence and soul solely through 'forced information transfer.' If possible, it would be best for you to learn and master it gradually.\"","\"Learning the Ancient Language through forced means lacks soul,\" Senior Three-Eyed confirmed.","Song Shuhang couldn't help but sigh.","\"I've thought of a suitable reward for you,\" Senior Three-Eyed finally spoke up.","\"Please, do share,\" Song Shuhang replied with curiosity.","\"While it won't grant you direct mastery of the Ancient Language, it will significantly enhance your learning efficiency when you study it,\" Senior Three-Eyed stated as he made a subtle hand gesture.","The eyeball butler stepped back and returned with a tray containing a crown made of thorns.","The appearance of this item conveyed a sense of pain.","\"Speaking of fate, this item is intertwined with yours,\" Senior Three-Eyed remarked with a smile.","\"Senior, I don't have a penchant for masochism,\" Song Shuhang quipped. While he did possess a high tolerance for pain, he didn't derive pleasure from it.","\"Who said anything about masochism? I meant that this item and your 'Throne of Endurance' are part of the same magical tool series. The Throne of Endurance is used to keep those on the brink of death alive, while this Wisdom Crown made of thorns is designed to enhance learning efficiency. When you wear it, even a slacker can become a top student. A top student can ascend to the status of a study god while wearing it,\" Senior Three-Eyed explained proudly.","\"Senior, your language is remarkably up-to-date,\" Song Shuhang remarked.","\"Of course, I've been keeping an eye on developments in the outside world,\" Senior Three-Eyed replied with a hearty laugh. \"So, are you satisfied with this treasure?\"","\"I just want to ask, does it hurt to wear it?\" Song Shuhang inquired cautiously.","\"Naturally. How could wearing something made of thorns not be painful?\" Senior Three-Eyed retorted.","Song Shuhang was left momentarily speechless.","\"Do you want it? If you don't, I'll keep it,\" Senior Three-Eyed offered.","\"Yes!\" Song Shuhang gritted his teeth. This item was a treasure, and it made for a wonderful gift he could offer to his disciples as an inexperienced teacher.","Once he had mastered the Ancient Language, he could pass this treasure on to his disciples, allowing them to wear the thorny crown and study diligently, day by day.","\"Hahaha, I love the way you grit your teeth while reluctantly accepting this treasure,\" Senior Three-Eyed laughed and retrieved a piece of paper from his pocket.","\"What is it?\" Song Shuhang took the paper and examined it.","It was a fifty percent discount coupon.","What on earth was this?"]},{"number":2421,"title":"Chapter 2421 The Whole World Knows","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang held the 'Fifty Percent Discount Coupon' in his hand and looked up at the three-eyed youth.","The three-eyed youth smiled slightly. His smile said it all. This 'Fifty Percent Discount Coupon' was a precious item that was far more valuable than an ordinary coupon.","\"A precious fifty percent discount coupon... Could this be a coupon from 'that' merchant?\" Song Shuhang's eyes lit up as he asked.","Even the three-eyed senior considered this coupon to be precious, and when he thought about it, there was probably no other coupon in the myriad realms that could match the description.","If it was indeed a coupon from that guy, then the value of this small piece of paper would be beyond estimation—after all, he possessed an overwhelming number of incredible items.","If he were to select the most expensive treasure from his collection and apply a fifty percent discount, the value in spirit stones would be astronomical!","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","\"Is that not the case?\" Song Shuhang noticed the expression on the three-eyed senior's face and realized he had made a mistake.","\"Since it's a coupon I provided, it's naturally related to me,\" the three-eyed senior sighed.","Song Shuhang felt a bit embarrassed. \"But, Senior, you don't sell things.\"","\"Tyrannical Song, although the master doesn't sell things, don't forget about the ultimate technique, the Godly Strike,\" reminded the eyeball butler on the side.","The Godly Strike, also known as the Money-Burning Strike by Song Shuhang, was a powerful technique that consumed a vast amount of precious materials. In theory, its power could be infinitely increased by using a sufficient quantity of celestial materials and earthly treasures.","This technique was one of Song Shuhang's most formidable offensive skills and was capable of determining the outcome of a battle. It was one of the most terrifying techniques in his arsenal, second only to the Karmic Virtue Sword. Of course, this was all under the premise of having enough money.","The principle of the Money-Burning Strike was to consume celestial materials and earthly treasures and transform it into an attack method. During the process, it would also borrow power from the three-eyed senior and form a ritual for the expenditure of money.","\"So, you're saying this Fifty Percent Discount Coupon allows me to save half of my wealth when I use the Money-Burning Strike?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"More or less.\" the eyeball butler nodded.","Song Shuhang held the Fifty Percent Discount Coupon and felt a chill in his heart.","He thought of the precious treasures he had acquired from the seniors of the 'Nine Provinces Number One Group.' Aside from the materials consumed during the Wealth Distribution Ritual, he had kept a batch of celestial materials and earthly treasures for unforeseen needs, such as crafting exclusive artifacts for his disciples.","Now that he had this coupon, he couldn't shake the feeling that his treasures would soon be used up in the Money-Burning Strike.","With that in mind, Song Shuhang hesitantly asked, \"Senior, can this coupon be converted into cash?\"","The three-eyed senior responded with a smirk, \"Are you handsome enough?\"","Song Shuhang replied, \"If I say I'm handsome enough, will you convert it into cash, Senior?\"","In fact, Song Shuhang had a fairly pleasant appearance even before his cultivation journey. His facial features were well-proportioned. After undergoing numerous body tempering and cultivation breakthroughs, his current appearance was quite handsome.","\"Alright, impossible things are best left unspoken. The Wealth Distribution Ritual outside is coming to an end, and it's time for you to leave this space,\" the three-eyed senior said as he held the box. \"See you next year.\"","\"See you next year,\" Song Shuhang waved the Fifty Percent Discount Coupon.","When he exited the Wealth Distribution Ritual Throne, it would be nearly the start of a new year in the earthly realm.","His life, Song Shuhang's life, was about to enter a brand new year!","...","...","Song Shuhang pushed open the small wooden door and entered the Wealth Distribution Ritual Throne.","His gaze shifted downwards.","At this moment, members of the Su Clan, senior members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, and other members with sacred titles were all on various steps of the Wealth Distribution Ritual Throne to choose the treasures they needed. These treasures were originally provided by members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, and for the seniors, this Wealth Distribution felt more like an 'exchange of treasures' activity within the group.","Song Shuhang's thoughts turned, and he locked onto the location of Soft Feather. Senior Butterfly had asked him to secretly exchange the Universal Bangle for her.","Now was the perfect time!","At that moment Soft Feather, No. Sixteen, and some other members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group with sacred titles were all on the step reserved for Eighth Rank Profound Saints.","Coincidentally, Soft Feather was reaching for a box. Song Shuhang immediately recognized the item inside the box. It was a hairpin-like artifact, a prototype of a hairpin that served as a decoration for immortal attire. Just like Soft Feather's hairpin, this one was also a prototype artifact.","Soft Feather smiled as she took the box.","Song Shuhang's mind moved, and he used the management authority of the Wealth Distribution Ritual Throne to secretly transfer the Universal Bangle into the box that Soft Feather had just taken. He completed the task that Senior White had entrusted to him.","After Soft Feather took the box, she turned around and looked at Su Clan's Sixteen, who was not far away, observing.","Su Clan's Sixteen casually touched the scarf with a dragon pattern around her neck and looked at the treasures on the Wealth Distribution Ritual Throne. She didn't particularly desire anything, so she planned to choose something randomly after everyone else had made their selections to avoid accidentally taking something others wanted.","A few minutes later, everyone on this step had already chosen their treasures. Su Clan's Sixteen came to a box without any particular desire in mind. She reached out and took it.","Song Shuhang glanced at it and saw that the box contained a 'gossamer cloak,' a decorative ribbon used to complement immortal attire. Just like Soft Feather's hairpin, this gossamer cloak was also a prototype artifact.","\"Should I perform another secret exchange to give Sixteen a surprise? After all, she just gave me a valuable mask.\" Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Then... he searched through his treasure trove in his core world and sighed.","He did have precious items on him, but they were all immovable assets.","\"Tyrannical Song, did you perform a secret exchange just now?\" Suddenly, a voice echoed in Song Shuhang's mind.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","I finally did a secret exchange, and now it seems like the whole world knows about it. It's as if everyone knows I performed a secret exchange!","\"Tyrannical Song, if you can still perform secret exchanges, I have something here that I hope you can secretly deliver to Su Clan's Sixteen. What do you think?\" the voice continued.","\"What is it?\"","\"Three packaged Su Clan's Sixteens,\" the voice replied.","Song Shuhang was flabbergasted."]},{"number":2422,"title":"Chapter 2422 Star Path Map, Su Clan’s Sixteen Takes Form","paragraphs":["Three packaged Sixteens, that's fantastic~","But wait, that's not the issue! Why does the owner of this mysterious voice have three packaged Sixteens?","In Sixteen's trial, wasn't she supposed to find and encounter different 'Sixteens,' defeat them, and retrieve them?","As this thought crossed Song Shuhang's mind, he couldn't help but wonder. \"Is this the work of the mysterious ancestor of the Su Clan?\"","Only the enigmatic ancestor of the Su Clan could interfere with Su Clan's Sixteen's 'trial' and bring different Sixteens here.","\"I don't have time to explain. Little Sixteen is about to open the gift box. Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you going to help?\" urged the mysterious voice.","\"Sure,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","As soon as he spoke, he felt a faint spatial fluctuation in his palm. The frequency of this spatial fluctuation didn't seem like the spatial power of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, but more like Senior White's spatial talent.","Soon after, three thumb-sized crystals appeared in Song Shuhang's palm.","Each crystal contained a miniature version of Su Clan's Sixteen.","Song Shuhang examined the three crystals. Not good. These three crystals emitted a peculiar energy field. Anyone who saw them would suddenly desire to collect them!","...","...","Meanwhile, Su Clan's Sixteen had gently opened the box.","\"Undercover operation!\" Song Shuhang quietly activated his authority as the administrator of the Throne of Wealth and covertly transferred the three Sixteen crystals into Su Clan's Sixteen's box.","At that moment, Su Clan's Sixteen's action of opening the box momentarily paused.","When she had chosen this box, she had already determined the treasure inside. However, when she opened it, three objects connected to her life suddenly appeared.","The White Dragon also sensed something.","Su Clan's Sixteen carefully put away the three crystals. Due to their small size, the White Dragon only needed to open a small spatial entrance to place the three crystals with all the other 'Sixteen clones' she had collected previously.","After Su Clan's Sixteen finished opening the treasure chest, the Wealth Throne's activity came to an end.","Besides the treasures selected by the Su Clan members and the Nine Provinces Number One Group, there were also some remnants of natural treasures left in the Throne of Wealth.","However, Song Shuhang couldn't access this portion of the treasures. He had to save it for the next wealth distribution ceremony. After his bet with Senior Three-Eyed was completed and the binding with the wealth distribution throne was removed, he could use the remaining treasures in the wealth distribution throne all at once and turn them into a 'pay-to-win' arsenal.","...","...","The vortex of the Wealth Throne began to spin again.","The Su Clan members who had obtained satisfactory treasures during the wealth distribution ceremony were moved out one by one and returned to the ground.","After a while, only the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group remained.","\"Seniors, let's descend as well,\" Song Shuhang suggested with a smile.","\"I need to descend first. The Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting will still be hosted by me and Ah Four,\" Su Clan's Seven gave Song Shuhang a thumbs-up. \"Well done, Junior Song! Thanks to this round of wealth distribution ceremony, your favorability among the Spirit River Su Clan members will keep rising. The higher the favorability, the more freedom you'll have in the Spirit River Su Clan in the future.\"","\"It's all thanks to the strong support of the seniors,\" Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","The members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group began to leave the space of the Wealth Throne.","Song Shuhang looked at the seniors departing one by one and thought about his Intrinsic Golden Core Composition.","On his Intrinsic Whale Core, there was a special Golden Core composition called the Star Path Map.","The dragon pattern on the whale core emitted abundant starlight, creating a winding star path on the whale's body. The people Song Shuhang knew, including most of his friends and influential figures, turned into illusory figures and appeared on this star path.","It began with the first time Song Shuhang encountered 'Soft Feather' and ended with the other 'Soft Feather' who opened the door.","All the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, as well as most of Song Shuhang's friends and significant figures, could be found on the star path.","However, Senior White Two, Su Clan's Sixteen, and Senior White Two were not on this star path.","Song Shuhang sighed softly and said, \"Sixteen's still not here... Huh?\"","Just as he sighed, at the beginning of the star map, between Soft Feather and Senior Yellow Mountain, a faint figure began to appear.","Shoulder-length hair, sharp little dragon horns, a delicate porcelain doll-like face, and a petite body...","It was Su Clan's Sixteen!","Su Clan's Sixteen, who had been unable to project onto Song Shuhang's natal star map all this time, finally took form as 2019 was nearing its end!","Song Shuhang suddenly turned his head to look at Su Clan's Sixteen. Sixteen had successfully consolidated her form on the star map. Did this mean that Su Clan's Sixteen had passed her 'trial by fire'?","As expected, Su Clan's Sixteen's body underwent a change.","Her dragon horns seemed to have grown slightly taller. In a way, dragon horns were also a part of her body. As a result, Su Clan's Sixteen's height increased a bit.","At the same time, Su Clan's Sixteen's aura became more complete. Though she still had a light and ethereal quality, the current Sixteen seemed to have finally found stability. She was no longer as insubstantial as before. It was as if she could dissipate at any moment.","The three 'Sixteens' that the owner of the mysterious voice had Song Shuhang secretly manipulate were the key to Su Clan's Sixteen's transformation.","That was great!","Song Shuhang observed Su Clan's Sixteen, who was gradually completing her natal star map, and secretly sighed in relief. He had to thank the owner of that mysterious voice.","\"Are you still there?\" Song Shuhang tried calling out in his mind.","\"I'm still here,\" the mysterious voice replied.","\"Thank you for helping Sixteen. May I know your name?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"You can call me Little Cutie,\" the mysterious voice replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"Goodbye,\" the mysterious voice said.","This time, she didn't disguise her voice.","The voice... It was somewhat similar to Su Clan's Sixteen's, but it had a mature quality to it.","Was it Sixteen's mother?"]},{"number":2423,"title":"Chapter 2423 In the Face of Expanding Power, Everything is Just a Paper Tiger","paragraphs":["\"If the owner of this mysterious voice was really Su Clan's Sixteen's mother, should I ask Sixteen about her mother's situation?\" Song Shuhang thought to himself.","However, as this thought crossed his mind, he suddenly remembered something. During the recent Su Clan's annual gathering, he never once met Su Clan's Sixteen's parents!","Senior Seven didn't introduce them to him, and Sixteen never mentioned anything about her parents.","Moreover, when Su Clan's Sixteen faced her Fourth Stage Heavenly Tribulation, her parents didn't appear at all. It was Su Clan's Seven who was concerned from start to finish.","Considering these clues and the dangers of the cultivator profession, could something have happened to Sixteen's parents? Song Shuhang had an unsettling suspicion.","If that were the case, it might not be appropriate to directly inquire about Su Clan's Sixteen's mother.","\"After I leave this place, I should discreetly confirm with Senior Su Clan's Seven about Sixteen's parents.\" Song Shuhang thought.","After some contemplation, he attempted to call out to the mysterious voice fairy in his mind. If she was still around, perhaps he could discover her identity?","However, this time, the owner of the mysterious voice had already departed and didn't respond.","Another benevolent senior who performed good deeds without seeking recognition.","In fact, Song Shuhang quite appreciated this type of senior, as he himself sometimes liked to perform good deeds anonymously.","...","...","When Song Shuhang emerged from his contemplative state, he noticed that all the seniors in the group had left the Wealth Throne. Only him, Sixteen, and Soft Feather remained.","Su Clan's Sixteen opened her eyes and exhaled slowly. It seemed she had successfully fused with these three new clones.","Song Shuhang gracefully landed beside her. \"Sixteen, have you completed your trial?\" he inquired.","\"It's mostly done. There's just one final step remaining,\" Su Clan's Sixteen said while gently clenching her small fists and giving a 'you can do it' gesture. \"The last step requires a long time to refine, and it's purely a matter of time... So, in a way, the trial is already complete!\"","\"Congratulations, Sixteen,\" Soft Feather said.","\"Thank you,\" Su Clan's Sixteen replied.","The White Dragon scanned Sixteen's body with her divine sense and nodded. \"Her aura has stabilized. Now, she just needs some nurturing.\"","\"Yes, you do need to put on some weight,\" Song Shuhang agreed.","\"Shuhang, for a girl, being lighter is better. You still don't understand girls' hearts.\" The sword chimed in.","\"Senior, do you understand?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Of course, didn't you hear my girly voice?\" the sword responded.","Song Shuhang was speechless. He couldn't argue with that!","At that moment, Pavilion Master Chu, who was standing on top of Song Shuhang's head in a daze, spoke up. \"Oh, by the way, Fellow Daoist Scarf.\"","\"What's the matter?\" The White Dragon turned her head and asked. \"What's going on, Fairies?\"","The two fairies were determined not to be outdone.","\"I saw Immortal White Bones a few days ago and had a conversation with her,\" Pavilion Master Chu said with a gentle smile.","\"Immortal White Bones? She finally appeared.\" The White Dragon couldn't help but tense up.","\"Come on, let me use voice transmission to set a password to prevent eavesdropping,\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","\"Give me the password privately first,\" the White Dragon requested.","Then, the White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu entered 'private voice transmission mode' and whispered to each other.","\"You'll get pregnant if you chat privately,\" the virtuous lamia seized the opportunity to chime in while imitating Thrice Reckless Mad Saber's voice. This was a voice message that Senior Thrice Reckless had sent in the group, and it was unclear when the virtuous lamia had recorded it.","\"Don't worry about pregnancy and childbirth. XX Gynecology Hospital, a century of gynecology and obstetrics. A worry-free life, be a quality woman,\" Fairy Creation continued to sing.","After the two fairies finished singing, they looked down at Song Shuhang's shadow.","After a long while, Black-skinned Soft Feather mustered the courage to speak up. \"A lifetime of pregnancy and happiness?\"","Fairy Virtue and Fairy Creation both wore satisfied smiles.","The atmosphere became awkward...","Additionally, Song Shuhang had become somewhat sensitive to the topic of pregnancy and sterilization lately.","\"Infinite Storage!\" So he waved his hand and put the three fairies back into his sleeve.","\"Let's go, Song Senior, Sixteen. The seniors in the group are waiting for us outside,\" Soft Feather suggested, shifting the conversation away from the awkwardness.","...","...","The three of them walked side by side and jumped down the stairs of the Throne of Wealth, arriving at the exit of the Huge Whirlpool.","There was less than an hour left until the year 2020.","\"A new year, a fresh start!\" Song Shuhang exclaimed as he stepped out of the whirlpool.","Soft Feather and Su Clan's Sixteen followed closely behind.","After stepping out of the Wealth Throne... the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique within Song Shuhang's body seemed to surge vigorously!","His main body, which was in seclusion within the man-made small world, opened its eyes.","It had completely received and integrated the information and data transmitted by the unknown White 1-33. This mass of data was an entire world.","Moreover, the Inner World began to evolve. With the assistance of Unknown White 1-33, the artificial small world and the Inner World completed the first stage of synchronization.","At that moment, the man-made small world had become a sub-base of the Inner World, attached to it. Between the Inner World and the man-made small world, there was an additional passageway similar to Senior White Two's world of the black lotus.","Once Song Shuhang's realm increased, his Inner World could directly merge with the man-made small world and become a part of itself.","The data of the entire world had infinitely strengthened Song Shuhang's mental energy.","Unknown White 1-33's power had also strengthened the realm and energy of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique.","The evolution of the Inner World was also feeding Song Shuhang.","After taking a step forward, Song Shuhang's state of mind swelled.","He had to suppress his realm, study the illusions of reality, learn the ancient language, and so on in the near future. All of that was empty talk! In front of his inflated strength, he was just a paper tiger!","\"As expected... Because of that interference, some things have changed slightly,\" Soft Feather's eyes darkened.","Because of her interference, Senior Song didn't have any 'heartbroken' past, and his body and mind were both developing very healthily. After experiencing more fortuitous encounters, Senior Song's cultivation speed increased by a notch.","In the end, Senior Song's tribulation transcended earlier than expected.","Spirit Butterfly Island's Soft Feather effect.","However, Senior Song's tribulation this time was very important and special. He had to choose the right time and wait for an important 'opportunity'.","So... He couldn't let Senior Song transcend his tribulation ahead of time."]},{"number":2424,"title":"Chapter 2424 The Mature Senior Song","paragraphs":["First, Senior Song's tribulation must be postponed for a while. When the right moment arrives, he would break through the bottleneck of the Eighth Stage Realm and advance to the Profound Sage level in one fell swoop.","With this in mind, Soft Feather took a step closer to Song Shuhang and grabbed his arm. \"Anyway, let me put the brakes on for now.\"","As she spoke, a gentle force emanated from her hand and attached itself to Song Shuhang's primordial spirit.","This gentle force contained a time attribute that was surprisingly capable of directly influencing Song Shuhang's physical body through his primordial spirit. It guided and pacified the swelling power within his body to temporarily suppress it.","However, this suppression was merely a temporary measure. Once Soft Feather's guiding and suppressing force was removed, the power within Song Shuhang's body would once again swell uncontrollably.","Song Shuhang was slightly puzzled and looked at Soft Feather.","\"Senior Song, it's not the right time to advance,\" Soft Feather said.","\"Why?\" Song Shuhang pondered for a moment, then suddenly asked, \"Is it dangerous to advance now?\"","He could not seem to recall why.","But that one time, when the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were dragged into the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage Realm in the Black Dragon World, Song Shuhang had an extremely uneasy feeling in his heart that he couldn't shake. It was as if he had lost an important senior at some point in time and had cried so bitterly.","Such a thing had never happened before. Everyone important to him was still alive and well.","However, this feeling emerged from the depths of his heart and couldn't be calmed.","So, after returning from the Black Dragon World, whenever Song Shuhang transcended his tribulation, he would do his best to avoid the possibility of transcending it with a group to prevent getting others involved in his heavenly tribulation. Last time, he and Su Clan's Sixteen were sent to the past by the method left behind by Senior White, which was an irresistible factor.","Now that he saw Soft Feather suppressing his tribulation in the future, Song Shuhang immediately had a guess. Could it be that if he transcended the tribulation now, it would attract a huge crisis? Was that why he was being stopped?","\"It's not necessarily dangerous, but the timing isn't right,\" Soft Feather gently shook her head.","\"Will others be in danger?\" Song Shuhang pondered and asked. If he wasn't in danger, could it be that he had gotten someone else involved in his Profound Sage Tribulation?","\"Don't worry, Senior Song. There shouldn't be anyone else transcending the tribulation with you,\" Soft Feather reassured him, but she didn't elaborate further. After all, many things had changed due to her interference last time.","Moreover, even if Senior Copper Trigram, Senior Ancient Lake Temple, and Fairy Tian Tian hadn't been surprised, Senior Song had still become much more mature. This was really for the best.","After hearing this, Song Shuhang secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Let's go to your Inner World first,\" Su Clan's Sixteen reminded him.","Regardless of when Song Shuhang was going to transcend his tribulation, he had to leave the Spirit River Su Clan's annual meeting first. There were so many seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One Group and cultivators from the Su Clan below, and staying here was always a hidden danger.","\"Alright, I'll leave a message for Senior Seven and Senior Yellow Mountain later,\" With a thought, Song Shuhang moved Su Clan's Sixteen and Soft Feather into his Inner World.","...","...","In the Inner World, next to Pavilion Master Chu's pool, the figures of Song Shuhang, Soft Feather, and Su Clan's Sixteen appeared.","\"I'll send a message to Seven,\" Su Clan's Sixteen said.","\"Then I'll report the situation to Senior Yellow Mountain,\" Song Shuhang took out his mobile phone. He had left a small passage in the Spirit River Su Clan's location to transmit the signal.","Soft Feather's hands were still holding Song Shuhang's arms, and she was in charge of suppressing the swelling power in his body.","Venerable Yellow Mountain raised his head in puzzlement and looked at the place where Song Shuhang and the other two had disappeared.","\"What is Shuhang doing? Why did he suddenly disappear with Little Sixteen and Soft Feather?\" Northern River's Loose Cultivator asked in puzzlement.","Su Clan's Seven pinched his chin. \"But why would he bring Soft Feather along?\"","\"Yo, Seven, are you mentally prepared?\" Fairy Lychee asked with a smile.","\"Huh?\" Su Clan's Seven was stunned. Then, he waved his hand and said, \"No, no, Fairy Lychee misunderstood. That's not what I meant.\" Before the annual meeting, Sixteen mentioned to me that she wanted to talk to Song Shuhang about some things in private. Therefore, I can understand if she wants to leave with little friend Shuhang. However...\"","In terms of relationships, the Spirit River Su Clan should be more or less mentally prepared.","After all, Song Shuhang and Sixteen had given a divinity demonstration speech together last time.","All the cultivators in the universe had seen this.","Since the first Sage in a thousand years was so shameless, the Spirit River Su Clan naturally had to consider the possible relationship between Su Clan's Sixteen and Song Shuhang.","As they were talking, Su Clan's Seven and Venerable Yellow Mountain's phones rang at the same time.","The two of them took out their phones at the same time.","Then, Su Clan's Seven and Venerable Yellow Mountain's facial expressions changed in unison. The two of them frowned at first, then looked surprised, and then regained their composure.","\"It's a message from Shuhang,\" Venerable Yellow Mountain said.","\"News from Sixteen,\" Su Clan's Seven said at the same time.","\"Did something happen?\" Northern River's Loose Cultivator asked.","\"It's not good,\" Venerable Yellow Mountain stretched out his hand and massaged the left side of his chest. His heart felt stuffed.","\"Shuhang might be advancing again,\" Su Clan's Seven said in a heavy tone.","Northern River's Loose Cultivator was speechless.","\"If I count it right, it's indeed about time,\" Medicine Master nodded.","\"This month should be considered a little late. In the past, he would advance in the middle of the month. This month, it has already been dragged to the last day of the month, or even the last hour,\" Purple Mist said.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer rubbed his temples. \"Are we going to form a group to transcend the tribulation again?\"","\"Group up to transcend the tribulation?\" A handsome scholar's eyes lit up.","\"No, Sixteen said that Soft Feather was helping Song Shuhang adjust his energy... Because this matter happened too suddenly, Shuhang needed some time to prepare for the heavenly tribulation. It shouldn't be a group tribulation,\" Su Clan's Seven replied.","It was common sense for cultivators to prepare many things when facing the heavenly tribulation.","It was understandable that Shuhang wanted to prepare something.","\"I'll go and tell the members of the Su Clan about the situation. Perhaps at the beginning of next year, we'll be able to see Shuhang's fifth speech,\" Su Clan's Seven put away his phone and walked toward the clan members.","...","...","In the Inner World, Su Clan's Sixteen, Song Shuhang, and Soft Feather sat opposite Pavilion Master Chu while staring at her with their six eyes.","Pavilion Master Chu was speechless.","\"When is the best time for me to transcend the tribulation?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"I remember that it should be when the world undergoes a great change,\" Soft Feather replied."]},{"number":2425,"title":"Chapter 2425 Administrator White","paragraphs":["\"Such as earth and heaven are undergoing significant changes?\" Song Shuhang recalled the recent transformations in the mortal world.","Now that the fat ball was on the verge of departure, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was bouncing around, and malevolence was stirring... It gave the impression that a massive spectacle was about to unfold.","\"So, do we just wait here?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","Pavilion Master Chu remained silent. Seriously, why were the three of them sitting so neatly in front of her and staring so intently?","Su Clan's Sixteen offered a reminder, \"Shuhang, you could use this time to make some preparations before facing the tribulation.\"","In the past, whenever Song Shuhang confronted his tribulation, it would strike without warning and leave him with no chance to prepare. As far as she could recall, Song Shuhang had never attempted to use the Tribulation-transcending Formation.","This time, Soft Feather had temporarily suppressed the expansion of his main body's power and bought him some preparation time, which he should make the most of.","\"Preparations before the tribulation... I'm really not used to it,\" Song Shuhang sighed.","At some point, he had grown accustomed to facing the tribulation head-on anytime, anywhere.","Pavilion Master Chu levitated slightly and said, \"The tribulation you're about to face is the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation, so the Tribulation-transcending Formation won't be of any use. Let's see what 'pendants' we can bring into the Tribulation Realm.\"","Song Shuhang had a plethora of pendants on his person, but unfortunately, many of them could only be used in the mortal realm. Once brought into the Tribulation Realm, they would trigger the special effect of 'group tribulation transcending' and increase the tribulation's power.","Otherwise, with Song Shuhang's divine equipment and an array of accessories, he could handle a Ninth Stage tribulation with ease.","\"Understood,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","He extended his hand and summoned Good Fortune, Karma, and Black-skinned Soft Feather from his inner world.","\"Black-skinned Soft Feather and Scarlet Heaven Sword can stay in the Inner World,\" he decided.","Being inner demons, it was safer not to bring Soft Feather and Scarlet Heaven Sword into the Tribulation Realm to avoid potential mishaps.","The Virtuous Lamia nodded and opened her mouth to release the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword and handed it over to Black-skinned Soft Feather for temporary safekeeping.","\"Fairy Creation, stay as well... Even if you enter, you won't be able to assist Song Shuhang,\" White Dragon reminded her.","This time, Fairy Creation obediently nodded and said to Song Shuhang, \"Song... Uh, Benben, Benben ~\"","\"Alright,\" Song Shuhang responded. \"In that case, I'll entrust you, Fairy, with the task of locating the Scholarly Classic.\"","Last time, he had tricked the clone's smurf account of the fat ball into going to the Wealth Throne as gambling capital. After Senior Three-Eyed and Horse had engaged in a four-person bet, the Horse had emerged as the ultimate victor.","However, before leaving, it had handed over all the treasures it had won to Song Shuhang.","So, Song Shuhang was the one who had the last laugh.","The stakes were both potent and abundant and included Senior Three-Eyed's blueprint, the 'spatial authority' of the fat ball's clone, and the whereabouts of the Scholarly Sage's supreme treasure, the 'Scholarly Classic.'","To prevent further complications, Fairy Creation proposed that she should search for the location of the Scholarly Classic while Song Shuhang faced his tribulation.","Song Shuhang extracted the information about the Scholarly Sage's Scholarly Classic and handed it over to Fairy Creation.","Fairy Creation accepted the information with delight.","\"You're welcome. However, please be aware that this information was provided by the fat ball, so the location where the Confucian Code is hidden is likely to be fraught with danger. When searching for it, Fairy Creation, exercise caution. If real danger arises, seek support from the Confucian faction or wait for me to complete my tribulation before coming out,\" Song Shuhang advised.","Fairy Creation nodded.","Song Shuhang faintly smiled and opened a portal to his Inner World, with the coordinates set in the Huaxia Realm.","Fairy Creation waved to everyone and then lifted her Scholarly Dress as she departed from the Inner World.","\"Do you understand her?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked White Dragon.","\"It would be a miracle if you could understand her!\" White Dragon remarked. Among everyone present, aside from Song Shuhang, Fairy @#%× was probably the only one who could comprehend what Fairy Creation was trying to convey with her string of 'Song Adai, Song Aben, Heyoyo.'","\"Telepathy?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet guessed.","\"Stop dreaming. How could Song Shuhang possibly possess such an advanced magical technique?\" the sword chuckled.","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","\"By the way, I'll drain the energy from that strand of my hair and let her accompany you into the Tribulation Realm,\" Pavilion Master Chu mentioned.","Pavilion Master Chu's hair, having had her energy drained, was now just an ordinary strand of hair. She wouldn't trigger any changes in the tribulation. At that time, although she couldn't provide Song Shuhang with spells and energy, she could impart some experience and knowledge.","At the same time, she could also broadcast the entire process of Song Shuhang transcending the tribulation.","\"Thank you, Senior Chu,\" Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude.","\"Check the condition of the magic tools, the quantity of pills, and the number of spirit stones,\" White Dragon reminded.","\"The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure has just leveled up and is in good condition. There are also pills for spiritual energy recovery. I've prepared some living springs and placed them in the Universe Bracelet's space. The Flat Imperial Hat is already brimming with the power of virtue, and there are also some spirit stones... If you need to spend money, there's a 50% discount coupon you can use. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet is also in good condition,\" Song Shuhang reported.","\"I'm sorry, but I can't assist you in the tribulation,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said. He was Senior White's magical treasure.","\"That's true. What a shame. If it were possible, I'd really like to bring Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet with me to confront the tribulation. Among the many big shots I've faced, tribulation big shots are the most spirited,\" Song Shuhang lamented. As long as they didn't engage in group tribulation transcending, facing the tribulation was still quite fascinating.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was rendered speechless.","\"Speaking of which, I suddenly had an idea regarding facing tribulation big shots.\" After mentioning this, Song Shuhang extended his hand and drew a line across his waist. \"What if I cut myself in half and filled it with the power of virtue? Would it work if I sent half of my body into the Eighth?Stage Profound Sage Tribulation when I transcend it?\"","He recalled Senior White's actions. Currently, Senior White was split into two, with one half remaining in the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm while the other half studied the God Creation Plan outside.","If this plan were viable... If he sent half of his body inside, even if he were reduced to ashes by the Heavenly Tribulation, the other half of his body could still be regenerated using the foundational principles of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique.","\"I think if you do that, it's highly likely that both halves of your body will be pulled into the Heavenly Tribulation Realm. You might even end up with two heads, and the power of the Heavenly Tribulation will be doubled,\" Senior Turtle crawled over at some point and commented. \"Sage White cut himself open when he transcended his tribulation and sent half of his body out, which is different from your sequence of actions. If you don't have a means to send half of your body out of the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, you don't need to think too much about it.\"","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang chuckled.","He opened the cultivation chat function, retrieved Senior White's message, and said, \"Senior White, are you available? I'd like to request two disposable flying swords, the One-time Use Black Room-breaking Edition, for my tribulation.\"","\"You're transcending the tribulation? Wait, I'll get someone for you,\" Senior White replied.","A moment later, a?notification sounded in Song Shuhang's mind.","[Ding! Administrator Ah Bai has invited Immortal Fairy White Bones to join the cultivation chat list.]"]},{"number":2426,"title":"Chapter 2426 Secret Technique: Slow-Witted Song’s Big Bone Shards","paragraphs":["In the face of the unexpected actions by Senior White, Song Shuhang remained remarkably composed.","Ji Cao, Wu 6, take a seat.","Although the cultivation chat function was an innate ability that had evolved from his Golden Core's QR code, Song Shuhang had long grown accustomed to the frequent use of the big shots in his friend list.","[Ding! Immortal Fairy White Bones has accepted the invitation and added Tyrannical Song as a friend. Note: Orthopedics Department.]","Song Shuhang was left bewildered.","Apart from the fact that these prominent figures possessed various skills, the cultivation chat itself had its own unique charm.","Especially when it came to nicknames, it seemed to have a peculiar talent for it.","Song Shuhang glanced through his friends' list in the cultivation chat. Then, he swiped his hand gently, extracting the three fairies, [Crispy (crossed out) Head] Pavilion Master Chu, [Orthopedics Department] White Bones Immortal Fairy, and [Golden Dragon Scarf] White Dragon Sister, and placed them into a separate group—Slow-Witted Song's communication group.","Having completed this operation, Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","\"What did you just do?\" Pavilion Master Chu suddenly inquired. Though she couldn't sense Song Shuhang's group activity, her Immortal intuition told her that Song Shuhang had performed some action related to her.","The White Dragon also turned her head and fixed her gaze on Song Shuhang. Her intuition surpassed even that of Pavilion Master Chu.","\"Yes, Immortal Fairy White Bones just added me to my friend list. I didn't expect both of you to be so perceptive,\" Song Shuhang said while adjusting his mask with composure.","Pavilion Master Chu was rendered speechless.","The White Dragon was also rendered speechless.","Simultaneously, Immortal Fairy White Bones sent a message to Song Shuhang.","[Orthopedics Department] Immortal Fairy White Bones: \"Can they actually communicate like this? What kind of innate ability is this?\"","\"Cultivators like us need to keep up with the times. If we don't adapt and evolve, we'll become obsolete,\" Song Shuhang responded.","[Orthopedics Department] White Bones Immortal Fairy: What does 'Orthopedics' mean?","\"This is a system-generated nickname. The 'cultivation chat' system automatically collected some information about you and generated a nickname. If you dislike it, I can change it for you,\" Song Shuhang suggested.","Of course, he still needed to refine the technique of changing nicknames.","Pavilion Master Chu served as an example.","\"I'll change it when I come up with a nickname I like next time. Sage Monarch White is currently making the 'disposable flying sword, small black room-breaking edition.' In a little while, open your Inner World and receive the flying sword,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones replied amicably.","\"Thank you, Senior Fairy,\" Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude. During his upcoming Eighth Stage Profound Sage tribulation, he needed to make an effort to seal some lightning for Senior White, as he planned to offer him special treatment later.","\"I have something to inquire about,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones added.","\"Please go ahead, Fairy,\" Song Shuhang said.","You're not really Slow-Witted Song's illegitimate son, are you?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones asked. Although she had already received the answer from Sage White, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and others, she wanted to hear it directly from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to put her mind at ease.","Song Shuhang was left speechless. \"Certainly not. I'm 18 this year and will turn 19 soon. Fairy, take a moment to reflect. Slow-Witted Song had already reached the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm in ancient times and had undergone sterilization.\"","\"Your explanation makes sense.\" After receiving the confirmation from Song Shuhang, Immortal Fairy White Bones felt at ease. This matter had nothing to do with her, and if it did, it would be quite chaotic.","\"By the way, I heard that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's true realm is still at the Seventh Stage, but you're on the verge of sterilization. Are you prepared?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones inquired further.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Fairy White Bones, that hurt.","\"Are you confident about transcending your tribulation?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones inquired once more.","\"As long as nothing unexpected occurs, I have some confidence,\" Song Shuhang replied. He was especially cautious now and dared not plant any flags.","On the other side, Immortal Fairy White Bones pondered for a moment before sending another message, \"My secret technique 'Slow-Witted Song's Big Bone Shards' is compatible with your Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure. If you're interested, I can teach you the incantation.\"","Song Shuhang was taken aback.","Was Immortal Fairy White Bones really making a concession? Did she need to give away her trump card secret technique?","Could it be that Senior White had some leverage over her?","\"In the duel against King Kun, you helped me out. You're about to transcend your tribulation, and I can't assist you in any way. However, someone created this secret technique for me, so I'm not sure if you can master it,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones explained.","After saying all this, Immortal Fairy White Bones suggested that he try to learn the incantation of the secret technique Slow-Witted Song's Big Bone Shards and offered tips on its casting.","The name of this secret technique was really Slow-Witted Song's Bone Shards?","Song Shuhang secretly sent a message to Senior White, \"Senior White, why did Immortal Fairy White Bones suddenly decide to share her trump card and secret technique with me?\"","To be honest, he was about to transcend his tribulation. Even if he received this trump card secret technique, he wouldn't have time to learn it.","\"Fairy White Bones appears to be convinced that you have a connection with Slow-Witted Song... That's why she made this decision,\" Senior White replied.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","\"Furthermore, the name 'Slow-Witted Song' mentioned by Fairy White Bones seems to be Song One,\" Senior White added.","\"Yes,\" Song Shuhang confirmed.","Regarding Slow-Witted Song, there were numerous speculations, but limited concrete information.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, if you have some time before transcending your tribulation, you might as well attempt to practice my White Bone Giant secret technique,\" Immortal Fairy White Bones suggested once more. \"This secret technique is quite easy to learn. If your physique is suitable, you may master it in one go.\"","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","Why did he have the feeling that Immortal Fairy White Bones was looking forward to him mastering the secret technique of 'Slow-Witted Song's Big Bone Shards'?","\"Let me see the details of the secret technique first,\" Song Shuhang retrieved the contents of the secret technique 'Slow-Witted Song's Big Bone Shards'?that Immortal Fairy White Bones had sent him in the chat history. He carefully examined it from start to finish.","After a while...","\"Did you manage to learn it?\" White Dragon Sister asked.","\"I'm completely clueless,\" Song Shuhang replied honestly.","This wasn't a martial art, body tempering technique, or boxing technique. Reading it felt like deciphering an ancient scroll.","\"Let me take a look at the cultivation technique... Never mind, I'd rather not,\" Pavilion Master Chu submerged herself in the hot spring once more. She could tell that Slow-Witted Song had a hand in creating this technique, so she had no interest in examining it.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, how's it going? Did you learn it?\" Immortal Fairy White Bones sent another message.","\"I still don't understand anything,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Immortal Fairy White Bones let out a sigh.","Subsequently, she stopped responding.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Time passed slowly.","He took out his phone and checked the time.","Only one minute and two seconds remained until the start of the year 2020, a moment of significance."]},{"number":2427,"title":"Chapter 2427 The First Second of 2020","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang pocketed his phone and whispered, \"There's one more minute.\"","The closer one got to the final moment, the more important it was to remain vigilant. Throughout history, countless predecessors had stumbled just before reaching the finish line of success.","\"The disposable flying sword, Small Dark Room Destroyer edition, is ready. Open the Inner World portal, and I'll hand them over to you,\" Senior White messaged through the cultivation chat function.","\"Thank you, Senior White!\" Song Shuhang swiftly opened the connection between the Inner World and the real world.","In the next instant, Senior White's spatial package silently appeared beside him. Senior White's mastery of spatial manipulation had reached new heights.","Inside the package were six disposable flying swords, each made of different materials. There were two of each type: one crafted from Qingwu's branch, one from Song Shuhang's wooden body, and one from Senior White's own branch of light of virtue. These various materials were suited for different environments.","Song Shuhang had initially requested only two flying swords, but Senior White had decided to send him six after considering various scenarios.","...","...","Song Shuhang stowed away the six disposable flying swords. His confidence in overcoming the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation grew.","In the hot spring, Pavilion Master Chu asked, \"Is there anything else you've forgotten?\"","\"Equipment, pills, status, pendants—everything's in order. Now, we just have to wait for the opportunity Soft Feather mentioned,\" Song Shuhang replied.","\"Do you have any regrets? Before the heavenly tribulation descends, is there anything you'd like to share?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked.","Song Shuhang was momentarily at a loss.","\"Let me translate it for you, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet. Do you want to write a will before facing the tribulation?\" the sword quipped. \"In fact, many cultivators in the cultivation world do prepare a will before transcending their tribulation, just in case.\"","Song Shuhang ignored their comments, reached out, and gave the sword \"Saber Nurturing Technique\" x20.","This time, it wasn't because the sword had touched upon his inner thoughts; it was purely a slip on his part. He hadn't used any dark techniques on the sword for a while.","There were indeed some regrets. The primary regret Song Shuhang was facing was the impending Eighth Stage Profound Sage sterilization.","However, even the brakes on his cultivation couldn't halt his advancement. What choice did he have?","If he were an ordinary cultivator, he would have plenty of time to find a fairy before reaching the Eighth Stage. He could slowly cultivate a romantic relationship, become Dao companions, and even establish a bloodline.","But Song Shuhang's progress was far too rapid. He didn't have the luxury of time for romance like his peers.","Song Shuhang glanced at Su Clan's Sixteen and Soft Feather.","Soft Feather embodied the ideal partner image for most male cultivators. However, there was no spark between her and Song Shuhang throughout their interactions. Soft Feather had never considered the concept of a 'Dao partner.' To her, the concept was far less important than enjoying life's pleasures.","Perhaps Soft Feather might change in the future. Her demeanor might transform into that of a refined lady. But at present, neither Song Shuhang nor Soft Feather had any intention of becoming Dao companions with each other.","Su Clan's Sixteen, on the other hand, also fit the ideal image of a partner for many men. She had a different style from Soft Feather, and her personality was more mature. With more time, their relationship might have warmed up naturally, leading them to become Dao companions. Even now, they were already in the early stages of a Dao couple, but it would take more time to fully solidify their bond.","Yet Song Shuhang had no time!","Currently, the only thing worth celebrating was that Papa Song and Mama Song had regained their youth. With their restored vitality, they might even have a third child after the second one.","...","...","\"Senior Song, are you thinking about the Eighth Stage Profound Sage sterilization?\" Soft Feather suddenly voiced Song Shuhang's thoughts.","\"Hahahaha!\" Song Shuhang chuckled awkwardly while trying to conceal the fact that Soft Feather had hit a nerve. Despite wearing a mask, Soft Feather seemed to have a knack for reading his inner thoughts.","Su Clan's Sixteen reached out and gently held Song Shuhang's hand to silently express her understanding.","Song Shuhang's heart warmed, and he reciprocated by gently holding Su Clan's Sixteen's hand.","\"Senior Song, there's no guarantee that Eighth Stage Profound Sages will be sterilized. Even if you advance to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, you needn't despair entirely,\" Soft Feather said to break the silence.","Pavilion Master Chu, yawning in the hot spring, interjected, \"The path to immortality. Stepping onto the path of immortality, related to the 'life' attribute, could alleviate concerns about sterilization. This applied not only to Eighth Stage Profound Sages but also to those who reached the Immortal Realm. For example, Cheng Lin.\"","\"The path of progeny?\" Song Shuhang's eyes lit up, and the Scholarly Sage's eye in his left eye began to shine.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chuckled softly.","The sword added, \"Don't stare at me!\" Pavilion Master Chu evaded Song Shuhang's gaze. Though she wouldn't be affected by the Scholarly Sage's eye due to her realm, she still didn't appreciate being scrutinized by the Impregnating Eye.","Senior Turtle also stood up and dodged Song Shuhang's gaze.","Soft Feather giggled and continued, \"So, Senior Song, you can therefore face the tribulation with confidence.\"","Song Shuhang cleared his throat and swiftly changed the subject. \"When will I transcend the tribulation? What's the 'timing' we're waiting for?\"","\"The timing... Oh? Wait a moment!\" Soft Feather suddenly grabbed Song Shuhang's arm.","\"What's wrong?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"I... Song... Senior, you... need to add... some effort,\" Soft Feather's words came out intermittently.","In the next moment, the refined aura around her vanished, and her pupils became unfocused.","With the suppression of Soft Feather lifted, energy surged within Song Shuhang's body like a volcano.","\"Sixteen, you and Soft Feather wait for me in the Inner World. I'll be back in no time!\" Song Shuhang stood up and declared.","In the future, Soft Feather had disappeared, but the 'right time' she had mentioned had not yet arrived.","However, that didn't matter.","Even if it wasn't the perfect 'opportunity,' Song Shuhang was confident in facing the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation.","\"Okay,\" Su Clan's Sixteen gently released Song Shuhang's hand.","Song Shuhang clenched his fist lightly.","He opened the Inner World and set the coordinates to an uninhabited region of the universe.","In the next moment, his primordial spirit and physical body appeared at the coordinates marked by the wooden saber in the depths of the universe. His Essence Soul and physical body merged into one as he reached the pinnacle of the Seventh Stage Realm and met the standard for transcending the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation.","The familiar Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation space opened up and engulfed Song Shuhang.","As the clock ticked, China entered the year 2020."]},{"number":2428,"title":"Chapter 2428 Moreover, I’m Not a Lion","paragraphs":["The familiar Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm appeared before Song Shuhang's eyes.","All around him stretched an endless sea of thunder, and the heavenly thunder roared and howled as if it wanted to tear apart every cultivator entering the Heavenly Tribulation World into pieces! The terrifying power of the heavenly tribulation struck fear into every Seventh Stage Venerable stepping into the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation World!","But when Song Shuhang heard the familiar thunder of the heavenly tribulation, he felt a sense of nostalgia.","Lately, Song Shuhang had spent more time in the Eighth Stage Tribulation World than in his school dormitory. In fact, he was even more animated here than when he visited home!","As a dormitory resident, Song Shuhang sometimes went home only once a month, and this year, he had visited even less frequently.","On the other hand, the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Space had been maintaining a monthly visitation frequency. Although it was a bit late this month, it still managed to arrive on the last day of the month, in the final second to preserve the streak.","More importantly... This time, Song Shuhang was entering the Eighth Stage Tribulation World alone.","\"It's just me this time. No need to form a group for the tribulation!\" Song Shuhang smiled. This way, he wouldn't have to worry about affecting innocent people.","Furthermore, with him alone, the power of the heavenly tribulation wouldn't be enhanced.","This time, he was facing a regular Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation.","\"Bring it on!\" Song Shuhang exclaimed boldly, Pavilion Master Chu's miniature red crystal resurrection magical artifact hanging around his neck gleamed.","His fists collided to produce a resounding clang of metal meeting metal. This loud sound even drowned out the thunder in the sea of heavenly tribulation lightning!","He activated Mutated Steel Hands over his entire body, coupled with the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique and Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha!","A host of holy ape phantoms materialized above Song Shuhang's head, led by a grand holy ape to form a neatly arranged square formation.","The true dragons on the necks of the holy apes also soared from their scarf-like forms and circled above the holy apes' heads!","The scholarly scriptures appeared in the hands of the holy apes and flipped open automatically as the voices of scholarly students chanting echoed through the air!","Two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasures flickered out of Song Shuhang's original Dantian, scattered around his body, and were in a ready state—each magical treasure was engraved with Senior Three-Eyed's Absolute Defense Forcefield formation.","On his right hand, he donned the Defiant Whale Gauntlet, where the artifact's Little Fairy manifested. She knelt on the gauntlet and pointed forward and emitted a series of cries.","The virtuous lamia appeared behind Song Shuhang, skillfully donning the flat imperial hat. The splendid dragon robe of the Great Empress materialized on her and recreated the posture of Fairy @#%× as the 'most beautiful fairy of the ancient Heavenly City.'","Simultaneously, the ghost fairy spirit within Song Shuhang's body voluntarily emerged and stood behind him. Then, the ghost spirit fairy hugged Song Shuhang from behind and activated the special divine body he had successfully cultivated from the scholar lineage. Under the influence of this unique divine body, the power of the heavenly tribulation would be greatly diminished.","This configuration, this lineup, was incredibly opulent!","A mere Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation could only tremble in fear before such an assembly!","\"I have a feeling you're bullying the heavenly tribulation,\" Pavilion Master Chu quipped. The energy in her hair had already been depleted by Pavilion Master Chu, so it wouldn't affect Song Shuhang's tribulation.","Pavilion Master Chu, being an experienced cultivator, had reached the Eternal Life Realm step by step.","Those who could become Eternal Life beings were all cultivators with extraordinary talent. When she had transcended her tribulation in the past, she had never taunted the heavenly tribulation like this.","\"Even a lion uses its full strength to hunt a rabbit. Besides, compared to the heavenly tribulation, I can't even be considered a lion. The heavenly tribulation is no weak rabbit. I must confront it with all my might; there can be no underestimation,\" Song Shuhang stated calmly.","Pavilion Master Chu raised an eyebrow.","In the sea of heavenly tribulation, thunder rumbled violently, and tribulation clouds gathered above Song Shuhang's head... However, the tribulation lightning had not descended for a long time.","\"Pavilion Master Chu, by the way, can one really overcome sterility through the path to immortality after reaching the Eighth Stage Profound Sage?\" Song Shuhang inquired during the lull.","\"You can ask Cheng Lin about that,\" Pavilion Master Chu responded.","\"I am Cheng Lin,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Pavilion Master Chu was speechless. Did he really think she wouldn't recognize him?","\"Cough, I don't know what Fairy Cheng Lin has been up to lately. I haven't been able to contact her for some time,\" Song Shuhang remarked.","\"We'll be able to reach her eventually. Cheng Lin is an Immortal with the life element, so you don't need to worry about the sterility of Profound Sages,\" Pavilion Master Chu assured him.","\"Are there any other options apart from the path to immortality through the life element?\" Song Shuhang's curiosity was piqued.","\"Yes,\" Pavilion Master Chu said slowly.","Song Shuhang's eyes lit up.","You're at the Seventh Stage Realm now. Before advancing to the Eighth Stage Realm, you could consider learning about artificial test-tube breeding,\" Pavilion Master Chu said nonchalantly.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky.","Actually, he had considered this plan before.","Moreover, the feasibility was very high.","So, was he going to be the first man to conduct an artificial test tube experiment in the Eighth Stage Tribulation World under the bombardment of heavenly lightning?","...","...","Rumble~","The heavenly lightning in the sky continued to roar, and the tribulation clouds shrouded the world.","However, the heavenly lightning still did not descend.","Song Shuhang furrowed his brow.","Had the heavenly tribulation mutated again? But this time, he was transcending the tribulation alone. There was no reason for the heavenly tribulation to become stronger.","\"Wait...\" Song Shuhang suddenly thought of something.","His clone was still transcending the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation.","During his last tribulation, he and Su Clan's Sixteen had been sent to the past to transcend the tribulation using the methods left behind by Wielder of the Will and separated them from the present world.","But this time, his main body had been pulled into the Eighth Stage Tribulation World, while his clone remained in the Ninth Stage Tribulation World.","He had a feeling that this operation was very risky.","Song Shuhang quickly opened the cultivation chat list and sent a message to Senior White and Senior White Two. \"Senior White, Happy New Year ~ My main body is transcending the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation, while my clone is in the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation space. Is this not too good?\"","\"Your clone in the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation space should be fine. Half of my body doesn't sense any danger,\" Senior White quickly replied—half of Senior White's true body was still in the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","If Senior White said there was no problem, it meant that the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation space was safe.","\"Have you started transcending the tribulation?\" Senior White Two asked.","\"I just entered,\" Song Shuhang replied.","\"What's unusual about the heavenly tribulation space?\" Senior White Two inquired.","\"The heavenly tribulation has been condensing. The tribulation clouds have covered the world, but it hasn't descended,\" Song Shuhang replied.","\"Don't panic. Maybe it's not because of you,\" Senior White Two reassured him.","Just a moment ago, the fat ball clone, which was battling his projected clone in the main world, suddenly came to a halt. It was directly blasted by his projected clone and exploded into a shower of liquid metal droplets that filled the sky.","Not only did the fat ball's clone come to a halt, but even the fat ball's main body in the Netherworld Realm suddenly stopped, as if it had crashed."]},{"number":2429,"title":"Chapter 2429 Senior White Two’s Troubles","paragraphs":["To be frank, Senior White Two wasn't accustomed to instantly obliterating the fat ball's clone like that.","In the present world, his projection clone started wrapping things up. He gathered the raindrop-like remnants of the fat ball and sealed each one individually before bringing them back to the world of the black lotus. In the course of this finalization, Senior White Two's projection clone also acquired a dragon-shaped commander's seal, a creation of the Third Wielder of the Will.","Simultaneously, in the Netherworld Realm, Senior White Two's true form had already departed from the cozy realm of the black lotus and arrived beside the true form of the fat ball.","At this moment, the fat ball boss's true form remained motionless. Its liquid metal body emitted a faint glow.","In the past, whenever Senior White Two appeared within a radius of 10,000 kilometers of the fat ball, the fat ball would instantly switch into its irritable older brother mode.","It seemed that this was the first time that two rulers of the Netherworld could maintain composure while facing each other.","Senior White Two approached and prodded the fat ball's body, but it offered no resistance.","'Considering what Song Shuhang just mentioned about the issue in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, along with the sudden main world crash of the fat ball's clone... Is the Heavenly Dao corresponding to the fat ball on the brink of dissipating?' Senior White Two pondered silently.","In this vast multiverse, the only force capable of affecting the fat ball and causing it to crash suddenly was the Heavenly Dao!","The fat ball's Heavenly Dao had always harbored imperfections, and the top experts of the multiverse had long sensed this.","Especially in recent times, the flaws in the Heavenly Dao Ball had been accumulating and erupting. Today, it seemed that they had reached a breaking point and led to the fat ball's crash.","\"Those destined to perish will eventually meet their end. Those who yearn to survive will eventually endure!\" Senior White Two articulated profound words, yet he gave no thought to the fact that the fat ball had attempted several times to find a means of escape, only to be covertly thwarted by him each time.","As the ruler of the Netherworld, how could he be expected to recall the \"good deeds\" he had perpetrated?","\"I had initially assumed that between you and me, I would be the first to vanish. Yet, in the end, I was the one to bid you farewell first. The world is indeed unpredictable.\" While Senior White Two waxed nostalgic, he began to toy with his hands.","He extended his hand and patted the fat ball's body. The fat ball behaved like an actual ball and showcased remarkable elasticity.","As Senior White Two continued striking it, the fat ball's body started bouncing up and down, akin to a springy water balloon. With each rebound, its form undulated.","On a whim, Senior White Two decided to flaunt his exceptional basketball skills. In truth, he quite enjoyed sports involving balls. Back when he was able to dispatch his \"projection clone\" to the main world via Song Shuhang, he had familiarized himself with a wide array of ball games on Earth.","Playing basketball, volleyball, billiards, football... Well, whether it involved striking or kicking a ball, as long as it was a ball game, he took keen interest.","\"You see, in this vast Netherworld Realm, I am the sole individual who came to visit you. In essence, amidst this expansive Netherworld Realm, the only one who genuinely cares about you is me.\" Senior White Two hoisted the hefty bulk of the fat ball high in the air and forcefully elevated it. He then assumed a shooting stance and powerfully hurled its form.","Boom!","The fat ball soared in a graceful arc before violently crashing into the ground of the Netherworld Realm and left behind a colossal crater.","\"Truthfully... I had hoped you could endure a bit longer. Song Shuhang has just attained the Eighth Stage Realm, and he lacks the qualifications to vie for the Wielder of the Will.\" Senior White Two approached the fat ball's side and hauled it out of the pit.","While speaking, he commenced the task of inscribing a sealing formation on the fat ball's body. He had aimed to seal it much like how the fat ball had employed the sealing pillar to deceive him. In principle, with potent materials and Senior White Two's full exertion, it shouldn't be an issue to confine the fat ball for several hundred years.","\"After all, if you were to dissipate now, it won't be long before a new Heavenly Dao and a ruler of the Netherworld emerge... I cannot predict what the next cultivator who inherits the Heavenly Dao and ascends as the ruler of the Netherworld will be like in terms of appearance and personality. I cannot foresee whether they will coexist as harmoniously as you and I. Moreover, if a new ruler of the Netherworld is born, it won't be similar to you, who lacks in primary form. This would pose quite a predicament for me.\" While etching the sealing formation, Senior White Two whispered to the fat ball.","\"The worst-case scenario is... once the new ruler of the Netherworld materializes, I will likely vanish much like you. After all, I have no knowledge of the methods employed by the Wielder of the Will to maintain me in the Netherworld Realm and uphold my status as the ruler of the Netherworld Realm. I wonder how enduring its methods will prove to be.\" Senior White Two softly stated.","These were all dilemmas plaguing Senior White Two.","However, due to his pride, he couldn't confide these worries in anyone else. Whether it was his pet or Song Shuhang, they were ill-suited to share in his concerns.","He was the ruler of the Netherworld, Bai. How could he possibly divulge his troubles to others?","\"Perhaps, soon after your dissipation, I may follow suit? If that transpires, then you and I are truly bound by a fate unwavering in life and death.\" Senior White Two halted his actions and lightly applauded.","At this juncture, the silver-white sphere of liquid metal was adorned with black runes. It looked like a work of art.","\"In actuality, I hope that Song Shuhang contends for the position of the Wielder of the Will. Since my inception, it's rare for me to encounter such an interesting young fellow who possesses numerous tricks up his sleeve, seeks help in myriad ways, and is virtually devoid of flaws. Aside from his inability to tell jokes, he's essentially flawless. If he were to advance to the Heavenly Dao... with him, I might not fade away. Furthermore, there wouldn't be any conflict between his rule of the Netherworld and me.\"","Senior White Two extended his hand and pressed it against the fat ball's body and initiated the seal.","\"Unfortunately, time remains too limited. His advancement speed was already so rapid... Yet in the end, I was still a few steps behind.\" Senior White Two's power flowed continuously into the sealing rune.","\"But that's all right. The position of the Heavenly Dao isn't all that enjoyable. Furthermore, Shuhang doesn't appear to harbor great desire to vie for the Wielder of the Will.\" Senior White stretched his hand and exerted pressure.","With the seal completed, the fat ball's body had been compressed to the size of a basketball.","The instant the seal was finalized, the fat ball's body abruptly regained its mobility. The fat ball, which had been malfunctioning, appeared to have restarted?","\"Bai Youyou!!\" The fat ball bellowed in a deafening roar.","\"Hello there, fat ball~\" Senior White Two greeted with a laugh. Simultaneously, he sent a message to Song Shuhang.","[Manual system notification: The Heavenly Tribulation Realm is about to recover. You should properly transcend the tribulation, Shuhang.]"]},{"number":2430,"title":"Chapter 2430 Stuck at the Heavenly Tribulation’s BUG","paragraphs":["In the realm of the Eighth Stage Profound Sage's Heavenly Tribulation, seizing the moment before the heavenly tribulation descended, Song Shuhang was sharpening his skills.","At this juncture, Song Shuhang wore a clever thorned crown on his head which was designed to enhance his learning abilities. The sharp thorns of the crown pricked against Song Shuhang's resilient skull and left a faint white mark on his forehead. But that was the extent of it.","Even the Thorned Crown, a divine tool aimed at causing pain to its wearer, could only inflict minimal discomfort on Song Shuhang.","Under the influence of the Thorned Crown, Song Shuhang held an ancient language book in his hands and was diligently studying the ancient language under the guidance of Pavilion Master Chu. Proficiency in the ancient language was a prerequisite for every Eighth Stage Profound Sage. Even if they couldn't speak it fluently, they needed to read and understand it.","As he was on the verge of ascending to the Eighth Stage Realm, Song Shuhang decided to learn a few more ancient languages, just in case. Who knew if the last-minute language he picked up would hold the key to success in the upcoming examination?","Additionally, he noticed another detail.","He observed that the projection of the Scholarly Holy Ape above his head had a similar effect to the Thorned Crown in enhancing his learning ability.","Song Shuhang speculated that this might be due to the Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha.","As a body-strengthening technique personally developed by the Scholarly Sage, it made sense that the Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha could improve learning capabilities while fortifying the physique.","Just as Song Shuhang was deeply engrossed in his studies, the voice of Senior White Two rang out in his ears.","The Heavenly Tribulation Realm was about to recover.","Song Shuhang swiftly put away the ancient language book in his hand and leaped to his feet. However, he had forgotten to remove the Thorned Crown. It was inconsequential as the crown didn't cause any pain or discomfort when worn; it was practically imperceptible.","\"Senior White Two mentioned that the heavenly tribulation is about to strike! Everyone, stay alert!\" Song Shuhang called out loudly to rally his comrades.","A pre-battle shout could boost morale and increase the odds of success.","\"Wuwuwu~\" The artifact spirit fairy on the Defiant Whale Warrior's gauntlet pouted and whimpered.","The Holy Apes above their heads once again pounded their chests like gorillas.","The virtuous lamia adjusted her empress dragon robe. Song Shuhang's tribulation was a crucial task for her. In addition to providing support and organizing the defense, she was responsible for sealing the lightning tribulation discharged by Song Shuhang and storing it in her inventory to augment her ingredient supplies.","Eighth Stage Profound Sage lightning tribulations were exceptionally rare. Apart from Song Shuhang himself, acquiring them through other means was challenging.","In previous tribulations, due to them being 'group tribulations,' the heavenly tribulations had mutated, preventing the collection of lightning tribulations.","This time, it was a rare one-on-one showdown between Song Shuhang and the Eighth Stage Realm's heavenly tribulation.","It was an opportunity too valuable to miss.","Rumble...","In the Profound Sage Tribulation Space, the celestial lightning continued to rumble, and the tribulation clouds gathered.","However, the heavenly lightning had yet to strike.","Song Shuhang furrowed his brows. Didn't Senior White Two mention that the heavenly tribulation was imminent? The prolonged delay was sapping their morale.","After some more waiting, Song Shuhang couldn't help but send another message to Senior White Two: \"Senior White, the heavenly lightning in my Heavenly Tribulation Realm still hasn't descended!\"","\"The heavenly tribulation hasn't started yet? Odd, the fat ball on my end has already regained consciousness and even broke free from the seal. It engaged me with its usual irritable demeanor. In other words, the 'sky' corresponding to the fat ball should have been successfully restarted, right? This is peculiar,\" Senior White Two promptly replied.","Could it be that when Song Shuhang ascended to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm during the Wielder of the Will's demise, he got stuck in a BUG state?","\"It's possible that your heavenly tribulation has a BUG. Wait a bit longer. If your heavenly tribulation remains unchanged, you can try something based on your own judgment. I'll deal with the fat ball first and contact you afterward,\" Senior White Two added.","Song Shuhang raised his gaze to the sky.","A BUG in the Heavenly Tribulation... was undoubtedly bizarre, but for some reason, he found it easy to accept. Perhaps he had grown accustomed to the quirks of the heavenly tribulation?","After all, in theory, the group tribulation transcendence he experienced before was essentially a BUG. Several cultivators, clearly not Profound Sages, were pulled into the Profound Sage Space when the heavenly tribulation's strength reached the Profound Sage level. After transcending the tribulation, they received the full Profound Sage treatment: Sage Seals, Sage Names, and Profound Sage Speeches.","If not for the Wielder of the Will's imperfection, a regular Wielder of the Will would have patched this loophole after Song Shuhang's initial divinity speech. Song Shuhang wouldn't have had the opportunity to display his divinity repeatedly.","\"Test it with your own judgment?\" Song Shuhang mused, staring at the sea of lightning. \"What's your suggestion, Pavilion Master Chu?\"","\"What do you have in mind?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired, intrigued.","Song Shuhang sighed and responded, \"Senior White Two mentioned that there might be a BUG in my heavenly tribulation. Although it's a rare occurrence for me to face the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation alone, something seems to have gone awry. Senior White Two suggested that if the Heavenly Tribulation Realm hasn't changed, I can experiment based on my own intuition. I'll give it a shot, but I hope to hear your advice.\"","\"If I were to rely solely on my instincts... well, you'd probably end up making a reckless decision,\" Pavilion Master Chu warned.","\"Come on, Pavilion Master Chu, I'm not Senior Thrice Reckless,\" Song Shuhang chuckled. \"But there was that one vaguely memorable experience...\"","Pavilion Master Chu's hair twitched slightly.","Unbeknownst to her, Song Shuhang seemed to have matured considerably. It left her feeling somewhat disconcerted.","\"Although we're not sure what kind of BUG has surfaced in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, we can't remain here indefinitely,\" Song Shuhang stated with determination. Time was precious, and he couldn't afford to squander it in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Pavilion Master Chu was momentarily taken aback. \"Alright, tell me your thoughts, and I'll provide some guidance.\"","\"Let's explore three approaches. First, we can probe the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation by examining the tribulation clouds,\" Song Shuhang proposed while pointing at the accumulating tribulation clouds in the sky.","\"What are you planning to do with the tribulation clouds?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired.","\"Considering that Heavenly Lightning Tribulation, Inner Demon Tribulation, and various attribute heavenly tribulations can all be transformed into ingredients, why not tribulation clouds? Compared to the pure energy form of heavenly tribulation, the tribulation cloud has a physical presence, making it more suitable for use as an ingredient,\" Song Shuhang explained, gesturing at the tribulation clouds.","\"If we can obtain Tribulation Cloud Cuisine recipes, that would be even better. However, I can always study it,\" he added.","\"On another note, I'd like to investigate whether I can split myself into two, similar to what Senior White did,\" Song Shuhang touched his abdomen while contemplating where to make the cut."]},{"number":2431,"title":"Chapter 2431 Hello, Your Half-Body Has Shut Down","paragraphs":["Senior White had already proven the feasibility of cutting himself in half in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm. He had left one half to transcend the tribulation while the other half went to the main world to play.","As long as half of his body was still in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, there wouldn't be any problems with the process of transcending the tribulation. The other half of his body that had gone to the main world to play wouldn't be forcibly pulled into the Heavenly Tribulation Realm by the laws of the world. Unless the other half of his body that had stayed in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm was turned into ashes by the heavenly tribulation, the other half of his body that had stayed in the main world would be pulled into the Heavenly Tribulation Realm again.","Song Shuhang had six disposable flying swords that Senior White had specially made - the Small Dark Room Destruction Version. He could travel back and forth between the main world and the Heavenly Tribulation Realm three times.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and drew a line on his waist. If he wanted to divide it, it would be better to use this position as the dividing line.","\"Do you want to send half of your body to the main world? What are you trying?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze.","\"There are many things I want to do. After all, ever since I started cultivating, every day has been very fulfilling. There are still many things I want to do. If I arrange them, I can fill a small notebook,\" Song Shuhang said seriously.","Pavilion Master Chu laughed. \"For example, to be on the safe side, to fall in love and have a child?\"","\"Hehe~\" Song Shuhang wasn't afraid of Pavilion Master Chu's teasing. Instead, he took the opportunity to change the topic and said, \"That's right. In that case, I can't send my upper body back. I have to consider sending my lower body back to the main world. It's better to keep it safe before I reach the Profound Sage Stage and get sterilized.\"","\"Men are indeed creatures that think with their lower bodies,\" Pavilion Master Chu's expression turned amused.","\"Pavilion Master Chu,\" Song Shuhang said, \"Aren't you thinking with your silly hair now?\"","Song Shuhang had become adept at deflecting teasing after being on the receiving end for so long.","Pavilion Master Chu didn't mind it at all and instead asked, \"Are you envious of this function of mine?\"","\"A little,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","\"It's useless to be envious. You can't learn it anyway. This move is different from the Control Spell. It's not a saber technique,\" Pavilion Master Chu said with a playful smile.","\"What?\" Song Shuhang was surprised.","The Control Shot Technique was a saber technique?","\"That's right. The 'control spell' that I taught you last time to condense your hair into more than twenty palms was actually adapted from Nine Slashes of Braid Blade. It's a real saber technique. It's a saber technique,\" Pavilion Master Chu said softly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"Back to the main topic.\" Pavilion Master Chu was in a good mood. \"What's your third plan?\" she asked. \"Other than making the tribulation clouds into immortal dishes and putting them into the Heavenly Tribulation Set Meal, and cutting yourself in half?\"","\"The third plan is the final plan - flip the table.\" Song Shuhang looked at the Heavenly Tribulation Realm and said, \"I'll directly destroy the entire Heavenly Tribulation Realm!\"","\"How?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze.","\"I haven't thought about it yet...\" Song Shuhang replied sincerely. The secret techniques he had mastered weren't rich enough, unless he could draw out the Karma Saber Technique that he had used to defeat the Demon Emperor, or prepare a large enough treasure to use the Krypton Gold Strike.","Apart from that, if he wanted to overturn the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, he would have to think of a way to do so.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","After talking for a long time, he still did not know how to implement the third plan.","\"However, the third plan is the final plan. If there is no other choice, we will have to flip the table. Now, I will execute Plan 1 and Plan 2.\" Song Shuhang said.","\"Using both plans at the same time?\"","\"Yes.\" With a thought, Song Shuhang transformed himself into his smoke form.","Behind him, the virtuous lamia reached out and grabbed a sharp sword from the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts 'Magical Treasure and slashed it at Song Shuhang, who was in smoke mode.","Song Shuhang, who was in smoke mode, was cut in half.","Half of it had the cold glint of a Saint's pupil, while the other half had a seven-colored light.","\"Very good. It seems like this plan will work.\" Song Shuhang said with satisfaction.","He had originally only wanted to separate his head from his body. Ever since the Divine Punishment·Losing Chastity incident, his head had become especially hard, and he had even awakened the innate ability to separate his head from his body.","Just now, Song Shuhang had used the effect of his smoke body to simultaneously use the head-body separation innate skill, and with the virtuous lamia's help, he had successfully cut himself off from the waist just like the head-body separation innate skill. This was different from the way he had cut his thigh when he was avoiding the fat ball's divination. This time, it was the real Song Shuhang in half-body mode.","The two halves of his body that had been cut open reformed into a human shape. The cut on his waist was smooth. There was no blood or internal organs, only a faint layer of smoke from the pseudo-undying mode.","Under the control of Song Shuhang's will, the two halves could move freely.","\"Wonderful beyond words.\" Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Pavilion Master Chu looked at this scene in a daze and didn't know what to say. Song Shuhang was full of peculiar techniques and strange abilities, but he didn't have any proper cultivation techniques or innate abilities.","One could imagine that after Song Shuhang mastered this newly developed ability, it would be even more difficult to kill him. Even if she cut Song Shuhang into several pieces, it wouldn't matter to him.","\"Then, let's send Half-body No. 2 into the modern world.\" Song Shuhang said.","Half-body No. 2 was the lower half of his body. Pavilion Master Chu's previous words were very reasonable. If the heavenly tribulation really didn't fall and had to last for a year and a half, perhaps he would be able to multitask and control his Half Body No. 2 to go to the main world to have a relationship. Perhaps he could pursue his relationship with Su Clan's Sixteen?","The virtuous lamia stretched out her hand and pressed it on Song Shuhang's two halves, and a large amount of light of virtue gathered and repaired them. This was not the first time they had done this, so they were quite skilled at it.","Song Shuhang took out a flying sword made of 'wood' and rolled up Half-body No. 2. He chanted an incantation, \"Go! Head to the modern world!\"","Half-body No. 2 was enveloped in the radiance of the disposable flying sword, the Small Dark Room Destruction Version, and disappeared into the Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation space.","Song Shuhang's consciousness split into two parts.","One part was used to control Half-body No. 1, which remained in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm. The other part was used to control Half-body No. 2, which was on its way to the modern world.","After two seconds.","The Disposable Flying Sword, Small Dark Room Destruction Version, successfully carried Song Shuhang's Half-body No. 2 to the modern world and arrived in a remote area of outer space with no one around.","The heavenly tribulation laws did not pull Half-body No. 2 back.","\"Success!\" Song Shuhang's lips curled up.","Next, he planned to control Half-body No. 2 to return to the core world and transfer Su Clan's Sixteen and Feather-Robe Beauty out first.","Just as he was about to put his thoughts into action... a golden vortex suddenly appeared in the void and swallowed his Half-body No. 2.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang lost contact with Half-body No. 2.","Song Shuhang was speechless."]},{"number":2432,"title":"Chapter 2432 Roll On~","paragraphs":["\"What's going on?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked, her expression bewildered.","She sensed that Song Shuhang had suddenly tensed up, his muscles going rigid. Despite wearing a mask that concealed his speaking face, those in the know had already figured out that Song Shuhang could speak. Could this be a form of body language?","\"I've lost contact with my Half-body No. 2!\" Song Shuhang exclaimed, his disbelief evident.","\"Could it be that the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Space has severed the connection between you and your lower half?\" Pavilion Master Chu speculated. Just because Sage White could control both halves of his body didn't mean Song Shuhang could do the same. Any cultivator who spent some time with Sage Monarch White would sense his uniqueness.","\"No, when my Half Body No. 2 returned to the modern world, I still had control over him. But after a moment, it was as if a black hole had swallowed my Half Body No. 2!\" Song Shuhang explained.","Pavilion Master Chu considered, \"Could Sage Monarch White's disposable flying sword, the Small Black Room Destruction Version, have accidentally ended up near a black hole and been consumed?\"","While the odds of such an accident were low, it was not impossible.","\"No, if I were swallowed by a black hole, I would definitely feel intense pain or something similar. Moreover... Although I lost contact with him, I could faintly sense that my Half Body No. 2 is still intact and unharmed. This feeling is so familiar,\" Song Shuhang mused, his hand on his chin.","It felt like he had experienced a similar situation before. Losing a part of himself closely linked to him, yet knowing it remained alive. The sense of déjà vu weighed heavily.","Pavilion Master Chu considered the remaining possibility, \"Then, there's only one possibility left. Didn't White mention before that the Heavenly Tribulation might have crashed once and restarted? Could it be that your Half-body No. 2 was captured by the reactivated Heavenly Tribulation as soon as it returned to the main world? Perhaps it was sent into another Heavenly Tribulation Realm of the Eighth Stage? Or it might have been sealed in a space that prevents it from interfering with the main world?\"","Returning to the main world while transcending tribulations clearly went against the rules.","\"That seems to be the only possibility,\" Song Shuhang nodded. \"However, it shouldn't be another Heavenly Tribulation Realm. I can sense that my Half Body No. 2 is safe and unharmed. He's most likely imprisoned and waiting for me to transcend the tribulation in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm or reveal my divinity after transcending before returning.\"","\"Can you use the effects of the Primary Instruction of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique to regrow Half Body No. 2 now?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired with a furrowed brow.","\"No, despite appearances, the connection between Half Body No. 2 and Half Body No. 1 wasn't severed. The connection effect still exists, which doesn't meet the criteria for the 'Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique' revival,\" Song Shuhang explained.","\"Then, why not cut off a little more? For example, cut to the chest and then use the Superclass of Secret Techniques to revive?\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","However, Song Shuhang had reservations about this idea. \"Even I would die if I were cut to the chest. I'd need the Living Spring's life-extending properties combined with the Scholarly Sage's blood to bring me back. But in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, the Inner World is too weak, and I can't access the Living Spring.\"","\"That makes sense. After transcending the tribulation, we can experiment with the Living Spring. I'll introduce you to my dao then. It'll be beneficial for you to observe the Great Dao of Immortals once you reach the Eighth Stage,\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","She covered her eyes with a ghost spirit, unable to look directly at Song Shuhang.","Pavilion Master Chu's Dao was intertwined with the Withering and Flourishing Twin Trees. It revolved around the 'life and death' aspect, giving birth to new life from death.","\"Let's set aside the matter of Half Body No. 2 for now. There's no way to locate him at the moment. What's your plan?\" Pavilion Master Chu swiftly shifted the topic and prevented Song Shuhang from dwelling on the issue.","\"Indeed, losing Half Body No. 2 is not an option. Let's proceed with Plan 1 and test these heavenly tribulation clouds in the sky,\" Song Shuhang said, his lips moistened.","The myriad tribulation clouds resembled cotton candy or soft ingredients, igniting one's appetite.","\"Do you have any strategies for dealing with the heavenly tribulation clouds?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired, intrigued.","\"No, but that's not a problem. I have two top Immortal Chefs in my friend list who can provide me with guidance,\" Song Shuhang replied confidently.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was the most skilled Immortal Chef in the current cultivation world. Her culinary expertise surpassed her cultivation level, and she was the sole chef capable of handling ingredients of the Eighth Stage or higher.","Additionally, there was the creator of the heavenly tribulation set meals, Senior Devil Emperor. When it came to heavenly tribulations, the Devil Emperor held unrivaled expertise.","Song Shuhang smoothly activated the cultivation chat function and sent a message to More Than Devil, \"Hey, Senior More Than Devil, have you been getting good sleep lately?\"","\"Scram!\" The Devil Emperor replied, annoyance evident in his words. He had finally managed to rest somewhat peacefully, but that troublesome Tyrannical Song had come knocking on his door again.","\"Not only, Senior, do you have any insights on dealing with heavenly tribulation clouds? Have you studied them before?\" Song Shuhang inquired cheerfully.","The Devil Emperor was rendered speechless.","In this aspect, he was the ultimate authority. He did want to share his knowledge and offer guidance, but the recipient was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","\"Get lost!\" The Devil Emperor retorted.","Regardless of the circumstances, he wouldn't be imparting his wisdom to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Meanwhile, in the main world universe, a golden vortex materialized, and from it emerged a golden figure."]},{"number":2433,"title":"Chapter 2433 It’s My Turn to Guard Her","paragraphs":["\"Hahaha, I, Song, have returned to the center stage!\" The golden figure stepped out of the vortex and shouted in the void.","\"Your Majesty, please refrain from shouting loudly. Excessive movement may cause the gold paint to come off,\" a man with a crown on his head, and sleeves resembling blazing suns, reminded from the vortex behind him. He smiled as he spoke. The fresh coat of gold paint had not yet dried.","This man was none other than the Great Western Emperor, one of the Four Great Emperors of the ancient Heavenly City.","The golden figure was left speechless, his grand entrance abruptly halted.","Soon after, another immortal, clad in ice armor with silver hair, emerged from the golden vortex. He expressed concern, \"Are you sure it's alright to use this half of a body at the last minute? Its strength is only around Rank-8, and it may not withstand your actions. Please handle it with care, especially the vital organs within this half. They have extraordinary origins, and you must protect them.\"","This was the other Great Northern Emperor, the one from the real world having already resurrected using Song Shuhang's bamboo leaf and thereby freeing himself from the Heavenly Emperor's grasp and gaining freedom.","However, for some reason, another Great Northern Emperor existed within this golden vortex, possessing the strength of an immortal.","Furthermore, the Great Northern Emperor who had resurrected in the main world seemed to be aware of the existence of this other Great Northern Emperor.","Although they were two separate Great Northern Emperors, they both held an interest in Song Shuhang. In their words, they continuously cautioned the golden figure not to harm Song Shuhang's body.","\"Don't worry. Although this half of my body is only around the Eighth Stage, I can utilize it to unleash my full power. When I borrowed your spare bodies in the past, my strength was restricted. Especially when I used the body of a sword cultivator, it was inherently incompatible with mine, and I could only unleash a fraction of my strength, sometimes not even a fraction,\" explained the golden figure.","It wasn't his initial intention to capture Song Shuhang's 'Half Body 2.' Instead, it was a spur-of-the-moment decision. Originally, he had planned to use the Immortal body of the 'Buddhist Indestructible Body,' which was the most compatible with him, for this mission. Unexpectedly, just as he was about to use that body to manifest in the world, Song Shuhang's Half Body No. 2 suddenly traversed space and landed at the exit of the golden vortex.","This twist of fate, or perhaps Senior White's influence, as it was Senior White's disposable flying sword, Small Black Room Destruction, that had delivered Song Shuhang's Half Body No. 2!","For the golden figure, there was no other body more suitable for his entrance into the world than Song Shuhang's. Thus, without hesitation, he changed his plan and captured Half-body 2 to coat it with a layer of golden paint.","\"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song should currently be at the 8th Stage, correct? Is he sending half of his body out of the Heavenly Tribulation Realm at this time... Could it be that he doesn't want to leave any regrets? After all, cultivators of the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm will become sterile,\" another immortal stepped out from behind the golden figure at this moment.","This was a man with Soul Seizing Chains on his hands, known as the Immortal Soul Seizing Emperor of the ancient Heavenly City.","Just like the Great Western Emperor, he was also an Immortal who had seized freedom from the hands of the Heavenly Emperor during Slow-Witted Song's battle with the Heavenly Emperor.","\"If that's the case, Slow-Witted Song, you've interrupted Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's plan... If he doesn't have any descendants, you'll have to take responsibility,\" a fourth immortal appeared. She was an Immortal fairy known as Fairy Peaches of Immortality.","When Slow-Witted Song first appeared to save Pavilion Master Chu, there were a total of seven Immortals in the golden space behind him. At that time, aside from the Great Northern Emperor, the other six Immortals had 'incomplete Dao' and were restricted by the Heavenly Emperor's Dao.","Later on, Slow-Witted Song had a direct confrontation with the Heavenly Emperor. He freed three Immortals from the Heavenly Emperor's 'Dao,' while the remaining three Immortals fell into a petrified state. He failed, and the price of his failure was that the three petrified Immortals were taken away by the Heavenly Emperor. Only the Dao Seed remained, and its whereabouts were still unknown.","That was the last time Slow-Witted Song shed tears.","\"Hey, you guys can think of it, but do you think I can't?\" Slow-Witted Song said smugly. \"When I took over this 'half,' I used the life-type path of immortality to preserve a portion of the life seed. When it's time for me to return this body, I'll label this 'Life Seed' that I've preserved using the Dao of Life and return it to Tyrannical Song. As long as he knows how to use these life seeds, he won't have to worry about having no descendants. Moreover, don't forget...","I have mastered the path of immortality in the life system. As long as I'm here, there's no need to worry about Eighth Stage Profound Sages becoming sterile!\"","\"Wait... Why did you think of extracting the Life Seed? Could it be that you cut off Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's little brother when you were painting the gold paint?\" The Great Northern Emperor asked expressionlessly. He was the type with a cold face and a kind heart. When he wasn't smiling, his face was filled with coldness no matter which angle one looked at it. But when he smiled, it was like the ice melting and spring arriving.","\"How is that possible? I have principles too, okay?\" Slow-Witted Song waved his hand. Moreover, he didn't have the hobby of cutting off his little brother. Last time, it was just a thought in his mind and he didn't actually attack his little brother.","Moreover, compared to the low-level method of cutting off the little brother, he had more methods and spells to make his gold paint more uniform. He had plenty of tricks up his sleeve.","\"Let's go!\" Slow-Witted Song gently waved his hand, and the golden vortex behind him slowly closed.","The Great Northern Emperor Two, the Great Western Emperor, the Soul-Seizing Emperor, and the Immortal Peach Fairy followed closely behind him.","\"Do you want to meet Pavilion Master Chu or the ancestral golden dragon?\" The Great Western Emperor tucked his hands into his wide sleeves and asked with a smile.","Slow-Witted Song was left speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu hasn't recovered yet, right? She used her own 'Dao' to give birth to Pavilion Master Chu Two. As for the ancestral golden dragon,\" the immortal peach fruit fairy added,\" her resurrection method is still on the mysterious island. She's waiting for someone to go over and kiss her awake, right?\"","\"Why do you know so much?\" Slow-Witted Song didn't know whether to laugh or cry.","\"Then let's revive the Ancestral Golden Dragon first. Her combat strength is one of the best in our ancient Heavenly City. If we have her to help us on this trip, our chances of success will be even greater.\" Soul-snatching Emperor calmly analyzed.","The ancestral golden dragon was an experienced Immortal of the ancient Heavenly City. In her complete form, she was extremely powerful, and she was Slow-Witted Song's biggest backer back in the ancient Heavenly City.","Slow-Witted Song shook his head gently. \"She has protected me for far too long. This time, it's my turn to protect her.\"","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and opened a spatial gate.","This spatial gate led to a strange myriad worlds.","This was a chaotic world.","At the center of this world, there were countless flowing liquid metals."]},{"number":2434,"title":"Chapter 2434 Encircling the Son of Heaven","paragraphs":["This chaotic world was an artificial minor realm.","It was akin to the artificial minor realm connected to Song Shuhang's core world.","Until today, this chaotic small realm had remained shielded while empowered by the force of the Heavenly Dao. In the vast expanse of the multiverse, no one could locate it.","But today, the moment that Slow-Witted Song and his comrades had been patiently waiting for had arrived.","The current Heavenly Ball Path suddenly malfunctioned. Although the process was brief, they finally seized control of this artificially created realm that had been hidden by the power of the Heavenly Dao!","\"Heavenly Dao Creation,\" Slow-Witted Song exclaimed as he opened the entrance to this chaotic world. The Great Northern Emperor and others could sense the unique aura enveloping this small realm.","At its center lay a charred land. The earth was cracked, and silver liquid metal occasionally flowed from its depths.","Beneath the scorched surface lay their target—the core of this realm!","\"This artificial world is one of the contingencies prepared by the current 'Heaven' for himself. If his original plan had succeeded, the ancient Heavenly City would have relocated to this location in this artificial realm. Eventually, the Dao of the entire celestial heavens would converge here to repair the flaws in the current 'heaven,'\" Slow-Witted Song explained solemnly.","However, their actions in the past, particularly his collaboration with Cheng Lin due to Pavilion Master Chu, disrupted the ancient Heavenly City's plans. He had even seized control of the Heavenly Court's territory and acted as the de facto ruler, although it was a precarious position. Eventually, Cheng Lin orchestrated the collapse of the Ancient Heavenly City, upending their plans entirely.","\"Is our target here?\" The Great Northern Emperor inquired, his presence chilling the air, nearly freezing even the surrounding space.","\"This space is a product of Heavenly Dao's creation, our opponent's home turf. Engaging in direct combat here would put us at a disadvantage,\" the Great Western Emperor observed.","\"But we don't have the luxury of choosing our battlefield,\" Slow-Witted Song replied while leading the way into the chaotic world. \"If we don't enter, we won't be able to draw our target out.\"","Now in control of most of the ancient Heavenly City, he had inherited both the Heavenly Emperor's Dao of Time and Cheng Lin's Dao of Life. His presence met the prerequisites for triggering changes within this chaotic world. Only by entering could they influence the core hidden beneath the scorched surface.","\"Don't worry, we have reinforcements this time,\" Slow-Witted Song reassured them once they had stepped into the artificial realm. Besides the might of the ancient Heavenly City, Fairy Cheng Lin had secretly gathered a group of top-notch Immortals.","These included Daozi, the first disciple of the Sage of the scholarly faction, the surviving Immortal from the Titanium Temple, the sole sober member of the cursed otherworldly demons, and Fairy Cheng Lin herself, who could temporarily manifest through Ye Si. Together, they formed a formidable force.","Slow-Witted Song entered the man-made realm, where his inherited Dao of the Heavenly Court and Dao of Time resonated with the realm's energies. The core of the man-made world sought to absorb Slow-Witted Song's Dao. However, unlike the Heavenly Emperor, Slow-Witted Song lacked the mark prepared by the Heavenly Dao which did not permit the realm's core to seize his Dao. Furthermore, he sensed the presence of the liquid metal sphere within the realm and unleashed a hidden power within him.","The Scholarly Sage's blood contained in the rainbow kidney surged with power, and a projection of countless scholarly scriptures materialized above him. It was accompanied by the sound of recitation. This was the first time Slow-Witted Song exhibited the demeanor of a scholar. Simultaneously, the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique and the Mutated Steel Hands Technique activated. All three cultivation techniques within Song Shuhang's body merged into one, and activating one brought the others into play.","The Scholarly Sage's power pushed back against the core's suction force and prevented it from absorbing his Dao. The Great Northern Emperor, Great Western Emperor, Immortal Peach Fairy, and Soul-Seizing Emperor entered the realm.","\"The power of the Scholarly Sage? I didn't expect Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to possess such hidden strength,\" the Great Northern Emperor expressed in surprise.","\"There's a lot more hidden within him. To be honest, if he were able to activate all the pendants on his body simultaneously, he alone could destroy the core of this man-made realm,\" Slow-Witted Song boasted. Unfortunately, activating all the pendants' powers in Song Shuhang's body and concentrating them in one point proved exceptionally challenging.","\"The core is reacting to both the Heavenly Emperor's Dao and the Scholarly Sage's aura. It's about to emerge,\" the Immortal Peach Fairy reported.","\"Let's do it,\" the Great Western Emperor said.","The Great Northern Emperor nodded and used his ice elemental powers to freeze the scorched ground and covered a vast area.","The Great Western Emperor released two suns into the sky, their fiery energies contained and ready to strike the target upon its appearance.","The Soul-Hooking Emperor created a complex formation with his Soul-Hooking Chains.","The core deep underground began to tremble, drawing all the liquid metal from the surrounding area back to itself.","With a deafening explosion, the core cracked open.","\"It's out!\" Slow-Witted Song declared.","\"Wait... It's empty!\" Fairy Peach exclaimed, her eyes wide open as she monitored the situation.","The core was empty. There was nothing inside!"]},{"number":2435,"title":"Chapter 2435 Not Many Words Exchanged","paragraphs":["Ever since she stepped into this chaotic world, the Immortal Peach Fairy had been vigilantly watching over the core.","At this moment, all the liquid metal in the chaotic world returned, and the core opened... but it was empty.","\"So much energy gathered in the core can't just disappear like that.\" Immortal Peach Fairy thought while looking up at the sky. These days, no one followed the usual path. The target might not burst out from the cracked core but instead seeped out from the core's shell.","Her hunch was right!","The empty core was merely a diversion. The real target had already appeared in the sky above the scorched black land while towering over them and peering down.","These unconventional targets were always a nuisance.","\"Darn it, the Divine Tree Beast is up there!\" the Immortal Peach Fairy extended her hand to conjure a massive wooden bow and several arrows. These arrows had probably been stored for too long, and they had sprouted fresh leaves and twigs.","With practiced skill, Immortal Peach Fairy nocked three arrows and shot them into the sky.","The Great Western Emperor raised his head slightly and flicked his fingers in his sleeves. At the beginning of this encounter, he had already launched two sunrises into the sky, and now they came in handy.","The two suns shone brightly and struck their target faster than the Immortal Peach Fairy's arrows.","Boom!","The two rising suns exploded one after another to reveal the true form of the target that Slow-Witted Song had brought them here to confront. It was a colossal humanoid figure made of liquid metal.","It was enormous!","The scorched earth where Slow-Witted Song and the others stood covered about half the size of China. Yet, the size of the super-large liquid metal figure in the sky exceeded even that of the scorched land.","With such size, just plummeting from the sky could trigger world-shattering devastation.","The Great Western Emperor's two rising suns were blocked by the giant's hand. The liquid metal giant's enormous palm was shattered, and the eternal fire of the rising sun clung to the broken palm, hindering the liquid metal giant's recovery.","Considering the nature of the giant's liquid metal composition, these injuries would heal almost instantly unless the Sunrise Fire waned. Thus, the Great Western Emperor cast another spell to infuse the power of Flame Maxim from the void into the Sunrise Fire and amplify its potency.","Following that, Immortal Peach Fairy's three sharp arrows penetrated the giant's body.","The budding arrows pierced through the liquid metal giant's defenses. Compared to the giant's colossal size, these three arrows seemed insignificant.","However, once the arrows embedded themselves in the giant's body, new shoots sprouted and took root. Countless thick vines emerged from the giant's wounds to entwine and restrain the liquid metal giant.","\"Such a massive body... It must be quite a spectacle to battle,\" mused The Great Western Emperor with a hearty smile.","At their level of power, tremendous size was not an advantage—unless it reached a truly awe-inspiring scale!","But unless it reached the realm of awe, the large size was nothing more than an evil punching bag.","\"Let's go. Don't underestimate them. Even if it's still in an imperfect state, it's a creation of the Heavenly Dao. You and I both know how challenging it is to deal with a Heavenly Dao creation,\" Slow-Witted Song cautioned.","\"Indeed,\" replied the Great Northern Emperor coldly. He extended his hand and conjured a frigid mist that enveloped the liquid metal giant to freeze key parts of its body.","The chains in the Great Western Emperor's hands swayed gently as they pierced into the fabric of space and vanished. Who knew what cunning plan he was devising in the shadows?","In the sky, the liquid metal giant remained eerily quiet. Its eyes rolled as it fixed its gaze on Slow-Witted Song. Then, its remaining intact arm suddenly struck toward Slow-Witted Song.","This liquid metal giant not only followed an unconventional path but also knew how to seize the enemy leader and pummel them when surrounded.","The assaults from the Great Western Emperor, the Great Northern Emperor, and the Immortal Peach Fairy were all directly absorbed by its body. Then, its giant hand was aimed at Slow-Witted Song.","It was exchanging injuries for injuries a seeming challenge for them to see who would be vanquished first, whether they'd finish him or he'd defeat the golden figure.","Undoubtedly, this liquid metal giant was even more merciless than the wicked!","He was a werewolf among the wicked.","Slow-Witted Song was speechless.","He extended his hand, and the faint silhouette of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure materialized in the air. It transformed into a shield in front of him to intercept the liquid metal giant's fist.","\"Don't worry about me,\" Slow-Witted Song said solemnly. \"Attack with all your might.\"","\"Don't fret, Fellow Daoist. I have great confidence in Your Majesty's resilience. You're a man who can endure all the pain in the world. Even when the Ancestral Golden Dragon made you shed tears, you didn't cry out in pain,\" the corners of the Great Western Emperor's mouth curled into a wry smile.","After the previous two Sunrise attacks, he had begun to accumulate power. Simultaneously, a mirror-shaped magical tool appeared before him, its surface pitch-black like a bottomless void.","Slow-Witted Song was speechless.","As he spoke, the liquid metal giant's fists repeatedly pounded and shattered the illusion of the Combined Magical Treasure in front of Slow-Witted Song.","Then, the liquid metal fist transformed into a palm, and a peculiar sealing rune flickered in its center as it descended upon Slow-Witted Song.","This sealing rune specifically targeted Slow-Witted Song's Heavenly Emperor's Path.","Slow-Witted Song's figure stiffened slightly.","Then, his body was pressed under the colossal palm.","\"No wonder you wanted to grab me and pummel me. As expected, your target is still the Heavenly Emperor's Path within me,\" Slow-Witted Song chuckled.","In a burst of white light, a gigantic skeleton formed with Slow-Witted Song at its core.","The first wave of iron-like skulls emerged while encasing Slow-Witted Song within.","Next came the ribs, arms, and bony legs...","This was Immortal Fairy White Bones' trump card, Slow-Witted Song's Bone Giant.","When White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu had seen this secret technique, they deduced that Slow-Witted Song had played a role in its creation.","Indeed, Slow-Witted Song had mastered this secret technique.","The white bone giant manifested and effortlessly pushed open the liquid metal giant's palms.","\"Armored! Beast God Skeleton!\" Slow-Witted Song continued to command.","The illusion of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure swiftly descended upon the skeletal giant and transformed it into an even larger Beast God skeleton.","\"Come on, round two!\" Slow-Witted Song held the projected Squid Tyrant Dual Blades in his hands and pointed them at the liquid metal giant.","...","...","At the same time, in the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation Space, Song Shuhang was currently employing the sealing technique under Pavilion Master Chu's guidance in an attempt to seal the severed tribulation clouds.","However, ordinary sealing techniques had little effect on the tribulation clouds, and Song Shuhang continued to fail.","Suddenly, while in the midst of casting the sealing technique, Song Shuhang experienced a slight pause.","\"An inspiration?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired.","\"No, that's not it.\" Song Shuhang shook his head. He raised his hand and employed a secret technique.","Pavilion Master Chu was shocked."]},{"number":2436,"title":"Chapter 2436 My Skeleton Giant Is So Miserable","paragraphs":["Clang!","In a series of mystical sound effects reminiscent of background music, ribs materialized out of thin air to envelope Song Shuhang, the ghostly fairy, and the virtuous lamia. They fell within a comforting sense of protection. Unlike when Slow-Witted Song cast the spell, the white bone giant didn't use its iron-like head to shield him.","Furthermore, it seemed that the current Song Shuhang, with only half of his body remaining, also had an incomplete white bone giant appear.","In fact, the white bone giant he summoned was only the upper half of its body.","After using its ribs to safeguard Song Shuhang, it relied on its hands to support itself on the ground and moved swiftly. The level of coolness had suddenly plummeted into an abyss.","Pavilion Master Chu was bewildered.","Why did you suddenly learn Immortal Fairy White Bones' secret technique while following me to learn the Sealing Arts?","What's the meaning of this?","It seemed that those with the surname Song were indeed big boneheads.","If it weren't for the fact that this idiot currently had no energy left, Pavilion Master Chu would have definitely snapped Song Shuhang's neck and dug out his big bonehead.","\"Don't crawl, stop, don't crawl anymore... This scene is truly pitiful.\" Song Shuhang called out.","The white bone giant he conjured had only half a body, and it agilely moved around with its hands supporting it. Its agility was incredibly high. However, this scene was particularly heart-wrenching.","It was obviously a very cool spell, so why did it change when it reached his hands?","Could it be that my posture was wrong when I learned the secret technique?","As he was pondering, the virtuous lamia behind him suddenly shouted in Song Shuhang's voice, \"Slow-Witted Song's big bone scum~\"","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","Could it be that even the virtuous lamia had learned this move?","Then wouldn't I be able to summon two 'Song Bone Scum' in one go?","Or perhaps... I only learned half of it, and the virtuous lamia also learned half of it. Then, we merged together to form a complete Slow-Witted Song's big bone scum?","Just as Song Shuhang was deep in thought, the virtuous lamia swayed her body, and her virtuous form attached itself to the white bone giant.","The virtuous lamia's upper body perfectly enveloped the white bone giant, while her lower body transformed into a snake's tail, which moved agilely.","The secret technique of the white bone giant and the virtuous lamia merged to create a new combination.","She hadn't actually learned this secret technique. The reason she had called out was that she had copied this line and recorded it in her dialogue library, so she could snatch Song Shuhang's lines next time.","After combining with the white bone giant, the giant virtuous lamia raised the flat imperial hat on her head, and her splendid empress dragon robe once again enveloped her entire body.","Pavilion Master Chu was bewildered.","\"I can evolve again.\" Song Shuhang waved his hand, and the two sets of Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasures flew toward the virtuous lamia.","Beast God Equipment!","He remembered that last time, the two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasures had transformed Immortal Fairy White Bones' White Bone Giant into a mecha.","This time, what would happen when the Combined Magical Treasures, the virtuous lamia, the flat imperial hat, and the secret technique of the white bone giant came together?","Song Shuhang was eager to find out.","An armed virtuous lamia?","Fairy @#%× in empress mode was very majestic, so she shouldn't be too weak in armed mode, right?","While he was contemplating, the two sets of Combined Magical Treasures and the virtuous lamia completed their fusion.","Unlike the Beast God Skeleton, the two sets of Combined Magical Treasures didn't turn into mechas. Instead, they formed decorative armor around the virtuous lamia's neck, chest, arms, and waist.","The other two sets of magical tools took the form of a shield and a sword in the virtuous lamia's hands.","The sword was Senior White Two's Holy Sword of the End, and the shield was a round shield adorned with the pattern of the Impregnable Holy City.","In her form as the armed empress.","Powerful, incredibly powerful!","Song Shuhang could sense a continuous stream of energy emanating from the body of the armed empress.","This was no longer the power of the Eighth Stage.","Under the influence of such a formidable force, Song Shuhang was confident that he could cleave open the entire Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation space and disrupt the heavenly tribulation's proceedings.","\"If I could maintain this form indefinitely, not to mention an Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation... even a Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation, I could cut it into pieces and cook it.\" Song Shuhang declared.","\"Don't get too conceited,\" Pavilion Master Chu cautioned.","\"Don't worry, Senior Chu. This level of power won't lead me astray. I have self-awareness, and this form can't be maintained for too long. Firstly, the power of virtue in the flat imperial hat is very limited and won't last long. Without the support of the flat imperial hat, the power of this form will be greatly diminished,\" Song Shuhang explained. \"However,\" he continued, \"this form came at the perfect time!\"","Under Song Shuhang's willful control, the armed Fairy Empress swung the Sword of the End and slashed at the heavenly tribulation in the air.","As the sword descended, a large section of the tribulation cloud was sliced and separated.","If it were an ordinary Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation, the tribulation cloud would have exploded upon contact with the sword, leaving no opportunity for the cultivator to cut it.","But now, Song Shuhang was stuck in the heavenly tribulation's glitch. The tribulation cloud condensed but didn't explode, and was sliced into pieces like tofu.","After slicing through the tribulation clouds, the armed empress sheathed her sword and placed her hand on the tribulation clouds, performing the sealing technique.","\"I've been thinking before that there are two reasons why I can't seal the tribulation clouds. Firstly, my sealing technique isn't proficient. I don't have a strong talent for sealing techniques. Secondly, my innate realm is too low, and I'm only a Seventh Stage Venerable. As a result, it was extremely difficult to seal the tribulation clouds of the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation. But now, I can use the Fairy Empress to cast the sealing technique!\" Song Shuhang explained.","The sealing technique that Pavilion Master Chu had imparted to him was soon completed.","If the sealing technique didn't work, then he would use his realm to make up for it!","With the help of the armed Fairy Empress, who possessed power on par with the Ninth Stage Realm, the Eighth Stage Profound Sage tribulation cloud was reluctantly sealed into small pieces and stored in Song Shuhang's food?storage bracelet.","\"See, it worked.\" Song Shuhang proudly exclaimed.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","She remembered the time when she was still weak and had worked hard to cultivate the sealing technique. Why did I work so hard to cultivate the sealing technique back then?","Song Shuhang stored the sealed tribulation cloud into the 'Universal Magical Bracelet.' In the future, whether he could repay the massive debt to Shadow Lord depended on whether he could come up with a hundred ways to cook the tribulation cloud.","\"Speaking of Shadow Lord's enormous debt... Shadow Senior's item that can materialize 'obsession,' the Sacred Shadow Land bracelet, is still with me.\" Song Shuhang suddenly remembered this miraculous treasure.","Currently, this magical treasure was still being nurtured in Song Shuhang's spiritual lake. After using it last time, it was filled with cracks and was on the verge of collapse.","On the other side.","The battle between Slow-Witted Song and the liquid metal giant continued.","\"Fellow Daoist, are you ready?\" Slow-Witted Song shouted.","\"Ready.\" The Great Southern Emperor chuckled.","He reached out and pulled... an entire piece of land was pulled out from the void.","This land was filled with an ancient aura, and there were remnants of the battle of peerless experts on it. Even after tens of thousands of years, the sword intent, aura, and the power of the spells that had clashed still lingered.","Even though the masters of the battle had long departed, the two different top-tier Great Dao laws were still entangled!","Legend had it that this was where the Scholarly Sage had fought his final battle.","It contained the Scholarly Sage's final obsession.","\"Perfect timing. This next round will completely finish the target.\" Slow-Witted Song said solemnly.","This was his last chance to free his precious companion...","It was also the final assistance he could provide when Tyrannical Song transcended the Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation."]},{"number":2437,"title":"Chapter 2437 Iron Fist of Words, Power of Knowledge!","paragraphs":["\"Seize this opportunity, Tyrannical Song,\" Slow-Witted Song said softly.","He then extended his hand and beckoned gently to summon an object from his original dantian which landed in his hand—the secret treasure, the Shadow Sacred Land!","This treasure, the Shadow Sacred Land, was the only one in all the realms capable of harnessing the fire of obsession and manifesting it as combat power. It was a highly cherished secret treasure of the Shadow Lord.","At that moment, the Shadow Sacred Land still bore numerous cracks.","Over these past few days, the Shadow Sacred Land had been nourished by Song Shuhang's intrinsic spiritual lake, and the cracks had somewhat begun to mend. However, to fully restore it, relying solely on the nourishment of his natal spiritual lake wasn't sufficient. Many precious heavenly and earthly treasures were still needed for its repair.","\"You must hang on,\" Slow-Witted Song called out to the Shadow Sacred Land.","In the past, when Song Shuhang's Saber Nurturing Technique had activated it, the Shadow Sacred Land had evolved once, significantly increasing its strength.","\"As long as you persevere, I will find a way to completely restore you after this incident is over. Now, lend me your power,\" Slow-Witted Song urged as he activated the Shadow Sacred Land.","In the next moment, the land that the Great Southern Emperor had brought over ignited with flames of obsession—the obsession left behind by the Scholarly Sage was once again activated by the power of the liquid metal sphere.","The most suitable candidate to confront the liquid metal sphere was none other than the Scholarly Sage.","The burning obsession of the Saint was drawn over and converged upon the Shadow Sacred Land.","The Shadow Sacred Land grew intensely hot, and the cracks on it widened, emitting a faint sound of distress.","Unfortunately, Slow-Witted Song hadn't mastered the Blade Nurturing Technique, so he couldn't alleviate the Shadow Sacred Land's pain.","\"Hold on, you must hold on. Once we pass through this trial, countless Saber Nurturing Techniques will be waiting for you. The cracks on your body can be fully repaired,\" Slow-Witted Song reassured.","The Shadow Sacred Land emitted a spiritually resonant sound.","In the next moment, countless flames of obsession were transformed by the Shadow Sacred Land, enveloping Slow-Witted Song in an illusory flame.","The flames shrouded Slow-Witted Song, causing his form to vanish.","Simultaneously, an indescribably potent aura emanated from the flames.","Boom!","The flames expanded...","A man clad in a Confucian robe materialized in the void.","Merely by standing there, he exuded the aura of a master.","When people beheld him, for some inexplicable reason, they were awed by his presence.","No introductions were necessary, and no intimidating aura leaked. Just by his presence, he was a master—a mysteriously impressive one.","\"I have succeeded,\" the Soul-Seizing Emperor smiled with satisfaction. His efforts to excavate the entire continent and drag it into the battle space had not been in vain.","Now, it was time to reenact the battle between the Scholarly Sage and the liquid metal sphere.","In the skies above the Scholarly Sage's obsession body, a group of holy apes quickly lined up in formation behind the saint's obsession, silently flipping open the saint's scripture.","\"I excelled in my studies!\"","\"I was remarkable when I entered the Dao!\"","\"My cultivation is extraordinary!\"","\"The Dao I established is outstanding!\"","As their chanting continued, the righteous energy in the world gathered and fortified the Scholarly Sage's state.","In the void, the number of holy apes continued to multiply.","One thousand, two thousand, three thousand.","The true legion of holy apes had descended.","The holy apes didn't need to take any action. Their mere presence and unified singing exerted immense pressure on the enemy.","In the air, the liquid metal giant's attention was drawn to the Scholarly Sage's obsession body.","At this point, the liquid metal giant was in dire straits.","The few individuals who had confronted it were the top Immortals of the ancient Heavenly City.","Thick vines ensnared its body, thick ice immobilized it, and the eternal fire of the rising sun enshrouded its wounds to prevent any form of regeneration.","The Scholarly Sage's obsession raised its head and met the gaze of the liquid metal giant.","The liquid metal giant's eyes filled with rage and hatred.","But the Scholarly Sage's eyes remained devoid of emotion.","\"Howl!\" The liquid metal giant roared while abandoning its levitation and preparing to descend, intent on crushing everything below.","The Scholarly Sage's obsession lightly touched its own body. Perhaps because Song Shuhang had previously summoned the Sage's obsession, its body had already acclimated to it.","Additionally, Song Shuhang possessed the Sage's blood and frequently used the Scholarly Sage's eye. Therefore, Song Shuhang's body readily accepted the Scholarly Sage's obsession, allowing him to unleash the Sage's power flawlessly.","The Saint's Obsession Body raised its hand and hurled the scripture it held.","The scripture expanded instantly, revealing a pitch-black spatial gate.","Within the book was a golden palace, containing an entire world.","The portal hovered before the Saint's Obsession Body and projected its other end beside the liquid metal giant.","The Saint's Obsession Body rolled up its sleeves, clenched its fists, and assumed a stance.","Simultaneously, countless scholarly characters materialized and enshrouded the fist of the Saint's obsession body.","This was the iron fist of knowledge!","The power of erudition!","Gripping the iron fist of knowledge, the Scholarly Sage struck the scripture's spatial gate before him.","In the next instant, a colossal fist extended from the spatial portal projection beside the liquid metal giant and hammered the giant's face.","The iron fist, brimming with the power of knowledge, struck the liquid metal giant's face with great force. Water splashed in all directions, and the liquid metal giant's visage crumbled.","The Saint's Obsession Body didn't stop at a single strike.","Its fists pummeled the scripture spatial gate incessantly!","The fists were like a tempest relentlessly assaulting the spatial gateway. Subsequently, they magnified upon emerging from the other side of the spatial gateway and relentlessly battered the liquid metal giant's head.","The liquid metal behemoth tried to evade, but the spatial gateway's projection shadowed its movements. Its massive size left it incapable of dodging the relatively diminutive spatial gateway.","Boom! Boom!","The iron fist of knowledge, infused with the power of words, was instructing the liquid metal giant on becoming more human.","Every punch bore the recitation of scholarly students and imparted knowledge. The saint's iron fist struck not only the giant's body but also educated its spirit.","Attacking the foe's exterior with fists and reshaping their interior with knowledge—cultivating both the external and internal. This was the invincible Confucian Dao that the Scholarly Sage had upheld throughout his lifetime.","The Great Northern Emperor, the Great Western Emperor, the Soul-Seizing Emperor, and the Immortal Peach Fairy were powerless to intervene.","The scene of the Saint's Obsession Body battling the?liquid metal giant that everyone had imagined failed to materialize.","From beginning to end, it was the Scholarly Sage's Obsession Body dominating the liquid metal giant.","'In the battle of the Heavenly Dao all those years ago, was it truly the Scholarly Sage who lost?' This thought crossed the minds of everyone present."]},{"number":2438,"title":"Chapter 2438 Seize the Opportunity, Tyrannical Song!","paragraphs":["Those who had never laid eyes upon a Confucian sage couldn't fathom the extent of their strength!","Even the universally recognized Heavenly Emperor, who was said to be on par with the Confucian sage in terms of cultivation level, couldn't match the sage's prowess in battle.","This was the sage who had carved a unique path, ushering in a golden age for Confucianism!","The subsequent battle had no twists, no dramatic comebacks, and no thrilling flashbacks.","From the moment the Confucian sage's obsession body appeared, with the opening act of the iron fists of knowledge pounding the liquid metal giant, to the relentless onslaught that shattered it, there was a single sensation—pure exhilaration.","Throughout the entire battle, the obsession body of the Confucian sage never resorted to a second spell or attack.","Just like that, the colossal form of the liquid metal giant was mercilessly reduced to smithereens by the unrelenting iron fists of Confucian wisdom and left nothing behind.","\"It's over,\" the Great Northern Emperor remarked softly.","The Confucian sage's obsession body retracted its final blow, and the scripture suspended in the air was drawn back into the sage's grasp.","The fervent flames of obsession dissipated.","The Confucian sage's obsession body vanished to reveal the feeble Slow-Witted Song within.","...","...","Slow-Witted Song exhaled deeply and collapsed onto the ground.","His utilization of the Confucian sage's obsession power was fundamentally different from Song Shuhang's experience. When Song Shuhang had harnessed the sage's obsession, it had been primarily driven by his own will.","In contrast, when Slow-Witted Song activated the Confucian sage's obsession power, the entire battle had been orchestrated by the sage's obsession.","It felt as though his very essence had been drained.","Were it not for the support of Song Shuhang's 'half body' this time, Slow-Witted Song doubted he could have endured until the end.","Cracks appeared on the Sacred Shadow Land on Slow-Witted Song's wrist.","Fortunately, the Sacred Shadow Land endured until the conclusion.","\"Your efforts are appreciated,\" Slow-Witted Song gently caressed the Sacred Shadow Land, being careful not to apply too much pressure, lest it shatter.","He then carefully removed the Sacred Shadow Land and placed it within the spiritual lake of the second half of Song Shuhang's body, where he could nurture it.","\"Is it over?\" the Immortal Peach Fairy inquired. This was a complete artificial world, and leaving it unused seemed like a waste.","At this moment, the Great Northern Emperor spoke coldly, \"We can't take control of it; it's too hot. We obliterated the liquid metal giant within this world, and it's highly likely that an invisible mark has been left on it.\"","\"But leaving it untouched seems like a waste,\" the Great Western Emperor chimed in. \"Perhaps Tyrannical Song might fancy this chaotic world?\"","\"For Tyrannical Song, this small world is just as troublesome. He's still in the midst of transcending the Eighth and Ninth Stage heavenly tribulations. Handing him this world might pose a risk. However... someone else might find it useful,\" Slow-Witted Song noted.","He produced a disposable flying sword, a rudimentary version similar to Senior White's, and left it at the entrance of the chaotic world.","Should Sage Monarch White require this chaotic world, his powerful fortune would naturally guide him to its vicinity and allow him to retrieve it.","If Sage Monarch White had no interest in this world or found it excessively problematic, his own fortune would naturally steer him clear of the small chaotic world.","\"Additionally, let's leave a coordinate marker at a more distant location. If Sage Monarch White isn't intrigued by this chaotic world, when the time is right, we can return to claim it for ourselves,\" Slow-Witted Song suggested.","The coordinate marker should not be placed too close, to avoid triggering a fixed-rate backlash from the Heavenly Dao.","...","...","Having taken these measures, Slow-Witted Song initiated the golden vortex once more.","The ancient Heavenly City's Immortals returned to the golden vortex space—they couldn't linger in the mortal world for too long before the Heavenly Dao could potentially seize them to rectify its imperfections.","After the Immortal Emperors had departed, Slow-Witted Song sealed the golden vortex.","With their final retreat severed, the current Heaven was left with no escape route.","If their calculations held true, following the loss of this path of return, the Heavenly Axiom would be unable to 'restart' the next time it 'crashed'!","Both the core of this chaotic world and the Celestial Thearch's Heavenly Court Dao were methods employed by the Heavenly Dao Ball to reboot itself.","If the Heavenly Dao Ball couldn't be restarted and entered a state of dormancy, that would present the perfect opportunity for Song Shuhang's advancement!","Taking advantage of the Heavenly Axiom's temporary pause to ascend to the Prominent Divine Stage would spare him from the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation.","\"Seize the opportunity, Tyrannical Song. The rest is up to you,\" Slow-Witted Song's form detached from Song Shuhang's body.","\"Are you ready? We're setting off.\" At that moment, a figure materialized in the void.","It was Fairy Cheng Lin, now devoid of any signs of life.","Currently, she was borrowing Ye Si's body and employing a secret technique to make a temporary appearance.","\"Let's go... It's time to meet the Heavenly Emperor once more. To be honest, her transformation has exceeded our expectations,\" Slow-Witted Song nodded.","The true form of the Celestial Thearch was also a part of the original ghost spirit, Ghost God Cheng Lin."]},{"number":2439,"title":"Chapter 2439 The Time Has Come!","paragraphs":["The newly resurrected Heavenly Emperor appeared just as she did in Slow-Witted Song and Cheng Lin's memories. After her resurrection, her goal was to rebuild the ancient Heavenly City and discover her own path.","However, lately, the actions of the Celestial Thearch had taken a peculiar turn. She seemed to possess a vast knowledge and was no longer willing to adhere to the Heavenly Dao. She desired freedom.","Consequently, Slow-Witted Song decided to accompany Fairy Cheng Lin on a journey to find the Celestial Thearch and engage in a conversation with her.","The reason for bringing Fairy Cheng Lin along was Slow-Witted Song's concern that he might be at a disadvantage during this conversation and that there was a risk of violence. By having Cheng Lin accompany him, they could potentially overpower the Celestial Thearch if physical persuasion became necessary.","Regardless of whether they would resort to physical persuasion, being prepared was prudent. They needed to be vigilant against the possibility of the Celestial Thearch using physical force.","On the other side, within the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation Space, Song Shuhang wore a crown of thorns on his head and various accessories that boosted his intelligence. He was diligently attempting to learn the ancient language.","The control of the skeletal giant had already been transferred to the virtuous lamia.","Fairy @#%× was having a great time. She used her sword to cut the tribulation clouds in the sky into various shapes, including stars, triangles, squares, hexagons, and even heart shapes.","After sculpting these clouds into different shapes, Fairy @#%× compressed and sealed them, then transferred them to Song Shuhang's spatial magical bracelet.","\"@#%! Fairy!\" Song Shuhang exclaimed while struggling with the pronunciation of her name.","\"Wrong again,\" Pavilion Master Chu sighed. Song Shuhang's pronunciation needed improvement.","When faced with the ancient language's complex syllables, Song Shuhang found it challenging to articulate them correctly.","Pavilion Master Chu even jokingly suggested that Song Shuhang's tongue might need modification to cope with the language.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","\"Let's take a break. Even the Thorn Crown can't help you. I'm losing hope too,\" Pavilion Master Chu lamented as her hair drooped in exhaustion.","\"Perhaps I should seek out an ancient senior and enter a dream state?\" Song Shuhang pondered aloud.","Although Dreamland was currently in passive mode, it could potentially become more accessible after certain conditions were met, such as blood fusion or soul resonance.","\"Don't even think about it, or I'll stick a hair into your head,\" Pavilion Master Chu threatened, fully aware of Song Shuhang's uncanny abilities.","She also believed that the 'dreamland' ability could be a useful method for learning the ancient language, but she didn't want Song Shuhang to discover her secrets.","\"Don't worry, Senior Chu. You definitely won't meet the requirements for my dream entry,\" Song Shuhang assured her as he recognized the need to reassure her for his own safety.","Just as they conversed, Song Shuhang suddenly stiffened.","\"Half of my body!\" he exclaimed.","Pavilion Master Chu was baffled.","\"Yes, I've reestablished a connection with it!\" Song Shuhang affirmed.","Regaining control of Half-body No. 2, he promptly guided it into the Inner World.","Leaving Half-body No. 2 exposed in the main world was dangerous, as it could be seized by other potentially powerful adversaries.","Song Shuhang couldn't afford to let Half-body No. 2 act independently.","Within the Inner World, by the living spring, Half-body No. 2 emerged.","Lady Onion, who had been learning magic techniques from Senior Turtle, was startled.","\"What kind of monster is this?\" Lady Onion exclaimed while revealing her true form and delivering a swift kick to Song Shuhang's lower body.","Clang ~~","The sound of metal striking metal reverberated.","Lady Onion clutched her right leg in pain, her grievances plain to see.","\"This is half of Shuhang's body,\" Pavilion Master Chu explained with a bubble-laden sigh.","\"Shuhang, why did half of your body come to the main world? Just transcend the tribulation properly and stop with all these antics,\" Senior Turtle advised.","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","He had been reprimanded by Lady Onion. It was a truly unique experience.","\"I'll transfer half of my body back to the Heavenly Tribulation Realm,\" Song Shuhang declared through a secret sound transmission.","After the earlier incident, he wasn't willing to leave Half-body No. 2 outside any longer. Sending it back to safety was the prudent choice.","However, before sending it back, he needed to test it with Senior Turtle and Pavilion Master Chu. There was no telling what might have happened to Half-body No. 2 during its forced absence. It could have sustained damage.","\"Senior Chu, Senior Turtle, please excuse the inconvenience,\" the other half of Song Shuhang said.","He also wondered where Su Clan's Sixteen, Soft Feather, and the black-skinned Soft Feather had gone.","Pavilion Master Chu and Senior Turtle's divine senses swept over Song Shuhang's upper body, carefully examining him.","\"There's no issue with his body. He's unharmed,\" Pavilion Master Chu confirmed. Additionally, she sensed a faint aura, although it had been intentionally obscured and difficult to identify.","\"I don't detect any problems either... Furthermore, I can vaguely sense my master's aura coming from half of Shuhang's body,\" Senior Turtle remarked with a furrowed brow.","\"The Great Northern Emperor's aura?\" Song Shuhang was taken aback.","\"Yes, albeit very faint. Nevertheless, Shuhang, half of your body may have come into contact with the Celestial Thearch,\" Senior Turtle asserted confidently.","Song Shuhang pondered this revelation.","The golden vortex, the presence of the Celestial Thearch's aura, and the ability to temporarily sever the connection between his main body and Half-body No. 2—all the pieces fell into place.","Simultaneously, he checked Half-body No. 2 while special attention to the core's condition.","Soon, he noticed something unusual.","\"The Shadow Holy Land has been attacked... and there are more cracks?\" Song Shuhang's voice conveyed his disbelief. \"Doesn't this mean repair costs will increase again? It's a financial nightmare!\"","He also realized, \"Wait... these items in the cosmos bag, are they materials for repairs? Could they be used to mend the Shadow Sacred Land? If so, it's not so bad—it won't add to my debt.\"","\"And what's this?\" Song Shuhang inquired as he examined the last item closely.","\"It emanates a powerful life aura. Could it be a technique mastered by an Immortal specializing in the life system?\" Senior Turtle speculated.","Lady Onion inspected the treasure and added, \"There are inscriptions on it, which are quite rare among the Song family's hereditary genes. It's valuable.\"","Pavilion Master Chu was at a loss for words.","Senior Turtle was equally puzzled.","Song Shuhang remained thoughtful.","After a brief silence, Pavilion Master Chu remarked, \"It's a valuable item. Shuhang, make sure to keep it safe. It?may come in handy in the future.\"","Song Shuhang's other half immediately transferred the life-based treasure deep within the Inner World for safekeeping.","\"I'll transfer half of my body back to the Heavenly Tribulation Realm. Don't worry about me. Just wait for me to display my divine prowess before everyone!\" Half of Song Shuhang's body conveyed its intentions while sounding somewhat awkward.","Then, he retrieved a disposable flying sword, a small black room-breaking model, and returned to the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","He had a feeling that when Half-body No. 2 returned to the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, it would be the perfect opportunity to challenge and overcome the Heavenly Tribulation BUG!"]},{"number":2440,"title":"Chapter 2440 When I Get Angry, I’ll Even Cut Myself!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang felt that his ability to remain composed was wearing thin. Due to an awkward situation, his Half Body No. 2 was practically racing back to the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","\"My physical composure may be sufficient, but my mental resilience still needs some cultivation,\" he thought to himself.","Senior White's Disposable Flying Sword: Small Black Room-Breaking Edition emitted a dazzling rainbow-colored light.","Song Shuhang's Half Body No. 2 had successfully returned.","Upon seeing the seamless return of his half, Song Shuhang couldn't help but breathe a sigh of relief.","The virtuous lamia temporarily halted her efforts to slice through the tribulation clouds. The clouds had already been riddled with holes, and it would take some time for them to reassemble before she could continue sculpting the desired shapes from them.","Although the tribulation cloud was vast, it contained a significant amount of water. After being compressed and sealed by Fairy @#%×, the once expansive tribulation cloud now was the size of a round table.","\"By the way, Senior Chu, when I encountered half of my body, I suddenly had an idea,\" Song Shuhang transformed both halves of his body into an ethereal smoke form and prepared to merge them.","\"What idea is that?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked casually.","Song Shuhang replied, \"Senior Chu, if your main body recovers a bit more and you feel like venturing out into the Inner World, I can detach my Half Body No. 2 and lend it to you for a stroll. After all, staying cooped up in the Inner World for too long might get tiresome.\"","\"Thank you, but I don't need it,\" Pavilion Master Chu responded nonchalantly. Borrowing Song Shuhang's Half Body No. 2 was out of the question.","However, perhaps the tail of the virtuous lamia could be considered!","If she could occasionally venture outside, wouldn't it be delightful to employ the virtuous lamia's tail for a stroll?","Fairy @#%× regarded Pavilion Master Chu with suspicion.","...","...","\"Fusion!\" Song Shuhang softly commanded.","He guided the two halves of his body to merge them.","At that moment, a bloody light suddenly emanated from Half Body No. 2.","The blood-red light carried a seven-colored treasure glow and some minuscule specks of light, swiftly returning to Song Shuhang's Half Body No. 1—it was the Scholarly Sage's blood!","It had abruptly taken the vital components of Song Shuhang's Half Body No. 2 and fled to return them to Song Shuhang's Half Body No. 1.","Song Shuhang was taken aback.","He immediately applied the brakes and halted the merging of the two halves of the ethereal smoke body.","The actions of the Scholarly Sage's blood served as a warning!","It was highly likely that his Half Body No. 2 had encountered an issue.","\"Cancel the fusion, dispel the pseudo-immortal smoke body!\" Song Shuhang's thoughts raced.","The two halves of his body shed their ethereal state and descended to the ground.","\"What's the matter?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked as she regained her composure.","\"When I was preparing to merge with Half Body No. 2, the Scholarly Sage's blood, my last resort, returned along with the organs safeguarded by Half Body No. 2. I suspect that Half Body No. 2 may have a hidden problem; otherwise, the Scholarly Sage's blood wouldn't have taken such action,\" Song Shuhang asserted with deep concern.","The blood of a Saint didn't act without reason.","\"Before your Half Body No. 2 returned, did you allow my main body to examine it?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired.","\"Yes, I did. I even had Senior Turtle inspect it. However, neither Senior Chu nor Senior Turtle detected anything amiss,\" Song Shuhang observed his body closely.","\"In other words, it might have the ability to elude detection by my main body and Fellow Daoist Turtle. Your Half Body No. 2 went for a walk. Whom did it possibly offend this time?\" Pavilion Master Chu reprimanded Song Shuhang with a sharp knock to his head.","If it could evade her main body's detection, it implied that the opposing party was at least on par with her in terms of cultivation, thus enabling counter-reconnaissance.","\"I don't know, I'm clueless!\" Song Shuhang was equally puzzled.","Half Body No. 2 hadn't been absent for long. It was only approximately four hours.","Who knew what it had experienced during this short span?","...","...","Subsequently, in the serene and peculiar Heavenly Tribulation Realm, Song Shuhang's upper and lower halves faced each other.","\"It appears to be fine. There's no other energy mingled with your Half Body No. 2,\" Pavilion Master Chu stated thoughtfully. She didn't possess energy in her hair, so she relied on her 'sight' to assess the situation.","\"And I still maintain control over Half Body No. 2... I didn't perceive anything unusual,\" Song Shuhang stated.","However, this was what made the situation even more alarming.","\"Why don't we sever it?\" Pavilion Master Chu recommended casually, \"After all, the vital components of Half Body No. 2 have already been retrieved by your Scholarly Sage's blood. As for the remaining portion of Half Body No. 2, you can employ the Superclass of the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique and Cheng Lin's Self-Healing Technique to regenerate it.\"","The tool spirit fairy on the glove lifted her finger in approval.","The virtuous lamia, situated behind Song Shuhang, stood ready as well.","Song Shuhang clenched his teeth and steeled his resolve.","Half Body No. 2 had proven to be extremely enigmatic. With the Scholarly Sage's blood serving as a reminder, Song Shuhang was unwilling to merge with it once more.","Moreover, Pavilion Master Chu's suggestion was logical. Given that the vital elements of Half Body No. 2 had been reclaimed by the saint's blood... As for the remaining portion, it could, at the very least, be regenerated!","Wasn't the reason for mastering the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique so that he could confront a situation like this?","\"Stay still and don't move!\" Song Shuhang ordered Half Body No. 2.","Behind him, the skeletal giant, virtuous lamia, flat imperial hat, and the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure, condensed into the form of the Armed Empress and waited.","Senior White Two's Holy Sword of the End emitted a menacing aura of destruction.","\"Cut!\" Song Shuhang gritted his teeth, closed his eyes, and issued the ruthless command.","Even though he was divided into two halves, Half Body No. 2 was still his own body. It was akin to wielding a giant blade to slash at his own thigh.","Song Shuhang never imagined that he would find himself in such a predicament—having to eliminate a portion of himself.","This blow was bound?to be excruciating!","\"You troublesome bug, even squishing you feels a bit tricky!\" the virtuous lamia remarked, her words oddly fitting the situation.","On the Holy Sword of the End, a tremendous sword energy was unleashed.","Boom!","A colossal sword light erupted, and a thousand-meter-long sword qi manifested in the virtuous lamia's hand!","The sword qi cleaved through the sky and the earth.","Beneath this formidable sword qi, Song Shuhang's Half Body No. 2 appeared as insignificant as an insect.","In the following instant, Song Shuhang experienced the agony of his Half Body No. 2 being gradually eroded.","However, thanks to his cultivation of the Three Great Body Tempering Techniques, Half Body No. 2 possessed remarkable resilience. Under the onslaught of the formidable sword qi, it didn't shatter immediately, but was gradually worn away.","Song Shuhang finally comprehended the sensation of someone attempting to kill him—a body so robust that it couldn't be severed, presenting a quandary for his adversary.","Just as Song Shuhang's Half Body No. 2 was slowly diminishing, the entity concealed within it could no longer remain idle.","It had never encountered an individual as ruthless as Song Shuhang, who was willing to eliminate half of his own body. Such unyielding ruthlessness was three times fiercer than that of the most ruthless individuals.","If it didn't emerge soon, Half Body No. 2 would be utterly annihilated and spell its own demise as well.","With a piercing buzz, a pitiful droplet of liquid metal oozed out from Half Body No. 2."]},{"number":2441,"title":"Chapter 2441 The Spell to Wipe Out the Target","paragraphs":["Only a tiny droplet remained. It looked like it could dissipate at any moment—this was the frailest form of the 'liquid metal sphere' that Song Shuhang had ever encountered.","However, he wouldn't underestimate it under any circumstances.","Song Shuhang could sense that this droplet of 'liquid metal' wasn't the fat ball, nor was it the Wielder of the Will's Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. After all, he was intimately familiar with the fat ball and had clashed with the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball several times. He knew them too well to make such a mistake.","So, the origin of this droplet of 'liquid metal' was becoming apparent.","Heavenly Dao Sphere!","This had to be some technique related to the Heavenly Dao Sphere—after all, the Heavenly Dao was eternal and indestructible, so it shouldn't be the actual Heavenly Dao itself.","Song Shuhang cautiously observed the 'liquid metal droplet,' ready to strike at a moment's notice. At the same time, he swiftly prepared all his various maneuvers, attacks, talents, and dark arts.","On the other side, the 'liquid metal' was also 'watching' Song Shuhang.","One wrong step, and it would be a cascade of mistakes.","Ever since this merciless man had forced it to reveal itself, it had lost the upper hand.","And what unsettled it was that this ruthless individual standing before it exhibited no hint of fear whatsoever!","One must understand that it possessed identity and dignity. Even if it was incredibly feeble, all cultivators in the countless worlds who hadn't transcended their own 'Dao' would be subdued by its dignity and rendered immobile!","Yet, when this man caught sight of it, his eyes sparkled with anticipation.","A Venerable on the verge of attaining the Eighth Stage Realm had the audacity to provoke it, effectively diminishing its prestige.","If it were in its pristine form, it would unquestionably crush this insignificant pest to oblivion.","\"Expert Appraisal Technique!\" At this very moment, the merciless figure in front of it initiated a genuine assault!","He dared to attack it!","He truly dared!","Pa~ A familiar beam of light struck it with pinpoint accuracy.","This light...","\"Is it the Scholarly Sage's Impregnating Gaze?\" The drop of liquid swiftly responded.","Meanwhile, Pavilion Master Chu, hovering above Song Shuhang, quickly remarked, \"It's ineffective.\"","\"After all, its identity is intact,\" replied Song Shuhang. Even after deducing the other party's identity, he decided to initiate the Impregnating Gaze because it could create a peculiar technique!","Across countless worlds, numerous adversaries who had crossed paths with the Scholarly Sage had been schooled in the ways of the Sage's boundless love, much like King Kun.","These formidable individuals, who had experienced the Scholarly Sage's boundless love, would instinctively experience an illusory pain even if the Expert Appraisal Technique had no effect.","Regrettably, the droplet of liquid metal remained unaffected by the Expert Appraisal Technique. Perhaps the love the Scholarly Sage had extended to the fat ball wasn't substantial enough.","Nonetheless, the Expert Appraisal Technique wasn't completely futile. At the very least, Song Shuhang was certain that the other party was exceedingly frail. It was so feeble that it couldn't evade the Impregnating Gaze in a straightforward manner. He had discreetly prepared the Descartes Leaf Appraisal Divine Technique! In the end, it wasn't needed.","Furthermore... Perhaps owing to the target's connection to the liquid metal sphere, the Scholarly Sage's eye was activated. It collaborated with Song Shuhang to focus on the droplet of liquid metal and activate its vulnerability scanning feature.","\"The target's body and spirit are in an extremely weakened state. It is recommended to employ a mental assault.\" A hazy message was relayed to Song Shuhang's mind via the Sage's eye.","The body and spirit of this droplet of liquid metal were both gravely wounded and feeble. However, because of the unique characteristics of the opponent's liquid metal form, the impact of a physical attack would be significantly diminished. Therefore, the most appropriate method of attack for Song Shuhang at this juncture was a mental assault!","A mental assault?","Song Shuhang pondered.","Rope's secret technique involved sound and soul attacks but wasn't yet perfected.","What form of mental assault would prove most effective at this moment?","...","...","\"Whoosh!\" The residual form of the Heaven's Chosen One, subjected to Expert Appraisal Art, was stimulated. It levitated into the air and emanated a formidable aura and spiritual pressure.","Even Pavilion Master Chu felt slightly uncomfortable.","\"Perfect timing!\" Song Shuhang thought excitedly.","\"Goddess Virtue!\" he called out loudly. The virtuous lamia's Armed Empress form could assist in mitigating the mental pressure.","Simultaneously, Song Shuhang flicked his golden core's QR code to meet the adversary's mental pressure.","\"Let's be friends, big brother!\"","As the cultivation chat talent underwent continuous evolution, Song Shuhang had the confidence to add major figures to his list of friends!","He no longer had to fret about the actions of these major figures because he now possessed considerable control. Furthermore, he had even more major figures in his friends' list, bolstering his support!","He was no longer apprehensive about competing in terms of operations and background.","[Ding! The Heavenly Dao Sphere has added you as a friend. Please choose its friend group.] A notification appeared in Song Shuhang's mind.","Success!","[Place it in Blacklist 2 alongside King Kun!] Song Shuhang swiftly selected.","All the decisions were made in an instant.","Then, the divine third eye on Song Shuhang's forehead opened.","[Mental Pollution!]","Capitalizing on the fact that the other party had yet to comprehend the various functions of the cultivation chat, Song Shuhang forcefully opened the information channel.","A plethora of useless data and information that had been conveyed to Senior Three-Eyed were unceremoniously dumped onto this droplet.","In the heavens, wisps of white smoke billowed from the Heavenly Dao Sphere.","This occurred because its current form and mental state couldn't endure the onslaught of this mental corruption and were being pushed to the brink.","The notification from the Scholarly Sage's eye had indeed proven effective!","[Next, extract all information about the giants within the artificial small world, including their daily routines, mating positions, and conversations!] Song Shuhang again extracted the information from his mind.","An assortment of pointless data regarding the giants in the 'man-made small world' was extracted, converted into a pile of 1DB of garbage data, and forcibly injected.","In the sky, the white smoke surrounding the Heavenly Dao Sphere carried a faint burning odor.","It seemed as though it was on the brink of collapse at any moment.","\"What's the next step? What should we do now?\" Song Shuhang mused.","\"Suggestion: Seize the opportunity to employ a potent spell and vanquish the target in one fell swoop. Note: You have only one chance.\" The Scholarly Sage's eye transmitted precise combat instructions.","Just one opportunity. He had to capitalize on the target's vulnerability and lack of resistance to obliterate it decisively.","The same tactic wouldn't work twice.","If he failed... Once the target became cautious, it would be impossible to deceive it once more.","A formidable spell capable of eradicating the adversary in a single stroke?","Song Shuhang's heart twitched faintly.","Krypton Gold Strike?"]},{"number":2442,"title":"Chapter 2442 Turning This World Upside Down!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang was a person with a strong heart. People like him often remained calm and composed even in critical situations. Their robust mental resilience allowed them to make rational decisions when facing extreme challenges.","In order to eradicate the liquid metal within the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, Song Shuhang had limited options due to the restrictions on his Inner World, which prevented him from using many external means. He needed to find a solution within those limitations.","Apart from the Krypton Gold Strike, he had a few other potential methods that included the Karmic Saber and a sealing technique he initially intended to use against the fat ball, namely the Holy Ape World Refining technique along with mysterious Whites 1-33.","However, the Karmic Saber was a ruler-level technique, and without the assistance from the Black Dragon World, using it solely with his own power could result in unpredictable outcomes. It might work well if luck was on his side, but it also carried the risk of being ineffective.","To effectively wield the Karmic Saber, Song Shuhang needed to wait for his cultivation chat talent to improve and strengthen his connection with the pendant boss. In this situation, where he had only one chance to strike, the unstable nature of the Karma Blade was not advisable.","As for the Holy Ape's World Refinement and Whites 1-33, they were both limited by the Heavenly Tribulation Realm and required the cooperation of the disposable flying sword, the Small Black Room Destruction Version. These methods introduced too many variables, and if not executed perfectly, they could provide the liquid metal entity with an opportunity to escape.","Therefore, after careful consideration, Song Shuhang concluded that the most suitable approach for the moment was to pay his way through.","Coincidentally, Song Shuhang had recently acquired a batch of heavenly and earthly treasures, along with valuable materials for repairing the Sacred Shadow Land that had been brought by Half-body No. 2 upon its return. Additionally, he possessed a valuable 50% discount coupon.","With a determined resolve, Song Shuhang decided to proceed with this payment strategy.","He understood that if the treasures were expended, he could always acquire more. However, if this enigmatic liquid escaped, it might be lost forever.","\"Purchase!\" Song Shuhang declared internally.","He retrieved the precious treasures from his bracelet, the spirit stones he had recently acquired, and the valuable materials intended for the repair of the Sacred Shadow Land. Simultaneously, he presented the 50% discount coupon.","He activated Divine Strike!","Song Shuhang's hair stood on end as it took on a brilliant golden hue. Wings of light emerged to form an 'eye' in the space between the wings. This eye synchronized with Song Shuhang's divine third eye to enhance the efficiency of the Krypton Gold Strike.","\"Money is but a worldly possession!\" Song Shuhang recited an incantation he had created.","Each time he added a treasure to the mix, the strength in Song Shuhang's palms grew stronger. With each increment of power, his trembling hands intensified.","\"50% discount coupon!\" Finally, he included the coupon within the orb of light.","Song Shuhang pondered how this 50% discount coupon would function. Would it save half of the Heavenly Materials and Earthly Treasures for his Krypton Gold Strike, or would it double the attack's potency?","The answer became apparent as the 50% discount coupon was absorbed. The energy in Song Shuhang's palms surged exponentially. He could sense that the power of the Divine Strike had increased by several folds. It was indeed the latter!","His heart ached. He had spent a substantial fortune on this divine attack.","Using the eye drops to exchange for treasures from the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group had nearly depleted his resources. Most of the acquired treasures had been placed in the Inner World as sacrifices. Song Shuhang had retained only a small portion of the heavenly treasures to aid his disciples in crafting magical treasures.","The repair materials for the Sacred Shadow Land had only included one Qiankun bag, but its quality was exceptionally high. According to the calculations of the Shadow Overlord, the cost of repairing the Sacred Shadow Land was comparable to the flat imperial crown worn by the virtuous lamia and equivalent to an Eighth or Ninth Stage spirit stone, which Song Shuhang possessed.","With a considerable number of treasures and the 50% discount coupon, the power behind this payment-driven strike was overwhelming.","Curiously, Song Shuhang had noticed a peculiar trend. Each time he employed the Krypton Gold Strike, it was somehow linked to the fat ball. In the Scholarly Faction, he had used it to confront the Scholarly Sage's obsession, ultimately exhausting his resources and executing the attack on the fat ball's incarnation. This battle had solidified his unique status in the Scholarly Faction, although he had lost much in the process.","Subsequently, during his escape from the Wielder's small black room, Song Shuhang had once again expended all his assets to execute the Krypton Gold Strike against the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. It had left him bankrupt and fleeing.","Now, having gathered a considerable number of treasures, Song Shuhang had once more emptied his pockets to employ the Krypton Gold Strike against this droplet.","Three different Krypton Gold Strikes, each tied to the fat ball, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, and the Heavenly Dao, had depleted Song Shuhang's wealth.","'You make my heart ache so much that I can't breathe, so I'll make your body stop breathing!' Song Shuhang's inner cry reflected the emotional and financial turmoil he had experienced.","\"One Hit of Krypton Gold—Divine Strike!\" Song Shuhang's voice resounded like rolling thunder as it echoed throughout the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Pavilion Master Chu could hear the anguish in Song Shuhang's roar.","With a deafening boom, the energy on Song Shuhang's fingertip transformed into a brilliant white light, piercing through the droplet engulfed in white smoke.","At that moment, nothing else existed in the world but this radiant white light.","Wherever the light passed, everything disintegrated.","The entire Profound Sage Heavenly Tribulation Realm trembled violently. The sea of lightning dissipated, and the tribulation clouds ruptured.","It was as if doomsday had arrived.","The liquid metal was annihilated by the beam of light. It disintegrated along with the surrounding space before being consumed by the explosion of the light.","The residual power of the strike reverberated within the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm for an extended period.","No being could survive such an onslaught.","\"Has the target been eradicated?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired, her disbelief apparent. She could no longer sense her target's presence.","Song Shuhang retracted his finger and accessed his cultivation chat friend list.","[Ding! Your friend 'Blacklist 2,' member Heavenly Dao Sphere has perished.]","Song Shuhang breathed a sigh of relief.","He intended to share the good news with Pavilion Master Chu, but before he could speak, the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm suddenly erupted.","The spatial confines of the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation could no longer contain the tumultuous force and exploded instantly.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","On this day, the first Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, overturned the table and set a new record by transcending the tribulation!"]},{"number":2443,"title":"Chapter 2443 The First Time Seeing Tyrannical Song in Such a State","paragraphs":["In the Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, things exploded without warning and left no time for reaction.","Song Shuhang stared at the collapsing Heavenly Tribulation Realm, his mouth agape as he struggled to utter a word.","After sacrificing all of his treasures and once again finding himself penniless, he had successfully defeated the Heavenly Dao Sphere. However, he hadn't anticipated that the Heavenly Tribulation Realm would also crumble.","\"Look, your wish has come true,\" Pavilion Master Chu pointed to the crumbling Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","—Previously, Song Shuhang had mentioned a third plan, which was to shake the table and destroy the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Now, he had accomplished just that!","Well, a man who keeps his word isn't someone you dislike.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu chuckled and asked, \"So, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, what are your thoughts now?\"","Song Shuhang struggled for words for a while before saying, \"Silence is golden.\"","The sudden explosion of the Heavenly Tribulation Realm had caught him off guard, and he wasn't prepared, both physically and mentally.","\"Now, the question is, with the Heavenly Tribulation Realm collapsing, has my Eighth Stage Profound Sage tribulation been successfully completed, or did it fail?\" Song Shuhang tried to remain calm as he analyzed the situation.","\"It's possible that the laws of the world will transport you to another Eighth Stage Profound Sage space for the tribulation,\" Pavilion Master Chu speculated—there was more than one Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Previously, Sage Monarch White had collected Heavenly Tribulation nuclear bombs from multiple Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realms and eventually reached the same one where Song Shuhang and the others were.","\"However, I've never seen the destruction of an Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm before, so I don't know what will happen. By the way, have you prepared your speech?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked.","\"I haven't had the time for that,\" Song Shuhang replied, feeling frustrated—he had been in the process of drafting his speech just a few days ago and had only written a beginning. He hadn't expected to be thrust into the Heavenly Tribulation Realm so quickly.","\"In that case, you'll have to do your best and see if you can improvise. I don't have a pre-written script for you to use. It's all up to you!\" Pavilion Master Chu said.","Song Shuhang silently observed the collapsing Heavenly Tribulation Realm while assessing his own state. His cultivation realm remained unchanged! He was still stuck at the bottleneck of the peak of the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, unable to break through.","It seemed that his tribulation transcendence had failed after the Heavenly Tribulation Realm's collapse.","\"So, does this mean I'll have to transcend the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation once more after I get out?\" Song Shuhang pondered.","...","...","Meanwhile, in various realms across the cosmos, a month had passed since Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's divine display.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, a regular participant in the Profound Sage Speech of the Ten Thousand Worlds held every month, was conspicuously absent this time!","For some reason, at this moment, many cultivators from different realms and cultivation systems began to think of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Various thoughts filled the minds of individuals from different worlds and cultivation systems in the vast multiverse.","\"Could it be that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has successfully transcended his path to immortality and concluded his journey through the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation realm?\" Cultivators from various worlds speculated that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song might be a peak Tribulation Transcender who was validating his path to immortality. That was why he had repeatedly conquered the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm's tribulation and given speeches on stage. Thus, many cultivators held such theories in their hearts.","\"While it's somewhat regrettable, I'm also inexplicably relieved,\" someone sighed.","\"Unfortunately, I had been eagerly anticipating Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's speech this month. I was hoping to utilize it as an opportunity to break through my own cultivation bottleneck. His online Q&A speech last time greatly benefited me,\" many cultivators expressed their anticipation for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's appearance.","Among the cultivators, there were feelings of regret, relief, unwillingness, and eagerness...","Regardless of their specific feelings, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had emerged in the minds of numerous cultivators across the universe.","Some cultivators gathered together and sensed a peculiar aura. They exchanged glances.","\"Wait, could this sensation be indicative of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's Dao Manifestation?\" Suddenly, a thought crossed someone's mind.","Eighth Stage Profound Sages possessed a unique characteristic: upon ascending, the myriad worlds would set up a stage for them to deliver lectures and showcase their divinity.","If a Profound Sage advanced to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, it would also trigger a significant change. It was said that after a Tribulation Transcender successfully transcended the Ninth Stage Immortal Tribulation, they could entrust their primordial spirit to the void and condense a natal star using the laws of the universe. From then on, the power of the Tribulation Transcender was no longer confined to their physical body. In fact, it was extremely challenging to completely annihilate them by killing their physical forms alone.","The successful condensation of a Tribulation Transcender's natal star would also result in peculiar phenomena in the myriad worlds.","\"Could it be... just now, we couldn't help but think of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. Was it because he achieved immortality? Did he advance half a step further into the Ninth Stage Tribulation Immortal Realm, becoming an entity with eternal life and immortality?\"","As cultivators pondered these questions, a scene reminiscent of a 'divine display' unfolded above their heads.","All idle cultivators couldn't help but raise their heads and gaze at the sky.","This sensation was akin to witnessing a Profound Sage displaying their divinity!","Had a new Profound Sage successfully attained enlightenment, vindicating their Dao? Or perhaps...","Rumble~~","This time, the divine display was unlike any before! All cultivators throughout the universe looked up and beheld a terrifying explosion.","Fierce energies, a majestic Thunder Sea, and the enigmatic Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","However, everything was collapsing!","Even through this divine display, the myriad worlds' cultivators could still feel the violent and desolate power surging within the depicted world, eager to consume and annihilate everything in its path.","\"What is this? Is it doomsday?\"","\"No, it seems to be the Heavenly Tribulation Realm. It's collapsing!\"","Why was the Heavenly Tribulation Realm collapsing?","And where was the Profound Sage set to display his divinity this time? Where was he?","\"There, at the center of the disintegrating world, the light of virtue!\" Someone with keen eyes spotted the focal point.","In the heart of the crumbling Heavenly Tribulation Realm, the radiant light of virtue coalesced into the Virtuous Empress.","\"It's Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's Virtuous Empress!\"","Few in the myriad worlds could match the beauty and temperament of this Virtuous Empress.","Furthermore, this time, the Virtuous Empress appeared even more resplendent.","The flat imperial crown atop her head, the empress's dragon robe, the exquisite armor decorating her neck, chest, arms, and slender waist, as well as the substantial shield and longsword in her hands, added a touch of Valkyrie spirit to her imperial authority.","And beneath her floated the man known throughout the universe—Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!","Or, more accurately, half of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!","This was the first time people had seen Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in such a sorry state!"]},{"number":2444,"title":"Chapter 2444 Seizing the Opportunity","paragraphs":["Even someone as formidable as Tyrannical Song had been pushed to the brink to the point of leaving behind only half of his body!","Just how terrifying was the heavenly tribulation he faced?","The Eighth Stage Profound Sage realm had directly obliterated next to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","\"Hiss ~\" Many people inwardly gasped.","They had initially believed that with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's top-tier Tribulation Transcender strength, facing the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation to validate his own path should have been a cakewalk, and conquering the heavenly tribulation should have been like child's play.","Now, it seemed that the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation Tyrannical Song faced each time wasn't as easy as people had imagined.","Could the Heavenly Tribulation Realm adjust to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's strength and become even more formidable?","Just like the scene unfolding before them, as Tyrannical Song battled the heavenly tribulation to the very end, half of his body crumbled, and it even shattered the entire Heavenly Tribulation Realm!","\"Every Tribulation Transcender on the path to immortality undergoes countless hardships. None of them have it easy.\"","'The path to immortality is a journey toward eternal life! Step by step!'","At this moment, cultivators from various realms began to gain profound insights. The path of cultivation was a gradual process, and it had never been easy!","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song hadn't even started his speech when a small wave of virtue power began to gather.","...","...","The Spirit River Su Clan's annual gathering, which took place only once every few decades, had come to an end.","The Su Clan was currently hosting their clan members and guests, with Old Ancestor Knot personally attending to the guests.","During the banquet, all heads turned... and then they saw Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and the shattered Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm.","Exclamations of astonishment filled the air.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, Doudou, who was about to gain independence, remarked, \"Even though this month was late, Tyrannical Song is never absent.\"","Fairy Dongfang Snow replied, \"After this, Shuhang will truly be 'Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.' What do you think, fellow Daoists?\"","Apothecary was rendered speechless.","\"Eh?\" Northern River's Loose Cultivator asked.\" Didn't Sixteen and Soft Feather manifest their divinity together?\"","Previously, Song Shuhang had clearly left with Sixteen and Soft Feather, but this time, they didn't form a group to transcend the tribulation?","\"In the end, this is his final manifestation of divinity before others. He doesn't need to form a group to transcend the tribulation. He can directly enter the tribulation transcending space,\" Dharma King Creation explained.","JSJ rubbed his chin. \"In other words, Shuhang didn't form a group to transcend the tribulation this time?\" He had wanted to see if he could form a group with him.","Members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group quietly discussed in the group.","The group leader, Venerable Yellow Mountain, wore a serious expression as he gazed at the shattered Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm and the remaining half of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in the middle.","\"Senior Yellow Mountain, what's troubling you?\" Fairy Lychee asked in a hushed tone.","\"I have an indescribable feeling. It's as though something new is about to begin,\" Senior Yellow Mountain replied quietly.","Fairy Lychee nodded slightly. She shared the same sentiment.","...","...","Simultaneously, in the myriad worlds, some prominent figures related to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song exhibited diverse reactions.","The Almighty Merchant and the Almighty Merchant Fairy, both wrapped in the same blanket, gazed silently into the void.","After a long pause, the Almighty Merchant spoke,\" My disciple, starting today, I will lift the restriction on trade between you and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.\"","\"Master, have you suddenly grown a conscience?\" Fairy Can Enter Anything asked in astonishment.","\"Conscience? In our line of work, we have all sorts of hearts, but a conscience isn't one of them.\" The Almighty Merchant smiled and pointed at the image in the air. \"Look, my disciple. The destructive blazing white power roaming in this shattered Eighth Stage world is the power of money! He had performed a malevolent technique at a great cost. Once used, one becomes addicted to it. If there's a first time, there will be a second and third.","Every time he uses this attack, he'll require a significant amount of natural treasures. Profound Sage Tyrannical Song will become our loyal customer.\"","The fairy was speechless.","However, I have a conflict with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, so I'll leave the deal with him to you,\" the Almighty Merchant stated.","\"I feel like you are playing a trick on me,\" Fairy Can Enter Anything muttered.","She sensed that her master must have discerned something but chose not to explain it to her.","...","...","On Spirit Butterfly Island, the Celestial Thearch, tending to the unconscious Lord Spirit Butterfly's medicine, looked up at the void.","A moment later, she smiled.","One of her concerns had been resolved. Furthermore, if she guessed correctly, Tyrannical Song was the one who had solved this issue.","\"But the next moment will be the wildest,\" the Celestial Thearch whispered.","After losing its backup plan, what action program would the programmed Wielder of the Will activate?","The most likely scenario was that the Wielder of the Will would forcefully take action and capture all entities related to the Ancient Heavenly City and forcibly extract them to compensate for its own shortcomings.","It might even indiscriminately capture all Immortals and Tribulation Transcenders.","After contemplating this, the Celestial Thearch secretly messaged Song Shuhang, \"Senior Song, from now on, maintain a low profile.\"","...","...","At the bottom of the sea, King Kun, on Song Shuhang's 'blacklist 2,' rested peacefully.","Suddenly, its expression shifted.","It had detected a message—the new addition to Blacklist 2, the Heavenly Dao Sphere, had perished.","Was Blacklist 2 a death list?","In the collapsing Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, the upper half of Song Shuhang's body clutched a 'disposable flying sword, small black room-breaking edition.'","The virtuous lamia raised her hands while cradling him in her palms.","Their eyes fixated on a point not far ahead... It was the remaining half of Song Shuhang's body that hadn't been completely severed. To be precise, only a small part of Tyrannical Song's other half remained.","At that moment, an emotionless will passed over Song Shuhang's other half.","Then, the will came to a halt on the fragment of 'Half Body No.2.'","The ghost fairy spirit quietly materialized behind Song Shuhang and activated the special divine body she had acquired from the 'scholar lineage.' Thanks to the?ghost fairy spirit's unique constitution, Song Shuhang's presence quickly diminished, and in the blink of an eye, he became 'slightly invisible.'","Moments later, the 'emotionless' will began to retreat.","Before departing... It took away the remains of his second half.","Even if it was just half a body, parts of Tyrannical Song's body seemed highly desirable to the universe's big shots. Everyone sought to lay claim to some of Tyrannical Song's possessions.","Song Shuhang and Pavilion Master Chu remained silent.","In this manner, the emotionless will successfully carried the 'fragment of Tyrannical Song's second body' away from the disintegrating Eighth Stage Profound Sage world and disappeared."]},{"number":2445,"title":"Chapter 2445 Profound Sage Tyrannical Song Not Dominating This Time?","paragraphs":["The recent dramatic scene was fully projected into the countless realms through the 'show of divinity' program!","Practitioners from across the realms witnessed half of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's body freezing in place, while the remaining half of his body was taken away by an invisible force.","Although they couldn't directly see the 'emotionless' willpower, through the 'show of divinity' scene, practitioners across the realms could vaguely sense a terrifying, indescribable power descending upon half of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Even though this sensation was indirect and vague, the souls of practitioners across the realms trembled, and those of lower realms fell into unconsciousness.","\"Terrifying! Is this the calamity that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is facing?\"","Some of the more powerful beings gained valuable insights from this scene. Some top-tier immortals even guessed the identity of that faint power.","\"What has Profound Sage Tyrannical Song done? Even the power of the heavens has been drawn out!\"","The more they knew, the more awe-inspiring it became, and their admiration for half of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song grew.","As a result, another wave of virtuous power formed and condensed across the countless realms.","Before Profound Sage Tyrannical Song even began his speech, he had already accumulated two waves of immense virtuous energy.","Just by showing his face, he could accumulate merit across the countless realms.","Undoubtedly, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was currently the most influential figure in the countless realms.","...","In the collapsing Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, after the vanishing of the will, Pavilion Master Chu breathed a sigh of relief and softly asked, \"Is there still a connection between you and Half-body No. 2?\"","\"No, there isn't,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Half Body No. 2 had already suffered the onslaught of sword qi from the Armed Empress Fairy and a kryptonite attack. It had been rendered necrotic and beyond recovery. Naturally, the link to the deceased Half Body No. 2 was severed.","Currently, Song Shuhang was discreetly utilizing the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique and the Cheng Lin Self-Healing Technique to regenerate his body. During this process, he had also prepared some sheets similar to the Almighty Merchant's for modesty's sake, as he was still in the 'show of divinity' segment.","Additionally, Song Shuhang activated the cultivation chat function and opened Blacklist 2.","In the list, the Heavenly Dao Sphere's name had dimmed, marked with 'Death.' King Kun, on the other hand, still shone brightly, accompanied by the radiance of a seven-colored divine artifact.","Song Shuhang kept his attention on King Kun and was ready to send a private message if necessary. He had learned from past experiences.","Previously, after losing one of his sneakers to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, the adversary had repeatedly tracked his position through various means and launched long-distance attacks. Given that his Half Body No. 2 had been taken by the Will of the Heavenly Axiom, it might attempt to telepathically assault him from a distance. To mitigate this risk, Song Shuhang was prepared to transfer the spiritual attack to King Kun if needed. He learned not to cling to a single option after the last incident.","However, the Will of the Heavenly Axiom, after taking Half Body No. 2, did not take immediate action. It seemed as though nothing had changed, and the world continued its normal course, as if the Will had never appeared.","The divinity ceremony carried on.","The disintegrated Eighth Stage Profound Sage realm, despite its destruction, still served as a backdrop for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and resolutely established a platform for showcasing his divinity. It appeared committed to ensuring that the practitioners across the countless realms experienced the damage caused by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's final speech.","The 'show of divinity' segment had ended, and the crucial 'Sage Seal' was next.","Typically, the 'Sage Seal' ceremony was highly anticipated by the countless realms, as it was during this segment that people learned the origin and Sage Name of the Eighth Stage Profound Sage displaying their divinity.","However, as Song Shuhang began the process of condensing the Sage Seal once more, the practitioners in the countless realms no longer held high expectations.","After all, he was a familiar face, and expectations were somewhat lacking.","People were now speculating about what Sage Name Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would choose this time.","The first candidate for the Sage Name was Cheng Lin.","\"Hmm? Isn't Profound Sage Tyrannical Song going for a dominant theme this time?\" Practitioners from across the countless realms felt puzzled. They were accustomed to his previous choices of dominant themes and unity.","\"Why isn't it a unified theme this time?\"","\"Why isn't everyone neatly aligned?\""]},{"number":2446,"title":"Chapter 2446 My Name Is Song Shuhang, and I’m Freaking Out Right Now","paragraphs":["Honestly, at this moment, many cultivators across the realms would prefer the fifth Sage Title of Tyrannical Song to be 'Tyrant Tyrant.' This way, it would at least be more orderly and ease everyone's discomfort to some extent.","As soon as the daoist name 'Cheng Lin' appeared, a group of top-tier experts across the realms who were 'in the know' froze for a moment.","Some displayed expressions of joy, some resentment, and others admiration.","When it came to the name 'Cheng Lin,' these top-tier experts across the realms had too many memories and thoughts.","\"By the way, can I use the private chat function of the cultivation chat now? Someone, please go and privately chat with our friend Song Shuhang and ask him to choose a more organized daoist name!\" Fairy Firefly, who had a touch of OCD, couldn't help but request.","At that moment, she wished she could use a repulsive force to send the daoist name 'Cheng Lin' flying.","Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, and Tyrannical Demon were all neatly lined up, but suddenly, 'Cheng Lin' appeared behind them. It was just too uncomfortable.","\"Fairy Firefly, there's no need to be anxious. There are still several backup daoist names that Song Shuhang has prepared,\" Northern River's Loose Cultivator reassured her.","\"Speaking of which, the day has finally come,\" Medicine Master said with a sigh.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer continued, \"Indeed. Although I knew that our friend Song Shuhang would one day become a Profound Sage after accidentally claiming the title of 'Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,' I didn't expect him to do it so quickly.\"","\"No, that's not what I meant,\" Medicine Master replied.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer, \"Meow? It seems our radio waves aren't on the same channel? Medicine Master, you've changed after marrying Ziyan!\"","\"I'm sighing at the passage of time. Back then, I was the one who led our friend Song Shuhang to enter the sect and guided him in practicing the Basic Buddhist Fist Technique to reach the Foundation Establishment realm. Now, Ziyan and I are still pregnant with the next generation, but our friend Song Shuhang has already been sterilized,\" Medicine Master sighed. This was probably fate! The connection between him and Song Shuhang was just right.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer was speechless.","Phoenix Slayer's claws scratched the sofa vigorously. Medicine Master's words made perfect sense, and Young Master Phoenix Slayer didn't know how to respond to Medicine Master's words.","Yellow Mountain remained silent for a moment. \"Do you want to take your medicine, Medicine Master?\"","\"I've already taken it. Senior Yellow Mountain, you don't need to worry about me,\" Medicine Master replied.","Yellow Mountain was so tired that he wanted to retire.","\"It's here, it's here. Song Shuhang's next Sage Title has come out,\" Fairy Dongfang Six reminded.","Next to Song Shuhang in the Prominent Divinity Stage, the line of words kept changing. This time, it transformed into several different daoist names in one go.","Tyrannical Saber Song One, Scholar Mountain of Books, Path-Seeking Scholar, Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion's Tear of Healing, @#%×...","The first three daoist names were all daoist names that Song Shuhang had used before. Of the seven daoist names, 'Virtuous Buddhist Sabersman' and 'Priest Mu' had already been given to his disciples, while 'Swordsman of Baijing Street' and 'Scholar Kindheartedness' had other uses.","The first three dao names were understandable.","As for the appearance of 'Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue,' it was very likely because he had signed a contract with Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue to become the 'preparatory Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue.' Later, Lady Onion inherited the 'Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber' and became the current Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue. Then, Song Shuhang's status would naturally be pushed back, and he would become a reserve Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.","\"What the heck is 'Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion's Healing Tear'?\" Pavilion Master Chu rapped Song Shuhang's head forcefully. Why did her Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion appear in Song Shuhang's daoist name?","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"Also, why did the daoist name of Fairy @#%× become your backup daoist name? Are you planning to become a fairy?\" Pavilion Master Chu didn't know what to say.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the enlarged virtuous lamia.","Fairy @#%× gave him a beautiful smile. With that smile, many cultivators across the realms suddenly felt like they were falling in love.","\"Tyrannical Saber Song One! Tyrannical Saber Song One!\" At the same time, many practitioners with OCD across the realms began silently reciting in their hearts.","It would be best to remove the two words 'Song One,' and the fifth daoist name would simply be 'Tyrannical Saber.'","In this way, it would truly be neat and pleasing to the eye!","\"Which daoist name are you going to choose?\" Pavilion Master Chu sighed and asked.","The current Song Shuhang was officially a Profound Sage, and unlike the previous times where his Sage name was randomly chosen, he now had the right to choose his own Sage name.","\"Saber Tyrant or Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue,\" Song Shuhang said calmly.","The reason why Song Shuhang only chose 'Tyrannical Saber' and not 'Song One' was because his strong desire to live had suddenly erupted!","This was because the daoist name 'Song One' would make the pendant on his body and a few big shots think of something bad.","If he really used the Sage Title 'Tyrannical Saber Song One,' who knew what kind of cruel things Sister White Dragon, Pavilion Master Chu, and Immortal Fairy White Bones?would do to him?","The White Dragon and Immortal Fairy White Bones?were still a good pair. After all, they weren't his pendants.","However, Pavilion Master Chu's hair was sticking to his head day and night.","If he used the name 'Song One,' Chu's hair would become the Sword of Damocles hanging above his head. That would be very fatal.","At the same time that Song Shuhang made his choice, Pavilion Master Chu's hair seemed to soften. \"That's fine. Among your daoist names, only 'Nine Virtues' and 'Tyrannical Saber' are?most suitable for you. So, choose one. Which one do you want to choose?\"","\"Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue,\" Song Shuhang said with a faint smile. As for the last Sage Title, he suddenly wanted to choose a Sage Title that was different from the others and didn't walk the path of tyrants.","Being neat and tidy was a form of beauty, but sometimes, being incomplete was also a form of beauty!","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand.","And just like that, on January 1st, 2020, for the fifth and final time, he prepared to manifest his Sage Title.","Please address him as the 'Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue!'","Tap!","As the compulsive individuals in the realms endured Song Shuhang's choice with discomfort, the characters began to coalesce and form the 'Sage Seal.'","Then, in the next moment, the Heavenly Dao suddenly exploded!","All across the realms, every cultivator could feel it. All eyes were fixed on Tyrannical Song as he formed his Sage Seal, and they all experienced the sudden disappearance of the Heavenly Dao, a violent shock that reverberated through their beings.","For a moment, the entire realm fell into a silence as deep as death.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","...","...","...","My name is Song Shuhang. Just last year, I was an ordinary freshman at Jiangnan University.","Now, I'm in complete panic mode.","Today marks my final public manifestation as a Sage and the day I officially become a Profound Sage. I even selected a Sage Title that I truly like.","These are two beautiful things and a turning point in my life.","But suddenly, the Heavenly Dao exploded.","What do I do next? I'm in urgent need of help."]},{"number":2447,"title":"Chapter 2447 Hello, Everyone, I’m Tyrannical Song, and This Is My Final Sermon","paragraphs":["Tyrannical Song, a man destined to be etched into the annals of the cultivation world, never failed to astonish with each of his divine manifestations.","He announced his presence to the entire cosmos as the First Saint in a thousand years. Then, with his fearsome Impregnating Gaze, he imprinted his image firmly in the hearts of all cultivators and left an indelible memory.","His divine manifestations spanned across all realms—the earthly plane, the Nine Netherworlds, and even the ancient worlds beyond those. There were traces of his imposing figure even in the distant past.","Neither time nor place could hinder his divine appearances!","He held the record for the most divine manifestations in the history of the cultivation world, a record that only Tyrannical Song himself could break!","Today marked Tyrannical Song's fifth public divine manifestation, and even though it was the fifth, this formidable man showed no signs of stopping. He was continuing to rewrite the history of the cultivation world!","This time, he ruthlessly shattered the Eighth-Grade Heavenly Tribulation World and ascended to the stage of divine manifestation within the collapsing world of heavenly tribulations. Just his posture during this divine manifestation was enough to once again be recorded in history.","But Tyrannical Song was not content with such historical events.","As he condensed the fifth Saint Seal, not even the Heavenly Dao could withstand the pressure and collapsed!","Every corner of the cosmos and every cultivator was left stunned and speechless.","[On Earth's date, January 1, 2020, Tyrannical Song's fifth divine manifestation. The collapse of the Heavenly Tribulation World, the destruction of the Heavenly Dao, and the shockwaves through the myriad realms!]","Historians in the cultivation world carefully documented this event. As Tyrannical Song hailed from Earth's China in the main world, the date was recorded based on Earth's time.","The man who caused the Heavenly Dao to crumble during the Prominent Divine Stage, regardless of his ultimate fate, would forever be etched in the annals of the cultivation world as a brilliant celestial event!","In the future, whenever the topic of Heavenly Dao was raised, it would be impossible to overlook Tyrannical Song!","...","The collapse and disappearance of the Heavenly Dao triggered a series of chain reactions and violently affected all planes within the universe.","The world's spiritual energy tide might arrive prematurely.","More importantly, the Immortals and Tribulation Transcenders who had long concealed themselves from the world would emerge from hiding.","These top-tier mighty figures of the world would enter the stage. It was time to commence the battle for the Heavenly Dao!","Who would become the Scholarly Sage of this world to reign supreme and dominate the myriad realms?","Who would emerge as the ultimate victor, inheriting destiny, attaining immortality, and becoming the master of countless worlds?","All cultivators throughout the universe cast their gaze upon Tyrannical Song as he manifested his divinity.","In terms of popularity, Tyrannical Song emerged as the leading contender for the title of Wielder of the Heaven!","With the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, he achieved Dao immortality while drawing the world's attention, geography, and destiny toward himself.","All cultivators in the universe shared a single thought—no matter who aspired to claim the title of Wielder of the Heaven, they could not avoid Tyrannical Song!","To attain immortality, one must first conquer Tyrannical Song's trial!","...","...","At this moment, Song Shuhang felt immense pressure.","The eyes of all cultivators throughout the universe were fixed upon him.","Moreover, he could sense that some of the reclusive heavyweights had emerged and begun to take an interest in his Prominent Divinity Speech.","\"Senior Chu... Would it be better for me to disappear for a while?\" Song Shuhang was beginning to feel overwhelmed.","Pavilion Master Chu was in a quandary. She was uncertain how to respond to Song Shuhang's question.","The Sage Seal, in the midst of condensation between Song Shuhang's fingers, had halted due to the collapse of the Wielder of the Will.","The Nine Virtues Sage Seal had yet to fully form, and it was likely it never would.","The repercussions of the Heavenly Dao's collapse rippled across myriad worlds, affecting Song Shuhang in his Prominent Divine Stage.","The Sage Title 'Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue' was no longer fitting for this moment.","The laws of heaven and earth had forcibly intervened in the Sage Seal's formation process. They sought to utilize his Sage Seal to broadcast to the myriad worlds that the Heavenly Dao was on the verge of collapse.","It was akin to a television station originally airing a television drama, but then having to interrupt it urgently to broadcast news of a world-class disaster. As a result, the original TV series was abruptly cut off, and the world news segment took over.","This was Song Shuhang's current situation.","The 'Sage Seal of Tyrant' had been truncated, and an urgent message concerning the Heavenly Dao's collapse had taken its place.","A moment later, a resounding boom echoed.","The words 'Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue' on Song Shuhang's Sage Seal became distorted.","In their place appeared the words 'Tyrannical Annihilation,' related to the collapse of the Heavenly Dao and permeated with a destructive aura.","Because the laws of heaven and earth had forcefully interfered with the Sage Seal's formation, Song Shuhang's fifth Sage Seal was unusually massive, far larger than the previous four.","In fact, this Sage Seal vaguely contained information about the Heavenly Dao's destruction. Its birth signified the vanishing of one of the Heavenly Daos!","Karma and changes of all kinds determined that this 'Sage Seal of Tyrant' was extraordinary.","It was the finest among Sage Seals—a mutated Sage Seal.","Perhaps, it could be aptly named a 'Dao Seal.'","Tyrant Destruction Dao Seal!","Tyrannical Song's fifth stance, Sage Monarch Tyrannical Extermination!","\"Sage Monarch Tyrannical Annihilation!\" This holy name resonated within the hearts of all throughout the myriad worlds.","Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Demon, and now, Tyrannical Annihilation.","At last, satisfaction!","\"Was all of this part of Tyrannical Song's plan?\" A few top figures in the myriad worlds pondered this possibility.","After all, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's advancement this time seemed incredibly fortuitous!","It was as though he had deliberately chosen the very moment when the Heavenly Dao crumbled to vindicate his Dao and, in doing so, condense an unprecedented Dao Seal!","\"The Sage Seal has been gathered, and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's Dao has been perfected. But will he still deliver his speech this time?\" Some ordinary cultivators in the myriad worlds were contemplating simpler matters that concerned them directly.","The battle for the Heavenly Dao was a distant concern for such cultivators.","Listening to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's lecture was a more immediate and relevant?option.","However, given the current circumstances, it seemed that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had already perfected his Dao. Would he still proceed with his speech?","...","...","In the void, Song Shuhang extended his hand and pressed it against the Sage Seal of Tyrant. He took a deep breath, calming his thoughts.","Despite the unforeseen turn of events, he had no intention of missing his imminent Profound Sage Speech. After all, this was meant to be his final address. However, he was uncertain how many would still listen to his speech after learning of the collapse of the Heavenly Dao.","He hoped for a smooth conclusion.","After stowing away the Sage Seal of Tyrant, Song Shuhang rose to his feet and stepped onto the designated spot for the Profound Sage Speech.","The live broadcast of the Profound Sage Speech reached across the myriad worlds.","After brief preparations, Song Shuhang began, \"Fellow cultivators of the universe, I am Tyrannical Song... I believe you are all acquainted with me.\"","\"This marks my final address!\" Song Shuhang declared to the multitude of worlds.","Pavilion Master Chu was taken aback.","Was this truly his last speech?","At this moment, she found herself pondering.","Should she perhaps provide Song Shuhang with a reminder?","Song Shuhang had always assumed that this would be his last speech.","However, there was a critical issue... He remained at the pinnacle of the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm.","Yes, although the Sage Seal had been formed and the speech had commenced, Song Shuhang's realm had yet to advance."]},{"number":2448,"title":"Chapter 2448 Bai Youyou, I’m Reluctant","paragraphs":["However, after careful consideration, Pavilion Master Chu dismissed the idea of reminding Song Shuhang.","After all, what followed was Song Shuhang's self-proclaimed \"final sermon.\" She didn't want to disrupt Song Shuhang's state of mind and let this unfortunate young man complete his \"final sermon\" in peace.","Let Song Shuhang savor this brief moment of happiness first—it was a kindness from Pavilion Master Chu.","At the very least, she would have to wait until he finished his sermon and condensed the wishes and merits of all living beings in the universe before she reminded Song Shuhang. It would be more interesting that way.","With that in mind, Pavilion Master Chu lazily reclined.","...","\"Tyrannical Song's Final Sermon?\" When cultivators from various worlds heard this, they were intrigued.","As they had suspected, Tyrannical Song had already ventured beyond his own Dao and he wouldn't waste any more time experimenting with public sanctification and sage sermons.","Thinking about this, many cultivators in the universe were saddened. Indeed, every time Tyrannical Song delivered a sermon, everyone gained valuable insights.","The previous Sexy Tyrannical Song's Online Q&A style of sermon had helped many cultivators find solutions to long-standing cultivation challenges and enabled them to break through their bottlenecks.","Since this would be Tyrannical Song's farewell sermon, more and more cultivators in the universe began eagerly anticipating it. In comparison to the hardships of cultivation, these sermons had become of utmost importance.","Regrettably, the monthly benefits of Tyrannical Song's sermons were coming to an end.","In retrospect, the past year had been filled with joy, tears, bitterness, and sweetness, ultimately culminating in a bountiful harvest.","\"One last sermon, and we won't need to worry about the Impregnating Gaze warning anymore?\" A small group of cultivators contemplated this with newfound hope. Each time Tyrannical Song spoke, no one dared to leave a negative review in fear of Tyrannical Song suddenly changing his demeanor.","After all, Tyrannical Song had a checkered past and had once used his mask to deceive the strict rules of sage sermons.","If this was indeed Tyrannical Song's farewell sermon... then the Impregnating Gaze warning would no longer concern them?","Fantastic!","\"Tyrannical Song, this time we'll evaluate your sermon seriously. If it falls short, don't blame us for withholding praise!\" As they pondered, these cultivators recalled Tyrannical Song's previous sermons.","Upon closer inspection, Tyrannical Song's sermons were ingenious and consistently struck a chord with everyone's hearts. It seemed that every time one gave Tyrannical Song a favorable review, it was well-deserved.","In light of this, losing the Impregnating Gaze warning appeared trivial.","\"Senior Tyrannical Song, don't end it so abruptly. If you're willing, you could deliver a few more lectures. We're ready to pool the wishes of all living beings to accumulate merit. We hope that Senior Tyrannical Song's sermons will continue indefinitely!\"","Some cultivators even began revealing their divinity in public. When a genuine Sage spoke, they could freely express their desires and receive real-time feedback from cultivators across myriad worlds.","They hoped their wishes would be acknowledged by Tyrannical Song.","...","...","Song Shuhang exhaled deeply and organized the content of his intended sermon in his mind.","Despite the news of the collapse of the Heavenly Dao affecting him, the number of cultivators tuning in for his sermon hadn't diminished significantly!","After all, even with the Heavenly Dao's collapse, the Immortals wouldn't immediately plunge into a deadly conflict.","Furthermore, Tyrannical Song had become universally recognized as the touchstone.","All the cultivators across the universe were certain of one thing—the competition for the qualifications to become a Heavenly Dao cultivator would commence with Tyrannical Song.","As a result, some prominent figures were closely observing Song Shuhang. To win every battle, one must first know themselves and their adversaries.","Tyrannical Song, who had transcended his own Dao, unquestionably possessed the qualifications to contend for the Heavenly Dao.","\"For this final sermon, let's return to the most original and pure style of discourse,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Demon, and the newly condensed Seal of Annihilation—the Seals of the Five Directions spontaneously orbited Song Shuhang like celestial bodies.","Song Shuhang folded his hands gently and revealed a golden core QR code on his palm. However, he refrained from displaying the QR code.","He hesitated.","If he revealed this Golden Core QR code during the sermon, would it prompt all practitioners in the universe to instantly add him as a friend?","Could his cultivation chat handle such an overwhelming influx of information?","Or, more importantly, could he endure the torrent of information in his current state?","After pondering for a moment, Song Shuhang discreetly extinguished the Golden Core QR code in his palm. Sometimes, one must restrain their desires.","He didn't wish to be overwhelmed by the information from the Golden Core QR code during the sermon and perform a death-and-revival act before the entire practitioner community.","Now wasn't the time to disclose the Golden Core QR code. At the very least, he had to wait until he reached the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm before considering its implementation.","\"For the content of this sermon, it might be a bit eclectic,\" Song Shuhang began explaining the situation in detail as per his thoughts.","His draft for the sermon had been crafted with guidance from Pavilion Master Chu, Sister White Dragon, Senior Turtle, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and other companions.","The secrets of Immortals and Tribulation Transcenders were interwoven throughout.","It also encompassed Song Shuhang's cultivation chat.","While the sermon was diverse, it quickly captured the attention of practitioners from across the universe. Even some top experts were raptly listening.","The resonance of the Great Dao and the manifestation of the Great Dao began to swirl around Song Shuhang.","The five Seals continued to encircle him, and the Dao Seal of Tyranny descended into Song Shuhang's grasp.","With both hands, he held the Seal, and his thoughts became increasingly lucid. The sermon, once incomplete, was now being composed continuously within his mind.","This new content delved into the Sage Name Tyrannical Annihilation, the collapse of the Wielder of the Will, and intertwined with Song Shuhang's own experiences of life and death.","Simultaneously, a constant stream of revelations began surfacing in Song Shuhang's mind.","He gained a deeper understanding of his cultivation techniques and secret arts.","Additionally, another previously incomplete secret technique was gradually reaching fruition. It was a multi-attribute secret technique crafted by Spirit River Su Clan's Ancestor Rope, 'Voice + Spirit + Soul.'","This secret technique allowed the caster's voice to be filled with magical power and enabled them to provide listeners with an immersive experience.","...","...","In a distant world,?White and the fat ball stood a hundred meters apart.","\"Bai Youyou... I truly can't bear... can't bear to disappear like this,\" Fat Ball's voice was slightly stuttered, as if a tape had become stuck.","Its body was disintegrating.","With the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, even it couldn't continue to exist.","\"Yeah, I know,\" White replied.","He was the person in the universe who understood the liquid metal ball the most. To survive, Fat Ball had gone to great lengths and used various methods.","Unfortunately, Fat Ball's corresponding Heavenly Dao hadn't granted it more time.","After a moment's pause, Fatty Ball decided to speak, \"In six different locations within the Nine Worlds, I've hidden important treasures related to the previous Heavenly Dao. After I dissipate, these treasures...\"","\"Say no more; I already know,\" Bai Youyou spoke up. \"Of your six treasure hiding spots, three have already been secretly emptied by me, and I have clues about the remaining three.\"","Fat Ball was speechless.","\"Bai Youyou, I still want to kill you.\"","\"Farewell,\" White softly said at the end.","Let Fat Ball disappear with its grudge against him."]},{"number":2449,"title":"Chapter 2449 The Sleeping Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["Fat Ball shrunk while becoming increasingly transparent from the inside out.","It resembled a piece of firewood on the brink of burning out, its feeble flame of life flickering in the wind and rain.","\"The very... last...\" Fat Ball strained to speak with a glitch-like voice.","Suddenly, it gathered all the strength within its body and transformed its entire form into a fist while hurtling towards Senior White Two?like a rocket.","In its final moments, it resolved to land a punch on Senior White Two's repulsive face!","Senior White Two stood unmoved and made no attempt to dodge. It was as though he intended to face Fat Ball's final punch head-on.","Whoosh~","The gust of wind caused Senior White Two's long hair to flutter as the fist formed by Fat Ball's body struck an inch away from Senior White Two... It couldn't advance any further.","In the next moment, the enormous fist dissipated like sand and scattered on the ground.","The ruler of the Netherworld, Fat Ball, met its end.","A sudden gale picked up, lifting the sand formed by Fat Ball's body into the air. In midair, this sand underwent further erosion and eventually dissipated completely.","Senior White Two stood there silently for several minutes. Then, he produced a pair of sunglasses and donned them with a suave gesture. He lightly patted his windbreaker and turned to depart.","...","In the mortal realm, within the myriad worlds, cultivators all looked up at the sky, silently listening to Tyrannical Song's final sermon.","Even the lower-level cultivators who had fallen unconscious due to sensing the ruthless will had awakened under the guidance of the elders and were now listening attentively.","Tyrannical Song, the Profound Sage, delivered his sermon this time without resorting to any special techniques. He returned to the purest form of preaching and delivered it earnestly.","His sermon this time encompassed a wide range of topics, somewhat mixed and complex. However, every paragraph contained the insights of Tribulation Transcenders and even Immortals.","\"It appears that Profound Sage Tyrant's preparation for this sermon may be lacking?\" Some of the top-notch figures detected many details in Song Shuhang's sermon.","Undoubtedly, this sermon was highly captivating. Even they were deeply engrossed in it. However, it was evident that Tyrant Song's sermon was somewhat hurried. It seemed he hadn't even finished writing the complete 'sermon.'","\"It seems this is indeed Profound Sage Tyrant Song's final sermon.\" The top experts thought to themselves.","The strength of Tyrant Song's final tribulation was undoubtedly beyond imagination. To confront the last heavenly tribulation and verify his own Dao, he hadn't even had time to finish writing the script for his last sermon.","Tyrant Song must have devoted all his time to 'transcending the final tribulation'!","\"Is everything part of your plan?\"","These top experts couldn't help but cast their gazes at Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in the sky.","At this moment, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song sat cross-legged—sharp-eyed individuals could see that his toes had just grown out.","In the time it took for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to display his divinity and deliver his sermon, his lower body had already fully regenerated!","What a terrifying self-healing technique!","The sharp-eyed experts' evaluation grew even higher.","In the void, Sage Monarch Tyrannical Song, sitting cross-legged, had closed his eyes.","He had wrapped a blanket around his waist and clasped his hands together to place them naturally on his abdomen. The colossal Empress Fairy stood behind him like a guardian deity.","At this moment, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song appeared as if he were asleep.","However, his sermon didn't pause. An ethereal voice emanated from his mouth while carrying an enchanting quality.","As his sermon unfolded, the cultivators in the myriad worlds felt their heartstrings being tugged!","Every sentence and word began to possess a breathtaking effect that drew in the cultivators from the myriad worlds who were listening. Everyone opened their hearts and enter the world of Tyrant Song Tyrant Extermination!","\"Wait, this sensation... this feeling where every sentence and every word begins to possess a special power... could it be that Tyrannical Song wants to create his own 'words'?\" A few veteran top experts suddenly had a thought.","The two most recently recognized Supreme Sages were the Heavenly Emperor of the ancient Heavenly City and the Sage of the scholarly faction.","Both of them possessed very unique characters that belonged exclusively to them—Imperial Script and Confucian Script.","Conceiving one's own words seemed to symbolize a higher realm.","Had he already begun to create his own 'characters' after stepping into his own Dao?","As expected, he was extraordinary.","In the future battle of the Heavenly Dao, he was an ordeal that no one could evade!","At Spirit River Su Clan, Su Clan's Ancestor Knot looked at Song in surprise.","He knew that Song was currently employing the sermon technique. It was the incomplete combination of voice, mental energy, and soul secret technique that he had spent three days imparting to him.","He hadn't expected Song to utilize the opportunity of the sermon to perfect his secret technique!","\"Wonderful.\" Knot smiled.","Through Song's sermon, he could deduce the 'completion' segment of the secret technique and begin to perfect his own secret technique.","\"By the way, is Shuhang asleep?\" Fairy Lychee suddenly spoke up.","Her intuition had always been precise.","Although Song Shuhang was still delivering his sermon and hadn't paused, Fairy Lychee felt that he had fallen asleep.","\"Is he asleep?\" Senior Yellow Mountain was taken aback.","Falling asleep while giving a sermon... Why did this scenario sound so familiar?","After some contemplation, an idea suddenly flashed through Senior Yellow Mountain's mind.","In the next moment, he felt an illusory pain in his lower abdomen.","There was no mistake... It was during young friend Song Shuhang's second 'public divinity display' sermon. At that time, he was delivering a sermon on the topic of 'Cultivating the Demonic Seed in One's Heart.' However, as he spoke, he unexpectedly fell into a sleep-like state. Midway through, he transformed the subject from Cultivating the Demonic Seed in One's Heart into a Confucian lecture. That night, no one in the myriad worlds, including the Netherworld Realm, slept.","Senior Yellow Mountain began to feel uneasy.","At the same time, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, who had been delivering his sermon, suddenly stood up.","He spread his hands and displayed the posture of a white crane spreading its wings, and retracted his leg to adopt the posture of a golden rooster standing alone.","His eyes remained closed, as if he were in deep slumber."]},{"number":2450,"title":"Chapter 2450 Tyrannical Sage’s Discourse Goes Off Course","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang's tightly shut eyes... They offered Senior Yellow Mountain a slight sense of relief.","However, it was a minuscule respite that was tinier than a nail tip.","Furthermore, it was only temporary, and no one could guarantee when Shuhang might suddenly open his eyes.","Just as Senior Yellow Mountain was contemplating this... Song Shuhang opened his eyes! Not his regular eyes, but a third eye on his forehead!","\"Triplets?\" Senior Yellow Mountain's heart raced.","Was a simple Impregnating Gaze no longer sufficient to satisfy his young friend, Song Shuhang?","...","...","In the void, while Song Shuhang was performing the Golden Rooster Standing Alone and the White Crane Spreading Its Wings, the Ghost Fairy Spirit behind him hastily appeared and reached out to grasp the blanket tied around Song Shuhang's waist to prevent it from slipping off and expose him.","\"...\"","Could this inexplicable posture mean that Senior White had possessed him?","She observed Song Shuhang's current state.","Had he fallen asleep?","At this moment, Song Shuhang had entered a meditative state, or rather, a state of enlightenment, much like sleep in any case.","However, even though he had entered a sleep-like state, his discourse never ceased.","It was as if his mouth had been enchanted to keep talking about profound techniques and Dao endlessly.","The divine third eye on his forehead had been activated by Knot's secret technique. The divine third eye already had the ability to forcefully convey information. Now that it had taken the initiative to manifest itself, it was cooperating with the secret technique to amplify the effect of this secret technique which enabled Song Shuhang's discourse to carry more information and become even more captivating.","Simultaneously, the Virtuous Lamia behind him began to act. She formed a lotus seal with her hands, and a dense network of virtuous light appeared around her. The power of virtue that Song Shuhang had condensed during his discourse was all guided by the Virtuous Lamia to this network of virtue behind her to strengthen the network and laying a solid foundation for Song Shuhang's future.","However, only she and Song Shuhang could see this network of virtuous light.","There was only the depiction of the Virtuous Lamia forming a lotus seal with her hands which released a substantial amount of virtuous light and illuminated Song Shuhang's back like a dazzling sun.","...","All the practitioners in the universe watched Profound Sage Tyrannical Song with confusion. They didn't understand why Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would suddenly assume such a peculiar posture.","This combination of Golden Rooster Standing Alone and White Crane Spreading Its Wings made everyone feel like they were witnessing some sort of performance... But on the other hand, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's unceasing discourse had the power to captivate hearts and draw their attention.","The listening state of the practitioners in the myriad worlds oscillated between 'acting' and 'captivating' and plunged them into a realm of uncertainty.","Pavilion Master Chu stirred slightly. She was considering whether to provoke Song Shuhang. After all, he was in the midst of delivering a discourse. However, considering that Song Shuhang was currently in a state of 'enlightenment,' and interrupting someone's enlightenment was akin to sabotaging their future, she refrained from interfering.","\"Can't you transcend the heavenly tribulation properly and deliver a serious discourse for once?\" she sighed.","She felt like she was on the verge of becoming a nagging mother, one who was always worrying about Song Shuhang's trivial affairs.","\"Forget it, I don't care anymore. Just do whatever you want. If you have the ability, go ahead!\" Pavilion Master Chu thought to herself.","Just as this thought flashed through her mind, Song Shuhang did something unexpected!","One after another, white lotus flowers appeared around Song Shuhang. This was the 'Lotus Blossoming Tongue' skill.","A massive black lotus materialized beneath Song Shuhang's feet. It was the unique ability of 'Lotus Step by Step.'","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Soon after, a colossal illusory world emerged behind Song Shuhang.","It was a world as enchanting as a fairyland.","However, this world revealed only a fraction of its splendor.","At the center of the Void Illusionary Immortal Realm was a spring brimming with life energy. The springwater flowed continuously to form two pools.","In the lower pool, a fairy maiden with long black hair, radiating beauty comparable to the Virtuous Empress, lazily blew bubbles out of boredom. Her body was submerged in the pool.","Sitting by the poolside were three other fairies.","One had long black hair, a tall and fair-legged figure.","One had short hair and a petite frame, donning a white dragon scarf.","One sported a green ponytail, a buxom figure, and wore a green cheongsam.","However, due to the phantasmal nature of the projection, the scene was shrouded in misty immortal energy that lent to it an ethereal beauty.","Pavilion Master Chu was left utterly bewildered.","This projected world was Song Shuhang's Inner World. Since the Eighth Stage's Heavenly Tribulation Realm had been obliterated, the Inner World was naturally no longer concealed.","Pavilion Master Chu was tempted to give Song Shuhang a sound scolding.","Though the image had been veiled by immortal energy, anyone who knew her could undoubtedly recognize her based on certain characteristics.","This time, everyone in the universe was aware that she was leisurely blowing bubbles in the pool.","\"If you weren't in a state of enlightenment right now, I would definitely scold you until you fainted!\" Pavilion Master Chu muttered to herself.","At that moment, the Song Shuhang in discourse underwent another transformation.","His odd stance began to sway. His palms, like wings, danced gracefully, and the artifact spirit fairy on his right fist knelt on the back of his hand. She swayed up and down while making melodious sounds.","With this action, Song Shuhang's state was adjusted to the 'optimal mode.' Yes, within the 'White Crane Spreads Its Wings + Golden Rooster Standing Alone' posture lay a set of techniques for rejuvenating energy and refining one's state.","When Song Shuhang's main body absorbed the unknown White 1-33's power in the artificial small world and merged with it, his body instinctively assumed this posture. It was also because this set of movements allowed his body to adapt to the best state at any given moment.","The divine third eye, the network of the Virtuous Lamia, the Inner World, the Scholarly Sage's eye, and the playful horse posture... Song Shuhang's abilities merged into one.","Then, the fifth Sage Seal, the Tyrant Destruction Dao Seal, shone brilliantly.","It contained information about the collapse of the Wielder of the Will, and it finally resonated with Song Shuhang in his most powerful state.","Thus, in the eyes of all the practitioners in the universe, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song briefly?paused.","It was a short pause that lasted no longer than taking a deep breath.","Then, with renewed vigor, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song continued his discourse.","And then... he went off on a tangent.","In a different context, the content of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's subsequent discourse diverged from the previous 'technique' which caused bewilderment among listeners. It was as if his words didn't align with his prior performance.","All the practitioners in the universe were left puzzled.","\"&~\" At that moment, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song opened his mouth in discourse and uttered a peculiar syllable.","This syllable contained information about the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, along with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's understanding of the cycle of life and death.","Simultaneously, under the augmentation of the third eye, Knot's Secret Technique was in full swing.","With just one syllable, all the practitioners in the universe were drawn into Song Shuhang's rhythm.","Next, it was time for Tyrannical Song to shine!"]},{"number":2451,"title":"Chapter 2451 The Car Door Is Welded Shut – No One Can Get Off!","paragraphs":["\"Is this... really a self-created language?\" Some of the top influencers who were present to witness Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's recent utterance were left astounded.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had, astonishingly, succeeded in crafting his very own written language.","They say beginnings are always tough, and creating one's initial set of characters is the most arduous step. Once this milestone is achieved, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would have a solid foundation to continually develop his unique written language.","But what style of writing did Profound Sage Tyrannical Song employ?","Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Demon, and Tyrannical Annihilation... If we followed this pattern, then his words could naturally be dubbed... Tyrannical Literature?","\"Does Profound Sage Tyrannical Song wield the same power as the Scholarly Sage and the Heavenly Emperor?\" As they contemplated this, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song spoke once more.","His speech was rapid, slightly mumbled, difficult for the denizens of the universe to discern his words clearly. But that was inconsequential; whether they comprehended his speech clearly or not, practitioners across myriad worlds who were in a state of 'empathy' could grasp the essence of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's message.","Thanks to Knot's secret technique and the Dao Seal of Tyranny, fortified by his divine third eye, every practitioner in the universe had aligned with Song Shuhang's rhythm.","This was the black car heading towards Tyrannical Song's era. The car door had been firmly sealed, and there was no chance of disembarking mid-journey!","Furthermore, Song Shuhang's forthcoming discourse delved into the information regarding the collapse of the Wielder of the Will. Even Immortals would not be entirely immune. Song Shuhang's divine show this time transcended ordinary exhibition; it was influenced by the power of heaven and earth and served as a platform to communicate the news of the Wielder of the Will's collapse to practitioners across myriad worlds.","Anything connected to the Wielder of the Will, even mere news of its demise, possessed an overwhelming power that could not be resisted.","As Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's speech unfolded, practitioners throughout the universe felt their surroundings undergo a transformation.","It was as if they had entered a dream, but this dream was extraordinarily lifelike, and their consciousness remained exceedingly clear. This was the legendary daydream!","\"It's as if a colossal illusion of reality has enveloped the universe. All practitioners have been ushered into this illusion of reality!\" A prominent figure commented calmly.","Though Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had borrowed the authority of Sage's Speech, it was evident that his mastery of the illusion of reality was profound.","The illusion of reality was an innate ability many Immortals continued to study. While it was an ability only Seventh Stage Venerables could grasp, numerous Immortals found it exceptionally enigmatic and worthy of in-depth exploration.","With a collective intake of breath, all the practitioners across the universe found themselves within a world brimming with righteousness.","They hadn't gathered together physically, but every individual had transformed into Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and shared the insights conveyed by his discourse.","\"What place is this?\" Most of the practitioners gazed in confusion at this unfamiliar realm.","For some practitioners of demonic and malevolent arts, entering this world induced a profound sense of discomfort and distress.","Members of the modern world's scholarly faction swiftly recognized this illusory realm. It was the scholarly faction's Golden Lotus World!","The countenances of the scholarly faction's patriarchs and True Monarch Eternal Fire turned pallid.","They recognized this as the environment when the Golden Lotus World had just taken form. Coupled with the information about the collapse of the Heavenly Dao and the cycle of life and death disclosed in Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's speech, an ominous foreboding settled in their hearts.","After all, they were the central figures in those events.","That experience was a nightmare they wished never to revisit for the rest of their lives... Even the faintest recollection sent shivers down their spines.","Not every practitioner was named Tyrannical Song, not everyone could embrace pain, and not everyone had a presence behind them applauding silently in moments of agony.","\"I hope we're overthinking it. I hope Profound Sage Tyrannical Song can be merciful,\" silently prayed the scholarly faction's leaders.","In the next moment, the Golden Lotus World of the scholarly faction was ruthlessly pierced by a finger seemingly forged from steel. This finger, composed of liquid metal, appeared before the leaders of the scholarly faction and in the sight of all the practitioners in the universe.","\"What is this?\"","\"What kind of origin does this finger have, emanating boundless despair, fear of mountains of corpses and seas of blood, and cruelty as bottomless as the abyss?\"","Beneath this finger, even Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders felt as insignificant as ants, and lower-level cultivators were less than insects.","After the finger's descent, all the inhabitants of the Golden Lotus World were crushed.","Reduced to pieces...","During this cruel process, the malevolent energy of the Netherworld infiltrated their bodies and intensified the agony of death!","Even when they died, the will of all beings remained alive and endured indescribable torment and the incursion of the Netherworld's malevolent energy.","What a harrowing way to meet one's end!","Even the countenances of Immortals, who had seen much, twitched. The impact of the speech on them was not overwhelming, and their resolve wouldn't waver due to this degree of suffering and death.","However, that liquid metal finger aroused their concern. The overwhelming pressure, the aura of despair, and the ability to command the malevolent energy of the Netherworld... Was it the Sovereign of the Netherworld?","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had once confronted the Sovereign of the Netherworld? And he was still alive and thriving?","Longevity-seeking Immortals held Profound Sage Tyrannical Song in higher regard.","\"Is it over?\" After experiencing the excruciating ordeal, practitioners throughout the universe breathed a collective sigh of relief.","They had no desire to relive the experience of being crushed by a higher power a second time.","\"Over? It's far from over,\" True Monarch Eternal Fire thought to himself.","That was an experience trapped in an endless loop. He couldn't even fathom how he endured it initially!","As practitioners across the universe thought it was the end, they were resurrected within the illusory world.","They were brought back to life!","They were alive!","Damn, who had cast the resurrection spell? Were they out of their minds?"]},{"number":2452,"title":"Chapter 2452 This Is Exactly the Benevolence of Tyrannical Song, the Profound Sage!","paragraphs":["\"Now, all the cultivators across countless realms must be secretly cursing the one behind the resurrection.\" thought True Monarch Eternal Fire.","He was the mastermind... the man cursed in secret by cultivators from all realms.","Therefore, this truth must remain hidden from outsiders.","Presently, True Monarch Eternal Fire had covertly advanced to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm. Ever since he became the custodian of the Confucian Golden Lotus World, he had continuously received feedback from that world, which propelled him from the Sixth Stage to the Seventh Stage. However, this matter was a closely guarded secret of the Confucian faction, never revealed to the public.","With the Confucian Golden Lotus World as his support, as long as he proceeded steadily, ascending to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm was just a matter of time.","Hence, this matter had to be shrouded in secrecy, ensuring that when practitioners from all realms delivered their lectures, they wouldn't remember it and give him unfavorable reviews.","Contemplating this, Eternal Fire calmly embraced his next demise.","...","...","In the midst of despair and sorrow enveloping practitioners from all realms, they were caught in an endless cycle of resurrection.","That terrifying liquid-metal finger pressed down mercilessly time and again!","No matter how many times they perished, that mysterious force unfailingly resurrected them, only to be crushed once more by that heartless golden finger!","It made practitioners from all realms begin to question the meaning of their existence.","Who am I? Where am I? What is the purpose of my existence?","Their existence was merely to perish repeatedly?","Regardless of how often they experienced death, they could never grow accustomed to it.","Each demise offered a completely distinct and fresh experience.","At that moment, even though they were being driven to the brink of collapse, the Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, still striving to construct a stage for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's lecture, seemed to radiate the brilliance of a sage. Tyrannical Song's lecture this time owed much to the collapse of the Eighth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","\"Let me die... Don't resurrect me anymore... Let me truly die,\" shed many tears of sorrow among practitioners from all realms.","However, despite their cries and the excruciating pain, practitioners from all realms were growing stronger.","The understanding gained through these cycles of life and death was the most effective way to temper a cultivator's heart.","Death after death would eventually transform into the most precious personal experience, becoming a cherished insight for practitioners from all realms and fortify their wills.","...","...","\"This can be said to be a boon bestowed upon all realms by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,\" contemplated an Immortal calmly.","This infinite death lecture was clearly a part of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's life experiences.","All practitioners from all realms were drawn into Tyrannical Song's rhythm and experienced death, but in the context of the lecture, they didn't truly face death!","Furthermore, this lecture's protagonist was based on the will of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Ordinary cultivators lacked the formidable will of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. If they were genuinely placed within that plot, many might perish two or three times before their will collapsed and perhaps even fall into a coma. Consequently, the tempering effect of the Samsara of Death was significantly diminished.","Yet, by taking on the role of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, even if a cultivator's willpower was lacking, they would still be guided by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to experience the cycle of death. They couldn't faint or give up. Thus, the tempering effect of the Samsara of Death would be maximized!","\"After this lecture, the willpower of practitioners from all realms will be elevated to a higher level! Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's merits are immeasurable,\" judged a prominent figure.","The Heavenly Dao had already crumbled, and the realms were inevitably entering the most chaotic era.","During this period, only cultivators with stronger wills could survive!","After undergoing Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's lecture, more practitioners would be capable of surviving in the future.","\"Although it appears to be a cruel cycle of life and death on the surface, this is precisely the benevolence of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,\" concluded many bigwigs.","They couldn't help but contemplate how much better it would have been if they had encountered Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's lecture in their youth.","This was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song guiding practitioners from all realms to cultivate their 'willpower' attribute.","Unfortunately, for those in their present state, the effect of this Samsara of Life and Death was weak and nearly ineffective.","...","...","How many times had they died?","Practitioners from all realms could no longer keep track.","The liquid-metal fingers above their heads continued to press down relentlessly, unfazed by fatigue.","The power of resurrection was equally stubborn and refused to release all living beings from its grip.","Practitioners from all realms felt that their blood had already saturated the entire space. Their flesh and blood now coated the entire world.","This was a bloodstained, ruthless world, and the bloodstains were all theirs.","How many times could one die in a lifetime?","Aside from the group of people involved in the Confucian faction, 99% of practitioners from all realms had never died so many times!","They felt that on this day, they had exhausted all the 'shares of death' they were destined to experience in their lifetimes.","\"Is it not over yet?\" some questioned.","\"I used to think that the Impregnating Gaze was the most dreadful lecture in all realms... Looking back, I was truly naive.\"","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was a man who consistently brought fresh experiences to all realms. He had once made the world feel pain, and this time, he made the world experience death!","\"However, were all these experiences Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's own? Did he ever undergo such despair? If it were me, could I endure like Senior Tyrannical Song and persist until now?\"","\"Hold on, Senior Tyrannical Song! Don't yield to death!\"","Perhaps due to the principles of the Stockholm Syndrome, many cultivators were moved by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song after enduring death repeatedly. They even felt admiration from the depths of their hearts.","Finally, the protagonist who had remained silent all along took action... He gently raised a folding fan made of green onion sprouts in his hand and blocked the liquid-metal finger.","During this time, there was certainly some plot taking place, but it had nothing to do with the cycle of life and death and was thus omitted from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's lecture.","The liquid-metal finger finally relented.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had saved the world!","At that moment, all practitioners from all realms were moved to tears.","The Illusory World that had enveloped them dispersed.","Practitioners from all realms found themselves drenched in sweat.","The experiences of death were etched into their very bones. The memories of their bodies being crushed and their flesh torn apart lingered in every muscle and nerve and became their most cherished experiences.","Despite the pain, the gains were more precious than the suffering.","At this moment, practitioners from all realms were willing to contribute their wish power to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and achieve the merit of his final lecture.","They only hoped that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would be merciful and spare them.","******","At that moment, after the first death lecture concluded, Song Shuhang's consciousness was pulled up and quickly ascended!","This was something he had never experienced in his previous divine shows.","Song Shuhang didn't panic.","He could vaguely sense... This should be because the laws of heaven and earth had forcibly interfered with his Sage Seal Condensation and Profound Sage Lecture, and he had received feedback from the laws!","At this moment, the power of heaven and earth that was interfering with his Profound Sage Lecture was retreating.","But where there was interference, there would inevitably be feedback.","He couldn't be sure if this feedback was good or bad. In any case, the feedback fell upon Song Shuhang's body.","In just a few breaths, Song Shuhang's divine sense and mental energy were temporarily strengthened to a level far beyond his actual realm.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang's consciousness came into contact with a very special rule—the divine show rule he was currently employing!","With just a gentle touch, Song Shuhang's consciousness was abruptly returned to the mortal world.","The intense pain, as if the world were collapsing, exploded in his head."]},{"number":2453,"title":"Chapter 2453 Impartial and Equal","paragraphs":["His head throbbed!","What's more, this was a brand-new kind of headache that Song Shuhang had never experienced before. There were no immunity factors for this kind of head pain stored in his 'immunity bank.'","Song Shuhang had endured dozens of different types of head pain in the past. Some were physical, some caused by illnesses, some were aftermaths of overpowering mental energy, some were the price for using secret appraisal techniques, and some were the anguish of the soul... and so on.","But this time, the pain was different from anything he had ever felt. This time, the pain was the price Song Shuhang had to pay for delving into rules that far exceeded what humans could comprehend. It was somewhat similar to the Immortal Lord forcibly coming into contact with genuine immortal knowledge and falling into a deep slumber.","\"Hiss ~ Thankfully, I only touched it for a moment before my consciousness was knocked back.\" Song Shuhang thought to himself upon regaining consciousness.","If he had remained in contact for too long, he might have turned into a second Immortal Lord and become a slumbering man who required a passing princess's kiss to awaken.","Song Shuhang slowly opened his eyes—due to the pain, his consciousness had returned, and the lecture had temporarily come to an end.","'Is it over?!' When practitioners from all across the universe witnessed this scene, they felt their hearts starting to race. Had Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's lecture finally concluded? For the practitioners who had died countless times during the lecture, there was nothing in the world more fortunate than this moment. Their cycle of death had finally come to an end.","After subjecting the myriad worlds to suffering and making them experience death, Song Shuhang had successfully sped up the heartbeats of practitioners from all across the myriad worlds.","\"Hiss ~~ It hurts, it hurts, it hurts.\" At this moment, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, now in the Prominent Divine Stage, pressed his hands against his temples and softly exclaimed.","As soon as he cried out in pain, Knot's secret technique spread throughout the myriad worlds!","The state of Profound Sage's lecture was not yet over!","The words 'pain, pain, pain' instantly spread to the ears of every practitioner through the 'Profound Sage's Lecture.' Simultaneously, the 'headache' buff that Song Shuhang had just obtained was equally distributed among all practitioners.","Every practitioner received the same 'headache' information, and it was shared impartially.","\"Aaah ~\" Like Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, most of the practitioners across the universe held their heads with both hands and screamed in pain.","Even the top-tier Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals couldn't resist pressing their temples and desperately rubbing them.","'What could Profound Sage Tyrannical Song have done to cause such intense pain?' pondered the top-tier experts of the myriad worlds.","There was a distinction between experts and newcomers.","The ordinary novice cultivators, after hearing the shared 'headache' from Song Shuhang, were in so much pain that they gave up thinking.","However, the top-tier experts sensed more information from this wave of headache.","That was the information hidden deep within Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's 'headache' state. It was... a rule that transcended the limits of the world!","For the top-tier experts, this rule that transcended the world had an indescribable allure, much like a starving gourmet encountering an irresistible delicacy.","They yearned to understand the rules hidden in the 'headache' state.","The top-tier experts displayed their abilities and used their own methods to analyze and dissect the 'headache' state layer by layer and seek the truth contained within it.","After peeling away the layers, a few top-tier experts finally came into contact with the rules in the 'headache' state. It was a rule wrapped in a 'QR code.'","However, because Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had only inadvertently revealed this 'headache' state through his 'Profound Sage's Lecture,' the information obtained by the top-tier experts was very incomplete.","The top-tier experts tried to study this 'QR code'-like thing, but the QR code was also very vague...","\"Isn't it time yet?\" whispered an Immortal skilled in divination.","This QR code had not yet reached the moment of 'manifestation,' so it was in a blurry state.","At the same time, there were truly top-tier experts who could vaguely guess the core 'rules' through the layer of the 'QR code' shell.","\"These rules are very likely related to 'Profound Sage Prominent Divinity, the condensation of the Sage Seal, and the lecture'... Was this the reason why Profound Sage Tyrannical Song kept showing his divinity and giving Profound Sage's Lectures? His goal was to come into contact with this rule that transcends the world!\"","Even the Scholarly Sage and the Heavenly Emperor wouldn't dare to do such a thing, right? Because if they dared to do so, they might be forced into an eternal sleep because they came into contact with rules that far exceeded their realm!","'Wait! Under normal circumstances, when a practitioner comes into contact with a 'rule' of this level, they would instantly suffer the greatest backlash. However, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song seized the opportunity. He stepped in at the moment the Heavenly Dao was destroyed and instantly came into contact with this rule. That's why he succeeded.' Similar thoughts quickly appeared in the minds of several top-tier experts.","Everyone had similar intelligence, clues, and information. Their horizons were also similar. It was only natural that they would come up with similar answers under such circumstances!","'As expected, this battle for immortality should start with 'Tyrannical Song' as the starting point!'","In other words, they wanted to eliminate Tyrannical Song before he became stronger!","The top-tier experts confirmed this thought again.","...","...","After more than ten minutes of the practitioners in the universe experiencing a headache, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, who was displaying his divinity in the void, finally concluded his Profound Sage's Lecture.","Feeling pain, understanding pain, accepting pain, adapting to pain... Finally, conquering pain!","Once again, Song Shuhang's 'immunity bank' had acquired a new pain-resistant factor.","One day, he would conquer all the pain in the universe. When that day came, there would be no pain that could make him suffer anymore.","\"Phew.\" Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","He began to assess the changes in his condition.","After the Profound Sage's Lecture ended, wave after wave of the 'power of virtue' began to gather from the myriad worlds. Although the pain was excruciating, after Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's lecture concluded, the practitioners from all worlds offered the 'power of virtue' they should have offered, silently converting it into Tyrannical Song's merit through the Profound Sage's Lecture.","In addition to the changes in his virtue, Song Shuhang's most significant gain was that he had come into contact with the rules of 'displaying divinity in front of people.'","He could sense that his 'cultivation chat' ability was absorbing the rules of 'displaying divinity' that he had come into contact with.","Furthermore, thanks to the 'headache' at the end of the lecture, Song Shuhang felt that he had become more approachable... This was a very wonderful change.","He felt like he had become closer to the world and the practitioners of the myriad worlds."]},{"number":2454,"title":"Chapter 2454 If Fate Permits, We’ll Meet Again in the Martial World!","paragraphs":["The 'Sage Monarch Tyrant's Prominent Divine Speech,' destined to be recorded in the annals of cultivation history, had finally concluded.","The scene of his divine appearance began to gradually fade.","Practitioners from myriad realms could only witness a visible surge of immense virtue descending upon Profound Sage Tyrannical Song—a profound and rich power of goodness!","This time, the virtue that Song Shuhang had acquired far surpassed his previous four experiences!","Perhaps it was due to the overwhelmingly awe-inspiring nature of this speech? Or perhaps, with the Heavenly Dao now absent, there was no intermediary influence on the virtue and resulted in its exceptional density this time?","Song Shuhang focused his thoughts and directed a substantial amount of virtue toward the virtuous lamia in hopes that she would take another step forward in her evolution. If she could ascend to the Ninth Stage Realm in one leap, it would greatly simplify his future Ninth Stage Realm heavenly tribulation.","Behind him, the virtuous lamia had already switched out of her 'Armed Fairy Empress' mode. Her small hands moved swiftly, collecting all the suspended 'white lotuses' from the air. Then, she discreetly consumed the white lotuses while covering her mouth with her sleeve.","The virtue continued to pour into the void and into her body, which she divided into three smaller portions and one larger one.","One portion was absorbed directly into her body.","Another portion was directed toward the virtuous fat whale, enhancing the mount's strength. The virtuous fat whale could now be considered a clone of Fairy @#%×.","A portion was directed to the Virtuous Lightning Tree, her weapon, which flickered with the power of the heavenly tribulation.","The largest portion of the virtue was guided into the faintly discernible 'network of virtue' behind her. This network of virtue was the most crucial element of her evolution and held great significance for Song Shuhang's future.","\"Thank you all for watching my final divine performance. Following this, I shall no longer grace this 'divine stage.' Fellow Daoists, if fate permits, let us reunite at the world's end!\" Song Shuhang respectfully bid farewell to the fellow Daoists of the universe before the 'divine stage' entirely dissipated.","If one were to ignore the ghost fairy holding a blanket for him, Song Shuhang's current appearance would be undeniably stunning.","The 'Sage Monarch Tyrant's' speech had concluded flawlessly!","...","...","Pa~","The scene of the divine spectacle dissipated.","Simultaneously, Song Shuhang found himself teleported out of the collapsed Heavenly Tribulation Realm of the Eighth Stage.","Without the Heavenly Dao taking the initiative to restore it, it remained uncertain when the collapsed Heavenly Tribulation Realm of the Eighth Stage would recover. It might even eventually crumble and vanish entirely.","In the boundless universe, Song Shuhang hastily retrieved a pair of shorts from his magical bracelet and put them on. He felt uncomfortable wearing shorts in front of the myriad worlds; it was cold and awkward.","After donning his pants, the ghost fairy swiftly merged back into his body and disappeared. She seemed oddly bashful.","'Aren't we essentially one entity? No need to be shy, right?' Song Shuhang thought with amusement.","He turned his attention to the virtuous lamia, eager to see the results of this massive infusion of virtue. If the virtuous lamia could ascend to the Ninth Stage Realm in one go, it would provide him with a significant advantage when facing the Ninth Stage Realm's heavenly tribulation in the future.","However, as he turned around, he saw the virtuous lamia silently spinning silk.","The formidable heavenly tribulation of virtue stood behind her and formed the framework for her cocoon-spinning process.","Song Shuhang was left dumbfounded.","Fairy @#%×, are you the successor of Spirit Butterfly Island?","The virtuous lamia silently shook her head in response to Song Shuhang's unspoken question, then continued to expertly weave her large cocoon.","'The virtuous lamia is sure to succeed this time!' Song Shuhang thought with delight.","Once the fairy had completed her evolution and reached the Ninth Stage Realm, Song Shuhang would possess another potent card to play when confronted by formidable adversaries.","\"Is the speech over?\" At that moment, Pavilion Master Chu, who was above them, sent a secret voice transmission.","\"It's concluded,\" Song Shuhang sighed and responded via voice transmission. \"To be honest, I've grown accustomed to the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation and the monthly divine spectacle. Now that it's all over, I can't help but feel a bit wistful.\"","Strangely, after delivering this speech, he felt an unusual sense of emptiness within, as though something was missing.","\"Nevertheless, this marks the end of my last speech, and I've shed a heavy burden from my heart,\" Song Shuhang added. This meant he wouldn't have to spend as much time composing the 'Profound Sage Speech' in the future.","\"No need to feel wistful. Moreover, it's still too early for you to release that heavy burden.\" Pavilion Master Chu's tone remained soft and gentle.","Song Shuhang shivered involuntarily. \"Senior Chu, can you speak normally?\"","He wasn't accustomed to this gentler tone.","\"Hehehe, Sage Monarch Tyrant Extermination, after completing your final speech, why don't you check your current realm?\" Pavilion Master Chu continued to transmit her voice in that soothing manner.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","My realm, my realm!","Darn it, now I understand why I feel empty after this speech!","My realm hasn't advanced!","In theory, when a Seventh Stage Venerable completed the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation, their realm should have ascended from the Seventh Stage to the Eighth Stage.","Yet, Song Shuhang had not experienced the typical realm-advancement process.","\"How could this be? I clearly concluded the Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation, manifested my divinity, and delivered a speech! Why hasn't my realm progressed?\" Song Shuhang appeared despondent.","\"Is it because I transcended the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm? Or maybe it's due to my predicament within the Heavenly Tribulation Bug when I underwent the Tribulation Transcendence Realm? Or could it be that the Heavenly Dao collapsed the moment I advanced?\"","Pavilion Master Chu's voice held a trace of playful amusement.","Performing a heart-piercing attack was a delicate task that required the cooperation of heaven, earth, location, and people. When these three elements were harmonized, a simple heart strike could yield a critical hit.","\"Do I have to undergo the heavenly tribulation again? Manifest my divinity once more?\" Song Shuhang lamented.","During his recent divine spectacle, he had declared, \"This will be my final manifestation of divinity. If fate permits, we shall meet again at the world's end.\"","If he transcended another tribulation and manifested his divinity once more, how could he deliver an opening speech?","\"Hello, dear audience, I've missed you all so much. Because of my intense longing, I've decided to manifest my divinity once more. This time, I assure you it will be my last speech.","\"Greetings, everyone, it's me, Tyrannical Song, once again. We haven't seen each other for a few days; I hope you're all well. The previous manifestation was meant to be the final one, but due to an operational error, the speech segment went awry. This time, I guarantee it's the last one! After this speech, we'll meet again in the martial world!\"","By then, who would believe that this was truly his last speech? His credibility would be in tatters.","\"I've found you~\" Just as Song Shuhang was wallowing in disappointment, a voice suddenly echoed in his ears. \"Excuse me, are you my main body?\"","This voice carried a mechanical quality.","\"Ah!\" Song Shuhang felt as though he had been shocked with electricity, and he let out a groundhog-like cry.","It was the fat ball!"]},{"number":2455,"title":"Chapter 2455 I Never Thought I’d Hide So Deeply, Yet You Still Figured It Out!","paragraphs":["The fat ball was always the adversary that Song Shuhang dreaded facing the most.","There was no other reason, but the main one was that the fat ball boss was the most formidable opponent Song Shuhang had ever confronted. It was the only one that had cornered him without an escape route.","So, every time he laid eyes on the fat ball, Song Shuhang's heart would race, and he would feel a sense of unease. This reaction had become instinctual by now.","At the same time, Song Shuhang swiftly activated a series of life-saving measures.","The Core World was activated!","Song Shuhang summoned the Massive Bone Fragments of Slow-Witted Song! The gigantic skeleton materialized behind Song Shuhang. Even though his lower body had already regenerated, when he invoked Slow-Witted Song's Massive Bone Fragments, he still crawled around with just the upper half of his body and his hands.","Next, the Combined Magical Treasure appeared and hovered beside Song Shuhang.","\"Virtuous Lamia, Armed Fairy Empress mode!\" Song Shuhang called out promptly.","However, the virtuous lamia did not respond.","\"Fairy @#%× is busy spinning a cocoon,\" Pavilion Master Chu reminded him.","The virtuous lamia had already spun a substantial cocoon and hung herself on the virtuous lightning tree. Until she completed her evolution, she was temporarily unable to assist Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang sighed.","On the opposite side, the fat ball transformed into a quiet sphere. It remained motionless, almost as if it were waiting for Song Shuhang to finish his transformation.","\"Why don't you summon the virtuous lamia's fat whale and combine it with Slow-Witted Song's Massive Bone Fragments?\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested.","Unfortunately, Song Shuhang couldn't manage that at the moment.","The virtuous fat whale wasn't a lamia, so it didn't possess as many abilities.","Hence, he had to settle for an alternative.","\"Beast God Equipment!\" Song Shuhang remained vigilant and, with a thought, applied one set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts' Combined Magical Treasure to the giant skeleton's body. The other set transformed into the 'Holy Sword of the End,' the giant skeleton's weapon.","The massive skeletal giant shielded Song Shuhang within its ribcage and provided him with a sense of security. Most importantly, his Core World remained open.","When the Core World opened, an energy connection formed between Pavilion Master Chu's main body and her hair. Simultaneously, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and Scarlet Heaven Sword appeared beside Song Shuhang.","Soft Feather and Su Clan's Sixteen appeared at the exit of the Core World.","\"Don't come out yet,\" Song Shuhang cautioned.","Su Clan's Sixteen and Soft Feather halted. However, the White Dragon swayed slightly and landed on Song Shuhang's shoulder.","\"Since the Core World has opened, shouldn't you return to it?\" Scarlet Heaven Sword inquired.","\"It's safer to open Shuhang's Core World at this moment,\" Scarlet Heaven Sword said cheerfully. \"If we encounter a crisis, the Core World will always be quicker than Song Shuhang.\"","Song Shuhang raised his hand and activated the Saber Nurturing Technique x10.","\"The fat ball on the opposite side seems a bit peculiar,\" Song Shuhang commented calmly.","When the virtuous lamia didn't cooperate earlier, the fat ball didn't seize the opportunity to attack. Instead, it remained quiet and waited for Song Shuhang to complete the Beast God Equipment.","Moreover, there was an issue with the fat ball's condition.","There seemed to be something amiss with it, as though it posed no threat.","\"Think about it calmly... The Heavenly Dao just collapsed, right? Logically, the corresponding ruler of the Netherworld should have dissipated as well,\" Song Shuhang reasoned through group voice transmission.","Furthermore, the fat ball before him was most likely an avatar created by the faint ball combining with the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball—a clone!","This clone had been chasing him relentlessly while even forcing him to hide in his Core World at one point.","If the Netherworld's fat ball had dissipated, there was no reason for this clone to persist!","...","...","Song Shuhang and the fat ball's clone remained motionless, locked in a standoff.","If the enemy didn't move, they wouldn't either.","\"Perhaps the ruler of the Nine Nether Sphere hasn't disappeared?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suggested via voice transmission. \"My master is still alive and kicking. Maybe the ruler of the Nine Nether Ball finally found a way to keep me here at the last moment?\"","\"I'll contact Senior White Two,\" Song Shuhang decided, calling out in his mind, \"Senior White Two, are you there?\"","After calling out, he suddenly recalled Senior White Two's advice from their previous encounter. Senior White Two had asked him not to shout \"Are you there?\" and instead leave a message if he had something to say to save time and energy.","So, Song Shuhang added, \"Has the main body of the Netherworld fat ball died?\"","A moment later...","\"Those who are going to die will still die,\" Senior White Two replied.","He sounded somewhat disappointed. After all, he had been a lifelong adversary, and his sudden demise might have left him feeling uneasy.","\"Senior White, are you certain that the Netherworld fat ball's true body is dead? Completely dead?\" Song Shuhang inquired further.","\"I witnessed it disappear with my own eyes... What did you do this time?\" Senior White Two, knowing Song Shuhang all too well, suspected that Song Shuhang had stirred up trouble again, likely involving the fat ball.","\"If the fat ball boss is truly deceased, is there a possibility that its 'clone' can still survive?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Did you encounter it?\" Senior White Two was taken aback.","\"Yes, it's standing opposite me right now. But something seems off with its condition,\" Song Shuhang responded.","Senior White Two asked once more, \"Has it started trash-talking?\"","\"He didn't. The fat ball boss seems harmless at the moment,\" Song Shuhang assured.","\"Did you take the wrong medicine?\" Senior White Two quipped. If Song Shuhang's opponent truly was the fat ball, then its head should have finally transformed from a liquid metal state into pure water.","\"I'll go to your location to take a look. Quietly open a passage to the Core World. I'll observe the fat ball from a distance,\" Senior White Two suggested.","Senior White Two had a different perspective than Song Shuhang. He was acutely aware of what his existence meant to the fat ball. To the fat ball, he, the Scholarly Sage, and Song Shuhang were unquestionably among the top five most despised individuals in the universe.","His ranking was most likely higher than that of Song Shuhang and the Scholarly Sage.","To avoid provoking the fat ball, he chose to have his projection clone remain concealed within Song Shuhang's Core World to observe the fat ball from a?distance.","...","...","Song Shuhang and the fat ball still faced each other, neither moving.","Senior White Two's projection clone approached Su Clan's Sixteen and Soft Feather cautiously. He raised a finger to his lips. Be silent.","Then, he glanced at the fat ball from a distance.","Its liquid metal appearance and its aura confirmed that it was indeed the fat ball.","\"Shuhang, try to engage in a conversation with it,\" Senior White Two spoke up.","With Senior White Two backing him up, Song Shuhang mustered his courage.","He recalled the fat ball's lines when it first appeared. \"Are you my main body?\"","With a serious expression, Song Shuhang responded, \"I never thought I'd hide so deeply, yet you still figured it out!\""]},{"number":2456,"title":"Chapter 2456 Tyrannical Song, Let’s Begin the Prelude to the ’Battle for the Heavenly Dao’!","paragraphs":["On the other side, the imposing fat ball finally reacted after hearing Song Shuhang's response. Its spherical body rolled, and an eye appeared on its surface as it fixed its gaze on Song Shuhang. It was awaiting Song Shuhang's next words.","\"That's right, just as you suspected.\" Song Shuhang maintained a serious expression and said in a deep voice, \"I am indeed your true self!\"","Pulling off a feigned death act was a delicate art. It required not only controlling the depth of deception but also having substantial capital for it.","Song Shuhang's skills weren't quite mature yet, and he couldn't compare to the seniors like Thrice Reckless and Copper Trigram in the group. However, with so many heavyweights around him and Senior White Two's projected clone backing him up, he had plenty of leverage.","Even if he accidentally triggered the fat ball's suspicions, Senior White Two would support him from behind. Furthermore, he had the pendant on him and a special card prepared just to deal with the fat ball.","Failure seemed impossible, no matter how you looked at it!","Pavilion Master Chu was left dumbfounded.","Sword was confused.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","Senior White Two's projected clone clicked his tongue in amazement.","He had never anticipated that Song Shuhang would respond to the fat ball like this and essentially liken himself to the Heavenly Dao!","On the other side, the fat ball rolled its eye and stared fixedly at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang calmly met the fat ball's gaze.","Four pairs of eyes met—Song Shuhang had three, and the fat ball had one.","After a while.","\"But why aren't you spherical, true self?\" the fat ball asked while voicing its inner curiosity.","After seeing Song Shuhang, it was certain that he was the person it had been seeking all along! However, if he was indeed its true self, why wasn't he in a spherical form?","\"Because the human form is just one of my hundreds of forms,\" Song Shuhang replied with a straight face.","The fat ball remained silent, its single eye fixed on Song Shuhang. Its intent was clear—it wanted to see Song Shuhang's spherical appearance.","Pavilion Master Chu sent a group message, \"So, Shuhang, why don't you transform into a ball?\"","\"Therefore, Shuhang, you are indeed the true self of a ball,\" the sword chimed in.","\"It's not difficult to transform into a ball... I have the pseudo-undying mode. After turning into a cloud of smoke, I can even transform into a hexagon, let alone a ball,\" Song Shuhang calmly responded.","This level of pain was like a gentle breeze brushing against his face. It neither hurt nor itched.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, \"Then why don't you give it a try and transform into one?\"","\"Wait, let me prepare some divine power first,\" Song Shuhang secretly began to prepare the World Refining Holy Ape Technique.","If the fat ball's clone was truly fooled by him and believed he was the true self... he might be able to transfer the fat ball's clone into the 'artificial small world' and let the unknown Senior White 1-33 seal it.","That seal had originally been a trump card Song Shuhang had prepared to deal with the fat ball's clone.","This was the choice Song Shuhang made after careful consideration.","After secretly preparing the World Refining Holy Ape Technique, Song Shuhang opened his eyes and said to the fat ball, \"Watch carefully!\"","In the next moment, his body turned into pseudo-undying smoke mode. Under his control, his body condensed into a round Song ball.","On the other side, the fat ball's single eye blinked gently and said happily, \"You're indeed my true self!\"","Then, deep inside the body of the fat ball's clone, a necrotic kidney appeared and floated faintly. The rotten kidney emitted the aura of a 'pseudo-undying' cultivator, the same source as Song Shuhang's smoke mode!","With this 'same origin' necrotic kidney as evidence, the fat ball's boss's guess was confirmed—Sage Monarch Tyrant Song was indeed its true self!","\"What is that?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked in puzzlement.","\"Whose?\" the sword inquired.","\"Mine,\" Song Shuhang said sadly.","Pavilion Master Chu was left dumbfounded.","\"Shuhang, is this rotten kidney of yours the reason why the fat ball can continue to exist in this world?\" Su Clan's Sixteen whispered from the exit of the Inner World, with Soft Feather quietly peeking out alongside her.","\"My kidney doesn't have such a powerful function. I'll trick the fat ball boss over later and see if I can send him a secret appraisal technique to test its strength,\" Song Shuhang said.","Senior White Two said, \"Are you planning something big again? Also, be cautious when transmitting your voices. If it weren't for me protecting you, your voices might have been overheard by the fat ball. It's best to set a password when using group voice transmission. Moreover, Shuhang, you should upgrade your cultivation chat function. Create a 'temporary group chat' function to prevent the possibility of private messages being leaked.\"","\"The cultivation chat function has been upgrading, but it's not progressing that quickly. Also, this is a rare opportunity. I want to see if I can trick the fat ball into coming over and arrange for it to be placed in the unknown White 1-33 seal in the artificial world. That was originally the little nest I prepared for the fat ball boss,\" Song Shuhang said.","\"Alright!\" At that moment, the fat ball's clone suddenly said, \"True self, shall we merge?\"","Since he had finally found his true self, he naturally had to fuse with him.","\"Let's merge!\" Song Shuhang's body of smoke spread its arms—the World Refining Holy Ape Technique was secretly prepared.","He had originally thought of how to entice the fat ball's boss, but he did not expect the other party to be so cooperative and take the initiative to come to him. He did not even need to think of an excuse.","This was fate!","Come, throw yourself into my arms, and let me send you into the middle of Unknown White 1-33, enjoying the treatment that Senior White Crane dreamed of!","The fat ball's clone began to spin. It was as pure as a child and wanted to throw itself into the embrace of its true self.","But at that moment...","A loud voice echoed from the depths of the universe.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I know you're near the main world's solar system. You'll definitely hear my voice... I'll be waiting for you on Mars. Let's begin the battle for the Heavenly Dao!\"","This voice enveloped the solar system region. All the cultivators in this region could hear it. To achieve this, he must be a significant figure!","The fat ball's clone paused.","Then, it said angrily, \"You're just a rat who doesn't even dare to say your name. How dare you provoke the main body? Main body, allow me to go to Mars to fight and take him down! I will be the vanguard of this battle for the Heavenly Dao.\"","If he couldn't even defeat it, he wouldn't be qualified to challenge its main body!","Having said that, the fat ball moved its body and opened the space door to escape to Mars. The space authority it had lost in the bet had been restored.","Senior White Two was left speechless."]},{"number":2457,"title":"Chapter 2457 Sneaking Away~","paragraphs":["Among those present, Senior White Two was feeling the most conflicted at this moment. He had a lot on his mind, but all those thoughts seemed to be stuck in his throat.","It was very frustrating.","The fat ball, even though it was just a secondary account, left Senior White Two wondering how to assess it in this situation.","\"This is karma,\" suddenly remarked Song Shuhang.","\"Karma?\"","Song Shuhang sighed and said, \"If it weren't for the fat ball boss taking my rotten kidney back then...\"","\"You wouldn't have a brand new rainbow kidney now,\" quickly interjected the sword.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","To be honest, Song Shuhang's constant feeling of being targeted by the blasted sword was starting to get on his nerves. He wasn't sympathizing with himself; he felt sorry for Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Song Shuhang quickly performed the Saber Nurturing Technique twenty times with a flick of his finger.","The sword emitted a faint hum in response.","Behind them, Senior White Two chuckled and commented, \"Cause and effect, it makes sense.\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet mused, \"I wonder how much combat prowess is left in the fat ball boss. Will the formidable figure who's about to initiate the prelude to the battle for the Heavenly Dao be able to contend with it in this onslaught?\"","Assuming nothing unexpected occurred, the prelude to the battle for the Heavenly Dao would still commence on Mars, albeit with a last-minute change in contestants.","\"Incidentally, Senior Song, Sixteen, Senior White... should we venture to Mars to witness the prelude to the Battle of the Heavenly Dao?\" Soft Feather's eyes gleamed with excitement, eager to move. The first battle for immortality was an epochal event she yearned to witness.","\"I'd like to attend as well... Yet, my better judgment suggests caution is warranted at this juncture, prompting me to exit first,\" Song Shuhang mused while stroking his chin.","Despite having deceived the fat ball boss, the fact remained: an unsealed fat ball boss was far from ideal. There was no certainty when it would regain its memories. Who's to say it wouldn't suddenly recall them and retaliate against Song Shuhang?","Hence, while the fat ball's clone was absent, seizing the opportunity to depart the 'speech site' for Earth was prudent. Song Shuhang intended to don the mask gifted by Su Clan's Sixteen to shroud his celestial secrets and thwart divination attempts to locate him.","\"If Shuhang doesn't wish to go, who's interested in attending? I can discreetly lead a team there,\" Senior White Two offered.","He held a keen interest in the remaining clone of the fat ball. Song Shuhang's decaying pseudo-immortal kidney wouldn't suffice for the fat ball clone to endure the annihilation of the Heavenly Dao. It surely concealed other secrets or opportunities Senior White Two coveted.","Moreover, he contemplated relocating his 'basic disk' from the Netherworld Realm. Remaining in the world of the black lotus posed risks.","When the fat ball reigned supreme in the Netherworld Realm, Senior White assigned Senior White Two to stay in the Netherworld Realm and share the authority with the fat ball. However, when the next Wielder of the Will advanced and the subsequent ruler of the Netherworld emerged, Senior White Two couldn't guarantee his survival.","Even if Song Shuhang or an item on his person became the next Wielder of the Will and bore an emotional connection with him, there was no assurance the next Netherworld ruler wouldn't forcibly oust him and cause him to vanish.","\"Count me in,\" Soft Feather chirped enthusiastically.","\"I'd like to witness it as well,\" Su Clan's Sixteen concurred after thoughtful consideration.","\"Very well, then let's go,\" Senior White Two said while suppressing the Netherworld ruler's pressure via his projected clone before vanishing into the void with Soft Feather and Su Clan's Sixteen.","\"Wait, Senior White, I'd also like to...\" Song Shuhang hastily extended his hand but found himself alone as Senior White, Soft Feather, and Su Clan's Sixteen had already disappeared.","Song Shuhang let out a long sigh.","\"Would you like me to broadcast it for you?\" the White Dragon in her compact form asked. She and Su Clan's Sixteen could share their perceptions, enabling her to relay everything Su Clan's Sixteen witnessed. This was analogous to Song Shuhang's ability to transmit via the virtuous lamia.","If Song Shuhang so wished, she could also record Su Clan's Sixteen's viewpoint at specific times and clandestinely deliver it through the background.","\"Let's return to the Inner World first,\" Song Shuhang decided. He removed the mask from his face and transferred it to his hand.","He lightly placed the mask on, and the effects of this divine artifact cloaked both his physical form and primordial spirit.","The mask proved invaluable. It preserved Song Shuhang's secrets and obscured his facial expressions.","In the Inner World, along the periphery of the living spring, upon witnessing Song Shuhang's return, Lady Onion promptly reverted to her onion form and inserted the enlightenment stone into Senior Turtle's shell.","Lady Onion rarely revealed her human form in Song Shuhang's presence to forestall any romantic inclinations he might develop.","\"Hello, Sister Golden Dragon, you're back,\" Pavilion Master Chu greeted the White Dragon on Song Shuhang's shoulder, her countenance radiant.","The White Dragon was at a loss for words as she interpreted Pavilion Master Chu's words as an eternal sisterhood pledge.","\"Shuhang, Sixteen may need to enter seclusion for a while. Your Inner World boasts an abundance of spiritual energy. It is an ideal place for her to seclude herself. Can you designate a suitable location within the Inner World for her isolation?\" the White Dragon requested.","Furthermore, Su Clan's Sixteen had a matter to discuss with Song Shuhang. Originally, she had intended to broach it during the Su Clan's annual gathering, but Song Shuhang's sudden relocation to the Heavenly Tribulation Realm disrupted her plans.","\"No problem,\" Song Shuhang consented.","\"Hehehe,\" the White Dragon turned to Pavilion Master Chu. \"Fairy Chu, let's engage in a profound conversation for the time being.\"","\"You're most welcome,\" Pavilion Master Chu responded with an enchanting smile.","Song Shuhang sighed inwardly while slipping away with all his accessories. Suddenly, he recalled Su Clan's Sixteen had a 'Sage Sealed Wooden Saber' used for coordinates!","He adjusted his mask and donned the magical treasure crafted by Senior White Two to conceal his 'Sage Number.'","Having made the necessary preparations, Song Shuhang stealthily opened a small gateway to the Inner World.","In the next instant, his head emerged from Su Clan's Sixteen's chest.","Soft Feather playfully winked at him from the side."]},{"number":2458,"title":"Chapter 2458 The Man of Five Consecutive Triumphs!","paragraphs":["Su Clan's Sixteen lowered her head and gazed at Song Shuhang, who had emerged from her chest—this scene brought back memories of not long ago when Song Shuhang had only a head left, and at that time, she had cradled his head in her arms.","\"Senior Song, your appearance is quite unexpected,\" Soft Feather conveyed through mental communication.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He hadn't expected to make an entrance in this manner—last time, he had entrusted the 'Sacred Seal Wooden Saber' to Sixteen. It was a masterpiece crafted after numerous experiments that could transform into a small pendant. It seemed likely that Su Clan's Sixteen was wearing it around her neck now.","He couldn't help but wonder if the White Dragon would find this 'Sage Seal Wooden Saber' uncomfortable against her dragon body. After all, she had grown accustomed to wrapping a scarf around Sixteen's neck in hopes of keeping her healthy.","On the side, Senior White Two inquired via voice transmission, \"Didn't you say you wouldn't join us?\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet hastily responded on Song Shuhang's behalf, \"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song is a human who doesn't always follow through on his words. He says 'no, no,' but his body is very honest.\"","Song Shuhang was speechless.","It hadn't been easy for him to snatch the 'Confucian Classics' that Fairy Creation had left behind in search of the Sage. Furthermore, the virtuous lamia had fallen into a state of evolution. He hadn't expected that he still wouldn't have a chance to deliver his lines.","Senior White Two looked at Song Shuhang and remarked, \"Since when did you develop such a troublesome attribute?\"","Song Shuhang shook his head and replied, \"It's nothing. It's just that... sometimes, I tend to be a little pretentious.\"","Senior White Two had no answer for that.","Su Clan's Sixteen quickly stretched out her hand and held Song Shuhang's swaying head, preventing him from moving. \"Since you're here, let's watch together. The show is about to begin.\"","The White Dragon took this opportunity to exit her Inner World and return to Su Clan's Sixteen's side.","Song Shuhang tried to push his entire body out of the Inner World, but Sixteen had a firm grip on his head. Consequently, he went along with it and maintained his current position.","With only his head exposed, Song Shuhang opened the divine third eye on his forehead and quietly observed his surroundings to watch the battle unfold smoothly.","At this moment, everyone was concealed in a corner of Mars, shielded by Senior White Two's magical treasure.","The main character of this Prologue to the Battle of the Heavenly Dao was several kilometers away.","A formation comprised of celestial light had created a pristine sanctuary on Mars.","Within this aura of immortality, a man adorned with a golden hoop and dressed in green attire sat gracefully on the ground while playing the zither.","Behind the Golden Hoop Immortal, a magnificent Great Dao Light Wheel faintly shimmered.","Besides providing background music, it exuded an otherworldly presence.","\"Who is this Immortal?\" Song Shuhang inquired curiously.","Senior White Two responded in an ancient tone, \"I do not know him. He is an Immortal I have not encountered in my recollections... either an ancient recluse who did not engage in Heavenly Dao battles during my time or a newcomer who appeared after the era of the fat ball following my own. The latter seems more plausible. After all, I have participated in two Heavenly Dao battles, and even if I didn't personally face every Immortal, I would have heard of them in my era.\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chimed in proudly, \"My Lord is truly formidable.\"","Pavilion Master Chu added, \"Based on the appearance of the Great Dao Light Wheel, it appears to be a path to immortality similar to the 'soul'.\"","Song Shuhang gazed at the 'Wheel of Eternal Life' for an extended period, yet he couldn't discern any traces of the 'Dao of the Soul.'","Buzz~","At this point, the Golden Hoop Immortal waved his right hand across the zither.","The sound of the zither reverberated melodiously.","Subsequently, an abundance of grass materialized out of thin air around the Golden Hoop Immortal, taking root and sprouting on the surface of Mars as if in a dream.","\"That's quite impressive,\" Song Shuhang remarked enviously. \"Senior Pavilion Master Chu, I recall you mentioned that you only know how to play the zither?\"","Pavilion Master Chu responded, \"Forget about it. Your style doesn't match playing the zither. Moreover... with your limited time and rapid progress, it might be wiser to dedicate some time to mastering the ancient language first. Although being handsome is a lifelong attribute, if you don't first master the ancient language, you might not have the opportunity to be handsome in the future.\"","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Although he had a great presence during the Proclamation of Divinity, he had deliberately restrained his majestic aura, so as not to intimidate the practitioners from across the universe.","The fat ball boss had originally chosen not to attend, but it had ultimately decided to join the gathering.","As the Immortal Golden-Hooped Immortal resumed playing the zither, his brows furrowed in contemplation.","He had anticipated that with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's arrogance, even if he didn't engage directly in combat, he would at least make arrangements for the battle. However, Tyrannical Song's true form had been mistaken for a mere spectator.","Was Tyrannical Song's true form truly that of a fat ball?","\"Good song, good zither!\" the fat ball said in the form of Song Shuhang. It applauded lightly. He descended from the void step by step, his entire being exuding an imposing aura that seemed to dominate the world.","Even the Immortals below were influenced by this aura.","Such a commanding presence. Is this the real Tyrannical Song? The Golden Hoop Immortal marveled internally.","Truly, a man with five sage names beginning with 'tyrant' lived up to his reputation!","The Golden Hoop Immortal was brimming with fighting spirit!"]},{"number":2459,"title":"Chapter 2459 The Power of Rules Beyond Immortality!","paragraphs":["The imposing presence of the fat ball transformed into Song Shuhang not only affected the Golden-Hooped Immortal, but also drew the attention of many hidden spectators. Apart from Song Shuhang and his companions, numerous immortal dignitaries and top-tier tribulation transcenders who had reached the embryonic stage of their own Great Dao were observing from various realms and dimensions as they focused their gaze on Mars. They watched the destined battle that would shape the future of the \"Immortality-Prologue Battle.\"","To avoid getting entangled in or disrupting the \"Tyrannical Song vs. Golden-Hooped Immortal\" battle, these immortal dignitaries and embryonic Dao practitioners maintained a cautious distance from Mars.","Only Senior White Two, the ruler of the Netherworld, dared to bring Song Shuhang and his group directly to Mars to witness the battle up close.","\"Speaking of which, this liquid metal version of me looks really cool,\" Song Shuhang exclaimed.","As the fat ball, every step he took seemed to be placed on nodes of his aura. Each step increased his presence and imposed psychological pressure on his adversaries.","\"Snap out of it; this isn't you,\" Sister White Dragon reminded him.","\"Don't be envious, Senior Song. Someday in the future, you'll be as powerful as the fat ball before you,\" Feather said in consolation.","\"Besides, it might not be too far in the future. Maybe next month? Or the month after that?\" Pavilion Master Chu thought to herself, but she refrained from voicing it out due to sheer laziness.","...","...","On the opposite battlefield, the fat ball, now in the form of Song Shuhang, finally set foot on solid ground.","The formidable force field surrounding him effortlessly enveloped the formation space set up by the Golden-Hooped Immortal.","\"Your zither playing is quite skillful,\" the fat ball remarked calmly. It was followed by an in-depth commentary on the topic of musical harmony, profound and intricate.","\"I didn't expect Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song to have such profound knowledge of musical theory. I'm genuinely impressed.\" the Golden-Hooped Immortal laughed heartily. Tyrannical Song's knowledge was as vast as the starry sky itself!","The Golden Hooped Immortal remembered Tyrannical Song's fourth lecture, where he addressed online queries. Regardless of the cultivation system or issue at hand, a sincere inquiry to him invariably yielded a satisfying response!","With thousands of diverse cultivation systems existing throughout the universe, Tyrannical Song's ability to dabble in all of them was truly awe-inspiring.","And now, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song exhibited impressive musical proficiency. It was as if there was nothing in the world beyond his grasp—even the condition of pregnancy couldn't hold him back!","The fat ball, taking on Song Shuhang's form, placed his hands behind his back and commented, \"Initially, I thought you were an uncouth individual who lacked manners and even refrained from introducing yourself. It appears that you're not as ill-mannered as I initially presumed.\"","\"Ah?\" The Golden-Hooped Immortal paused momentarily before bursting into hearty laughter. \"I suppose I didn't think that through.\"","He then stood up and stored away his zither, extending a courteous greeting to the fat ball. \"I am Scholar Little Grass, Yue Ruhuo.\"","Immortal Yue Ruhuo—his daoist name was akin to the halo behind him and resembled a burning moon.","The fat ball nodded approvingly and offered his own daoist name in return.","Meanwhile, a bemused Senior White Two watched from a distance, unsure of how to react.","As the introductory exchange concluded, the fat ball and Immortal Yue Ruhuo officially commenced their Heavenly Dao Battle.","There was no room for needless banter.","The fat ball was the first to initiate an attack. It was a manifestation of the combat instincts he had honed through millennia of sparring with White. Even with the loss of his memories, those instincts remained deeply ingrained.","Ball Shuhang activated his left eye and unleashed a radiant beam.","\"Impregnating Gaze!\" Many of the universe's prominent figures who had been silently observing the battle felt a sharp pang in their stomachs. These were veterans who had once contended with Scholarly Sage.","\"In the past, 'Tyrannical Song' had yet to fully master his own Dao, and due to limitations in his realm, the Impregnating Gaze had no effect on us. But now, he has transcended his path and joined the ranks of Immortals. In this case, we must remain cautious of the Impregnating Gaze!\" This thought simultaneously crossed the minds of countless luminaries.","It appeared that they might not be immune to Tyrannical Song's Impregnating Gaze at this moment.","\"Behold the Holy Beast Martial Soul!\" Scholar Yue Ruhuo was evidently prepared for the attack. The instant 'Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's' left eye illuminated, he swiftly enacted a corresponding mystical technique.","Beside Scholar Yue Ruhuo appeared a colossal Holy Turtle Martial Soul.","Having dared to be the first to challenge Tyrannical Song, Yue Ruhuo had meticulously studied his adversary's background. In particular, he had thoroughly researched Tyrannical Song's signature technique, the Impregnating Gaze—a powerful move that warranted vigilance.","The Holy Turtle Martial Soul summoned by Yue Ruhuo possessed the attributes of a black hole, capable of distorting and consuming even light.","Furthermore, the Holy Turtle Martial Soul was not a passive entity. It could withstand the effects of the Impregnating Gaze and enter a state of pregnancy. However, pregnancy was not a disadvantage for the Holy Turtle Martial Soul. While in this pregnant state, it could activate its secondary function—laying eggs. Each of these turtle eggs harbored a potent offensive divine art and exuded extraordinary power.","This 'Sacred Beast Martial Soul' was a technique meticulously crafted by Scholar Yue Ruhuo after gaining a profound understanding of his opponent.","Not only could it neutralize the opponent's attack, but it could also harness the adversary's attack attributes and turn them against him.","This 'Martial Soul' was a countermeasure Scholar Yue Ruhuo had devised specifically to confront Tyrannical Song's abilities.","The confrontation unfolded as anticipated. Ball Shuhang unleashed a powerful beam that broke through the Immortal's defenses. However, the expected 'pregnancy effect' failed to materialize.","Instead, the Holy Turtle Martial Soul's shell and body were torn asunder that led to a massive explosion that consumed both the Holy Turtle Martial Soul and Scholar Yue Ruhuo.","\"What kind of attack is this?\" The prominent figures witnessing the battle were left bewildered.","This was because they could sense that the laws imbued within Tyrannical Song's 'eye technique' surpassed the realm of both Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals.","\"Could this be the fruit of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's last divinity manifestation and Dao verification during the dissolution of the Heavenly Dao?\" At that moment, Tyrannical Song had come into contact with laws that?transcended even those of Immortals!"]},{"number":2460,"title":"Chapter 2460 The Man Who Opens the Gateway to a New World","paragraphs":["It's believed that before long, news of \"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song having a powerful eye technique besides the 'Impregnating Gaze'\" would spread within the circle of big shots across the myriad of realms.","White Dragon smiled faintly. \"In the future, when facing 'Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,' the powerful beings of the myriad realms will have a headache. Every time Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's left eye lights up, these formidable individuals will have to make a split-second decision whether it's the 'Impregnating Gaze' or a 'powerful offensive eye technique.' If they make a wrong judgment, the consequences will be unimaginable.\"","As she spoke, White Dragon extended her small claw and very 'naturally' began to stroke Song Shuhang's head. As her small claw stroked his head, White Dragon's claw naturally touched Pavilion Master Chu's hair.","\"You, get away! Don't touch me!\" Pavilion Master Chu's hair lashed out at White Dragon's small claw.","Although White Dragon winced in pain after being swatted, she was still delighted: \"I'm patting Song Shuhang, what's it to you?\"","As a result, a terrifying 'battle of the immortals' unfolded on Song Shuhang's head between White Dragon's small claw and Pavilion Master Chu's hair.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He felt a chill on top of his head, and black hair kept falling from it. If this continued, he'd turn bald.","Learning the 'hair-growing technique' from Senior Dharma King Creation was undeniably one of the best choices in his life.","...","...","Meanwhile, in the forcefield space where the fat ball and Scholar Yue Ruhuo were battling, the fat ball stood still, silently waiting after landing at attack.","A blue vortex appeared in the area where the 'Heavenly Eye' attack had caused the explosion, barely managing to absorb the aftermath of the explosion.","The smoke dissipated.","Scholar Yue Ruhuo, on the other hand, was in a sorry state within the huge crater. If the fat ball hadn't given him time to recuperate and had continued to unleash a few more 'Heavenly Eye Opening' shots at him, he might have been forced to retreat prematurely.","Across from him, the fat ball, in the form of Song Shuhang, crossed his arms and exuded a regal air. \"Have you recovered?\"","Scholar Yue Ruhuo kept his gaze fixed on the fat ball and said, \"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song... are you trying to intimidate the other fellow daoists through this opportunity?\"","After a moment's thought, he tried guessing why Tyrannical Song hadn't pressed his advantage—Tyrannical Song likely wanted to showcase his strength and prowess to the fellow daoists of the universe through this battle.","\"Only true peerless experts have the right to challenge me,\" declared Ball Shuhang. \"So, I'm going to let everyone across the universe witness my combat prowess. If you lack confidence, don't approach and waste my time.\"","Scholar Yue Ruhuo wasn't offended. He smiled and replied, \"Indeed, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, so that's your intention.\"","In fact, he had decided to be the first to challenge Tyrannical Song and kickstart the battle of immortals, all in an effort to showcase his own strength and prowess to the fellow daoists of the myriad worlds.","While he had misjudged the previous attack and was at a disadvantage, it didn't mean his prowess was lacking.","Next, he would unleash his true power and techniques. \"Very well, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, the warm-up is over!\"","The Martial Souls of saint beasts manifested beside Scholar Yue Ruhuo and merged into his body. A green soul fire appeared around him.","His Dao was the Dao of Martial Souls!","Each martial soul that appeared beside him had an extraordinary origin. These Martial Souls were all at least as powerful as top-tier Tribulation Transcenders, and the five most precious Holy Beast Martial Souls possessed the might of immortals, each with their unique talents.","After their fusion with him, he alone equaled several Immortals in power.","In terms of pure combat strength, his Martial Soul Dao was naturally much more potent than the ordinary 'Great Dao of Immortals.'","\"Interesting, but... this level of immortality falls far short of dealing with me, Tyrannical Song!\" the Ball Shuhang declared with crossed arms.","\"No, no, no. This terrifying six-in-one Immortal Dao is more than enough to trounce me,\" Song Shuhang privately admitted while feeling somewhat terrified.","In the forcefield space, the fat ball slightly raised his head.","Behind him, a pitch-black, despairing, and terrifying passage opened up.","Dark energy, as black as oil, surged from the passage and enveloped the fat ball boss.","Under the fat ball's will, this malevolent energy from the Netherworld merged into its body, taking on the form of a fearsome war fortress that materialized behind it!","Thousands of cannon barrels extended out from the war fortress, all locking onto Scholar Yue Ruhuo.","\"The Netherworld passage and the Netherworld energy?\" The spectators who had been secretly observing the battle were stunned.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song could actually manipulate the malevolent energy from the Netherworld!","The malevolent energy of the Netherworld and the spiritual energy of cultivators in the mortal realm were two entirely opposing forces. If mortal realm cultivators came into contact with the malevolent energy from the Netherworld and cultivated it, they would degenerate into Netherworld demons.","Spiritual energy and Netherworld energy could not coexist.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had previously employed his spiritual energy multiple times during his Prominent Divinity Speech. Given the power of virtue behind Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, it should have been impossible for him to coexist with the malevolent energy from the Netherworld!","\"Wait a minute, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's second 'Sage Name' is Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar!\" Someone suddenly remembered this Sage Name.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's second Prominent Divinity Speech had not only brought the compassion of 'maternal love' to the myriad of worlds but had simultaneously demonstrated divinity in the Netherworld Realm and the mortal realm while shedding the moniker of Demon Sage Tyrannical Scholar.","\"Could it be that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has overcome the issue of spiritual energy, power of virtue, and the malevolent energy from the Netherworld being incompatible? He can control spiritual energy and use the malevolent energy from the Netherworld?\"","The more they understood Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, the more they realized how unfathomable he was!","From the current situation, it was clear that Tyrannical Song was an entity that could be compared to the Scholarly Sage and the ancient Heavenly City's Celestial Thearch.","\"By the way, can the fat ball's clone also harness the malevolent energy from?the Netherworld? Is it still the Lord of the Netherworld?\" Song Shuhang curiously asked.","Senior White Two shook his head. \"To answer that question, we'll need to capture the fat ball's clone and examine it.\"","\"Knowledge is power!\" Ball Shuhang stretched out his hand, raised his index finger, and waved it gently.","In the next moment, countless cannons and pitch-black beams of light bombarded Scholar Yue Ruhuo.","\"Malevolent energy from the Netherworld?\" Scholar Yue Ruhuo remained unfazed.","A holy beast martial soul materialized behind him—a Radiant Kylin.","The Kylin's radiance possessed the power to suppress evil and dispel darkness which made it effective against the malevolent energy from the Netherworld.","The two sides clashed once again.","Dark energy cannons and the Radiant Kylin's power collided.","Powers at the Immortal level clashed, exploded, flashed, and were annihilated...","Both sides were flexing their formidable muscles to the world.","In reality, this was a unique bodybuilding competition.","Under Senior White Two's protection, Su Clan's Sixteen, Soft Feather, and Lady Onion watched with great interest.","However, Song Shuhang was different from before and fell into silence. It wasn't because of the battle between the White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu, but because he sensed a hidden change in the battle.","\"Senior White, is there something changing around the fat ball?\" Song Shuhang looked at Senior White Two.","\"Yes.\" Senior White Two nodded and said, \"When it attracted the malevolent energy from the Netherworld, some mechanism in the world was triggered.\"","It felt like a pre-set program that was activated when the fat ball drew the malevolent energy from the Netherworld into its body.","\"Did the stars in the sky become brighter?\" The sword said from the side.","\"Uh? Is the distance between us and the fat ball increasing?\" Soft Feather asked in puzzlement.","The world... It seemed to have started to change.","The key to this change was the moment when the fat ball opened the 'Netherworld Passage'!"]},{"number":2461,"title":"Chapter 2461 The Sole Wealth I Can Preserve","paragraphs":["The fat ball's action of connecting to the Netherworld Realm was like a signal that activated a pre-established program.","The stars in the sky became clear and bright... as though they were continuously delivering 'Star Power' to the world.","The world of Mars appeared to be expanding. For example, the distance between the fat ball boss and Scholar Yue Ruhuo, and the rest of the people, was subtly increasing.","\"Is Mars finally starting to expand?\" Soft Feather's eyes lit up.","Senior White Two extended his finger and gently poked the ground while shaking his head. \"The celestial body itself isn't expanding... but the space is expanding in a peculiar way.\"","Subsequently, Senior White Two used a wealth of professional cultivation knowledge and spatial expertise to explain the principle behind the 'expansion' of Mars's internal space.","After a brief while, Song Shuhang whispered, \"Um... Senior White, could you summarize the principle you just explained in a way that I can understand?\"","Senior White Two appeared momentarily speechless.","\"Knowledge is power,\" chimed in the sword. It seized the opportunity to say, \"Shuhang, you should strive to learn every day. If you don't study, you won't be able to engage in our discussions in the future, and you won't even understand what we're talking about.\"","Lady Onion added, \"Study hard, rise early.\"","Song Shuhang sighed and said, \"I do want to study diligently, but my cultivation has been advancing so rapidly, and it's leaving me feeling overwhelmed.\"","The sword was at a loss for words.","\"In simpler terms, think of it as the effect of a Universal Space magic artifact. The external size of Mars appears unchanged, but its internal space has transformed into a Universal World, and the space is expanding,\" Senior White Two eventually explained and made it more accessible for Song Shuhang to comprehend.","\"Senior White, you always come through. Now that you've put it that way, I can easily grasp it,\" Song Shuhang nodded. He realized that he needed to apply himself diligently to understand these profound concepts. After all, knowledge was the only form of wealth he could store. Material wealth might come and go, but the knowledge he gained would always remain.","\"Furthermore... the spiritual energy on Mars is increasing rapidly,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet added. This surge in spiritual energy drew out the latent energy within the Martian ley lines, gradually forming the embryonic structure of a spirit vein. With a few more centuries, a genuine spirit vein would develop.","Several sprouts suddenly emerged from the soil near Song Shuhang and the others.","These weren't the illusory green grass conjured by Scholar Yue Ruhuo's zither-playing. These were real, living plants!","The life force emanating from these sprouts was genuine.","Nourished by the Heavenly and Earthly Spiritual Qi, these sprouts grew at a remarkable pace. Some of them transformed into towering trees in a short time, while others rapidly bloomed, bore fruit, and produced seeds.","The wind carried these newly formed seeds far and wide, scattering them to different parts of the world where they would grow anew.","\"Could this be the Spiritual Power Tide?\" Song Shuhang wondered.","A few months ago, he had heard senior members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group discussing the upcoming golden age of cultivation. They had predicted the arrival of a spiritual energy tide, which would usher in a surge in spiritual energy across the world.","Pavilion Master Chu responded thoughtfully, \"The full onset of the spiritual energy tide should still take some time... This sudden influx of spiritual energy feels more like a long-prepared volcanic eruption.\"","Song Shuhang gazed at the fat ball still engaged in battle and mused, \"Could this be a method left behind by the Wielder of the Will?\"","In any case, the changes on Mars were undoubtedly linked to the fat ball.","The observers, who had been watching from a distance, also arrived at this conclusion.","\"The changes on Mars are because of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song! He is the epicenter of these alterations to the world!\"","\"What does Profound Sage Tyrannical Song intend to accomplish? Why has he unexpectedly reshaped Mars?\"","\"By standing at the point where the Heavenly Dao collapsed, he likely possesses knowledge and clues beyond our reach.\"","The minds of the observers who had been watching the battle began to communicate discreetly. Initially, they had been silently observing without exchanging words, but the situation had evolved swiftly. Those who had transmitted their thoughts to witness the battle couldn't help but form a discussion group to deliberate without disrupting the ongoing battle.","Meanwhile, the consciousnesses of the White Dragon, Pavilion Master Chu, and Senior White Two had infiltrated the discussion group and silently received the messages.","This was an exclusive group reserved for individuals classified as 'big shots.' Song Shuhang's divine sense didn't possess the strength required to join such discussions.","However, Song Shuhang didn't remain idle.","At this moment, several people were simultaneously contacting him through his?cultivation chat friend list.","\"Song, are you causing trouble again?\" The voice function was a 'closed beta feature' of the upgraded 'cultivation chat' system, currently available to select members, and the Celestial Thearch was one of them.","Song Shuhang was slightly taken aback.","The Celestial Thearch was currently on Spirit Butterfly Island on Earth. Why would she suddenly send him a message to inquire about his activities?","After some contemplation, Song Shuhang had a foreboding feeling. Could it be that the 'expansion' was not limited to Mars alone? Was Mother Earth herself undergoing internal expansion?","Song Shuhang didn't immediately respond to the Celestial Thearch. Instead, he opened messages sent by other members.","[Always-on Saint Seiya] Northern River's Loose Cultivator: \"Shuhang, the moon in the main world suddenly expanded rapidly. The area inside the moon kept expanding, and spiritual energy poured in. Is this related to you?\"","[Beautiful Fishman] Yu Jiaojiao said, \"Song, the Dragon King Palace at the bottom of the sea has suddenly been filled with extraordinary splendor. Do you have any information on your side?\"","[Blacklist·Mother Yellow Mountain] Venerable Yellow Mountain: \"Shuhang, there are some changes in the main world. Is it convenient for us to chat?\"","[Blacklist·Mother Yellow Mountain] Venerable Yellow Mountain: [(°Д°)]","Originally, the 'blacklist' didn't have a title and was labeled as 'blacklist.' However, after the cultivation chat system was updated, a new blacklist title function was added for Song Shuhang.","\"Not only Mars, but even the moon, the modern world, and the seabed have changed,\" Song Shuhang felt a headache coming on.","One could only imagine the chaos unfolding in the main world.","After a sigh, Song Shuhang clicked on the Celestial Thearch's name and sent a voice message.","Boom ~~","In the distance, Ball Shuhand and Scholar Yue Ruhuo suddenly clashed fiercely and caused space to tremble! Even Song Shuhang and the others, who were shielded by Senior White Two's magical treasure, were thrown about by the impact. Song Shuhang's head shook wildly in response.","\"What now?\"","Is this related to me?","\"It's changing,\" Song Shuhang stated after steadying his head.","The Celestial Thearch remained silent."]},{"number":2462,"title":"Chapter 2462 I Am Tyrannical Song, and I Accept Any Challenges at Any Time!","paragraphs":["[Friendly Banter] Celestial Thearch: \"Well, Senior Song, congratulations on successfully cutting ties with me! We're no longer buddies.\"","Song Shuhang looked bewildered. \"???\"","The recent 'Spatial Tremor' had been quite potent. It had left him uncomfortable and caused a slight delay in his reaction.","He pondered for a moment but couldn't fathom why the Celestial Thearch had suddenly terminated their friendship.","It seemed that even a peerless powerhouse like the Celestial Thearch couldn't escape the unpredictable nature of women.","[Friendly Banter] Celestial Thearch: \"I was actually contemplating when to return your spoils of war, Senior Song. But now, that opportunity is gone! You've not only lost me, but you'll also permanently lose the spoils in my possession.\"","[Friendly Banter] Celestial Thearch: \"Ta-ta~\"","Song Shuhang exclaimed, \"!!!\"","The Celestial Thearch referred to the spoils as a singular item—the steel clone!","\"Wait, wait a moment! Did I say something wrong just now?\" Song Shuhang quickly replied.","[Ding ~ The message has been sent, but it has been rejected by the other party. Please try again after 15 days.]","A system notification echoed in his mind.","Song Shuhang sighed in frustration.","What kind of new function was this? He had no idea such a capability existed within the 'Cultivation Chat Group'!","Meanwhile, on the other side, at Spirit Butterfly Island, The Celestial Thearch sat in Venerable Spirit Butterfly's secluded meditation chamber.","She rested her chin on one hand while efficiently handling the island's documents with the other—after all, she was the Celestial Thearch who had once presided over the ancient Heavenly City. Managing a small Spirit Butterfly Island posed no challenge.","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly remained unconscious, but under the Celestial Thearch's administration, Spirit Butterfly Island continued to operate flawlessly without any errors.","However, just moments ago, the space around Spirit Butterfly Island had been disrupted, and the island's spiritual energy had surged. Strange plants had inexplicably appeared on the island.","A butterfly demon from Spirit Butterfly Island hastened to report this development to Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly.","On behalf of Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, the Celestial Thearch reassured the butterfly demon and other island inhabitants. She also ensured that Liu Jianyi's schedule was packed and left him with no time for idleness. This way, he wouldn't notice Soft Feather's unusual state.","\"The world's great transformation, coupled with the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, may not necessarily be detrimental to me,\" the Celestial Thearch murmured softly.","Moreover, she had utilized this opportunity to block Song Shuhang for fifteen days.","Fifteen days should suffice for her to reclaim the mysterious island. During this period, she need not worry about Song Shuhang's long-distance interference.","After addressing the emergency on Spirit Butterfly Island, the Celestial Thearch rose and entered the inner chamber.","Inside, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly remained unconscious.","Nevertheless, his injuries had fully healed. In fact, thanks to the Celestial Thearch's various nourishing elixirs, the Spirit Butterfly had even put on a bit of weight.","This incident could be considered a blessing in disguise for Lord Spirit Butterfly. Upon awakening this time, his realm would likely have advanced by a level.","Under normal circumstances, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly should have awakened earlier.","However... under the Celestial Thearch's deliberate control, he had entered a deep meditative state. While absorbing the elixirs' potency, he also sealed himself off from the world.","The Celestial Thearch was preparing to take action regarding the mysterious island.","During this process, it would be more convenient for her if Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly remained unconscious.","\"Everything is ready.\" The Celestial Thearch replaced the incense burner's contents beside Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly and stretched lazily, feeling quite content.","Back on Mars, Song Shuhang was even more confused.","\"By the way, Soft Feather, does the term 'Heaven and Earth Change' sound peculiar to you?\" Song Shuhang asked, perplexed. He had noticed that the Celestial Thearch's thought process had been evolving recently. Perhaps Soft Feather could decipher the Celestial Thearch's thinking and reverse it?","\"No problem at all,\" Soft Feather replied while blinking her eyes.","\"So, it's not a problem on my end,\" Song Shuhang affirmed.","\"The world is askew!\" Lady Onion exclaimed while shaking her tiny fists.","\"The world is already quite weary. Let's not make it shoulder the blame anymore,\" Song Shuhang remarked, his remaining black hair transforming into a nimble hand that gently patted Lady Onion.","If it remained incomprehensible, he would set it aside for now and revisit it later.","Song Shuhang's divine third eye focused on the ongoing battle.","The battle between the chubby boss and Scholar Yue Ruhuo appeared to be nearing its conclusion.","In the world of Immortals, a battle between regular cultivators could drag on for an unprecedented duration, spanning years or even centuries.","Scholar Yue Ruhuo was formidable and ranked among the elite among Immortals. In a typical battle of the Heavenly Dao, he might have had a chance to prevail.","However, the fat ball was a unique case.","\"We're almost there!\" Ball Shuhang declared while hovering in the air as its colossal war fortress temporarily powered down.","According to its calculations, it had showcased enough of its abilities to the myriad worlds this time. It couldn't reveal all its secrets; maintaining an air of mystery was more enticing.","\"The next move is one that left a deep impression on me... Someone once employed it against me, but I ultimately had the last laugh.\" Ball Shuhang announced while crossing its arms.","On the opposing side, Scholar Yue Ruhuo wore a solemn expression.","\"Today, I will use this move to determine the victor between us.\" With that statement, Ball Shuhang reached out and grabbed a portion of its form.","It transformed that liquid metal into a stable spatial portal and hurled it forward. The Space Gate resembled a mirror, its surface pitch-black.","Scholar Yue Ruhuo immediately sensed being locked onto. He tried to manipulate his spatial powers to change his position, but the sensation of being locked on was like an unshakable shadow that followed him relentlessly.","Among the spectators from the myriad worlds secretly watching the battle, a few experienced an uncomfortable twinge. The way Profound Sage Tyrannical Song fought had stirred painful memories for them.","Could it be that style of combat?","\"Fight, fight!\" Ball Shuhang roared in excitement, and behind it, numerous cannons unleashed a barrage against the mirror portal.","Simultaneously, Ball Shuhang split into three heads and six arms.","Fists, palms, fingers, claws, elbows... A plethora of divine techniques bombarded the mirror-like spatial gate.","In response, over twenty spatial passageways materialized around Scholar Yue Ruhuo.","A relentless onslaught of artillery fire, formidable fists, palm strikes, finger techniques, and claw techniques relentlessly assailed him.","Even an Immortal couldn't evade such masterful manipulation of space; they could only endure.","\"It's indeed that method!\" A few observers secretly watching the battle winced, recalling the Scholarly Sage.","In addition to his impregnating gaze, he had inflicted a good deal of pain on them with this combination of 'space portal' and 'combo strikes.'","The bombardment of artillery and the fiery, passionate attacks by Ball Shuhang continued for over ten minutes before finally subsiding.","Scholar Yue Ruhuo ultimately couldn't withstand the fervor of the assault.","\"You've lost,\" Ball Shuhang declared while floating in the air as it retracted its three heads and six arms.","With its head held high, it proclaimed, \"I am Tyrannical Song, and I accept any challenges at any time!\""]},{"number":2463,"title":"Chapter 2463 Environmental Responsibility, Everyone’s Duty","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang was startled.","No, that's not true. I didn't do that. Don't make baseless accusations!\" he retorted.","At that moment, Song Shuhang found himself in a precarious situation. As a humble Seventh Stage cultivator who had failed to advance to the Eighth Stage, he had no desire to meet an untimely demise.","It was as if Song Shuhang, the Seventh Stage cultivator, had been thrust onto the throne of a wolf pack, facing a group of menacing wolves with green eyes. He had no choice but to raise his head and let out a long howl and attempt to assert his dominance, but deep down, he was filled with trepidation.","Senior White Two, who was observing the scene, couldn't help but cover his face with one hand and gently rub his temples. The audacious and fiery performance by the fat ball was truly unsettling to him.","However, he couldn't deny that it was unexpectedly intriguing.","\"It's on fire!\" Soft Feather exclaimed, her eyes lighting up.","The recent display of prowess by the fat ball had ignited her spirit.","\"Senior Song, while the fat ball is still in its amnesiac state, maybe we can trick it into using that move again!\" Soft Feather suggested enthusiastically.","Song Shuhang couldn't decide whether to laugh or sigh. \"But you haven't even mastered spatial abilities. How do you plan to learn it?\"","\"Good point,\" Soft Feather conceded with regret.","Su Clan's Sixteen held onto Song Shuhang's head and chimed in, \"While the fat ball's memories haven't returned, we can still learn some valuable techniques and knowledge from it. They might come in handy in the future. Just be cautious during this period and avoid stimulating it, lest it suddenly recovers its memories.\"","\"That's a valid approach,\" Song Shuhang contemplated. Then, a spark of excitement lit up in his eyes. \"Maybe we can try to discover its memories related to wealth during this time. That way, we might be able to inherit the fat ball boss's riches!\"","Song Shuhang couldn't contain his enthusiasm when it came to wealth. This was likely a side effect of the \"pay-to-win\" skill, which heightened his desire for riches to an uncontrollable level, making him a slave to wealth.","\"Great idea!\" Lady Onion chimed in enthusiastically.","Meanwhile, Senior White Two, wearing a casual smile, silently thought to himself. The wealth left behind by the fat ball was already in his possession. However, he had no intention of dashing Song Shuhang's dreams. After all, everyone deserved to have dreams and ideals. Without dreams, life would be no different from that of a salted fish.","Even Song Shuhang had the right to dream of something seemingly unattainable. In any case, he was the ruler of the Netherworld Realm now. If Song Shuhang and the others ventured into the Netherworld Realm to search for the fat ball's inheritance, they wouldn't be in great danger with him protecting them. Moreover, if he was in a good mood, he might even leave a small token as a consolation prize for Song Shuhang.","Furthermore, Senior White Two glanced at the domineering fat ball in the battle, a smirk tugging at his lips. He sensed an opportunity to capitalize on the situation. The fat ball's performance enhanced its credibility as Tyrannical Song.","In the ongoing battle, the victorious fat ball chose not to slay Scholar Yue Ruhuo. Perhaps it was moved by the zither music Scholar Yue Ruhuo had played?","After securing the first victory and commencing the \"eternal battle of the Heavenly Dao\" for the myriad world's cultivators, the fat ball stood confidently in the void while maintaining the lofty image of \"Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.\"","At its waist, the pitch-black kidney exuded a faint aura of \"Tyrannical Song's presence.\"","Yet, Senior White Two felt that something was missing.","He extended his hand and gently retrieved a small \"silver badge\" from the fat ball's possession.","The fat ball appeared momentarily bewildered while holding the silver badge in its hand.","\"What's this?\" It sensed the aura of its main body.","Was this a treasure bestowed upon it by its main body?","Eagerly, the fat ball carefully stored the silver badge.","Once it stowed the silver badge away, onlookers from the myriad worlds secretly watching the battle witnessed five \"Sage Names\" emerge on the fat ball.","Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Demon, and the newest addition, Tyrannical Annihilation!","All five Sage Names bore the hallmark of \"known to all.\" The fat ball now exuded an intimidating presence that could dominate for a lifetime.","Senior White Two, hidden in the shadows, couldn't help but smile.","This little gadget was a creation of Senior White's in the modern world. It was known as the \"One-Tap Sage Number Changer.\" When Senior White had impersonated Song Shuhang in the main world, he had employed this small tool.","Recently, Senior White Two had developed a close relationship with Senior White.","After receiving the instructions for creating this little tool from Senior White, he had connected it to the tool used to suppress Song Shuhang's Sage Name. This way, the Sage Name suppressed on Song Shuhang's main body could pass through this small tool and be projected onto the fat ball.","It was a flawless plan!","Senior White Two eagerly anticipated the fat ball's future developments.","If the fat ball failed to recover its own memories, it would continue to fight on Song Shuhang's behalf and subdue those who refused to yield.","However, as a clone of the ruler of the Netherworld, the fat ball was destined to be incapable of inheriting the Heavenly Dao.","In that case, how would the Heavenly Dao ultimately choose the next Heavenly Dao?","\"Senior White, what did you just do?\" Song Shuhang asked in a hushed tone.","Why had five of his Sage Names suddenly appeared on the fat ball boss?","\"Don't accuse me without evidence. I didn't do anything,\" Senior White Two replied sincerely.","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","Meanwhile, on the other side of the battlefield, having received the small gift from its main body, the fat ball was greatly encouraged!","This gesture meant that its \"main body\" supported its actions.","After a moment of contemplation, the fat ball declared confidently, \"Seven days! I know you're watching me, so I'll give you seven days. For the next seven days, I'll remain here and await your challenges!\"","If they were going to battle, they might as well make it for impressive data!","The fat ball was determined to eliminate a portion of its competitors during these seven days.","...","...","Seven days. Senior White, should we stay here to observe the battle?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"Forget it. Let's continue monitoring the battle from a distance and keep an eye on the situation on Mars,\" Senior White Two suggested, shaking his head.","\"Agreed,\" Song Shuhang replied.","In truth, he also wished to return to Earth as soon as possible.","According to the messages left behind by Senior Yellow Mountain, Heavenly Emperor, and others, Earth's landscapes, oceans, and even the moon?had all undergone changes.","He intended to check on the current situation of the main world.","Amidst the sudden and significant changes, the main world must have been thrown into chaos.","With this in mind, Song Shuhang contacted Mother Yellow Mountain in his Cultivation Chat Group. \"Senior Yellow Mountain, could you provide more details about the changes on Earth?\"","\"Well, the environment has improved significantly, with a notable increase in greenery,\" Senior Yellow Mountain replied calmly after a brief pause.","Song Shuhang was left dumbfounded.","So, the so-called world-changing event had essentially been an environmental conservation initiative?"]},{"number":2464,"title":"Chapter 2464 Double the Pleasure, Twice the Excitement!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang quietly buried a 'Holy Seal Wooden Saber' in the depths of Mars as a coordinate. Then, he used the Inner World for transit and brought along Su Clan's Sixteen, Soft Feather, and Senior White Two's projection back to Earth in the present day.","Ball Shuhang with five Tyrant Seals crossed his arms and stayed put on Mars. He looked like an unrivaled overlord who was waiting for brave warriors to come and challenge him!","Scholar Yue Ruhuo, who had been defeated in the prologue battle of the Heavenly Dao Battle, sat cross-legged in his spot, silently recovering from his injuries. He didn't rush to leave; instead, he chose to stay and bear witness to the saga of 'Profound Sage Tyrannical Song' facing challengers from myriad worlds on Mars!","During this process of witnessing, he waited for other losers to join him.","The taste of failure wasn't meant to be savored alone; it needed to be shared. With more people sharing their failures, the bitterness of defeat would be diluted.","Sharing sorrow with the sorrowful is a virtue—so cry, everyone, just let it out!","...","...","Not long after, the news of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song claiming the first victory in the 'Battle of the Immortals' quickly spread throughout the various planes of the universe.","King Kun, who was on Song Shuhang's 'blacklist 2,' was quietly lurking in the depths of the ocean while wearing a serious expression.","He was also one of the big shots observing the battle on Mars.","Ever since he had pursued Immortal Fairy White Bones to seize the White Emperor Sutra a few days ago, he had been added to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's blacklist for some reason. He had been discreetly monitoring Profound Sage Tyrannical Song ever since.","This time, King Kun watched 'Profound Sage Tyrannical Song' and 'Scholar Yue Ruhuo' display their prowess. Despite suffering from abdominal pain and twitching all over, he saw Profound Sage Tyrannical Song using the methods of the Scholarly Sage to defeat Scholar Yue Ruhuo!","He was incredibly powerful!","The strength Profound Sage Tyrannical Song displayed on Mars didn't seem like that of a newly immortalized cultivator. He was clearly suppressing his cultivation realm and timing his path to immortality!","\"He has mastered the Impregnating Gaze and is proficient in the Scholarly Sage's 'Knowledge is Power' spatial attack. And the pendant fairy on his person... She's clearly the female disciple that the Scholarly Sage dotes on,\" King Kun silently began to analyze Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's information.","Many beings across the universe were speculating about the origin of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Now, King Kun felt like he had uncovered the truth.","\"The reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage. This guy is definitely the second life of the Scholarly Sage!\" King Kun gritted his teeth.","If he wasn't the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage, how could he be so powerful?","\"I need to discreetly gather information from the scholarly faction.\" King Kun thought to himself.","If Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was indeed the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage, then there would undoubtedly be information within the scholarly faction.","And if it was proven that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage... Then this battle for immortality would be rendered meaningless.","It wasn't interested in being defeated by the Scholarly Sage a second time.","After a moment of contemplation, King Kun stuck out his tongue and spat out an 'Indestructible Golden Body of the Tribulation Transcender.' King Kun's stomach had its own realm, where he stored his treasures.","In other words, King Kun was the kind of big shot who would drop equipment when he was defeated. He was quite dashing.","What King Kun spat out was the body of a Tribulation Transcender from the scholarly faction, one of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction.","Furthermore, this Tribulation Transcender's Indestructible Golden Body was extremely unique.","Although it no longer had a divine soul, this Indestructible Golden Body was not lifeless. It was full of vitality. It could be said that it was a Tribulation Transcender-level comatose patient in the cultivation world.","King Kun took out this body and secretly cast a spell. He entrusted a sliver of his consciousness into this indestructible golden body and concealed himself in its depths, without being detected by anyone.","A moment later, the golden body of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders slowly opened its eyes.","\"Go ahead,\" King Kun called out.","He would go to the scholarly faction to find out if Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage!","The golden body of the Tribulation Transcender nodded slightly. With the bamboo sword at his waist, he opened his mouth and spat out a string of bubbles.","The spatial gate opened.","The Tribulation Transcender's Golden Body stood up and stepped into the spatial gate, disappearing. Even though he was in a vegetative state, his suave demeanor had already been ingrained into the bones of the scholarly faction's Tribulation Transcender. Every action he took was imbued with suaveness.","King Kun closed his eyes once again and projected his consciousness onto Mars to observe the challenges that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would face in the next seven days!","Inside the Space Gate, the Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders slowly advanced, their destination being the location within the scholarly faction's main world that King Kun had set beforehand.","However, as they proceeded, the spatial passageway suddenly forked.","King Kun's consciousness was momentarily dazed.","Why did the spatial passageway suddenly split?","Moreover, it seemed that something at the spatial intersection was drawing the golden body of the Tribulation Transcender!","Could it be that some treasure was about to emerge? Furthermore, it was a treasure related to the scholarly faction?","After a moment of contemplation, King Kun made a decision. The golden bodies of the Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders moved forward and took the fork in the path.","If it was indeed a treasure, then it must be destined for them. Perhaps it was a treasure that could make up for the regret of not obtaining the White Emperor Sutra.","Taking a step back, even if there was an accident, it didn't matter. In any case, it was just a golden body of a Tribulation Transcender from the scholarly faction, and it wasn't anything valuable.","If this golden body of a Tribulation Transcender wasn't one of the 'Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction,' King Kun wouldn't even consider collecting it.","The spatial passageway disappeared.","The Golden Body of the Tribulation Transcender stepped into the main world.","Boom! Not far away, the sounds of battle could be heard.","Someone was there?","A sliver of King Kun's consciousness looked ahead, and soon, he saw that not far away, a fairy dressed in scholarly attire was locked in a fierce battle with a powerful demon from the Netherworld.","Eh? Isn't this Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's pendant fairy? Why is she here?","King Kun immediately recognized this fairy.","Fairy Creation, who was fighting on the other side, also noticed the figure that had intruded into the battle.","A few days ago, Fairy Creation had received information from Song Shuhang about the location of the Confucian Code, and she had come to retrieve it on her own. This powerful demon of the Netherworld was the guardian beast of the Confucian Code.","The fairy's consciousness swept past the figure who had suddenly barged in. In the next moment, her body stiffened... It was Senior Brother Yuanzi.","Opposite him, King Kun's consciousness started to think quickly.","After arriving here, it could clearly sense that a treasure was about to appear, and it was a treasure related to the scholarly faction. As for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's pendant fairy, she was obviously here to take the treasure that was about to be born.","\"Wonderful!\" King Kun was overjoyed.","The treasure of the scholarly faction, the treasure that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song wanted to obtain... Soon, it would become its treasure!","Snatching back the treasures from the scholarly faction and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was double the joy and excitement!","Karma, this was karma.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had stopped it from taking the White Emperor Sutra from Immortal Fairy White Bones, and now, it was going to take the precious treasure of the scholarly faction from him.","\"Hahahaha~\" The Tribulation Transcender drew the bamboo sword from his waist and strode forward.","'First, to take down Tyrannical Song's pendant fairy!' King Kun thought to himself.","The bamboo sword was raised high... Then, he slashed at the demon of the Netherworld."]},{"number":2465,"title":"Chapter 2465 Who Set This Seal? Is There Any Way Out?","paragraphs":["This blow moved with the speed of lightning and packed a tremendous punch. After all, it was the sword King Kun had prepared to use for a sneak attack on Fairy Creation to take her down in one strike! If the energy contained in this attack were unleashed, it could easily obliterate an entire city.","Now, this city-destroying sword strike landed squarely on the formidable Netherworld demon.","The unfortunate Netherworld demon was in the midst of a fierce battle with Fairy Creation, completely unprepared for the sudden appearance of the golden form of the Tribulation Transcender, which executed a stealthy backstab.","Upon contact, the sword inflicted a grievous wound that cut deep into the mountain-sized demon's back. Dark demon blood gushed out like a torrent, mingling with the spilling of its internal organs.","What's more, the momentum behind this sword strike showed no signs of stopping.","The sword's energy within the bamboo blade erupted, cleanly severing the Netherworld demon's waist!","\"Aargh!\" The colossal Netherworld demon emitted a final, unwilling cry before crashing to the ground.","Its massive form began to disintegrate, and in the blink of an eye, it turned into ashes, leaving nothing behind.","Only the malevolent aura lingering in the air echoed with the resentful cries of the Netherworld demons, a testament to their former existence.","King Kun stood there in stunned silence.","The carefully orchestrated attack had been wasted just like that. Moreover, he was now exposed to Fairy Creation and lost his chance for a surprise attack.","But more importantly, this physical form was utterly powerless against the Fairy of Creation. Even if King Kun forcibly utilized a fragment of his consciousness, the golden form of the Tribulation Transcender could, at most, symbolically raise the bamboo sword without moving it.","'Since capturing Tyrannical Song's pendant fairy is impossible... I must shift my focus and seize the impending treasure of the scholarly faction!' King Kun calmed himself down and thought.","Capturing the pendant fairy wasn't the primary mission; it was just a secondary one. Its completion was inconsequential; what mattered was accomplishing the central narrative, which promised immense satisfaction.","With this in mind, King Kun halted the Golden Body and squarely faced Fairy Creation without taking any further action.","Fairy Creation turned around, her eyes filled with delight as she exclaimed, \"Song! Ah! Foolish! Foolish!\"","King Kun was confused.","What did she mean? What was the message behind this statement?","King Kun delved into deep contemplation, trying to decipher the significance of this sentence.","\"Dumby ~ Dumby?\" Fairy Creation tilted her head and continued.","The Tribulation Transcender of the scholarly faction, 'Yuan Zi,' remained motionless before her.","His gaze appeared distant, like a salted fish devoid of its luster.","His body seemed somewhat stiff, with movements far from fluid. It seemed as if he hadn't moved for a long time.","Nevertheless, his vital essence remained unmistakable.","\"Silly Song, aah ~\" Fairy Creation seemed to be in high spirits. She stood before Yuan Zi's Tribulation Transcender Golden Body while swaying back and forth as she uttered a string of enigmatic words.","'Speak plainly!' King Kun had a headache.","His Immortal-level intuition suggested that Fairy Creation was on the verge of imparting crucial information to him, possibly about the supreme treasure of the scholarly faction.","However, the string of 'foolish foolish, dumby dumby' made absolutely no sense to him; he couldn't fathom its meaning at all. It was at this point that he considered the need for a translator with an infinite level of expertise.","Fairy Creation continued to sway merrily before Yuan Zi's golden body while uttering peculiar phrases for over half an hour.","From start to finish, King Kun's consciousness commanded the golden body to remain utterly silent.","\"Come with me, amidst the stars and sea, a generation with hearts afar. The dream endures, light-years away, and pride refuses to surrender!\" Finally, Fairy Creation and Senior Brother Yuan Zi's reminiscing reached its conclusion. Then, she managed to articulate a sentence that King Kun comprehended.","Fairy Creation grasped Senior Brother Yuan Zi's wrist with one hand and extended the other skyward while pointing toward the starry expanse.","'She must be inviting me to join her, correct?' King Kun speculated. He seemed to vaguely grasp the meaning behind Fairy Creation's pronunciation.","...","...","In this manner, Fairy Creation, accompanied by her formidable ally, the golden form of the Tribulation Transcender from the scholarly faction, embarked on a journey to the hiding place of the 'Confucian Classic.'","Their path was fraught with challenges.","The location where the Confucian Classics was concealed was evidently devised by the Netherworld fat ball. This treasure trove resided within a crevice between the primary world and the Netherworld Realm, with numerous Netherworld demons serving as guardians.","A treasure as precious as the Confucian Classics contained the 'Dao' of the Scholarly Sage. Even the Netherworld fat ball would not casually destroy it, for it represented an opportunity for escape or the realization of the Heavenly Dao.","Thus, it chose to seal the Confucian Canon and hide it away.","Fortunately, the Netherworld Domination Sphere had already vanished.","The absence of the fat ball's main body support diminished the seal's intensity and the danger associated with the Confucian Classic's hiding place by half.","With the potent ally King Kun at her side, Fairy Creation made steady progress while surmounting various obstacles and breaching multiple layers of seals.","At long last, she and the Golden Body arrived at their destination.","It was a circular chamber that bore a technological appearance.","Nestled at the chamber's center was an altar, atop which stood a circular sealing pillar filled with translucent, light-blue liquid.","Within the pillar rested a book emitting a faint radiance, suspended within the azure fluid.","It resembled the sealing style of the fat ball.","Moreover, the sealing pillar's technique mirrored the one used to seal Senior White Two, devised by the fat ball. The fat ball excelled in sealing, its technique surpassing even Senior White Two's. Under its formidable seal, even Senior White Two would remain confined for 5,000 years.","King Kun's eyes gleamed as he fixed his gaze upon the book.","Even separated by the sealing pillar, he sensed the tremendous power this 'book' possessed!","This was undoubtedly a treasure on par with the White Emperor Scripture, likely an artifact utilized by the Scholarly Sage prior to his passing.","'From this day forward, this book shall be christened 'Kun'!' King Kun exulted.","Taking control of the golden body, he strode forward while initiating a meticulous examination of the seal.","Fairy Creation joined him and squatted beside him in scrutiny.","Half a day later.","King Kun raised his head, despondent.","Who could have imposed this seal? Is there any way out?","The origin of the seal's cultivation system eluded identification. It didn't adhere to Dao, Buddhism, Demonology, Witchcraft, or Sorcery... It seemed foreign to the world's known cultivation systems.","'Since I can't break the sealing pillar, I might as well extract the entire pillar and study it meticulously!' King Kun pondered.","Taking a step back, he unsheathed his bamboo sword and slashed both the top and bottom of the sealing pillar, successfully dislodging it from the chamber.","The process unfolded seamlessly, and the sealing pillar was extracted without issue.","\"Hahahaha~\" King Kun erupted in joyous laughter as he hoisted the sealing pillar aloft.","Then, he turned toward Fairy Creation and passed the sealing pillar to her."]},{"number":2466,"title":"Chapter 2466 Song Shuhang’s Lavish Setup","paragraphs":["King Kun was so anxious that he might as well have been trying to wring cod liver oil from a fish!","Not being able to make a move on Tyrannical Song's pendant was one thing, but having to hand over the sealed pillar that he had painstakingly excavated to her was another matter entirely...","His happiness value plummeted from 100 to negative numbers.","The promised double tax evasion had turned out to be in vain.","Fairy Creation joyfully accepted the sealed pillar containing the Confucian Classics from Senior Brother Yuan Zi. She gently patted the pillar. This seal was incredibly potent, being at the level of a ruler of the Netherworld. Even an Immortal would find it challenging to break. However, it didn't matter, as long as Song Shuhang was present, the seal could be undone with 'love'.","She hugged the sealed pillar and spun around happily like a little girl who had just received her favorite toy.","Such a cute side was only revealed in front of her familiar senior brother.","The happier Fairy Creation became, the more uneasy King Kun felt.","\"I will have to use my main body!\" King Kun thought to himself.","This scholarly golden body was entirely unreliable. If he wanted to seize this sealed pillar, he could only allow his main body to come over personally. Once his main body arrived, he could seize Tyrannical Song's pendant fairy as well, which might become his trump card in the future confrontation with Tyrannical Song.","Just as King Kun was deep in thought, a portal opened in the void!","It wasn't a spatial portal but the exit of a small world-a spatial portal represented the strength of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, while the exit of a small world represented a tycoon who owned a small world.","Shortly after, four figures emerged from this small world.","Two men and two women.","One of the fairies had long black hair, a tall figure, and long, fair legs.","The other fairy had short hair and a petite figure and wore a white dragon scarf.","One of the cultivators had long hair that reached his back, and his eyes were like stars. He was a beauty capable of toppling cities and countries.","This was because the auras of these three figures were too extraordinary... This inadvertently made the fourth figure easy to overlook.","King Kun finally shifted his gaze away from the handsome cultivator and looked at the last one.","This person looked ordinary and wore an exquisite mask on his face. He had an aura-suppressing magic tool on his body that made it impossible for others to discern his cultivation.","However, King Kun recognized the other party's identity at a glance—Tyrannical Song. Don't think I can't recognize you just because you're wearing a mask!","Wait, why is Tyrannical Song here? Didn't he stay on Mars, waiting for someone to challenge him? King Kun was stunned.","It could sense the movements on Mars through its consciousness.","At this moment on Mars, Tyrannical Song, who held the title of 'Five Consecutive Tyrants,' was in high spirits while awaiting someone to come and confront him!","The Tyrannical Song on Mars isn't fake; it's evident. But the one in front of me doesn't seem like a fake either. Could it be... that this Tyrannical Song is a clone? If it's just a clone, perhaps my main body can come over and take the sealed pillar.","Thinking this, King Kun began to secretly observe Tyrannical Song in front of him and check his configuration.","King Kun's consciousness secretly scanned Song Shuhang from head to toe.","First was the headgear.","Messy hair, this messy hair was an Immortal! King Kun was astonished. It could clearly sense that the long hair on Tyrannical Song's head was an independent entity that emitted the aura of an Immortal.","This strand of hair was an independent Immortal.","Next, on Tyrannical Song's shoulder sat an onion sprout spirit. This walking onion sprout was just an ordinary little monster pet... However, the shrunken treasured saber tied to her waist almost blinded King Kun's eyes.","What level is this treasured saber? This saber definitely surpassed the level of an Immortal's divine weapon! This... Could it be the legendary dao artifact? King Kun's liver trembled.","The more he looked at this saber, the more it resembled the legendary 'Heavenly Dao Creation-Dao Artifact'!","Was Tyrannical Song already this wealthy? A divine weapon like a dao artifact was actually given to a pet little demon to use? Was he insane? This was a dao artifact that even Immortals coveted!","His gaze continued downward, and there was a saber and a stele hanging on Tyrannical Song's waist.","At this moment, the saber and the stele seemed to be communicating. Both were magic artifacts with high-grade artifact spirits!","This blade... How peculiar! This... this is a heart demon? King Kun's eyes widened.","Darn it, this wasn't a saber; it was a heart demon! Moreover, it was a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender... No, it was an even higher-level inner demon!","Could it be that Tyrannical Song had extracted his inner demon and refined it into a saber?","How had he managed to transform his inner demon into a divine weapon?","And this stone tablet. On the surface, it appeared to be a magical treasure at the peak of the Tribulation Transcender realm, but it exuded an incredibly terrifying aura. This aura was even more formidable for battle-type Immortals. This stone tablet was undoubtedly not as simple as it appeared! King Kun's intuition told him that this stone tablet might be Tyrannical Song's most fearsome divine weapon!","Finally, it was Tyrannical Song's leg equipment.","The renowned Tyrannical Song was wearing two different brands of shoes on his feet. Furthermore, they appeared to be ordinary sneakers.","Why were there two different brands of shoes? There had to be something special about this. King Kun discreetly examined Tyrannical Song's left sneaker.","In the next moment, it discovered that the sports shoe was actually emitting a seven-colored divine treasure light! Not only that, but there was also an aura that could cause the world to collapse hidden in the shoe, as well as a faint scent of the Wielder of the Will!","This pair of shoes was Song Shuhang's left sneaker that had been strengthened by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Senior White Two had already taken away the remaining drop of the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball' in the shoe and then returned it to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang had cut off his lower body while transcending the tribulation. His lower half wasn't wearing shoes, so he casually took out the +10 combat boots and put them on.","After seeing Tyrannical Song's equipment, King Kun's liver melted.","He was truly armed from head to toe.","Even if it was a clone, Tyrannical Song was still an invincible man.","Moreover, these were just Tyrannical Song's weapons on the surface. Who knew what other treasures were concealed in the shadows?","Additionally, Tyrannical Song wasn't alone.","King Kun discreetly glanced at the two fairies and the handsome cultivator next to him.","\"Crap, a Longevity Scarf?\" King Kun was stunned. It could clearly sense that the white dragon scarf around the neck of the petite fairy was an authentic Longevity Scarf! When did the dragon race produce a white Longevity Scarf, a genuine Longevity Scarf?","Then there was the fairy with long legs. Although she didn't have any eye-catching equipment or magic tools, the aura on her body was very strange. It was illusory and tangible, and it felt like there was a terrifying existence directly connected to her back.","Looking around, the most eye-catching handsome cultivator was the most ordinary. The aura on his body was almost non-existent, and his smile was charming. It gave people a very friendly feeling and made people unable to help but want to get close to him.","Just as King Kun was thinking about this, the aura of this handsome cultivator suddenly changed drastically.","It instantly switched from being friendly to being extremely terrifying and evil!","He seemed to be the embodiment of all evil in the world.","If it wasn't for the fact that King Kun didn't have legs, his legs would have gone limp long ago.","Birds of a feather flock together.","Monsters would only be friends with monsters.","King Kun instantly extinguished the thought of summoning his true body."]},{"number":2467,"title":"Chapter 2467 Heaven’s Not a Good Guy","paragraphs":["At this moment, if he were to summon his true form, he might be in serious trouble.","The formidable lineup formed by Tyrannical Song's equipment and that group of immortals would mean curtains for anyone who dared to approach.","King Kun securely concealed a fragment of his consciousness deep within the golden body of the Scholarly Tribulation Transcender, not daring to reveal it for fear of detection.","If Tyrannical Song were to notice anything amiss... Losing the golden body of the Scholarly Tribulation Transcender wasn't the real concern. What worried him was that the handsome cultivator next to him might follow that strand of 'consciousness' and expose his true self.","Provoking them was not an option.","...","...","Meanwhile, Fairy Creation approached Song Shuhang with a joyful demeanor and handed him the sealing pillar.","\"Thanks for your hard work, Fairy,\" Song Shuhang accepted the pillar and tapped it lightly. \"The design and the sealing technique, as expected, are the creations of the Fat Ball boss! It's rock solid!\"","King Kun's hidden consciousness sighed silently.","This disloyal treasure had initially promised to bear the name Kun, but now it had sneakily changed it to Tyrant.","Double the joy turned into double the heartache.","It was unsettling.","After giving the sealing pillar to Song Shuhang, she sang, \"Song ~ Dimwit ~ Dumb dumb ~\" melodiously.","With her enchanting voice, even without any lines, her singing alone was heavenly.","\"I see,\" Song Shuhang nodded as he listened.","Then, he turned to introduce everyone, \"Fairy Creation mentioned that the person beside her is her senior brother, Yuan Zi, one of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction. Senior Brother Yuan Zi suffered severe injuries during the scholarly faction's calamity, and his mind is currently clouded. As you can see, though he can move, it's purely instinctual.\"","King Kun was taken aback—did he even understand this? The god-level translator he had desired was actually here!","\"Yuan Zi from the scholarly faction used to be a renowned scholar across myriad worlds. It's such a loss,\" the White Dragon commented thoughtfully.","In the past, the scholarly faction had produced thirteen young Tribulation Transcenders, shocking the world. The Saint's ability to teach students was recognized throughout the myriad worlds.","Yuan Zi was the most elegant among the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders. His every action exuded a graceful demeanor that set a trend in many worlds during ancient times with his handsome and easygoing style.","\"If not for the great tribulation that befell the scholarly faction, those thirteen Tribulation Transcenders might be Immortals by now,\" Pavilion Master Chu lamented.","Before the scholarly faction's great tribulation, more than half of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders had already condensed the embryonic form of their Dao.","Becoming an Immortal was only a matter of time.","Unfortunately, they met an untimely end.","If the stubborn Seventh Heavenly Dao had stepped down a few hundred years later, the Scholarly Sage might have led more than six Immortals in the last Immortal War. Just the thought of it was despair-inducing.","...","...","Fairy Creation pointed at Yuan Zi and sang, \"Song ~ Adai!\"","\"Alright, no problem,\" Song Shuhang replied. \"I happen to have the coordinates of the scholarly faction, so I can directly take Senior Yuan Zi there.\"","Fairy Creation hoped that Song Shuhang could escort Senior Brother Yuan Zi back to the scholarly faction.","Currently, the scholarly faction had four resurrected '13 Tribulation Transcendents.' They relied on the resurrection array left behind by the saints to revive temporarily and move in the main world. Perhaps he could help Yuan Zi before they dissipated again.","\"Yes, yes,\" Fairy Creation said with joy.","Then, she indicated the sealing pillar and the Confucian Classics.","\"Alright, I'll handle the seal on the Confucian Classics. To be honest, this sealing pillar is an unexpected bonus,\" Song Shuhang replied.","With enough rounds of Blade Nurturing Skill, this 'sealing pillar' might become his new trump card. Just as he used it to seal the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball previously, when the new sealing pillar's favorability was full, it could imprison another wave of formidable adversaries.","\"Can this formidable seal be broken by Tyrannical Song? Does he possess significant expertise in sealing arts?\" King Kun secretly eavesdropped; the more he learned about Tyrannical Song, the more he found him formidable.","\"This sealing pillar is much weaker than the one on my main body. It should be easier to handle,\" Senior White Two mentioned.","Song Shuhang said, \"I plan to spend the entire night perfecting it. By the way, Fairy Creation, what are your intentions regarding the Confucian Classics? Should we return it to the scholarly faction?\"","Song Shuhang intended to give the Confucian Classics to Fairy Creation. When she made the bet with the fat ball and Senior Three-Eyed, she had shown great concern upon learning about the Confucian Classics. It appeared to hold significant importance to her.","\"Song ~ Adai!\" Fairy Creation suddenly jumped up and landed on the sealing pillar, vigorously shaking her head.","She meant that the Confucian Classics couldn't be returned to the scholarly faction at the moment.","\"Is it crucial?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"Very crucial,\" Fairy Creation replied. She extended five fingers towards Song Shuhang, then after a moment's thought, reduced it to four fingers. \"You little bug, you're a bit tricky to catch!\"","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"Alright, I understand. In that case, I'll keep the Confucian Classics in the Inner World. When you feel the time is right, you can inform the scholarly faction,\" Song Shuhang said.","Fairy Creation was deeply concerned about some of the Saint's relics and was reluctant to let them return to the scholarly faction.","For instance, when Song Shuhang was about to return the Sage's eye to the scholarly faction, Fairy Creation had also resisted.","\"Could it be... There's still a possibility of a Saint's resurrection?\" Song Shuhang's heart skipped a beat.","Fairy Creation wanted to keep both the eyes and the Confucian Classics by her side. Could these items be crucial tools for the Sage's revival?","\"Ah~\" After receiving Song Shuhang's confirmation, Fairy Creation jumped down from the sealing pillar and patted Song Shuhang on the shoulder.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Both you and the virtuous lamia have been stealing my lines, haven't you?","\"Are we heading to the scholarly faction next?\" Sword inquired.","If they were going to the scholarly faction, it would mean staying in the Inner World for a while. The scholarly faction had high Morality Values that countered its Mental Demon attribute. Black-skinned Soft Feather could conceal herself within Song Shuhang's shadow, but it lacked that innate ability.","\"Yes, our destination is the scholarly faction!\" Song Shuhang extended his hand and opened the Inner World.","Soft Feather pulled Sixteen inside and expertly followed suit.","Fairy Creation held Senior Brother Yuan Zi and followed closely behind.","Senior White Two, however, remained behind. \"You guys go ahead. I'll stay here and examine the fat ball's sealing altar. If there's anything important, don't forget to call me. Also, if the Confucian Classics gets unsealed, make sure to inform me.\"","The world left behind by the fat ball seemed to have piqued Senior White Two's interest.","\"Alright, Senior White. I'll contact you once we break the seal,\" Song Shuhang agreed.","The entrance to the Inner World closed, and an exit appeared near the White Cloud Academy of the scholarly faction.","...","...","After Song Shuhang and his companions departed, Senior White Two stepped forward and approached the sealed altar.","He gently knocked on the altar's surface before lifting it with a powerful grip. The altar, initially unearthed by King Kun, was completely raised and revealed a vast underground space and a complex mechanical structure.","Deep within the intricate mechanical framework lay a metal box.","\"It appears to be the work of the fat ball, but this section must be the masterpiece of the Heavenly Dao Ball,\" Senior White Two mused, holding his chin.","The fat ball had established a seal and an altar here to suppress the Confucian Classics.","Subsequently, the Heavenly Dao Ball covertly excavated a substantial space beneath the altar, leaving behind a complex mechanical artifact and this metal box.","Notably, the material of this metal box was a type of liquid metal.","Indeed, it was the essence of the Netherworld fat ball!","Hence, this underground structure must have been tampered with secretly by the Heavenly Dao Ball behind the fat ball's back.","\"To cut off the Netherworld ruler in secrecy. The Heavenly Dao is anything but benevolent,\" Senior White Two remarked."]},{"number":2468,"title":"Chapter 2468 Is Tyrannical Song Sterilized Like the Ball?","paragraphs":["Senior White Two began to expertly dismantle this futuristic-looking piece of equipment.","This wasn't the first time he had discreetly taken apart items and devices created by the fat ball. He was highly experienced in this regard. Although this particular contraption came from the \"Heavenly Dao Ball,\" the Heavenly Dao Ball and the fat ball shared a similar approach to crafting instruments. Overall, it didn't hinder Senior White Two's ability to smoothly disassemble the device.","Even when he encountered sections that seemed puzzling during the disassembly process, Senior White Two's intuition was unmatched. He could rely on his gut feeling to take apart items. When it came to disassembly, Senior White Two had the intuition of a grandmaster and had never ruined an item.","The only regret was that his talent points for 'reassembly' weren't maxed out.","However, nobody is flawless, and humans always have minor flaws. Besides, he was the ruler of the Netherworld, responsible for destruction rather than healing. In a short five or six minutes, Senior White Two successfully reached the side of the liquid metal box.","No other way around it, he was extremely adept!","Lying behind Senior White Two were scattered parts and components from the disassembled items, strewn across the floor.","The Gorilla General and the beautiful Tree Demon were summoned and silently began moving these parts away to take them back to the world of the Black Lotus for Senior White Two to use in his research after returning home.","\"Finally, it's time for the eagerly anticipated unboxing.\" Senior White Two rubbed his hands together.","\"My Lord, could there be a backup plan by the Heavenly Dao inside? Should I summon my main body and lock onto this area?\" Little Sun T233's voice resounded.","Since it had received the spare heart from the prominent figure of the Big-Eyed Planet, it no longer required long periods of sleep to accumulate energy. It now played the role of Senior White Two's butler. Unlike the eyeball butler of Senior Three-Eyed, Little Sun T233 was dependable and loyal. Always thinking of its master, it was a positive role model among butlers.","Moreover, Little Sun had never caused harm to its master's heart.","\"No need to worry. Even if there's a backup plan, it can't harm me now that the main body of the Wielder of the Will has already collapsed,\" Senior White Two replied.","The Wielder of the Will hadn't made an appearance, and the ball of darkness only had a small clone remaining. With Senior White Two as the sole ruler of the Netherworld, who in the universe could challenge him?","Senior White Two approached the liquid metal box and gently patted it.","Ripples appeared on the surface.","\"One piece?\" The beautiful Tree Demon remarked. The box had no visible seams, and even if they wanted to dismantle it, they didn't know where to begin.","\"Then let's create an opening.\" Senior White Two smiled faintly. He put on a pair of thin gloves and retrieved two sharp swords from a specialized magical treasure space.","One of them emitted a holy light that made all Netherworld creatures uncomfortable, while the other was a scholarly divine weapon not much inferior to the holy sword.","Senior White Two held the divine weapon and thrust both swords forcefully into the liquid metal box.","Without the protection of the Heavenly Dao's power, the sturdiness of the liquid metal box was not significantly stronger than the fat ball's main body.","Senior White Two and the fat ball had been locked in a struggle for thousands of years, engaging in countless battles. Senior White Two was the foremost authority on how to cut through the fat ball's body!","Supported by his extensive experience and formidable strength, the two holy swords successfully opened the lid of the liquid metal box.","\"As expected, using the Holy Sword and the Confucian Sword against the fat ball would yield even better results... Wait.\" Mid-sentence, Senior White Two suddenly felt a bit disappointed.","The main body of the Netherworld Realm's fat ball was gone, rendering the method he had painstakingly devised to deal with the fat ball useless, no matter how effective it might have been.","Senior White Two suddenly found himself a bit bored.","He stowed away the Holy Sword and the Confucian Sword, then proceeded to open the liquid metal box.","As the lid opened, a piercing aura of scholarly 'righteousness' swept over them.","The beautiful Tree Demon and the Gorilla General couldn't help but retreat, feeling uncomfortable.","\"The righteous aura of the Scholarly Sage?\" Senior White Two speculated. The 'righteous aura' leaking from it was remarkably similar to the aura of the Scholarly Sage's eye on Song Shuhang's body.","Could it be a fragment of a Saint?","Pa~","The box was fully opened and revealed a human-shaped recess inside. It appeared to be the perfect fit for a 1.1-meter-tall boy.","However, the box was empty; there was nothing inside.","The Gorilla General approached and glanced inside. \"Hmm, empty? Could it have been melted by this box?\"","\"It wasn't melted,\" Senior White replied as he gently touched the recess.","This liquid metal box initially contained a human-shaped child, but this child had apparently left this place long ago.","\"Based on the current clues... it's likely that the deceased Heavenly Dao Ball secretly harnessed the power of the Scholarly Sage using the Confucian Classics sealed by the fat ball. It guided the power of the Confucian Classics into the underground space and into this upper liquid metal box,\" Senior White Two guessed.","\"Then, somehow, using the power of the Confucian Classics, it created this human-shaped boy?\" Little Sun T233 speculated.","\"That's right. Perhaps some Saint components were utilized in this process.\" Senior White Two nodded.","\"A cyborg?\" The eyes of the beautiful Tree Demon lit up.","\"Ball-made man,\" Senior White Two revised the description.","\"The Heavenly Dao Ball created a ball-made person... What did the ball want to achieve? Could it intend to use it as a vessel for its reincarnation?\" The Gorilla General asked, puzzled.","\"Perhaps it wanted to create a Scholarly Sage,\" Senior White Two proposed.","In the final battle, the Scholarly Sage had utilized his innate talent to snatch away a portion of the Heavenly Dao Ball's existence. Perhaps it wanted to nurture another Scholarly Sage to resolve this issue.","\"Then who is this 'ball-made man'? If he left this place long ago and arrived in the main world... Maybe he has already transformed into someone in the cultivation world?\" Little Sun T233 speculated.","\"Among the big shots in the myriad worlds, is there anyone who fits this criteria?\" The beautiful Tree Demon inquired.","\"He might not be a big shot. He might not have cultivated to such a high level,\" Senior White Two said.","\"Man-made Scholarly Sage, the most suitable big shot in the universe,\" the Gorilla General mused, pinching his chin for a moment before his eyes suddenly lit up. \"No. Tyrannical Song?!\"","Thinking carefully, didn't No. Tyrannical Song fit this scenario?","No. Tyrannical Song is a genuine human,\" Little Sun T233 responded.","Song Shuhang was his biological son, not someone he had?picked up.","Many people had confirmed this.","If it's not No. Tyrannical Song, then could it be one of No. Tyrannical Song's ancestors?\" the beautiful Tree Demon speculated.","\"It won't be.\" Senior White Two said,\" I'm afraid that the ball can't give birth to humans.\"","Infertile, sterilized like No. Tyrannical Song?"]},{"number":2469,"title":"Chapter 2469 Shuhang, You’re Unfair.","paragraphs":["General Gorilla and the Beautiful Tree Demon had a simultaneous thought that had been on their minds ever since Song Shuhang's fifth manifestation as a Saint: whenever they heard words like 'sterilization' or 'procreation,' it immediately brought to mind the Sterilized Tyrannical Song.","Luckily, the Hamster was currently in Song Shuhang's Inner World. If it were present, its thoughts would undoubtedly align better with its identity as a demon of the Netherworld. Among Senior White Two's pets, its bloodline as a demon of the Netherworld was the purest.","\"If it's not Tyrannical Song or an ancestor of Tyrannical Song, then, for now, I can't think of a suitable candidate for 'creating a human ball,'\" regretfully remarked General Gorilla. They were eagerly anticipating the unfolding of the God of Ball Creation's tale involving Tyrannical Song, as it promised to be exceptionally interesting.","\"If the 'Ball-Created Man' was a Ball Creation Sage forged by the Heavenly Dao Ball using the power of the Confucian Classics, then the most probable location for its existence would be within the scholarly faction,\" speculated Little Sun T233. Although he had no knowledge of this artificial man's personality, being a creation of the Scholarly Sage's abilities, the scholarly faction seemed the most suitable place for its cultivation.","\"Who knows, perhaps this artifical man is a prodigious disciple of the scholarly faction or even an elder? Given its talent, standing out in the scholarly faction should pose no challenge,\" the gorilla general's eyes gleamed with excitement.","\"No. Tyrannical Song and the others have already departed for the scholarly faction, correct? With the Heavenly Dao's collapse, the?articial man is no longer constrained by it. Who's to say it won't cross paths with No. Tyrannical Song and the others?\" pondered the beautiful tree demon.","\"And should it encounter No. Tyrannical Song and the others, it might have its sights set on No. Tyrannical Song's saintly eyes and the Confucian Classics.\" the gorilla general's imagination ran wild.","\"Then, on a moonless night, the enigmatic artificial man might sneak into No. Tyrant Song's chamber and open that solitary door,\" added the gorilla general.","In a few words, the beautiful tree demon and it concocted a dramatic scenario of intrigue involving the artificial man and Tyrannical Song. The plot was filled with twists and emotions.","In reality, Tyrannical Song was already fatigued. He deserved a well-earned rest,\" gently advised Little Sun T233.","Senior White Two was left speechless.","\"Also, should we inform Tyrannical Song about the artificial man?\" inquired Little Sun T233.","\"No need... He won't grow without challenges. In any case, I've prepared a resurrection array for him.\" Senior White Two waved it off.","Upon hearing this, the gorilla general gazed at the sky with a touch of sadness. \"I feel Tyrannical Song's progress is already astonishing.\"","When they first encountered Tyrannical Song, he was a newcomer to cultivation who did not even how to fly on a sword. Back then, he was a formidable Rank-8 powerhouse, a general who had conquered the western beast cultivation world. In less than a year, Tyrannical Song had exhibited his divinity five times and turned into a genuine Profound Sage.","Perhaps it wouldn't be long before Tyrannical Song surpassed him.","\"However, time is running out,\" Senior White Two murmured.","No one had foreseen the swift collapse of the Heavenly Dao Ball while Song Shuhang remained stuck at the Seventh Stage Realm.","If only the Heavenly Dao Ball had lasted another year.","By then, Song Shuhang might have reached the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, walking his path toward immortality... He had the potential to strive for undying.","According to the Wielder of the Will's records, the upcoming ninth battle of the undying was of paramount importance. The key to changing this situation was for two different individuals to achieve immortality simultaneously... How to accomplish this remained a mystery to Senior White.","If there was a chance for two different individuals to attain Dao at the same time, Senior White Two hoped that Song Shuhang would seize one of those positions.","\"Let's go. We should bring this metal box back to the world of the black lotus and examine it in detail. Perhaps we can discover new clues to confirm the identity of the artificial man,\" Senior White Two said as he extended his hand and stowed away the liquid metal box.","Once the research was complete, he intended to shape the liquid metal box into a sphere to pay homage to the departed fat ball.","On the other side, Song Shuhang led everyone to escape to the scholarly world.","\"This is strange. Why did Tyrannical Song use a small world for the spatial jump instead of using spatial authority directly?\"","\"Eh, this small world... It's a fragment of the ancient Heavenly City!\" King Kun's consciousness stirred.","While he could only glimpse a portion of this small world, many buildings from the ancient Heavenly City were clearly visible.","As an ancient Immortal, King Kun had conducted research on the ancient Heavenly City and knew that it contained several small fragments of the Heavenly Court.","Tyrannical Song's small world fragments were complete and consisted of significant sections of the Heavenly Court.","\"Furthermore, in the depths of this small world... There seems to be an even more mysterious and foreboding world concealed.\"","Occasionally, a faint aura emanated from this hidden world and created an unsettling atmosphere.","Remaining in Tyrannical Song's small world made every second feel like an eternity.","Luckily, Song Shuhang only utilized the Inner World as a transit point and didn't linger long before arriving at the White Cloud Academy.","\"To be honest, returning to the White Cloud Academy always leaves me with leg and stomach cramps,\" Song Shuhang lamented.","It was the most harrowing place for him.","\"By the way, Senior Song, I haven't watched your speech yet, and the broadcast notice just came in!\" Soft Feather giggled.","\"Stop! Don't watch it!\" Song Shuhang hastily advised.","\"But I've already ordered it,\" Soft Feather replied.","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","He swiftly turned to Su Clan's Sixteen and said, \"Sixteen, don't click!\"","\"I've already ordered it too,\" Su Clan's Sixteen shyly admitted.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He then regarded Lady Onion, perched on his shoulder.","\"Heh, I've had my fair share of experiences. I'll wait for others to finish watching your speech before I tune in. I won't give in easily...\" Lady Onion declared proudly, then suddenly exclaimed, \"Oops, my hand slipped!\"","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","As they conversed, two exquisite gemstones flew in from the White Cloud Academy.","These glass gemstones glistened and were about the size of an eyeball.","\"Wow, what beautiful gems!\" Soft Feather exclaimed.","\"If you like them, you can ask Song Shuhang for them,\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested, half-jokingly.","Soft Feather was puzzled.","\"Those are my eyes,\" Song Shuhang proudly revealed.","The pair of glass gemstone eyes floated in front of everyone, and soon, four elegant Confucian scholars emerged from them while gazing curiously at Yuan Zi.","\"Eh? So it's a standard double room?\" Sword quipped. \"Shuhang, that's not very considerate. With four fellow daoists, you should have arranged a spacious room for each of them!\"","Song Shuhang was left utterly speechless.","Why don't you try extracting four eyes, then?"]},{"number":2470,"title":"Chapter 2470 Someone Is Remote Divining Me? Let Me Contact Senior King Kun!","paragraphs":["You had to understand that these two left eyes were incredibly unique. They came into existence when Song Shuhang was struck by divine punishment, reduced to nothing but a head, and then, during the mysterious Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique cultivation, a crafty fairy plucked them out to serve as spare eyes.","These two left eyes were infused with potent powers of rebirth and the essence of life, starkly distinct from Song Shuhang's normal eyes.","To obtain eyes with the same unique abilities, one would have to invoke divine punishment again and reduce Song Shuhang to a similar state, and then repeat the entire process to extract similarly special glass eyeballs!","Any missing step in this process could lead to errors.","\"A standard room for two would actually be quite suitable. Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword, there's no need to worry about us. In fact, we are already quite content to extend our existence to this day with the aid of Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song's eyes,\" the refined Tribulation Transcender from the Confucian faction responded with a smile. \"Welcome to the realm of Confucianism. Please come in for a chat.\"","\"A place like Confucianism? I couldn't possibly enter!\" protested the sword with the firmest tone, even as it uttered the most timid words.","Just as they were conversing, a small virtuous hand suddenly reached out from behind Song Shuhang, grabbed the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, and dragged it into a large cocoon.","\"Hey, what? Wait, don't do this!\" the sword exclaimed.","In the next moment, it was pulled into the cocoon of the virtuous lamia and vanished.","Shortly after, a faint swallowing sound and the sword's despairing sigh could be faintly heard.","No one had expected that the virtuous lamia, in the midst of spinning a cocoon for her evolution, would still stretch out her hand to perform a sword-swallowing act.","Song Shuhang was left in disbelief.","\"Would you require a translator?\" Song Shuhang turned around and inquired.","\"The kind that comes with a fee,\" Lady Onion hastily added.","\"Don't interrupt. How could I charge for translation?\" Song Shuhang quickly covered Lady Onion's small mouth.","\"It's only right to charge for translation. It's only right,\" the refined Tribulation Transcender smiled faintly. He reached into his pocket and retrieved a shiny Ninth Stage spirit stone and handed it to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was taken aback.","Why did it feel like Lady Onion and I were performing a comedy routine?","\"Senior, Lady Onion was just joking,\" Song Shuhang firmly placed the Ninth Stage spirit stone back in his pocket. \"Spirit... Stone.\"","If Song Shuhang had Pinocchio's nose, the refined Tribulation Transcender in front of him would undoubtedly have been pierced through.","Song Shuhang had to summon all his willpower to force that lie out of his mouth.","After lying, he felt a pang in his heart.","When he decided to be ruthless, he wanted to stab himself.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you needn't be so polite. We all know you're short on spirit stones,\" the refined Tribulation Transcender said with a smile.","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","\"It appears the entire Confucian faction is aware of your financial situation. We are making every effort to provide you with spirit stones,\" Pavilion Master Chu replied, having observed the situation with clarity.","As a bystander, she could discern that the Confucian faction was trying to supply Song Shuhang with spirit stones. If there were any opportunities or excuses, the dignitaries of the Confucian faction would undoubtedly find ways to continuously send spirit stones to Song Shuhang.","\"Haha,\" the refined Tribulation Transcender chuckled dryly. He wasn't an actor, so he was easily seen through by this peculiar fairy.","After the laughter subsided, he forcefully pressed the Ninth Stage spirit stone into Song Shuhang's hand and said, \"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, please accept it. Don't push it back, or else we'll spend the entire day at the entrance of the White Cloud Academy, and there'll be no way for us to enter.\"","\"Also, what was Junior Sister talking about just now? Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, please translate for us,\" the refined Tribulation Transcender added.","\"Crafty Fairy was just introducing Yuan Zi's condition to you. She mentioned that Yuan Zi suffered severe injuries during the previous Confucian faction calamity and is now in a vegetative state, acting on instinct. However, Yuan Zi still retains some instincts. He knows how to assist her in battle and how to give her the sealed Confucian Classics. Therefore, she brought Yuan Zi to the Confucian faction in hopes that the senior brothers could help him and see if they could restore his soul,\" Song Shuhang translated and explained.","\"Crafty Fairy? Oh, is that her new daoist name?\" the refined Tribulation Transcender smiled at Crafty Fairy.","\"Did Junior Sister's words contain such a wealth of information?\" the bookworm Tribulation Transcender was dumbfounded.","Why could Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song understand it?\" the high-spirited Tribulation Transcender looked at Song Shuhang with a perplexed gaze. What had transpired between Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and their junior sister? How could they exhibit such rapport?","\"Junior Sister, can you stop spacing out?\" the handsome Tribulation Transcender said to Crafty Fairy with a hint of exasperation.","\"We understood that sentence,\" the handsome Tribulation Transcender said with a wry smile. He reached out and patted Crafty Fairy. \"It's not about being dull, can't you speak normally?\"","\"Well, what Crafty Fairy meant was that the Confucian Classics is in her possession, but it's still sealed and requires a lengthy period to unseal. Furthermore, once the seal is lifted, the Confucian Classics won't immediately be returned to the Confucian faction. It still holds significant importance,\" Song Shuhang translated.","The handsome Tribulation Transcender was rendered speechless.","What?","Did that string of 'spacing out' sentences contain so much meaning?","\"Junior Sister, you can manage the matter of the Confucian Classics on your own. We won't interfere,\" the handsome Tribulation Transcender said with a smile to Song Shuhang. \"Additionally, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, if you ever decide to hand over the Confucian Classics to the Confucian faction, we will prepare as many spirit stones as possible. We guarantee that you won't suffer any losses, so please rest assured. You needn't worry about the Confucian faction's spirit stones. Ever since the establishment of the Golden Lotus World, the Confucian faction's demand for spirit stones has significantly decreased. Now, our rate of earning spirit stones far surpasses our consumption.\"","The Confucian faction was wealthy, exceedingly so, and would only continue to accumulate wealth.","Song Shuhang didn't?know whether to laugh or cry... He wanted to laugh, but he suddenly felt so envious that he wanted to cry.","\"Let's go, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. Let's not stand at the door any longer. Please come in,\" the handsome Tribulation Transcender smiled and showed the way for Song Shuhang and the others.","Song Shuhang turned around while holding Su Clan's Sixteen and Soft Feather's hands, and entered the Confucian faction's White Cloud Academy. Sixteen and Soft Feather were currently watching the live broadcast of his Profound Sage Speech. It wouldn't be long before they fell into an endless loop. He had to pull them along to prevent any accidents.","There was a barrier at the entrance of the White Cloud Academy.","The moment Song Shuhang's body squeezed into the barrier, a 'virus warning' suddenly sounded in his mind—someone was divining him remotely!","Moreover, he was wearing a mask that concealed the secrets of heaven.","In other words, the other party had significant influence!","\"Hey, now it's my Blacklist 2's turn,\" Song Shuhang said softly.","Meanwhile,?King Kun, in the depths of Yuan Zi's consciousness, was utterly bewildered."]},{"number":2471,"title":"Chapter 2471 It’s Not Me, Stop Making Baseless Claims!","paragraphs":["When King Kun heard Song Shuhang mention Blacklist 2, he immediately became alert.","This was because he was currently in what was referred to as Blacklist 2.","What was even more concerning was that a supreme divine being, who had previously been in Blacklist 2 alongside him, was now deceased.","What did Tyrannical Song have in mind?","Why did he suddenly bring up Blacklist 2 upon entering the scholarly faction's territory?","Could it be that he had already detected King Kun's presence deep within Yuan Zi's consciousness?","Did he lure King Kun into the scholarly faction just to deal with him?","Was all of this part of Tyrannical Song's grand scheme?","In an instant, a million possibilities swirled in King Kun's mind.","No, he couldn't afford to remain passive.","He needed to take the initiative!","King Kun silently made up his mind.","Just as King Kun's mind was swamped with countless thoughts... suddenly, his main body received a private message from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","\"Hi ~ Senior King Kun, good evening!\" The greeting was surprisingly warm.","King Kun was certain that Tyrannical Song's friendly tone concealed ulterior motives!","\"If it weren't for my consciousness trailing behind you already knowing that you were planning to deceive me, I might have fallen for your friendly facade.\" King Kun thought to himself.","So, should he respond to Tyrannical Song?","He knew Tyrannical Song was attempting to deceive him, but he couldn't fathom how.","This sensation was excruciating. It was akin to being blindfolded and suspended as a target in a 'knife-throwing game.' He knew the next knife would strike, but he had no idea from which direction it would come or which part of his body it would hit.","Just as King Kun hesitated about replying to Song Shuhang, Song Shuhang's friendly message arrived once more. \"Senior King Kun, you don't need to rush to reply. I'm just greeting you, nothing more. Goodbye ~\"","As long as the private chat was established, the blame would be deflected. Whether Senior King Kun chose to respond or not was no longer significant.","King Kun was confused.","Meanwhile, inside the barrier of the White Cloud Academy.","Song Shuhang nodded slightly. \"Done. I couldn't catch any sheep...\"","Deep within Yuan Zi's consciousness, King Kun was only growing more confused","Done? It was over?","Song Shuhang just greeted him and terminated the conversation without waiting for his reply?","What was going on?","King Kun couldn't comprehend Tyrannical Song's motives.","Could it be that he was bored and simply teasing him from a distance?","\"Impossible, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song isn't that dull.\" King Kun immediately dismissed his theory. Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was a man who calculated each step meticulously.","From the fifth divinity show, it was evident that every move he made was deliberate, including stepping onto the node where the Heavenly Axiom had collapsed to prove his immortality and making contact with the Supreme Law of Speech.","This formidable man wouldn't engage in meaningless endeavors.","He must have covertly manipulated something in his main body during their private chat.","When King Kun thought about the now-deceased other occupant of Blacklist 2, he became exceptionally vigilant. Simultaneously, his main body rapidly deployed numerous defensive measures around himself.","Undoubtedly, this was a wise decision!","Just as King Kun established his defenses, a destructive will locked onto the deep sea where he was concealed.","This will was akin to the descent of Heavenly Dao, but unlike the Wielder of the Will, this will exuded an eerie and deathly aura, symbolizing death and annihilation.","This menacing will had King Kun in its sights within the deep sea. Subsequently, a terrifying spiritual impact traversed countless dimensions and descended upon King Kun.","\"I've found you, Tyrannical Song,\" a mechanical voice devoid of emotion or warmth echoed within the mental assault.","King Kun was speechless.","Tyrannical Song? Me?","No, that's not right! You've got the wrong person!","In addition, he immediately deduced the reason behind Tyrannical Song's abrupt private message—it was undoubtedly due to that unexpected private message that had diverted the attention of the terrifying will!","Originally, this will should have locked onto Tyrannical Song, but because of Tyrannical Song's private message, it had switched its target to him.","Tyrannical Song had tricked him!","However, King Kun didn't have the luxury of time to vent his frustration on Tyrannical Song at this moment.","The hundreds of defensive measures surrounding his body were rapidly crumbling under the spiritual assault.","Ultimately, the spiritual attack, weakened to the brink by the layers of defense, struck King Kun's consciousness and caused his mental faculties to swell and burn.","King Kun was rendered speechless.","This cross-dimensional mental assault could swiftly dismantle a hundred layers of his defenses and eventually induce swelling in his mental faculties.","What kind of monstrous entity was this?","After a brief moment of contemplation, King Kun swiftly opened a spatial portal and exited Earth before returning to his main base, the Cloud World.","\"Tyrannical Song,\" King Kun clenched his teeth.","Should he respond and reprimand him?","However, what?if he was once again besieged by that monstrosity after replying to the message?","\"I want to delete Tyrannical Song from my friends list!\" King Kun attempted to send a request to the cultivation chat function.","\"Ding! The handy squirrel from artificial intelligence customer service is at your service.","\"Ding ~ Removing Tyrannical Song failed. The 'delete friend function' is not yet online. Please look forward to the next upgraded version.\"","\"Damn it!\"","How could it be that you couldn't delete someone from your friends list? Where was the rating system? It definitely needed to receive a few negative reviews.","\"Then block Tyrannical Song's messages and refuse to receive his private messages!\" A moment later, King Kun sent his request once more.","\"Ding! The 'Block Friends' Private Chat' function is still in beta testing. You are not a closed beta user, so you have not activated this function. Please look forward to the next upgraded version. Is there anything else I can help you with?\"","King Kun was speechless.","A while later.","\"Should I top up?\" King Kun inquired nonchalantly.","\"Ding! The top-up system has not yet been developed. Your suggestion has been acknowledged, and we will attempt to add a top-up system in the next version. Please look forward to it.\"","\"Damn it.\"","Shameless!","\"Leave a negative review for Tyrannical Song.\" King Kun voiced his frustration while beginning to scrutinize this 'cultivation chat' system.","This 'cultivation chat' system was a potential liability. If he continued to let it linger on him, it would be equivalent to taking the blame for Tyrannical Song.","Therefore, King Kun aimed to reverse-engineer the principles of this 'cultivation chat' spell and remove it from his body!","Alternatively, he could thoroughly analyze it and use it to counter Tyrannical Song!","\"Ding, successful negative review.\" No. Tyrannical Song's negative review count +1.","\"Authority, what level of authority do I currently possess?\" King Kun inquired.","Once he confirmed his own authority, he would use it to methodically test the foundation of this 'cultivation chat' function and ultimately exploit its weaknesses!","The day he exposed a vulnerability would be the day he could counter Tyrannical Song!"]},{"number":2472,"title":"Chapter 2472 Small Technique to Increase Prestige","paragraphs":["Just as King Kun was about to open the Cultivation Chat Group to remove it from its body or to find a loophole to counter Tyrannical Song, a shadow quietly approached it unnoticed.","The pot that Song Shuhang threw at it wasn't a non-stick pot, and it wasn't that easy to throw either!","Even though King Kun had used Dimension Transfer to move from the main world to the Cloud World, it still couldn't escape the lock of the pot.","The shadow approached King Kun quietly.","King Kun did not sense the other person at all!","King Kun was a genuine immortal, and Song Shuhang addressed it as \"Senior King Kun.\"","Even if it wasn't good at fighting, every being who stepped on the path to immortality was a talent from heaven and was definitely not weak.","When the shadow got close, it suddenly exploded. Its body turned into a water curtain that covered the sky and enveloped the huge figure of King Kun!","Within the water curtain, space was sealed, and spiritual energy was separated.","It was only when the water curtain descended that King Kun reacted!","It hadn't expected that someone had gotten this close to it without notice.","\"Heavenly Peng's Flying Technique!\"","At a critical moment, King Kun quickly transformed and used an escape technique to narrowly avoid the sneak attack.","Boom!","Behind it, the water curtain enveloped the place where King Kun had been just moments ago. There was a deep pit in the ground.","This was the first time King Kun had encountered a monster with a better appetite than himself.","\"Tyrannical Song, I found you!\" The water curtain monster made a strange sound.","\"Are you blind? Do I look like Tyrannical Song to you?\" King Kun asked angrily.","\"Don't think that I can't recognize you just because you've become a bit fat, Tyrannical Song!\" the water curtain monster said coldly.","King Kun was speechless.","'Fat?!'","\"Don't even think that you can scare me.\" King Kun stopped running away and turned around.","There were strong and weak immortals among them.","Unless one was as strong as the Scholarly Sage, who was half a level higher than ordinary immortal, there was no need to fear anyone.","A battle between peak immortals began.","After the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, all Tribulation Transcenders and immortals were no longer afraid. They wouldn't be able to attack with all their might anyway.","This was also the beginning of the world falling into chaos.","...","On the other side, at the White Cloud Academy's scholarly faction, Song Shuhang and the others were led to the world of the golden lotus under the leadership of a refined Tribulation Transcender.","\"By the way, I still don't know your daoist names,\" Song Shuhang suddenly said.","After the four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction were revived, they left with Song Shuhang's eyeballs. Song Shuhang had never asked for their names before this.","Up until now, the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders all recognized each other by their faces.","One was gentle and refined, one was in high spirits, one looked like a nerd, and another one was handsome.","There was also a radiant scholar who had borrowed Song Shuhang's ghost spirit a long time ago. He stood at the back, and his name was Yuan Zi.","Other than that, there was another scholar who looked ruffled and disheveled.","Song Shuhang had already met half of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you two are still peers. We don't dare to call you by name,\" said the handsome Tribulation Transcender as he waved his hand.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Behind him, King Kun, who was in the depths of Yuan Zi's consciousness, heard this, and its heart stirred.","The strange reaction of the Tribulation Transcender of the scholarly faction towards Tyrannical Song only further confirmed his guess.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was very likely the reincarnation of a Sage. Otherwise, why would the Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction treat him so respectfully?","After entering the world of the golden lotus, the connection between King Kun's consciousness and his main body had been severed. Now that it had been detached, it could only rely on itself. It didn't even know that its main body was trapped by a water curtain monster.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you can call us by our daoist names,\" said the refined Tribulation Transcender as he pointed at himself. \"I'm...\"","\"Twice the fool!\" Fairy Creation called out.","The refined Tribulation Transcender was speechless.","\"So, it's Fellow Daoist Wen Zi.\" Song Shuhang said with a nod. Just like his name suggested, Senior Brother Wen Zi was gentle and polite. That was the impression Song Shuhang had had of him.","At that moment, the handsome Tribulation Transcender beside him coughed softly. \"I'm...\"","\"Thrice the fool!\" Fairy Creation said again.","The handsome Tribulation Transcender was at a loss.","\"So, it's Fellow Daoist Yan Zi,\" Song Shuhang said. He remembered this handsome Tribulation Transcender. When they first met, it was this handsome Tribulation Transcender who, after hearing Pavilion Master Chu's words, and cried out, \" The hair becomes a spirit!\"","The Pavilion Master Chu's hair had tied him up.","He didn't think this person was foolish. As expected, those who led these three were not ordinary people!","\"I am the seventh fool,\" said the nerdy-looking Tribulation Transcender desolately.","He stood there calmly and waited for Song Shuhang to say his name out loud too.","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","The nerdy Tribulation Transcender looked at Song Shuhang with anticipation. That handsome face seemed to be saying, \"Come on! Just say my name!\"","Fairy Creation turned to look at Song Shuhang and said, \"Yes. He is also foolish.\"","\"Oh! It's Fellow Daoist Chi Zi!\" Song Shuhang said with a bright smile.","The Tribulation Transcender, Chi Zi, was silent for a moment. \"I said the same thing as her. You can understand her but not me? How is that possible?\"","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"I don't know either. Anyway, as soon as Fairy Creation opens her mouth, I just get the answer. Maybe it's because you, Senior Brother Chi Zi, and I don't have enough understanding of each other?\" Song Shuhang said.","The nerdy Tribulation Transcender thought for a moment and said, \"Then, should we think of a way to understand each other better?\"","\"That's alright. There's no need for that,\" said Sho Shuhang and declined politely.","He and Senior Brother Chi Zi were not very close.","\"I'm the last one,\" said the Tribulation Transcender who seemed to be in very high spirits. He waited for his junior sister to introduce him.","\"You are fool number eleven,\" said Fairy Creation.","\"Fellow Daoist Yu Zi,\" Song Shuhang said with a nod.","Wen Zi, Yan Zi, Chi Zi, Yu Zi, and Yuan Zi.","The daoist names of all the Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction seemed to be similar.","[The usage of the ancient language is slightly different from the present. Actually, you can recite the daoist names of the Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction in reverse. However, the meaning is similar.]","At that time, Pavilion Master Chu secretly informed him.","'In reverse? Zi Wen, Zi Yan, Zi Chi, Zi Yu, and Zi Yuan...' Song Shuhang sighed. 'Their status increased all of a sudden.'","The name was the same, but sometimes, when the order was reversed, it gave way to interesting things.","Then, if he reversed the order of his Sage Names...","Would Song Tyrant also sound good?","'Uh, forget it.' Song Shuhang shook his head.","...","While he was talking with the scholarly Tribulation Transcenders, Song Shuhang was multitasking.","Part of his consciousness was connected to Lady Dragon Network.?\"Lady Dragon Network, can you deduce the information about the guy who divined me from afar?\"","\"Tyrannical Song, please call me Miss Fat Ball,\" said Lady Dragon Network. \"I can confirm the information now. According to the historical records, the data of the long-range attacker is Heavenly Path Molt Sphere.\"","\"Heavenly Path Molt Sphere? Didn't I and Senior White Two already seal it?\" Song Shuhang was stunned.","He had used the sealing pillar to seal most of the Heaven's Will Liquid Metal Ball. It was still in Senior White Two's nest.","Could it be that the Heaven's Will Liquid Metal Ball had escaped?"]},{"number":2473,"title":"Chapter 2473 Excellent T-Postures","paragraphs":["If the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball escaped the seal, it would be serious.","Not only would Song Shuhang's body be smashed into pieces, but the world would also be destroyed and cast into the abyss if he wasn't careful.","'I have to confirm this with Senior White Two and see if the Heaven's Will Liquid Metal Ball has really escaped from the seal.' Song Shuhang thought to himself.","\"What's wrong? Why are you suddenly so nervous?\" At that moment, the stone stele at his waist sent a puzzled voice transmission.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Pavilion Master Chu, Lady Onion, Su Clan's Sixteen, Soft Feather, Little White Dragon, and the Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction were all looking at him.","Even if Song Shuhang was wearing a mask to cover his small face, his body language gave his emotions away.","He was like a barrage of comments unable to hide any secrets.","\"Did you run into a problem, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song? Do you need our help?\" The gentle and polite Tribulation Transcender, Zi Wen, asked softly.","\"If there is anything that we and the scholarly faction can do to help, we will do our best.\" Zi Yan patted his chest.","\"I'm not sure if it's a big deal yet,\" Song Shuhang said.","He briefly explained to them that someone had divined him from a distance and suspected that the divination target was the Heaven's Will Liquid Metal Ball.","Zi Chi looked at Song Shuhang in surprise. \"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, have you actually seen such a thing?\"","\"I only encountered it a few times and escaped from its clutches. Later, with the help of Senior White Two, we managed to fight back.\"","When Song Shuhang thought of the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball, he still felt a lingering sense of fear.","He had used the Play-To-Win Strike on the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball. When he thought of it, his heart ached so much that he couldn't even speak.","'He actually fought back against the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball?!'","The Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction felt that Song Shuhang was not as simple as he seemed. Anything related to the Wielder of the Will wasn't simple.","Tyrannical Song could be said to be the cream of the cultivation world. There was no one in the universe that he was afraid to provoke.","At that moment, the four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction began to suspect that Tyrannical Song was the reincarnation of their teacher.","The entire scholarly faction was spreading that rumor, and most of the scholarly disciples firmly believed it.","\"F*ck Heavenly Dao Molting Ball!\"","At that moment, King Kun in the depths of Yuan Zi's consciousness felt so wronged that it wanted to curse out loud.","Tyrannical Song was shameless. He lured the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball to his main body!","Luckily, its main body reacted quickly enough and returned to the Cloud World from the main world.","In the future, he had to be on guard against Tyrannical Song and absolutely couldn't give him any chance to take advantage of him!","Moreover, he had to find a way to send the information about the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball to his main body as soon as possible so that his main body could avoid suffering more damage.","...","\"Right, Fellow Daoist Shuhang. If the divination's target this time is really the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball, then we must tell Senior White immediately... Please, ask if the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball has really escaped!\"","Ever since Senior White Two made it into Song Shuhang's tombstone, he had been firmly remembering the words on it. He didn't want to be as reckless as Tyrannical Song.","After all, people only had one life.","\"Too late!\" At this time, Senior White Two's cold voice sounded from Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's body.","In the next moment, the stone tablet's body began to spiral toward the top of the world of the golden lotus.","The world of the golden lotus was an independent space. Under normal circumstances, even the power of the ruler of the Netherworld would be blocked.","However, Senior White Two's main body was in the world of the black lotus, which existed in parallel to the world of the golden lotus.","In addition, Song Shuhang was also in the world of the golden lotus, and with his Inner World acting as a medium, Senior White Two could use his Inner World to influence the stone monument in the world of the golden lotus.","\"Lord White, please spare my life!\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was terrified. In fact, spiraling up into the sky was nothing to him. However, White Two was the ruler of the Netherworld, and it was disastrous to anger him. At that moment, admitting defeat was the safest choice.","\"Senior White, please wait... I'm just an innocent passerby too!\" Song Shuhang said sadly.","It was clearly Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's fault. But Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was tied to his waist, so he was sent into the sky in a spiral.","The innocent bystanders suffered the most.","Since it was Senior White Two who had made the move, Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's went spiraling as fast as a gust of wind.","Besides, their posture was different from the normal coiling flight technique.","The man and the stele formed a T-shaped bamboo dragonfly.","Song Shuhang was horizontal.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, who was at Song Shuhang's waist, had turned into its original size, and was spinning madly against Song Shuhang's waist.","Everything in the world was dependent on cause and effect. Whatever one did to others would come back to bite them.","Su Clan's Sixteen, Soft Feather, Little White Dragon, and the Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction all raised their heads and watched Song Shuhang ascend to the sky.","\"I want to fly higher... I want to fly higher... I want to dance like a wild wind... I want to break free,\" sang Fairy Creation and added to Song Shuhang's plight.","The song, along with the spinning Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet in the sky, certainly made an interesting sight to see.","\"As expected, this stone tablet is extraordinary! Although it is only at the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, the power hidden within it is terrifying.\" King Kun's consciousness confirmed its guess.","\"Ka...ka...ka...\"","A strange sound rang out in the void. It sounded a little like the shutter of a camera. He wondered what Senior White Two was doing.","...","After Fairy Creation finished singing, Senior White Two finally let go of the stone tablet and allowed Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet to descend from the sky.","After landing safely on the ground, Song Shuhang's legs felt wobbly. \"Senior White, if you want to make a move on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet next time, can you please warn me first so that I can sacrifice him—\"","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet quickly interrupted him. \"You and I are connected. If you die, I will become a lifeless stone. No matter what happens, I will never leave you.\"","Song Shuhang was speechless.","\"The Heavenly Dao Molting Ball in my nest hasn't changed and is still sealed. There's nothing unusual about the seal.\" Senior White Two's voice rang out in Song Shuhang's mind.","'There was nothing unusual about the seal?'","Song Shuhang frowned. Suddenly, he thought of something. 'Could it be that the thing that attacked me was another Heavenly Dao Molting Ball?'","The Fat Ball was already the Eighth Stage Realm. There were so many Wielders of Heaven's Will before it, so there must be something else left behind!"]},{"number":2474,"title":"Chapter 2474 The Essence of History is a Replay Machine","paragraphs":["\"Perhaps there will be something like 'Heavenly Dao Molting White,' 'Heavenly Dao Molting Eye,' or 'Heavenly Dao Molting Dragon' among them?\" Song Shuhang pondered while rubbing his chin.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","In the next moment, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, who had moments ago declared, 'We will never part in life and death. If you die, I will be the tablet,' swiftly untied the rope connecting him and Song Shuhang. He leaped gracefully into the hands of Fairy Creation while transforming into a bystander tablet to avoid being entangled in Song Shuhang's tribulation.","Song Shuhang looked puzzled.","However, Senior White Two showed no reaction to the term 'Heavenly Dao Molting White.' It seemed that he could accept the term 'Heavenly Dao Molting White'—maybe because it didn't describe him, so he didn't mind it?","Seeing that Song Shuhang wasn't sent soaring into the sky, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet felt somewhat regretful.","\"The thoughts of the ruler of the Nine Worlds are too complex and unpredictable. It's impossible to fathom.\"","At this moment, Senior White Two's voice echoed in Song Shuhang's mind again, \"Don't overthink it... The one who attacked you is still the 'Heavenly Dao Molting Ball.'\"","Song Shuhang was taken aback.","Wasn't the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball still sealed?","\"The fat ball is in a unique state. Its remnants were born before the Heavenly Dao collapsed and were sealed by us. And after the complete collapse of the Heavenly Dao Ball, a new 'Heavenly Dao Molting Ball' was born in the world again to wander around. You can think of it this way: the previous Molting Ball wasn't entirely deceased, only half of it perished. This time, it's the other half of the molt left behind after its demise,\" Senior White Two explained.","The Heavenly Dao governed countless realms, so a complete molt wouldn't be so diminutive. In fact, in the obscure corners of every plane, new Heavenly Dao remnants could emerge at any moment. The quantity might not even be singular.","Unless he waited for the new Heavenly Dao to vindicate the Dao, he could sweep across countless realms and conceal the Heavenly Dao Molting again.","\"Not dead? Half dead, half alive?\" Song Shuhang gazed at the sky. As expected of the Wielder of the Will, he possessed numerous tricks up his sleeve.","\"Half dead, half alive, are you referring to Shuhang?\" The voice of the Heart Demon Sword emanated from the cocoon of virtue. Even encased in the cocoon, it refused to relinquish its role as a heart demon.","\"I'm not half dead. I'm as dead as it gets, down to just one head,\" Song Shuhang retorted.","\"Ah! He's dead! He's dead!\" While they conversed, Lady Onion's voice suddenly resonated.","Song Shuhang was perplexed.","When did Lady Onion become so immersed in character?","Did the trinkets on his person evolve toward actors?","\"It's crushed to death. No! It's crushed to death!\" Lady Onion exclaimed dramatically. She had been watching Song Shuhang's Profound Sage Speech and had been fine until now. Suddenly, the scene shifted, and she found herself in Song Shuhang's visual experience while getting crushed by the fat ball from another perspective. This pain was a hundred thousand times worse than when the green onion was unsheathed, and the green onion shoot fell.","What made Lady Onion feel even more despair was that she had experienced this before! Back then, she was in Song Shuhang's arms, being sliced into pieces and resurrected repeatedly.","But this time, she entered Song Shuhang's viewpoint and underwent the agony of being run over by the fat ball. Looking at the same event from a different angle was a novel experience!","Because she had lived through the original incident, Lady Onion knew well that this ordeal of being crushed to death wasn't just a one-time occurrence but an unending loop!","How cruel was the life of a green onion!","\"I'm joining in!\" Soft Feather chimed in excitedly. \"Ah! My whole body is being crushed! How miserable!\"","Song Shuhang stared at Soft Feather in bewilderment. He didn't detect any signs of 'pain' on Soft Feather's person.","Come to think of it, could the owner's pain be transferred to the ghost spirit? Had Soft Feather shifted her agony to the Heavenly Emperor?","On the other hand, Su Clan's Sixteen's cute visage was contorted, evidently enduring the pain.","\"That's why I told you not to watch the live broadcast,\" Song Shuhang sighed. He extended his hand, procuring the same type of sheet as the Almighty Merchant, wrapping Lady Onion, Su Clan's Sixteen, and Soft Feather, allowing them to recline.","\"Ah, he's resurrected! Who's the one who revived him?\" Lady Onion clutched the green onion shoot, screaming at the top of her lungs.","In the adjacent room, Senior Eternal Fire, who had just rushed over with enthusiasm and was about to meet his young friend Song Shuhang, stiffened slightly.","\"Hold on, the pain will pass,\" Song Shuhang consoled, helpless that his 'pain immunity' couldn't produce a vaccine to alleviate the pain for Su Clan's Sixteen and the others.","Seeing Sixteen endure the suffering and hearing Lady Onion's cries, he felt powerless.","\"Take them to the Inner World,\" Pavilion Master Chu suggested, her mind in a haze. \"The Living Spring can alleviate their mental anguish.\"","Song Shuhang's eyes brightened at this suggestion. \"The Living Spring can alleviate mental pain to some extent!\"","\"Senior Song, I don't need it,\" Soft Feather waved it off. \"I don't feel pain at all.\"","\"Don't be complacent... The longer the painful experience, the more excruciating it becomes,\" Song Shuhang cautioned. He reached out, gently placing Su Clan's Sixteen, Soft Feather, and Lady Onion into his Inner World and situated them alongside Pavilion Master Chu's main body, who was busy blowing bubbles.","The White Dragon opted to stay behind, transitioning from Su Clan's Sixteen's neck to Song Shuhang's. For the moment, she preferred facing Pavilion Master Chu's foolishness rather than entering the Inner World.","She would rather endure Pavilion Master Chu's ineptitude.","\"In the Confucianism world, which is clearly isolated, Tyrannical Song can still develop his own small world? Is his small world that formidable?\" King Kun, residing within Yuan Zi's consciousness, pondered and made a note of this information.","It was a 'what if' statement. If they ever needed to target Tyrannical Song in the future, they'd have to find a way to imprison this unique small world. Otherwise, Tyrannical Song could employ this small world for offense, defense, and escape. Therefore, they needed a strategy to limit it!","After sealing his Inner Small World, Song Shuhang exhaled deeply. \"The new Heavenly Dao Molting Ball is a headache.\"","\"A new Heavenly Dao?Molting Ball? Molting Ball Two?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired.","The White Dragon inquired, \"Do you have a plan?\"","\"No, but I have experience. Perhaps I can use the same trick again,\" Song Shuhang mused while extending his hand to touch the sealing pillar that enclosed the Confucian Classic, which restrained the fat ball boss.","There appeared to be some kind of fate between the sealing pillar and the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball.","History was, at its core, a recorder.","Perhaps Heavenly Dao Molting Ball Two was destined to be sealed within the fat ball boss's pillar?","\"However, to seal the Heavenly Dao Molting Ball, I'll need cooperation from someone,\" Song Shuhang contemplated.","Boom!","Just as he pondered, a violent tremor shook the world outside the golden lotus.","\"I implore you to open your eyes and cease being so oblivious! The Tyrannical Song you seek is right here, within the scholarly faction! So, cease chasing me!\" A thunderous voice echoed from beyond the White Cloud Academy and reverberated into the world of the golden lotus."]},{"number":2475,"title":"Chapter 2475 Broken Formation!","paragraphs":["\"Damn it, stop chasing me. I already said, Tyrannical Song is down there. What does it have to do with me if you want to find Tyrannical Song?\" The thunderous voice roared angrily.","'This voice? Hold on, my main body is coming!' The divine sense within Yuan Zi's body, belonging to King Kun, heard this voice and became distressed.","'Main body, please don't come!'","Tyrannical Song was clad in divine gear while accompanied by more than five Immortals. It was a lethal team, and anyone approaching would meet their doom!","\"Huh? Is that Senior King Kun?\" Song Shuhang listened closely and identified the owner of the voice.","Senior King Kun's voice was quite distinctive and highly recognizable.","However, why was King Kun here?","It seemed like he was being pursued.","Furthermore... just now, King Kun had shouted, 'Tyrannical Song is in the scholarly faction.'","'Did the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball locate Senior King Kun through remote divination and chase him all the way here?' Song Shuhang did some mental calculations and formed a hypothesis.","\"Senior King Kun? I remember! This senior once challenged his teacher... Our teacher battled with him for a full day and night and used it as a teaching tool by projecting the fight to the scholarly faction. It demonstrated the combat methods among Immortals. Additionally, our teacher experimented with several new spells on him.","\"Right, Senior King Kun's exploits are still documented in our scholarly textbooks,\" Seventh Senior Brother Chi Zi pondered.","'I don't care about my reputation!' King Kun's consciousness within Yuan Zi's body roared in frustration.","Originally, it had battled the Scholarly Sage for a whole day and night while earning recognition from the myriad worlds. After all, not many could engage the Scholarly Sage in combat for an entire day and night during the ancient Undying battle.","It hadn't expected that the Scholarly Sage would use it as teaching material to instruct his disciples while battling. Moreover, it was recorded in textbooks.","Darn it, it had to find a way to erase its presence from the Confucian textbooks!","...","...","\"Somebody is chasing after King Kun... King Kun is a veteran Immortal, incredibly powerful. Who could possibly be pursuing him all over the world?\" Second Senior Brother Wen Zi frowned. Moreover, judging by King Kun's recent shout, the formidable entity chasing him seemed to be targeting 'Tyrannical Song'?","\"Instruct all members of the scholarly faction to retreat to the Golden Lotus World!\" Third Senior Brother Yan Zi calmly ordered.","The opponent was after Tyrannical Song, so there might be a fierce battle ahead. In this situation, the Golden Lotus World's protective effect would come into play. With the Golden Lotus World shielding them, the scholarly faction would be invincible no matter what peril they faced!","\"If my deduction is correct, it's probably the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball,\" Song Shuhang calmly analyzed.","At the same time, he reached into his Inner World and retrieved the 'sealing pillar' containing the Confucian Classics.","In full view of everyone, Song Shuhang's hands began to rub the sealing pillar. His long hair transformed into twenty hands, all rubbing vigorously against the pillar.","With each stroke of the twenty-two palms, a seven-colored light emanated.","The sealing pillar containing the Confucian Classics trembled continuously.","Did Song Shuhang's palm strokes somehow enhance it?","'Has my main body been overtaken by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball?' King Kun's wisp of consciousness was infuriated.","'Moreover, is Tyrannical Song trying to unseal it? Wait, that's not right; it's clearly strengthening the seal!' It couldn't fathom Tyrannical Song's intentions.","\"No, time is too pressing.\" Song Shuhang let go of the sealing pillar.","To establish a rapport with the sealing pillar, he would need to practice the Blade Nurturing Technique for at least a full day and night. If the time was too short, it would be ineffective.","He had no choice but to temporarily abandon the idea of using the sealing pillar to bind the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","In that case, he would have to resort to the Artificial World Unknown White 1-33 Sealing method. Originally intended for sealing the clone of the fat ball boss, it now appeared necessary for another ball.","Although the situation was dire, Song Shuhang remained unfazed.","His Inner World was still resolute, and Senior White Two's consciousness was right beside him to provide a deep sense of security.","\"What's happening outside?\" the White Dragon raised her head and inquired.","\"That's right.\" Senior Eternal Fire stepped forward from behind and responded, \"The entity suspected to be the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball is still pursuing Senior King Kun. It's as if it has identified King Kun as Shuhang. This gives our scholarly faction enough time to retreat.\"","Having said that, True Monarch Eternal Fire extended his hand and projected the outside world's situation into the Golden Lotus World.","Outside the scholarly faction's defensive barrier, a pitch-black liquid sphere was relentlessly chasing King Kun.","The liquid metal sphere employed a straightforward and brutal attack method: it transformed into a terrifying water curtain that continually enveloped King Kun, intent on engulfing him entirely.","King Kun evaded constantly while launching Dao techniques from his body that bombarded the liquid metal sphere. However, his attacks were all absorbed by the water curtain of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. In fact, this Heavenly Dao Molt Ball could even regurgitate a portion of the absorbed Dao techniques.","During this time, King Kun attempted to break through the scholarly faction's sect protective formation.","However, the strength of the scholarly faction's sect protective formation exceeded King Kun's expectations. This formation had been reinforced by someone and possessed the power of an Immortal. Moreover, those who covertly reinforced the sect protective formation were orthodox Confucian cultivators.","At some point, another Immortal had appeared in the scholarly faction?","Additionally, after four of the 13 Tribulation Transcenders had been resurrected, they had also been repairing the sect's protective array.","Under the dual reinforcement, King Kun was unable to break through the scholarly faction's formation for the time being and couldn't lure the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball to the scholarly faction.","King Kun was furious and wished he could swallow Tyrannical Song, digest him, and then extract him to fertilize the flowers!","\"We should document this scene. By doing so, before the four of us dissipate, we can weaken the influence of the laws here and replenish our scholarly teaching materials database,\" Second Senior Brother Wen Zi said gently.","The scholarly faction had undergone several calamities, and their library of teaching materials was significantly depleted. During this period, the four of them had been frantically replenishing their database. Before they vanished, they wanted to leave behind even more precious knowledge and wealth for the scholarly faction.","\"I've been recording since the beginning,\" Senior Eternal Fire nodded slightly.","\"That's right, why didn't I think of that!\" Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He was someone with disciples, and he would undoubtedly need to impart various knowledge to them in the future.","In the past, he hadn't thought to secretly record battle scenes while facing formidable adversaries. How much knowledge and?teaching material had he squandered?","Knowledge was also wealth.","Boom!","At that moment, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball suddenly exerted a hidden force and increased its speed several times over before crashing into King Kun's body.","King Kun's massive form collided with the scholarly faction's protective formation and spat out... a plethora of treasures!","These treasures scattered on the ground, gleaming brightly.","These were all the precious collections of King Kun, stored within his belly's spatial domain. However, they had been forcefully ejected by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Crack!","At the same time, the scholarly faction's sect protective formation could no longer hold and shattered.","King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball crashed into the scholarly faction!"]},{"number":2476,"title":"Chapter 2476 Seize the Opportunity!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang's gaze remained fixed on the projected image as he searched for an opportunity.","If he could seize this chance, he intended to try and seal the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.'","When he saw King Kun vomit up a plethora of precious treasures onto the ground, Song Shuhang's eyes lit up. It wasn't because of greed, but rather the recognition of an opportunity to confront the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball' effectively.","The treasures scattered on the ground were part of the collection of the Immortal King Kun. Even through the screen, their immense value was evident. If he managed to use them judiciously... he could definitely inflict severe damage on the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball'!","Even if the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball' was made of liquid metal, it wouldn't escape being sealed after suffering severe injuries!","This was an opportunity—an opportunity to deal with the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.'","\"By the way, Senior White, are you still interested in the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball'?\" Song Shuhang discreetly contacted Senior White Two in his mind.","Senior White Two replied, \"Not interested. I already have a portion of the 'Molt Ball' that can be used for experiments.\"","Moreover, as long as he replenished his spirit stones, the consumed 'Molt Ball' could regenerate. It was an experimental product that could be repeatedly divided, so he had no concerns about running out of spirit stones. At this moment, he had no particular interest in the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball' outside the scholarly faction.","\"Senior White, when I go out to confront the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball'... can you watch over me from afar? Resurrection arrays are quite costly, and we should avoid using them needlessly,\" Song Shuhang suggested.","Senior White Two was left momentarily speechless.","No, Tyrannical Song was fully aware that venturing out to confront the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball' was quite likely to result in his demise.","\"Since you know there's a possibility of dying, why go out at all?\" Senior White Two reminded him, \"As long as you stay within the Golden Lotus World, the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball' won't be able to detect you, and King Kun won't be able to find you. If he can't find you, he'll eventually depart.\"","\"But the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball' remains a significant threat. As long as it exists, it will persistently divine my location from afar and seize any opportunity to eliminate me. Therefore, while Senior King Kun is preoccupied, I must try to seal the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball' and eliminate this future threat,\" Song Shuhang explained calmly. \"Moreover, there are numerous precious treasures in that area. If we miss this opportunity, we may never find such a shop again!\"","Upon hearing this, Senior White Two softened his stance. Song Shuhang was already quite destitute.","\"Very well, I will monitor you from a distance. Place your head into the Inner World, and my main body will provide you with the ultimate defense,\" Senior White Two agreed.","As long as his head remained intact and he possessed the Scholarly Sage's blood for the recovery of crucial treasures and organs within his body, Song Shuhang could be resurrected at any time.","\"Thank you, Senior White!\" Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude.","In the next moment, right in front of everyone, Song Shuhang detached his own head.","Upon seeing this, Lady Onion, who resided in the Inner World, experienced a mixture of pain and amusement—Song Shuhang, you've come to this point as well!","\"What?\" The White Dragon, who was wrapped around his neck, lost her support and expressed her displeasure.","\"I'm handing my head over to Senior White to add an ultimate defense,\" Song Shuhang replied.","He extended his hand and sent his head into the Inner World.","The White Dragon immediately deduced Song Shuhang's intentions.","\"Of course,\" Song Shuhang's navel made a sound.","After losing his body and acquiring a wooden body, he gained the ability to use his eyes and navel as his mouth.","After using the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique to regenerate his body, he seemed to retain a portion of this ability. He didn't inherit the ability to use his chest as a mouth, but he retained the ability to make sounds through his navel.","\"It's a rare opportunity. If possible... I hope to take care of the 'Heavenly Dao Molt Ball' today,\" Song Shuhang continued.","In the Inner World, the hamster carried Song Shuhang's head and moved it into the world of the black lotus, sending it to Senior White Two for enhanced defense.","\"Lady Onion, I want to borrow the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber?for this occasion,\" Song Shuhang's navel spoke again.","Facing such a formidable opponent as the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, he couldn't afford to be careless.","\"Of course,\" Lady Onion replied, her voice trembling slightly.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber emitted a melodious phoenix cry as it transformed from its miniature form and landed securely in Song Shuhang's hand.","\"Senior Chu, please stay here for a while... Your hair is radiating energy,\" Song Shuhang remarked.","Pavilion Master Chu consented with a nod.","\"I'll lend you the White Dragon,\" Su Clan's Sixteen interjected, her tone slightly begrudging.","\"Excellent!\" Song Shuhang accepted with a smile.","The White Dragon, on the other hand, was at a loss for words.","\"Senior Song, may I accompany you to confront these formidable adversaries? Now that the Heavenly Dao has collapsed, there's no need to conceal your strength, right?\" Soft Feather, who was reclining nearby, proposed.","Outside, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was locked in combat with King Kun, and Song Shuhang was contemplating intervention. He didn't want to miss such a grand spectacle.","\"I'll bring Soft Feather along with me. You should stay in the Inner World,\" Song Shuhang cautioned.","Soft Feather submerged half of her face in the living spring.","\"Senior Turtle, would you like to join me in confronting these formidable adversaries? Now that the Heavenly Dao has crumbled, there's no need to conceal your strength, right?\" Song Shuhang directed his gaze toward Senior Turtle.","\"Next time. My master sealed my realm,\" Senior Turtle replied, waving its forelimbs.","Indeed, it was time to seek out the Great Northern Emperor to undo the seal on its realm.","Crash!","At the same time, the hamster returned carrying Song Shuhang's head.","Now, Song Shuhang's ebony hair, fortified by Senior White Two's mystical technique, began to emit a silvery radiance. Pavilion Master Chu's hair was similarly coated with a layer of silver, indicating that she had also been blessed by Senior White Two.","\"By the way, Tyrannical Song, my master requested that I lend you this Immortal Shuttle as well,\" the hamster stated as it handed over the 'Myriad World Piercing Shuttle.'","Should Song Shuhang find himself reduced to just his head, this shuttle would enable him to escape with his head intact.","\"Thank you, Hamster,\" Song Shuhang gratefully acknowledged.","\"No need for gratitude,\" the hamster responded while elegantly flicking its crimson cape.","\"Then, I'm off!\" Song Shuhang declared with determination.","With a mere thought, his head autonomously lifted and emerged from the Inner World.","Nonetheless, he didn't seal off the passage to the Inner World. Instead, he retrieved a Sage Seal Wooden Saber and handed it to Senior Eternal Fire.","This way, the exit to the Inner World could be temporarily maintained.","This served as an additional contingency plan that Song Shuhang had devised for himself.","On the projected screen, King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball continued their battle within the confines of the scholarly faction.","\"Senior Eternal Fire, is there a way to transport me directly to the vicinity of that treasure pile via the world of the Golden Lotus?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"Let me attempt it,\" True Monarch Eternal Fire replied while nodding in agreement.","Under True Monarch Eternal Fire's guidance, the world of the Golden Lotus created a fist-sized opening near the location of the 'treasures.'","Song Shuhang assumed his immortal form to conceal his presence and quietly exited."]},{"number":2477,"title":"Chapter 2477 Reversing Karma through Overdraft","paragraphs":["'I, the resourceful Song Shuhang, have returned!'","Song Shuhang silently thought to himself.","Meanwhile, his ethereal smoky form spread out, discreetly gathering all the treasures scattered about. Even though these were treasures expelled by King Kun, Song Shuhang was a man, and cleanliness was the least of his concerns when surrounded by a trove of valuable items.","Each item strewn across this land was of the highest quality, worthy of collection by immortal cultivators.","However, Song Shuhang was about to spend them all!","Oh my, it's heart-wrenching.","Especially considering that these treasures had already fallen into his grasp.","Once in his possession, these treasures would be entirely his... This was worlds apart from spending someone else's money! If he were to splurge them all at once, it would undoubtedly go down in history as Song Shuhang's most extravagant spending spree!","\"These treasures hold significant value,\" the voice of White Dragon Sister chimed in.","\"Precisely, King Kun has quite the discerning eye,\" Pavilion Master Chu agreed.","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and gritted his teeth.","Within his smoky form, a pair of hands materialized, and he initiated the secret technique, Divine Strike.","If he allowed White Dragon Sister and Pavilion Master Chu to continue their conversation, his determination would undoubtedly waver, and he might flee with the treasure and miss the prime opportunity to vanquish the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Men must be ruthless with themselves!","When it's time to make a decision, act resolutely!","The treasures enshrouded by the smoky haze gravitated toward Song Shuhang's awaiting hands.","The first treasure was a silver page inscribed with cryptic symbols.","This particular treasure was the lightest and swiftest.","Its flight speed outpaced all others, eagerly hurling itself into Song Shuhang's 'pay-to-win strike.'","Just as it was about to plunge into the radiant sphere of the 'pay-to-win strike,' Song Shuhang abruptly clasped his hands together, forcefully interrupting the ritual.","The silver page gently descended into his palm.","Simultaneously, information regarding the secret appraisal technique flooded Song Shuhang's mind. Moments ago, when the silver page was about to join the 'pay-to-win strike,' it grazed Song Shuhang's fingertip, inadvertently activating the secret appraisal technique.","[Secret Treasure - Karma Book Remnant Page: The Karma Book is a supreme divine tome that records the mysteries of the law of karma. Each page catalogues various karma forces. This page documents the reversal of karma—overdraft karma, where the effect precedes the cause! Holding this page bestows the power to reverse karma!] A high-level appraisal notification materialized in his thoughts.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Don't assume you can obscure your true nature just by adopting grandiose names like 'Reversal of Karma' and 'Overdraft of Karma'!","This was undeniably a credit card model—spend first, then pay back! Overdraft consumption, mortgaging one's future!","But... I love it.","For someone like Song Shuhang, whose savings couldn't even last until the end of the month, overdrawing karma's power was indeed a necessity. Although it entailed borrowing from the future, it at least ensured his survival until month's end!","\"No more splurging?\" White Dragon Sister inquired, her tone tinged with confusion.","\"I won't splurge any further. It was merely a momentary indulgence; I must exercise restraint,\" Song Shuhang declared, deftly transferring the remaining treasures to his Inner World.","In this moment, Song Shuhang was richer than he had ever been before!","This marked the zenith of his life!","Simultaneously, he clutched the Karma Book in his hand. With this treasure, he could explore yet another avenue!","...","...","\"My treasures!\" In the sky, King Kun, locked in combat with the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, seethed with fury.","Even as the treasures expelled from its belly were hurled away by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, King Kun continued to intermittently monitor the treasures scattered on the ground during the battle. The whereabouts of the Kun's wealth were inseparable from the Kun's heart.","King Kun had been searching for the opportunity to reclaim the treasures it had disgorged. Every item contained within its belly represented its hard work and was steeped in memories.","Yet now, its treasures were enveloped by a shroud of black smoke and pilfered.","\"Die, you thieving scoundrel!\" King Kun whirled around and charged toward Song Shuhang's location. The liquid metal ball followed in hot pursuit.","One Kun and one ball, like two massive meteors, hurtled earthward in succession.","Simultaneously, both activated Spatial Imprisonment.","King Kun aimed to prevent the smoky cloud from escaping through spatial means.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball aimed to prevent King Kun from fleeing.","Faced with the impending collision of two peerless titans, Song Shuhang remained remarkably composed.","Since time immemorial, who had escaped death?","When one was unafraid even in the face of death, tranquility naturally prevailed within.","\"There's a spatial fluctuation.\" Song Shuhang covertly communicated with the Inner World. As expected, the Inner World was already in a state of panic.","\"Pavilion Master Chu, Sister White Dragon, assist me in buying some time,\" he swiftly requested.","\"It's impossible. My single strand of hair cannot withstand the combined onslaught of King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball,\" Pavilion Master Chu lamented.","Song Shuhang's smoky form dispersed and revealed his true self. \"No need for a head-on confrontation. Just take my body and evade for a while. I require time to prepare my ultimate move.\"","\"If it's only for a brief period, that's manageable,\" Pavilion Master Chu replied, her bewildering fur whirling rapidly as she dragged Song Shuhang's body and teleported to evade King Kun's attack range.","White Dragon Sister on his neck initiated a magical technique. Dozens of supportive and speed-enhancing formations descended upon Pavilion Master Chu and Song Shuhang. Subsequently, her body melded into Song Shuhang's, and a dragon bone emerged on his back.","White Dragon Sister's existence mirrored that of the virtuous lamia, allowing her to partially merge with Song Shuhang's body, akin to the virtuous lamia.","She controlled Song Shuhang's body and cooperated seamlessly with Pavilion Master Chu.","The two immortal ladies worked in unison and enabled Song Shuhang's body to gracefully evade the relentless attacks.","For the time being, King Kun and the liquid metal ball were powerless against Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang permitted his body to be guided while in flight. In his left hand, he clutched the Karma Book's remnant page, and in his right hand, he wielded the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","\"Karma Blade!\" He covertly executed this peerless saber technique.","Threads of karma materialized in Song Shuhang's eyes, extending outward from his body.","Simultaneously, the remnant page of the Karma Book emitted a faint glow.","Overdraft karma!","Enjoy the fruits now, pay for the consequences later.","In other words, if Song Shuhang's maneuver proceeded smoothly, guided by the power of the Karma Book, he could borrow the strength of senior cultivators in advance and subsequently make amends.","Success!","When the Karma Blade Technique coalesced, Song Shuhang knew that it had succeeded.","Once again, he established connections with several prominent figures.","The first karmic connection was to Senior White.","The second karmic connection was to Senior White Two.","The successful link between the two Senior Whites marked a propitious start!","It boded well for the future!"]},{"number":2478,"title":"Chapter 2478 Overdrafting Is Like Swiping a Card, Like Spending Someone Else’s Money","paragraphs":["The third karmic line pointed toward the divine third eye on Song Shuhang's forehead and then extended all the way to the 'Three-Eyed Youth'.","The fourth karmic thread penetrated Song Shuhang's body and connected to his ghost spirit. It then extended from the ghost spirit, took two turns in the air, and finally led to a striped dragon coiled around a pillar. This line was the most convoluted and possessed the greatest number of twists.","The fifth karmic line, connecting to an object that surprised Song Shuhang, pierced his non-rainbow-colored ordinary kidney. It then extended and connected to the Ball Shuhang, who was preparing to challenge the myriad worlds on Mars!","The sixth karmic line embedded itself in Song Shuhang's dantian and stuck to Lady Long Luo of the Black Dragon World.","Five of the six karmic threads had thus ensnared the four rulers Song Shuhang knew and the Heavenly Dao of the Black Dragon World.","But this was not the end!","The seventh karmic line pierced into Song Shuhang's Scholarly Sage's Eye, then branched out, connecting to five Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders within the scholarly faction. Some branches even extended into the void with no end in sight. Among them, the one stuck on Yuan Zi was particularly special, as it split a second time! The Scholarly Sage's karmic line had the most forks.","The eighth karmic thread passed through Song Shuhang's shadow and connected to Yu Rouzi. It eventually linked to The Celestial Thearch on Spirit Butterfly Island while sticking to Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly beside her as a bonus.","Last time, when Song Shuhang annihilated Senior More than One in the Black Dragon World, he only had seven karmic threads. This time, the number of karmic threads he wielded was even greater and stronger.","And eight was not Song Shuhang's limit.","The ninth karmic thread emerged, sticking to the hair of Pavilion Master Chu on Song Shuhang's head. It connected to Pavilion Master Chu's main body in the Core World through the hair, and then linked Pavilion Master Chu Two as well. But the karmic line did not stop there; it passed through the two Pavilion Masters and pierced into the void, sticking to an illusory figure.","Pavilion Master Chu's hair was speechless.","\"Are we not done yet?\" asked White Dragon Sister.","\"The opponent is the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. I need to overdraft as much as I can!\" Song Shuhang gritted his teeth.","Nine was not his limit; he could still overdraft one more karmic thread!","Another karmic thread, trembling, emerged from Song Shuhang's body—this was a loaned power, which he would have to repay in the future. Ten karmic threads had reached the limit of Song Shuhang's credit value.","But overdrafting was like swiping a card... It felt like spending someone else's money, with no pain in the spending!","The karmic thread quivered and reached out to White Dragon Sister.","\"Don't stick to me. Has my main body not revived yet?\" White Dragon Sister, though unable to see the karmic line, could vaguely sense it.","If her main body were to revive, Song Shuhang could indeed stick to her. If she were willing, Song Shuhang could access the power of more than half of the dragon clan through her.","\"Then, who should the tenth one stick to?\" Song Shuhang pondered rapidly.","Who else was there to stick to on him?","Words from Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet would overlap with Senior White Two.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber would overlap with Striped Dragon Two.","\"Right, Senior Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword,\" Song Shuhang declared.","Through the Heart Demon, he could connect to its main body, and with luck, he could even stick Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven to it.","Song Shuhang focused, and the tenth karmic thread trembled as it reached out to the sword. But halfway through, the tenth karmic thread suddenly lost its strength and drooped. It felt on Song Shuhang's +10 divine sneaker.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","But at that moment, he no longer had time to prepare.","\"Hurry up! My energy is depleting very quickly,\" urged Pavilion Master Chu's hair.","Behind him, King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball closely followed, ready to catch up to Song Shuhang and annihilate him at any moment.","\"He's here!\" Song Shuhang exclaimed softly.","The Karma Blade, through the method of reversing and overdrafting karma, stuck to the ten big shots and entered the charging stage.","This was also where the Karma Blade needed improvement. The big shots, scattered across the myriad worlds, were bound by karma, and then they returned power to Song Shuhang. Ultimately, it took time for these powers to converge.","In a normal battle, if Song Shuhang were to use this move alone, he would be destroyed by the enemy before he could finish charging. Fortunately, he had many accessories on him, which could buy him some time.","...","...","The karmic line attached to Senior White was the first to return the fruit—Song Shuhang's debt to Senior White increased yet another layer. Senior White had transmitted the special effect of the Trans-Spatial Walk of the disaster giant turtle's race, along with a blessing.","The Trans-Spatial Walk allowed Song Shuhang's Karma Blade to operate without spatial limitations, and that blessing was like a royal decree. Under this blessing, Song Shuhang's next move would represent Senior White's move, as if carrying out a mandate from him.","Then came Senior White Two. As the sole ruler of the Netherworld, Senior White Two bestowed upon Song Shuhang a brand-new law of destruction—this was a destructive force crafted for the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. Senior White Two had been studying the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball recently. This destructive force was a new law of the Netherworld developed for the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","The Three-Eyed Youth gladly accepted Song Shuhang's karma. He returned a portion of the law of plunder to Song Shuhang's karma blade. This was the law he had extracted from the betting ceremony. As long as Song Shuhang could defeat his opponent, he would be able to plunder an item from them. This item could be anything, even concepts like lifespan, sword intent, and saber intent.","The fourth karmic line, with numerous twists and turns, connected to Song Shuhang's ghost spirit, then through the ghost spirit to a braided girl, then through the girl to a dead fairy, and finally through the dead fairy to the big boss Striped Dragon Two.","Striped Dragon Two sighed. Ever since Song Shuhang borrowed strength from it through Cheng Lin, it knew this matter wasn't over. Honestly, it really didn't want to lend its strength to Song Shuhang. Because Song Shuhang wasn't handsome enough, he didn't meet its aesthetic standards.","However, with Cheng Lin's face, and Song Shuhang's current status as Cheng Lin, the big boss Striped Dragon Two begrudgingly returned a strand of strength to Song Shuhang. This strand of strength wasn't very strong, but it could activate the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber in Song Shuhang's hand and fully unleash its power!","The fifth karmic strand transmitted the power of Ball Shuhang back to him. Ball Shuhang naturally wouldn't refuse the request from the 'main body'.","It directly used the Sealing Technique it prided itself on to enhance the sealing power of Song Shuhang's saber move. This saber seal was divided into two layers. The first layer was designed to weaken the enemy's strength, while the second layer aimed to completely seal the defeated enemy into a pillar!"]},{"number":2479,"title":"Chapter 2479 We Are Born of the Same Root, Why Torment Each Other So Rashly?","paragraphs":["Lady Long Luo, attached to the sixth karmic line, provided Song Shuhang with substantial mental energy support, as she had done previously.","Isolated in the Black Dragon World and separated from the present world, the only power she could lend to Song Shuhang was a considerable boost in mental energy to fortify his mind.","However, the mental energy she returned was precisely what Song Shuhang needed at that moment. With his current realm and mental energy, he was utterly incapable of controlling the power from the ten karma feedbacks.","He had overextended himself this time.","Without enhancing his mental energy, Song Shuhang would have collapsed under the impact of the big shots' power before even unleashing the Karma Saber Technique.","As a Heavenly Axiom-level programmer, Madam Long Luo had always been meticulous in maintaining balance.","Thus, the power of the four rulers of the Netherworld, the equivalent power of the Heavenly Dao of the Black Dragon World, and Senior White's power had successfully converged!","The seventh karmic line, linked to the Scholarly Sage's eye, was activated for the second time. Last time, the Scholarly Sage's eye had initiated the 'cheat battle guidance' function, and this time was no different. The Scholarly Sage's eye fully engaged, bringing the Sage's battle experience to the forefront. This eye began methodically calculating the enemy's data, pinpointing the enemy, and instructing Song Shuhang on how, where, and when to strike with the Karma Saber Technique!","Additionally, this time the karma line connected to the Sage had a new development—it had branched!","The branched karmic lines adhered to the five 13 Tribulation Transcenders in the world of the golden lotus, as well as a mysterious entity lurking in the void. Song Shuhang surmised that these might be surviving Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction or perhaps disciples of another Sage.","From the five Tribulation Transcenders and these enigmatic entities, the branched karmic line received a myriad of secondary abilities like spiritual energy, Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha, scholarly righteousness, and poetry recitation—all linked to the scholarly faction.","More notably, the karmic line linked to the Tribulation Transcender Zi Yuan branched a second time and connected to another enigmatic existence in the void.","Due to this branching by proxy, Song Shuhang was unable to sense whom it connected to. Perhaps Tribulation Transcender Zi Yuan, like the Sage, had nurtured a prodigious disciple?","Moments later, an ability returned from this doubly branched Trapping Fruit Thread—the Heavenly Peng Escape Technique!","This Heavenly Peng Escape Technique, once bestowed upon Song Shuhang, would enhance his strength and increase his speed! Combined with the Scholarly Sage's eye's effect, when Song Shuhang deployed the Karma Saber Technique, his choices would be more numerous, and the saber marks even more elusive!","\"It appears that Tribulation Transcender Zi Yuan has a disciple from the Tian Peng Race? Furthermore, this Tian Peng disciple likely possesses strength surpassing that of a Tribulation Transcender?\" Song Shuhang mused.","The scholarly faction's pedagogical prowess truly stood unrivaled. The Saint's teaching ability was peerless, and his disciples' teaching skills were equally formidable.","Given the opportunity, Song Shuhang yearned to study further within the scholarly faction to enrich his sparse knowledge and also learn how to cultivate his disciples effectively.","Simultaneously, in the world of the golden lotus, Yuan Zi's body quivered slightly.","King Kun's consciousness, hidden deep within Yuan Zi's consciousness, was bewildered.","It faintly sensed that Yuan Zi's body had just accepted a spell akin to a sacrifice, and mysteriously, some power had detached from Yuan Zi's body.","Yuan Zi's body couldn't resist this sacrifice because it was a karmic summoning from the Scholarly Sage!","What perplexed King Kun was that for some reason, a 'power' from his body was also being reflected out—since he resided within Yuan Zi's body, he couldn't resist the Scholarly Sage's karmic summoning either!","\"A sacrificial summoning from the Scholarly Sage? What from my body was reflected out?\" King Kun pondered while?furrowing its brow.","A saint's summoning... Wasn't that Tyrannical Song's summoning?","By its estimation, Tyrannical Song was likely the Scholarly Sage reincarnated!","\"What exactly was reflected from me?\" King Kun contemplated briefly. \"If it truly is something from my body that's being reflected, I just need to keep a close eye on Tyrannical Song. If he utilizes what I sent out, then it's confirmed—he is indeed the Scholarly Sage reincarnated!\"","...","...","With the support of the Scholarly Sage's eye, bolstered by the energy of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders and the Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha, Song Shuhang's aura and mental energy soared to their zenith.","Subsequently, the eighth karmic thread returned feedback—black-skinned Soft Feather, Soft Feather, the Celestial Thearch, and Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly. The entire family was neatly connected in a single line.","From the bodies of black-skinned Soft Feather, Soft Feather, and the Celestial Thearch, a Time Law was transmitted, enhancing Song Shuhang's saber—time is like a knife, each strike aging one further!","This time, the Celestial Thearch did not respond. She had blocked Song Shuhang for fifteen days, and during these fifteen days, she wouldn't transmit a single iota of energy or support to Song Shuhang.","Alongside this, a pure Profound Sage Power was also transmitted from Senior Spirit Butterfly. One shouldn't underestimate this energy from Senior Spirit Butterfly. His bloodline was unique; in the last experiment, his blood exhibited a slight inhibitory effect on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. Therefore, his energy also fortified Song Shuhang's capability to 'restrain' the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. Even the smallest mosquito is still flesh, and perhaps Senior Spirit Butterfly's energy would be the final straw breaking the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball!","After the Celestial Thearch, Pavilion Master Chu and Pavilion Master Chu Two transmitted the 'Laws of Life and Death'. Pavilion Master Chu's path was incredibly extreme, embodying both positivity and negativity, life and death. However, this Law of Life and Death wasn't all... Lurking behind the two Pavilion Masters Chu was a saber intent infused with the essence of parting.","This saber intent, in harmony with the power of the two Pavilion Masters, transformed into a saber intent and technique capable of 'severing life and death with a single strike'.","Song Shuhang's heart stirred, and he vaguely surmised the origin of this saber intent...","From then on, the nine great karmic ties merged into one!","What further astounded Song Shuhang was that the tenth karmic line, weakly dangling on his +10 sports shoes, also sent feedback!","The tenth karmic line passed through the +10 sports shoe and eventually extended all the way to Senior White Two's world of the black lotus and sunk into the sealed Heavenly Dao Molt Ball One.","Song Shuhang originally harbored no illusions about the tenth karma, as he was set to confront the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball Two. In that case, how could he receive karma feedback from the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball One?","But reality proved to be more astonishing than fiction.","From the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball One, the ability of a 'black hole' was transmitted to him—the very 'black hole' that had nearly devoured Song Shuhang last time.","This was a death trap for the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball Two!","At this moment, the ten great Karma forces intertwined into one.","Song Shuhang raised the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","Under the release of Striped Dragon Two's power, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, for the first time before the world, revealed its Dao Artifact's might!"]},{"number":2480,"title":"Chapter 2480 Was All This Within Your Calculations?","paragraphs":["The shadow of the Undying Phoenix blazed on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber that wrapped Song Shuhang in unquenchable fire and fortified his constitution.","The air turned arid under the flames of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. Moisture evaporated from the air, and the earth cracked open. Even King Kun felt his skin drying up as it lost its sheen.","The mere presence of the Dao artifact's power, not yet unleashed, was already intimidating!","Song Shuhang felt this saber strike was more powerful than the one that had obliterated the Demon Emperor last time. How much stronger it was, lay beyond his comprehension or estimation.","In any case, each saber move felt incredibly powerful to Song Shuhang. For him, there was no perceptible difference between a 20-digit spirit stone deposit and a 21-digit one. Nonetheless, a 21-digit deposit was surely more explosive, right?","Ultimately, he could only feel that this saber strike was stronger!","The Scholarly Sage's eye, at full power, locked onto both King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","If it were the Karma Blade from before, the Saint's Eye would have focused only on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. However, with deeper resources this time, the Saint's Eye's choice was naturally more daring!","As the eye of a great saint, it would not be limited to a choice between two. It sought to obliterate both enemies in one go!","In Song Shuhang's vision, the Scholarly Sage's eye began to calculate furiously, continuously adjusting the enemy's angle, predicting their next move and position, and forecasting their reaction and evasion strategies against the Karma Saber Technique.","Song Shuhang felt the temperature in his left eye rising. His eye socket was on the verge of igniting. Meanwhile, his brain couldn't process much more; the core of his mind was completely occupied by the Scholarly Sage's eye.","This sensation was indescribably wondrous!","After all, the experience gained from these calculations would become Song Shuhang's experience points, even melding into his instincts!","...","...","\"Shuhang, we're about to be caught up!\" Pavilion Master Chu warned.","She and Fellow Daoist White Dragon had already exerted their maximum effort.","Snap!","At that moment, Song Shuhang lightly flicked his finger, and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was summoned forth!","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was confused.","It had expected him to draw the sword. Why was it brought out?","However, there was no time for Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet to protest. Under Song Shuhang's guidance, it swiftly expanded into a colossal suppression monument. Its suppressive power enveloped King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball hardly considered Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet a threat and merely adjusted their angle to charge at Song Shuhang again.","\"Now!\" Song Shuhang's left eye emitted smoke, his eye socket charred black.","Even so, Fairy Creation couldn't remove Song Shuhang's eyes—the next moment was crucial. Even if Song Shuhang's brain burned, he had to wait for this saber strike!","Using the suppressive power of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and the calculations of the Saint's eye, King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had successfully entered the position calculated by the Saint's eye!","The moment to strike down King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball with a single slash had come!","\"Heavenly Peng Escape Technique!\" A pair of Flowing Light Sky Peng wings materialized on Song Shuhang's back as his form moved at the speed of lightning and darted towards King Kun.","\"F * ck, my escape technique!\" King Kun instantly recognized the escaping technique Song Shuhang employed.","At that moment, its heart was as tumultuous as a cursed roc!","The Heavenly Peng Escape Technique was a well-known escape technique in the cultivation world, not exclusively King Kun's. However, King Kun's version was modified, as it could transform from a kun to a roc, owning the Heavenly Roc True Body. The Heavenly Peng Escape Technique it executed was naturally distinctive.","These unique Flowing Light Sky Peng wings were a signature feature!","Why would Tyrannical Song use his escape technique?","As this thought crossed its mind, Tyrannical Song, with the divine speed of the Heavenly Peng Escape Technique, appeared beside it, wielding the 'Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber' ruthlessly!","\"Heavenly Peng Escape Technique!\" King Kun didn't hesitate and returned to its true form as a heavenly roc and veered to the side. Simultaneously, it cunningly exposed the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball to Song Shuhang's saber!","This was the tactic King Kun devised the instant Song Shuhang unsealed the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. It planned to use Tyrannical Song's saber to eliminate the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball behind it!","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, too, reacted instantly. Its body expanded wildly and transformed into a gigantic black hole that devoured everything around it, warping and absorbing even the light!","\"Karma Blade!\" Song Shuhang had only one thought left—wield the saber.","The Scholarly Sage's eye computed the ideal angle and timing for the attack.","At that moment, Song Shuhang's brain was completely overwhelmed, his mind blank. He firmly swung the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and delivered an exquisitely beautiful strike.","This blade was elusive yet strikingly brilliant.","As the saber struck, everything in the world, like Tyrannical Song's mind, became blank, leaving only the formidable saber mark.","Simultaneously, in everyone's eyes, Tyrannical Song's figure seemed to transform into another entity—an existence that eclipsed the world, just like this blade!","King Kun's escape and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball's transformation into a black hole were all within the calculations of the Scholarly Sage's eye!","Whether the data of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball or King Kun's strategies, Song Shuhang and the Scholarly Sage had corresponding data.","In the next moment, the ten strands of karma Song Shuhang had accumulated as a massive debt twisted into a saber intent and exploded according to the Sage's calculations!","King Kun believed it could dodge the blade, but it couldn't!","No matter how it executed the Heavenly Peng Movement Technique, it couldn't escape the range of the Karma Saber Move! The power of the Karmic Saber ignored 'spatial blockage', targeting King Kun's weakest and most fatal spot, striking down!","Even luck seemed to be on Tyrannical Song's side! Faced with a 'choose one of two' evasion angle, King Kun chose, but ended up in the wrong position.","\"Scholarly Sage!\" King Kun bellowed thunderously.","This sensation was all too familiar. Facing the Scholarly Sage back then, the Sage's final blow had left a deep scar in its heart. It couldn't evade, and its vulnerabilities were exposed to the opponent's attack!","From start to finish, everything was within the Sage's calculations.","\"Is this also within your calculations, Scholarly Sage?\" Then, King Kun's body was consumed by the Karma Blade.","On the other side, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball fared no better.","It had transformed into a black hole, while Tyrannical Song's saber flare also created a similar black hole. Though not as powerful as its own, it managed to resist and neutralize the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball's black hole.","Simultaneously, Tyrannical Song's saber transmitted the seal of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, the destructive law of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, the power to ignore spatial lock, the fearsome damage of the time law, the saber light capable of severing life and death, and the eternal fire of the Dao artifact itself!","In the next moment, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball Two followed the path of the Demon Emperor and King Kun... becoming the third VIP customer to fall under the Karma Blade!"]},{"number":2481,"title":"Chapter 2481 The Gaze of Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["Neither King Kun nor the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball could withstand this blade!","More tragically, this earth-shattering slash also harnessed their own power—they had unwittingly contributed to their own destruction!","The blade fell.","Song Shuhang's entire body seemed hollowed out, his arm holding the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber trembling slightly.","Simultaneously, hundreds of consciousnesses from across the myriad worlds traversed dimensions and zeroed in on the scholarly faction's location on Earth.","These powerful consciousnesses, initially focused on Mars and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's seven-day challenge, awaited the immortal battle's progress.","However, the terrifying power of the blade erupting from the Earth's scholarly faction startled the top beings of the myriad worlds.","As their consciousnesses arrived, they witnessed that world-shaking slash!","The power to annihilate everything merged into one, forging an indescribably fearsome blade light.","As the blade swept through, the consciousness of these top figures from the myriad worlds went blank, with only the horrifying scar of the blade lingering in their minds.","After a moment, the top experts of the myriad worlds began dissecting the nature of this blade.","\"This slash contained an unfathomable spatial force... It transcended the very concept of space, lending the blade its eerie power. Once you see the mark, it's already too late to dodge.\"","\"Destruction law, pure destructive law... And yet, this law feels alien. My own path involves destruction, but I can't grasp this law. It's as if this destructive law is not of our worlds—almost like it was newly created. Who is this person?\"","\"Is that blade a Dao weapon? Such awe it inspires—it's not just any Tribulation Transcender or Immortal divine weapon!\" someone noted, focusing on the divine blade in Song Shuhang's hand.","\"It's the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, a renowned Dao weapon in the cultivation world. Is he the new Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue? But that doesn't add up. The Eighth Cultivator should have only just inherited the saber.\" This person seemed well-versed in the lore of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","\"There's also that terrifying sealing power. When this blade strikes, many defensive techniques are restricted, sealed. Even with my mastery in sealing arts, escaping the seal within this blade would be impossible in a short time,\" a deep voice remarked.","\"A seal that even Venerable Violet Thunder can't break swiftly? That powerful?\" Venerable Purple Thunder, a true Immortal, had validated his path with the Dao of Sealing.","\"This blade bears the aura of the Scholarly Sage. I've clashed with a Sage before... and was soundly defeated then. This feeling is unmistakable,\" another top figure, previously bested by the Scholarly Sage, added.","\"Can we not bring that up?\" someone interjected.","\"Let's not dwell on it. We're still friends, after all.\"","In truth, at least a third of those present had once sparred with Saints. Everyone sensed the aura of the Scholarly Sage in the blade, yet there was an unspoken agreement not to mention it.","Unexpectedly, someone candidly brought this issue to light.","That really hit hard.","\"But we must confront this. The blade technique bore the Scholarly Sage's essence, and it annihilated two formidable enemies on the scholarly territory. This implies a deep connection with the scholarly faction. Perhaps...\"","It could even be the reincarnation of a legendary Sage from the scholarly faction!","This was a dire speculation.","In fact, the shadow cast by the Scholarly Sage on the myriad worlds, even compared to this year's sudden collapse of the Heavenly Dao, was more profound, its influence deeper.","\"It can't be the Scholarly Sage. Even a Sage wouldn't leave behind life-saving means in the hands of the Wielder of the Will. As I know, the Scholarly Sage's resurrection array has long been ineffective. The remnants of the Heavenly Court once gathered the Sages' resurrection arrays, but the Scholarly Sage's imprint has vanished. The Sage is truly gone.\"","These words seemed to confirm a possibility, while also offering a faint comfort.","\"Speaking of the ancient Heavenly City... I just realized something. This slash contained the power of time! I've battled the Heavenly Emperor from the ancient Heavenly City. I can't be mistaken about this temporal essence.\"","The conversation returned to discussing the blade.","\"How did he embed so many Dao and laws into a single slash?\"","\"It's likely the Law of Life and Death and the saber intent?of severing life and death... It's this saber intent that serves as the main attack! Such a terrifying technique.\"","\"No, the saber intent alone couldn't bear such immense, complex force. Even this saber intent is merely a part of the entire slash!\"","\"Apart from these powers, there was also the black hole before. Was it also created by this slash? Or does this slash have the ability to shift flowers and trees, while moving stars?\"","\"I sense karma. That black hole might be tied to karma.\"","\"So, who is this person?\"","\"Tyrannical Song on Mars has already displayed his strength. Now, such a fearsome figure emerges in the scholarly faction. The battle of the immortals grows increasingly intense.\"","\"The prowess shown by this scholar rivals that of Tyrannical Song on Mars.\"","\"It's not just a match; it's outright stronger. Honestly, who among us is confident enough to withstand that attack?\"","A silence fell among the crowd.","Everyone reminisced about the aftermath of the slash while calculating internally. Could they have countered that slash?","Could they withstand it?","As they pondered, they suddenly noticed Tyrannical Song on Mars turning his gaze towards the scholarly faction!","\"There he is. Tyrannical Song's gaze has shifted!\"","\"That slash must have caught Tyrannical Song's attention. He can't possibly ignore such a strike!\"","\"Tyrannical Song set a trap on Mars for the seven-day challenge of the myriad worlds. Meanwhile, in the scholarly faction's domain, this person unleashed a terrifying slash. Tyrannical Song and this individual are bound to confront each other!\" The top figures of the myriad worlds anticipated the situation eagerly.","Tyrannical Song, at the forefront of the eternal battle, versus the enigmatic masked expert in the scholarly faction's domain.","Who is the true master of the tides?","As they contemplated, suddenly, behind the masked expert in the scholarly faction's territory, a large cocoon emerged and opened.","Then, a beautiful fairy emerged from the cocoon.","\"Wait... Doesn't the fairy from the cocoon look familiar?\""]},{"number":2482,"title":"Chapter 2482 Good-looking Lower Face","paragraphs":["It wasn't just familiar; it was overwhelmingly familiar!","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had shown his divinity several times. In each 'divinity' segment, this fairy maiden outshone Tyrannical Song himself.","Her unparalleled beauty and temperament, the delicate forehead ornament, the charming beauty mark at the corner of her eye, and her commanding empress attire left an indelible impression.","Especially during the divinity segments, there was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, whose appearance was considered average in the cultivation world, serving as a backdrop to her radiance. Like green leaves against vibrant flowers, her beauty was further accentuated.","But why would Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's virtuous empress appear behind this mysterious masked cultivator from the scholarly faction?","A dreadful hypothesis emerged in the minds of the top beings of the myriad worlds.","Instinctively, they wanted to resist this notion.","But the cruel reality forcibly pried open their eyes with its merciless fingers, compelling them to witness the upcoming, heartrending scene!","In fact, 'reality' was the most illogical, cruel, heartless, and unpredictable existence in the myriad worlds, akin to the legendary ruler of the Netherworld.","...","Fairy @#%× elegantly crawled out of the cocoon.","The time she spent evolving was much shorter than Song Shuhang had expected. He thought he could finally recite his lines for about a week, but to his surprise, he lost the right to recite them after just three days.","At that moment, the virtuous lamia still wore the flat imperial crown and the golden dragon robe of the empress with her wings folded in front like a waist decoration.","Her lower hem was hidden by the dragon robe. What stage had her snake tail evolved to?","Song Shuhang didn't turn to look, aware of the many powerful gazes from the myriad worlds converging on him across dimensions.","He had to remain composed and not show alarm.","Even without looking, he could sense the changes in the virtuous lamia. After all, he was now a cultivator of the Seventh Stage at his peak, and he had the basic skills.","Behind him, under Fairy @#%×'s dragon robe, there was something new.","A pair of shoes!","The virtuous lamia's feet extended from the dragon robe, displaying shoes that matched the dragon robe.","Had she evolved legs?","In this aspect, the virtuous lamia had finally outpaced Pavilion Master Chu from the 'living spring,' having grown out her legs first.","Now, it was truly complete.","Song Shuhang felt a sense of fulfillment, as if he had finally maxed out a card after spending a fortune.","After the virtuous lamia appeared, she maintained a serious expression—ready to support Song Shuhang at a critical moment. Yet sometimes, as she persisted, she seemed to lose her drive.","Currently, she stood dominantly behind Song Shuhang, the light of virtue enveloping him, secretly restoring his expended energy and bolstering his aura.","\"Thank you, Fairy,\" Song Shuhang murmured softly.","\"It's time to show my real skills!\" the virtuous lamia muttered some cryptic lines, then lowered her head to look at Song Shuhang...","But she couldn't see him.","Apart from the 'real dragon' emblem on her chest, she couldn't spot Song Shuhang.","At that moment, Song Shuhang was directly below her, in her blind spot.","\"Tyrannical Song!\" Despite their reluctance, the top experts of the myriad worlds called out this name.","The virtuous lamia was behind, and Tyrannical Song was in front.","Under Tyrannical Song's mask, his left eye emitted a scarlet glow, with white smoke eerily emanating from it.","But if Tyrannical Song was on the scholarly faction's territory, then who was the Tyrannical Song on Mars?","The group of top beings from the myriad worlds shifted their gaze back to Mars.","There, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song stood with his arms crossed, the five Sage Names 'Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Demon, Tyrannical Dragon, and Tyrannical Annihilation' visible on his body.","\"Congratulations to the main body for annihilating two enemies with one saber!\" the Five-Consecutive Tyrant on Mars finally spoke.","As soon as he spoke, he revealed information that sent shivers down the spines of practitioners across the myriad worlds.","Scholar Yue Ruhuo stared in shock at the Five-Consecutive Tyrants. He had fought the other for a long time, using all?his methods, only to realize that his opponent was merely a clone!","Was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song truly this formidable?","\"No.\" Tyrannical Song nodded slightly, gently pushing up half of the mask to reveal the handsome lower half of his face—indeed, Song Shuhang's lower half was surprisingly stylish, his overall appearance marred only by the upper half.","\"I am Tyrannical Song.\" After a long ponder, Song Shuhang managed to squeeze out this introduction.","\"Eighteen years old, please guide me,\" the virtuous lamia recited in the most domineering tone yet with the least imposing lines.","\"If I have offended you in any way.\" Fairy Creation slowly appeared, standing at Song Shuhang's left side.","\"C-come and hit me?\" Black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from Song Shuhang's right side. Contrary to the virtuous lamia, she used the most timid tone to recite the most domineering lines.","Facing a crowd of top beings from the myriad worlds, Soft Feather felt her end was near. It was likely she wouldn't survive past tomorrow. Perhaps a curse-specialist would remotely set up an altar to hex her to death.","The top experts of the myriad worlds fell into silence.","Tyrannical Song's true self was unexpectedly humorous? Moreover, his aura felt less intimidating than that of his clone. It suggested that he might be more approachable.","\"If you want to challenge my true self, you must first get past me!\" declared the Five-Consecutive Tyrannical Ball Clone Shuhang on Mars.","He spread his arms and exuded a grand aura, \"If you can't even defeat me, you don't deserve to challenge my true self! Come, the seven-day challenge continues. Those who wish to challenge my true self, come at me! I'll be waiting on Mars!\"","Senior White, observing from afar, silently ceased his remote monitoring of Mars—he just couldn't bear to watch anymore.","Song Shuhang donned his mask once more.","The shattered defensive array of the scholarly faction began to regenerate, gradually concealing Tyrannical Song's figure and cutting off the intrusive gazes of the myriad worlds' top beings.","Song Shuhang returned the saber to its scabbard.","The next moment, the Plunder ability added by Senior Three-Eyed to his saber activated.","King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, already vanquished under the blade, were pressed into the void by the power of ten karmas, becoming targets of plunder.","\"Ancient language, draw over the ancient language!\" Song Shuhang hoped internally.","Senior Three-Eyed's plundering ability could even extract items from concepts. The ancient language was also a target of 'plundering.'","Alas... Song Shuhang's dream was not realized.","After activating the plundering ability, two spots of light, each carrying special characteristics, merged into Song Shuhang's body, akin to the end of a bet ceremony.","Subsequently, the techniques of Liquid Golden Body and True Heavenly Peng Evasion emerged in his mind."]},{"number":2483,"title":"Chapter 2483 Don’t worry about your money, I’ll exchange it for your life","paragraphs":["He managed to snatch the special abilities of King Kun and the liquid metal ball in one fell swoop!","Indeed, under the auspice of Senior White's fortune, Song Shuhang could only draw top-tier abilities. The notion of extracting something as basic as the Ancient Language Pack was mere wishful thinking.","This was the quandary: borrowed luck was not his own, restricting him to rigidly extract only the most elite items.","Moments later, Song Shuhang's once-blank mind began to assimilate these two cultivation techniques.","The True Heavenly Peng Evasion Technique, an elite escape technique of the VIP treasure light, boasted cooler effects and greater speed than the standard version.","After acquiring the True Heavenly Peng Evasion Technique, Song Shuhang's frozen brain gradually sparked to life. A bright idea struck him—he remembered when he wielded the 'Karma Saber,' the 'karmic line' on Tribulation Transcender Yuanzi's body had bifurcated twice, granting him the Heavenly Peng Evasion Technique. Now, having serendipitously obtained the True Heavenly Peng Evasion Technique from King Kun, he felt a connection between them.","Later, he would need to find an opportunity to hold Tribulation Transcender Yuanzi's hand and discreetly employ the secret appraisal technique.","At Song Shuhang's current realm, appraising a Tribulation Transcender-level expert would demand a steep price... likely several deep, bone-exposing wounds, plus a level of pain that could induce a soft hum.","This was well within his threshold of endurance.","Once the True Heavenly Peng Evasion Technique imprinted itself in Song Shuhang's mind, he rapidly grasped the escape technique, mastering King Kun's execution nuances.","Senior Three-Eyed's 'bet ceremony' was an unreasonably potent ability, related to the corresponding Heavenly Dao and qualifying as a Heavenly Dao-level function.","It directly extracted this escape technique from King Kun, transferring it to Song Shuhang—this process was a 'cut,' not a copy. One party would completely lose this ability, which would then be affixed to the other party.","Similarly, the Liquid Golden Body Technique from the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was also extracted.","Judging by the name alone, it was clear that this was a body tempering technique!","Following the Mutated Steel Hands Technique, the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, and the Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song now possessed the Liquid Golden Body Technique, assembling four grand protective divine techniques.","Once the True Heavenly Peng Evasion Technique was extracted, Song Shuhang needed some time to familiarize himself with it and digest the information in his mind.","The moment the Liquid Golden Body Technique merged into Song Shuhang's body, his body automatically began adapting to it.","Song Shuhang didn't need to consciously process the knowledge or adapt to the technique. Each cell in his body actively engaged, swiftly embracing the Liquid Golden Body Technique.","Aside from saber techniques, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song's strongest talent lay in body tempering.","The thickest armor, the most relentless beating. Then, when the enemy failed to breach his defenses, he would deliver the decisive slash!","A few breaths later, Song Shuhang's thoughts stirred, and the pitch-black metallic color of the Mutated Steel Hands Technique manifested on his body. Immediately afterward, he activated the Liquid Golden Body Technique.","The incredibly hard metal body melted, transforming into a pitch-black liquid metal mode!","When you're hard, you're also soft.","At this juncture, Song Shuhang's body exhibited both hardness and softness, significantly amplifying his resistance to attacks. In terms of head-on collisions, a soft body had an advantage over a rigid one.","Combining hardness and softness was the ideal model!","Song, Thicker and Tougher, Shuhang!","...","\"Senior Song, you look so familiar,\" Black-skinned Soft Feather quietly remarked.","Song Shuhang looked skyward, \"Ah, I know, Soft Feather.\"","This was the appearance of the fat ball in its human form. The pitch-black liquid metal body seemed to flow, conferring exceptional resistance to attacks!","As they spoke, the virtuous lamia suddenly extended?her hands. Her colossal form gently cradled Song Shuhang in her palms.","Simultaneously, the 'liquid metal mode' on Song Shuhang's body dissipated, and he slumped weakly into the virtuous lamia's hands.","Following the conclusion of the Karma Blade, the power from the ten karma feedback dissipated.","Without the support of the ten karma's power, Song Shuhang was as fragile as a lump of clay. Any powerful being could easily swat him into oblivion.","Not only that, but eight of the ten Karma strands wrapped around his right hand, leaving eight red Karma marks on his right arm.","This was the testament to the immense debt he had incurred by maxing out ten karma credits.","Originally, ten karma marks should have been imprinted on his right hand. However, one was connected to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball One had been obliterated, its remnants sealed in Senior White's residence. Thus, the karma debt naturally transferred to the more intact Heavenly Dao Molt Ball Two.","And then, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball Two... was immediately annihilated again.","With the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball Two gone and lacking a successor, Song Shuhang's karmic debt remained unsettled.","After using the enemy's resources to defeat them, he no longer had to repay the karma debt. Just thinking about it, the deal was worthwhile!","Song Shuhang gazed at the karmic debt on his right wrist and smiled, \"This sort of thing is indescribable.\"","As for the other karmic line without a debt, it belonged to the Scholarly Sage. The Sage was gone, and this karmic debt had lost its source. The disciples of the saints did not inherit this karmic debt either.","In other words, the next time he used the Karma Saber Technique, he could pull in the karma of the Scholarly Sage, guaranteeing a profit.","The debts to Senior White and Senior White Two could be deferred. After all, they were already heavily indebted, so no immediate concern there.","Negotiating with Madam Long Luo would be more straightforward.","The fat ball's clone... currently, it was Tyrannical Song's clone, so this debt could be postponed.","Conversely, finding a way to repay the 'karma debt' to big shots like Striped Dragon Two, Senior Three-Eyed, Pavilion Master Chu, and the Heavenly Emperor was crucial.","It was not difficult to borrow again!","\"Also, if the debt karma line doesn't leave any traces, it indicates that the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and King Kun are completely gone,\" Song Shuhang mused while sitting in the palm of the virtuous lamia and looking into the distance.","\"Nothing remains of the aura of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball or King Kun. That slash of yours just now was excessively powerful,\" the White Dragon responded.","The power of the ten Karma strands twisted into one, under the Scholarly Sage's eye's calculations, executed a perfect slash.","This slash's power was perfectly utilized on King Kun and the Heavenly Path Molt Ball. Not a single bit of energy in the blade went to waste. The Sage was definitely a perfectionist in his lifetime.","\"However, King Kun might not be entirely gone,\" Song Shuhang suddenly said.","\"With its strength, it couldn't possibly survive that slash,\" Pavilion Master Chu countered, somewhat dazed.","Song Shuhang's attention was fixed on the blacklist in his cultivation chat group.","In this list, the name of the deceased had been marked with (Killed in battle). However, there was no similar mark next to King Kun's name!"]},{"number":2484,"title":"Chapter 2484 Spending Wealth to Save Life","paragraphs":["The cultivation chat function didn't show a (deceased) status, so King Kun might be cautiously surviving in some unknown state!","\"If I hadn't added Senior King Kun as a friend long ago, I might have been duped too,\" Song Shuhang said with a faint smile.","Maybe because his body was weak, his signature gentle laughter sounded somewhat sinister with the absence of its usual energy.","Sword shuddered. \"Shuhang, your smile looks so evil.\"","Song Shuhang remained speechless.","\"I searched thoroughly and couldn't find King Kun,\" Pavilion Master Chu murmured.","Stone Tablet said, \"I got no response either. Could it be a network delay? Maybe King Kun died, but the signal hasn't reached you in time?\"","Song Shuhang nodded slightly. \"That's possible, but... let's prepare for the worst, just to be safe.\"","\"The spatial lockdown is starting to lift. Do you need me to add another one?\" asked White Dragon.","If the spatial lockdown dissipated, King Kun, lurking in the shadows, might seize the chance to escape through space.","\"Please, White Dragon, could you reinforce it?\" Song Shuhang strained to get his brain working.","His mind was still sluggish, a consequence of overload.","Creation Fairy carefully removed the scalding Scholarly Sage's eye from Song Shuhang's left eye socket—this time, she didn't replace it with Song Shuhang's actual eye, instead waiting for the heat in his eye socket to dissipate.","White Dragon's delicate claw gently tugged, and a 'Spatial Imprisonment' descended.","Song Shuhang's 'Inner World' immediately shrank back.","\"How do you plan to find King Kun?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired, puzzled.","\"Hmm, maybe send a direct message to Senior King Kun and have him come out himself?\" Song Shuhang suggested while swiping open 'King Kun' in his friend list to access the private chat.","Senior King Kun, hiding won't help you—I have your number.","The moment I call you, and the ringtone sounds, that's when you'll be exposed!","...","...","In the world of the golden lotus, the four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction and a group of higher-ups had watched the entire scene of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song slashing King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","Seeing the battle outside end, the four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction, Son of the Deep, Venerable Eternal Fire, and a group of deans from the scholarly faction emerged from the world of the golden lotus to greet Tyrannical Song.","Once the tale of Tyrannical Song's saber strike spreads, his status in the myriad worlds will likely rise to match that of the Scholarly Sage and the ancient Heavenly City's Heavenly Emperor!","Slaying two Immortals with one slash demonstrated that his combat prowess truly had the power to dominate the era. Coupled with the formidable clone on Mars, Tyrannical Song's name would resound throughout the upper echelons of the myriad worlds tonight.","The four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction led the way, with Yuan Zi rigidly following behind, all heading towards Song Shuhang's location.","At that moment, King Kun's consciousness within Yuan Zi's body suddenly received a message.","\"Hey, Senior King Kun, you okay? I know you're still fine, so stop hiding. Come out, let's have a proper chat.\" A private message from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","King Kun was speechless.","\"Not going to reply, Senior King Kun?\" Profound Sage Tyrannical Song asked politely.","King Kun sealed his lips tightly.","Am I crazy? Why should I reply to you? Pretending to be dead silently is the smart move.","\"Senior King Kun, no need for secrets. Look at your friend list; your name is still bright without a (deceased) mark. So, no need to hide anymore!\" Song Shuhang sent another message.","Damn it, if I had fully grasped this 'cultivation chat' function, I would have blocked you long ago.","In the void.","On the palm of the virtuous lamia, Song Shuhang sat cross-legged while resting his chin in his hand and gazing at the members of the scholarly faction.","Creation Fairy knelt behind him, holding his head—keeping it from falling.","Song Shuhang was truly weak, his body ready to collapse without support.","As the members of the scholarly faction approached, Song Shuhang's gaze shifted to Yuan Zi.","Yuan Zi remained expressionless, like a vegetative person.","\"Senior King Kun, long time no see,\" Song Shuhang said with a sudden smile while staring at Yuan Zi.","The four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction were taken aback and spun to look at Yuan Zi.","Even Creation Fairy looked at Song Shuhang in confusion.","\"You can fool anyone, but not my eyes,\" Song Shuhang pointed at his left eye. Under the mask, his left eye socket still emitted a red glow, with smoke continuously emerging.","Though the Scholarly Sage's eye had been removed by Creation Fairy, the high temperature had yet to dissipate. The continuously emerging tears instantly vaporized and turned into smoke squeezing out of the mask's holes.","A sense of shock exploded.","On the other side, Yuan Zi remained motionless.","The four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction simultaneously pressed their hands on Yuan Zi's body, each using their divine powers to check his condition.","But moments later, Zi Wen, Zi Yan, Zi Chi, and Zi Yu frowned.","They detected nothing unusual about Yuan Zi.","The four Tribulation Transcenders turned their heads and looked at Song Shuhang in confusion.","\"Don't worry, Senior King Kun's reluctance to come out is within my expectations,\" Song Shuhang gently tapped his knee with his left hand. \"That's why I asked Ms. Long Luo to develop a 'ringtone' feature for me. It's a simple plugin, plug-and-play. Senior King Kun, answer my call!\"","[Ding—Little Squirrel Notification: New function added to cultivation chat. VIP dynamic ringtone plugin online. Congratulations to 'Senior Administrator' Ah Bai, 'Fair-weather Friend' Heavenly Emperor, 'Crisp (crossed out) Head' Pavilion Master Chu, and 'Purple Grape' King Kun for earning closed beta access.]","King Kun was shocked.","Did versions update this fast?","\"A 'Seven Kills Song' from Senior Creation, dedicated to Senior King Kun!\" Song Shuhang said with a slight smile while opening King Kun's private chat and sending a voice and video chat request.","Through this closed beta function, King Kun's body would play the dynamic song of Dharma King Creation.","In this way, no matter where he hid, he would be inevitably exposed!","\"Kill, kill, kill ~ disloyal people... Kill, kill, kill! Unfilial people... Kill, kill, kill!\" A violent, ear-piercing, crazy song began to play.","However, the music didn't emanate from Yuan Zi's body, but rather exploded at the edge of the scholarly faction's defensive barrier.","That was the edge of the Spatial Imprisonment!","\"Senior King Kun, please wait!\" Song Shuhang laughed heartily. Although he was extremely weak at the moment, the pendants on his body weren't.","Whoosh ~~","As Song Shuhang finished speaking, a myriad of treasures suddenly shot out from the edge of the scholarly barrier.","The brilliance of countless treasures dazzled Song Shuhang's eyes.","\"Ancient Heavenly City fragment!\" Song Shuhang spotted something of interest.","\"Understood!\" White Dragon leaped from his neck and flew toward the fragment of the Heavenly City.","At the same time, Yuan Zi moved.","He easily broke free from the four Tribulation Transcenders and dashed toward the treasure!","At the critical moment, King Kun had chosen to scatter his wealth to save his life by severing his tail!"]},{"number":2485,"title":"Chapter 2485 Karma Comes Full Circle - The White Dragon’s Tale","paragraphs":["Scattering wealth to save one's life is an extremely sophisticated technique in the art of escape.","As long as there's no deep-seated blood feud between the parties, it's not an irreconcilable enmity. At critical moments, using wealth to ensure survival often yields impressive results.","Numerous precious and exotic treasures were ejected, many of which even Immortals would covet. These would definitely slow down the enemy's progress... or at the very least, distract them for a few crucial moments.","A few moments were all King Kun needed to make a getaway!","After all, as a Kun, it possessed the most formidable escape technique in the myriad worlds. When it transformed from Kun to Roc, its physical escape prowess was unmatched!","Just by creating some distance and escaping the spatial lockdown, Immortals could freely use spatial techniques to flee the battlefield and vanish into the myriad worlds, to disappear like a fish into the ocean.","...","King Kun's strategy of scattering wealth was a very sensible choice.","For someone like Song Shuhang, perpetually on the brink of poverty, those countless treasures were absolutely blinding.","Among the shower of exotic treasures, a small white egg gently hopped. Under the cover of these treasures, it successfully breached the defensive barrier of the scholarly faction!","This was King Kun in its current form—faced with Tyrannical Song's unbeatable strike, King Kun had resolutely chosen to 'die' and let its physical body be destroyed by the saber.","At the same time, it secretly used a precious treasure to create a new body from its old, achieving 'rebirth.'","It just hadn't anticipated Tyrannical Song's flashy maneuver, which still managed to expose its new form.","\"For now, I'll abandon my wealth for survival. But when the opportunity arises in the future, once I've regained my strength, I'll definitely reclaim what I've lost!\" King Kun vowed inwardly.","Losing wasn't a concern, but Kun couldn't lose its spirit! Its body could be cowardly, but its demeanor must never be!","Behind it,?White Dragon gracefully gathered the fragments of the ancient Heavenly City.","Meanwhile, as she collected the fragments, White Dragon noticed the hopping little egg. \"Found you, Fellow Daoist King Kun.\"","Pavilion Master Chu shouted, \"Fairy White Scarf, don't let it get away! Capture it!\"","White Dragon was speechless.","\"Too late!\" thought the hopping little egg.","As White Dragon approached to collect the ancient Heavenly City fragments, the egg was already prepared for escape.","Though in the form of a small egg, its essence was concentrated within. Given some time, it could break out of its shell and transform back into a Kun. After that, just a few months would suffice for it to regain its peak condition!","With its escape plan ready, the White Dragon Fairy behind it stood no chance of catching up!","\"I must admit defeat this time! But next time, I will be the victor!\" The little egg of King Kun leaped powerfully into the void.","At the same time, within its shell, it transformed from Kun to Roc while instinctively executing a mighty escape technique famous in the myriad worlds!","Wings made of pure energy materialized on either side of the egg and gave the white egg an adorable look.","The Roc wings flapped and propelled the little white egg into the void.","Its speed was extraordinary!","The little white egg turned into a bolt of white lightning, soaring into the sky in the blink of an eye!","But... the speed wasn't as fast as King Kun had imagined!","\"No, I should be faster, right? I'm supposed to possess one of the swiftest speeds in the myriad worlds!\" King Kun was puzzled.","Though the speed of its wings was quick, this was merely the ultimate speed of a regular Roc. It was far from the godly speed of the myriad worlds' elite!","\"Wait, did I lose something?\" King Kun began to panic.","After being destroyed by Tyrannical Song's saber and resurrected as a little egg, it seemed to have lost something.","Memories? Abilities? Spells?","Not good... Was it the price of using the life-saving treasure that turned Kun into an egg?","Damn it, if using a treasure requires a price, why did it strip away my life-saving escape technique?","This was a total trap.","\"Hey, Fellow Daoist Kun, don't rush off!\" At that moment, White Dragon's voice echoed behind King Kun.","White Dragon too transformed into a bolt of white lightning and chased after King Kun.","At the same time, she waved her little claws to form a 'spatial lockdown' barrier to prevent King Kun from using spatial powers to escape.","This wasn't good; he was about to be caught!","\"Fairy White Dragon, why are you so persistent? If you keep this up, I'll fight back, even at the risk of my life!\" King Kun flapped its wings furiously to widen the gap between itself and the White Dragon Fairy while threatening her.","It was truly desperate and ready to risk everything!","\"If you're up for risking your life, I have no objections~\" White Dragon cheerfully responded. \"In my current state, even if I'm blown to smithereens, I can still be reborn in the body of the Su family's little darling. If you're set on risking your life, I'm ready to explode with you.\"","White Dragon and the virtuous lamia, as pendants, feared no death. As long as Song Shuhang and Su Clan's Sixteen's main bodies were intact, they could recover countless times using the power of virtue of their main bodies. Hence, their outlook was exceptionally optimistic.","King Kun was left speechless.","Its only course of action now was to desperately activate the Roc wings. Simultaneously, it began hastily designing an escape technique, tailored to the wings' characteristics.","As an Immortal, King Kun's knowledge was vast. Creating a bespoke escape technique during the chase wasn't challenging.","Moreover, since White Dragon Fairy's form was a unique 'body of virtue,' there must be a distance limit from her main body.","If it could create enough distance, it would surely shake her off.","A kun and a dragon, in a relentless chase.","Two streaks of white lightning, dazzling across the sky.","\"By the way, Fellow Daoist King Kun, didn't you also chase after our little white bone princess like this last time around the world?\" White Dragon suddenly spoke up from behind.","\"You?\" King Kun's heart fluttered.","\"Let me introduce myself. I'm the ancestral golden dragon of the ancient Heavenly City. Thanks for taking care of our little white bone princess, Fellow Daoist,\" White Dragon said, her voice filled with evident joy and cheerfulness.","\"How's that possible? The Ancestral Golden Dragon is supposed to be golden!\"","\"I faded,\" White Dragon calmly replied while subtly increasing her speed.","King Kun was speechless.","No, if this continued, it would be caught!","It had to resort to its last-ditch effort.","King Kun braced itself and activated its will.","\"Boom\"","Behind White Dragon, at the edge of the spatial lockdown, a space door opened.","Yuan Zi from the scholarly faction appeared.","Yuan Zi's physical body was King Kun's final trump card!"]},{"number":2486,"title":"Chapter 2486 Could It Be Because the Earth Is Round?","paragraphs":["Yuan Zi's body was extremely useful.","During its use, it was crucial to keep Yuan Zi away from Tyrannical Song's pendant fairy, avoiding any unforeseen incidents.","Now, with the considerable distance from Tyrannical Song, there were no more concerns.","\"Come quickly, protect me!\" King Kun urgently commanded Yuan Zi's body.","In truth, the command was redundant. The sliver of King Kun's consciousness inhabiting Yuan Zi's body had already sprung into action.","\"Friends in the sea are as close as neighbors across the world!\" A voice echoed from Yuan Zi's body, originating not from his mouth but from a sound wave within his body, as if he had his own background music.","Yuan Zi, ever nonchalant, retained his easygoing demeanor even in a vegetative state.","However, the poetry emanating from him wasn't a sign of Yuan Zi's consciousness returning, but rather the casting of a spell.","In the next instant, Yuan Zi's body instinctively activated the scholarly faction's top movement technique, World's End Is Near by.","This technique was the ultimate evolution of Song Shuhang's Virtuous Man's Ten Thousand Mile Walk.","Bolstered by the scholarly faction's Heaven's End Is Near, Yuan Zi's body burst forth, astonishingly outpacing the White Dragon Fairy, and made his way to King Kun's egg!","\"Eh? Yuan Zi's body? Looks like Song Shuhang was right on the mark,\" White Dragon mused, her small claws moving cautiously as she observed Yuan Zi.","Clearly, King Kun had utilized some secret method to control Yuan Zi's body—a detail not detected by her or Pavilion Master Chu until now.","It was unclear if Senior White had seen through King Kun's stealthy approach.","\"With Yuan Zi's body involved, capturing King Kun just got tougher,\" White Dragon remarked, somewhat regretfully.","She wasn't in her true form, but rather a manifestation formed by Su Clan's Sixteen's virtue. Her combat strength had limits, and she couldn't unleash the full might of the ancestral golden dragon.","'I'll need Song Shuhang to bring Pavilion Master Chu's hair here, and if possible, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet too. Once I team up with that hair and leverage Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet's suppressive power, capturing King Kun should be feasible.' White Dragon thought to herself, her little claws maneuvering to maintain a distance from both King Kun and Yuan Zi. Simultaneously, she opened the cultivation chat function and sent a private message to Song Shuhang with her request.","Ahead, Yuan Zi extended his hands and embraced King Kun's little egg.","\"Let's move, quickly! Let's increase the distance between us and the White Dragon Fairy. Then, I'll deploy my spatial abilities to escape,\" King Kun urged impatiently.","It could call for assistance, and so could the White Dragon Fairy tailing them!","If Tyrannical Song arrived now, King Kun would have no chance of fleeing.","What troubled King Kun more was the Tyrannical Song clone on Mars, which seemed to have sensed something. Its consciousness was once again projected from Mars, sweeping over the area.","Escape was imperative. King Kun needed to flee the spatial lockdown and leave this plane immediately!","Amidst King Kun's urgent commands, Yuan Zi's body surged with spiritual energy, and the Heaven's End Near Home technique was pushed to its limits!","Poetry faintly echoed from Yuan Zi's body, enhancing his already carefree aura, making his movement even swifter.","On Yuan Zi, handsomeness and practicality were perfectly fused.","With Yuan Zi's unreserved use of World's End Is Near by, the distance between King Kun and the White Dragon began to grow incrementally.","If this continued, Yuan Zi and King Kun would escape the White Dragon's spatial lockdown!","\"Shuhang, tell Chu's hair to speed it up. Teleport to the edge of my spatial lockdown and join me. Don't let this egg escape,\" White Dragon urged.","\"Pavilion Master Chu is recharging her hair right now. White Dragon, hang in there a bit longer! Also, coordinate with Pavilion Master Chu. She's trying to lock onto your location,\" Song Shuhang quickly responded.","Earlier, when executing the Karma Saber Technique with Song Shuhang, Pavilion Master Chu's hair had been completely depleted. Hence, recharging was necessary before she could support White Dragon.","\"Hurry, Yuan Zi's unrestrained use of World's End Is Near by will leave me behind. And the further I am from Little Sixteen, the more disadvantageous it is for me,\" White Dragon replied.","Pavilion Master Chu's hair spoke up, \"Golden Dragon Scarf, I've locked onto your coordinates. Get ready for the merge.\"","White Dragon responded, \"Stop the chatter and come over.\"","\"Eh? Wait a minute... Your position,\" Pavilion Master Chu suddenly interjected, puzzled.","\"What now?\" An irritated White Dragon, seeing King Kun and Yuan Zi nearly vanishing from sight, was met with Chu's hesitation.","\"You seem to be heading towards the scholarly faction? Yes, you're returning to where you started,\" Pavilion Master Chu observed.","The White Dragon was confused.","Returning to the scholarly faction?","She looked ahead. Yuan Zi, clutching King Kun's egg tightly, was surrounded by the echoing sound of poetry. The Heaven's End Is Next Door technique was in full swing and created a haze of white fog around him.","\"Maybe it's because the Earth is round? Big Sister White Dragon, you've circled back to your starting point?\" Song Shuhang speculated.","The White Dragon replied, \"Don't joke around. King Kun wouldn't make such a basic mistake.\"","\"You're here. I see you guys,\" Pavilion Master Chu suddenly announced.","Song Shuhang quickly looked up.","In the next instant, he saw two bolts of lightning in the sky heading towards the scholarly faction.","The leading bolt was Yuan Zi, holding King Kun's egg.","The one trailing was the relentless White Dragon.","They had indeed circled back.","Consequently, Song Shuhang adjusted his posture, sitting firmly in the virtuous lamia's palm.","Simultaneously, King Kun's egg in the air also 'saw' Song Shuhang!","Though lacking eyes on its shell, King Kun's gaze met Song Shuhang's!","\"Turn around, turn around now!\" King Kun's egg internally screamed.","Its focus had been on the White Dragon Fairy behind and the 'Mars Tyrannical Song clone's' distant, scanning consciousness.","Its sole command to Yuan Zi was to flee desperately to escape the White Dragon Fairy's 'spatial lockdown' as swiftly as possible.","Never had it anticipated returning to the scholarly faction in its flight!","This was insanity!","A death wish!","King Kun frantically commanded Yuan Zi.","But at that moment, it realized its commands to 'Yuan Zi' were like a stone sunk in the ocean.","The consciousness it left in Yuan Zi's body was also desperately sending signals and commands... to no avail.","Yuan Zi, holding King Kun's egg, was resolute. Executing the Heaven's End Is Near Home technique with a stylish, handsome 90-degree drift, he landed before Song Shuhang.","To be precise, in front of Fairy Creation, behind Tyrannical Song.","Amid King Kun's despair, deep as a bottomless abyss, Yuan Zi handed the egg to Fairy Creation.","At that moment, Yuan Zi resembled a caring big brother, joyously presenting a found toy to his sister."]},{"number":2487,"title":"Chapter 2487 King Kun, A Senior I Respect","paragraphs":["At that moment, King Kun was utterly disheartened.","The most profound despair in life is this: when you think you still have hope, only to have hope cruelly push you into the abyss of despair. The end of hope is the cruelest kind of despair.","When Fairy Creation took the egg of King Kun from Yuan Zi with a ceremonial flourish, King Kun knew it was all over. Literally, it was done for.","\"Ta-da!\" Fairy Creation joyfully held up the egg of King Kun like an athlete showing off her gold medal to the world.","Across from her, Tribulation Transcender Yuanzi stood expressionless and stunningly handsome, quietly safeguarding Fairy Creation's happiness.","Song Shuhang, propping his chin with his hands, struggled to keep his head up without Fairy Creation's support. It felt like his head might drop off his neck at any moment.","Maintaining his cutesy, chin-propped pose, Song Shuhang looked at King Kun and smiled, \"Those who want to leave will eventually go...\"","\"...and those meant to stay will always find their way back!\" Virtuous Lamia quickly interjected, stealing Song Shuhang's line with impeccable timing.","Fairy Creation, holding the egg, began to sing, \"Ah! Destiny is such a mysterious thing.\"","\"Senior Song, I haven't practiced this line. How should I respond?\" Soft Feather asked in a hushed tone.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","I don't know how to respond either!","Just then, the White Dragon, transformed into a streak of white lightning, made a perfect landing and wrapped around Song Shuhang's neck.","His head nearly took flight!","Song Shuhang did his best to steady his neck and posture while smiling. \"Look, Big Sister White Dragon. King Kun still ended up coming to us.\"","The White Dragon, gazing at the Kun egg in Fairy Creation's hands, sighed. \"If I'd known it would come to us, I wouldn't have chased it so hard.\"","\"Without Golden Scarf Fairy's relentless pursuit, King Kun might've already fled to another plane. So, Golden Scarf Fairy, you've really outdone yourself this time,\" Pavilion Master Chu comforted her.","The White Dragon was at a loss for words.","Nearby, the four Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction stepped forward and captured the stoic, dashing Yuan Zi.","Despite still being unable to detect King Kun inside Yuan Zi's body, the facts were clear that something was amiss.","They needed to take Yuan Zi to the golden lotus world for a thorough treatment.","\"Tyrannical Song, we need to conduct a more comprehensive examination of Yuan Zi. We'll meet in the golden lotus world,\" Second Dumb Zi Wen stated.","\"If my senior brothers need any help, just signal me. With a Cloud Piercing Arrow, I'll come to the ends of the earth!\" Virtuous Snake Beauty responded on behalf of Song Shuhang, quoting a line from an ancient drama.","The scholarly faction's Four Tribulation Transcenders looked up at Song Shuhang.","\"Yeah, that's what I mean,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","With a faint smile, the Four-Tribulation Transcenders led Yuan Zi towards the golden lotus world.","Even while being dragged away by his senior brothers, Yuan Zi maintained his dashing posture. A man handsome to the core doesn't lose his charm, even when carried away.","King Kun was speechless and watched helplessly as Yuan Zi's body was taken away.","\"So, Shuhang, what are you planning to do with this Kun egg?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked, the odd syllable at the end definitely not bubble-related.","\"I've eaten Kun Rocs before,\" the White Dragon nodded, \"but I've never tried a Kun egg.\"","\"Kuns aren't hatched from eggs,\" Scarlet Heaven Sword chimed in helpfully. \"They're born from a fetus, so naturally, there are no Kun eggs.\"","\"That's why this egg is so precious,\" the White Dragon said.","King Kun remained silent, not daring to make a sound.","Song Shuhang stroked his chin, deep in thought.","Honestly, he hadn't figured out what to do with King Kun.","Eating King Kun was obviously out of the question. He lacked the power and the teeth to consume an immortal-level Kun, let alone find an immortal chef who could cook it.","So, what to do with the egg?","\"Would you sell yourself, Senior King Kun?\" Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","The White Dragon was confused.","Pavilion Master Chu was startled.","Both fairies were stunned by Song Shuhang's question.","The Kun egg in Fairy Creation's hands trembled violently.","\"To be honest, I felt an instant connection with you, Senior King Kun. When I first saw you, there was this natural?affinity between us,\" Song Shuhang continued.","\"Don't even think about it. I'd rather die than yield to you,\" King Kun responded firmly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","King Kun, preferring death to submission, was a tough nut to crack.","\"By the way, Fairy Creation, what are you planning to do with King Kun?\" Song Shuhang turned the question over to Fairy Creation, since Yuan Zi had brought the egg back for her as a gift.","After a moment of contemplation, Fairy Creation handed the egg over to Song Shuhang, transferring the responsibility of dealing with King Kun to him.","Had it been during the golden age of the scholarly faction, Fairy Creation might have used her teacher's power to subdue King Kun. But now, she was helpless against the egg.","\"Aren't you going to eat it?\" the White Dragon asked, somewhat disappointed.","\"King Kun is a senior I respect. How could we possibly eat him?\" Song Shuhang asserted righteously.","After that, he opened his cultivation chat friend list.","Since Senior King Kun was unwilling to sell himself for freedom, it was time to repay some debts.","He owed a huge karmic debt due to the recent use of the Karma Blade.","He sent the information about King Kun's egg to Senior White, Senior White Two, Senior Scabbed Dragon, Lady Dragon Lattice, and the Heavenly Emperor, hoping one of them would be interested and help him settle some karma.","He also used the 'Wealth Scattering Throne' imprint to contact Senior Three-Eyed, sending the same information about the Kun egg.","\"Seniors, anyone interested in the Kun egg?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"Ugly, rejected.\" Scabbed Dragon was the first to reply.","\"He doesn't even have an eye. He doesn't meet the requirements for me to take him in as a servant.\" Senior Three-Eyed also replied.","\"Ding ~ The message has been sent, but it has been rejected by the other party. Please try again after 15 days.\" This was the feedback from the Celestial Thearch.","\"No need.\" Lady Dragon Lattice replied. She would politely decline the 'Immortals' of the main world. Not only did the Demon Emperor screw her over back then, but she also didn't want to accept any more Immortals of the main world into the Black Dragon World.","\"I'm busy.\" The busy Senior White took his time to reply to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang looked at the egg.","As an immortal's egg, King Kun simply couldn't be sold!","His gaze fell on the name of the Almighty Merchant on his friend list. Should he reach out to this big shot?"]},{"number":2488,"title":"Chapter 2488 The Plight of the All-Selling Merchant","paragraphs":["If he were the Almighty Merchant, perhaps he would be willing to purchase the King Kun Egg. And surely, it would fetch a handsome price.","However, the thought of selling the King Kun Egg for mere money made him feel as though he was getting the short end of the stick. After all, an Immortal-level kun, if raised properly, would be a treasure beyond measure. The catch was, one needed the means to raise such a kun.","Song Shuhang slipped into deep contemplation, his finger lightly tracing the name of the Almighty Merchant on his list of contacts.","\"What are you up to? What's going on?\" Suddenly, the Almighty Merchant sent a message.","As a top-tier Immortal, the Almighty Merchant sensed Song Shuhang mentioning him from afar.","Moreover, through his link to the cultivation chat friend list, he distinctly felt Song Shuhang's finger stroking his name back and forth.","The Almighty Merchant instantly felt a chill down his spine.","Was Tyrannical Song trying to trick him again?","\"Cough, senior, are you interested in a deal?\" Seeing the Almighty Merchant initiate contact, Song Shuhang seized the opportunity to pitch the Kun King Egg to him.","\"An egg deal!\" The Almighty Merchant sneered. What kind of business could there be between him and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song involving an egg?","\"Yes, yes, yes, senior. It's about the egg business.\" Song Shuhang responded.","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","LCough, it's like this, senior. I have an Immortal-level kun egg in my possession. I wonder if the Almighty Merchant would be interested in acquiring it?\" Song Shuhang quickly added - a little mischief was fine, but he didn't want to blow the deal.","\"Kun egg? Immortal level? King Kun?\" The Almighty Merchant replied swiftly.","\"Yes, exactly.\" Song Shuhang responded.","\"I'm blocking you. Goodbye... No, let's never meet again!\" the Almighty Merchant replied.","Song Shuhang was confused.","On the other side, the Almighty Merchant took out his notebook and recorded Tyrannical Song's name again, this time with a five-star mark.","King Kun was a major client of his!","Moreover, he was a five-star, high-quality customer.","Did you think King Kun amassed all those treasures in his belly by himself?","No, most of those treasures were actually purchased from the Almighty Merchant!","Such a stable, high-quality five-star client had been mocked by Tyrannical Song.","The Almighty Merchant's heart bled.","..","\"Strange, did I offend the Almighty Merchant again?\" Song Shuhang mused, bewildered.","Why did the Almighty Merchant react so strongly to the idea of selling the Kun King Egg?","Wait a second...","Could King Kun be a friend of the Almighty Merchant?","\"I was too careless. Before attempting to sell King Kun, I should have inquired about the relationship between the Almighty Merchant and King Kun.\" Song Shuhang massaged his temples.","He was still too young and often lacked foresight in his dealings.","\"Wait, that's not right either. If King Kun is a friend of the Almighty Merchant, wouldn't he want to buy King Kun instead?\"","Should he reach out to the Almighty Merchant for confirmation?","Or... should he secretly consult with Fairy Can Enter Anything?","As Song Shuhang pondered, Senior White Two responded to his message. \"Eh? A kun?\"","Senior White Two seemed interested in King Kun.","\"Yes, Senior White. It's an Immortal-level kun. After I defeated it, it transformed into an egg. The quality is exceptionally high!\"?Seeing Senior White Two's interest, Song Shuhang hurriedly recommended King Kun to him.","\"Do you plan to use it to pay off your karmic debt?\" Senior White Two asked with a smile.","Song Shuhang honestly replied, \"After all, I have no way to deal with it.\"","\"Alright, I'll take it then.\" Senior White Two responded, \"I'm currently studying beast taming and am curious to see if I can turn this King Kun Egg into something. If I succeed, you'll reap the benefits.\"","\"Great ~ Senior White. I'll send the egg to you right away.\" Song Shuhang laughed.","\"Done.\" He gently tapped the Kun King Egg in his hand.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","\"Stewed?\" the White Dragon asked.","\"No, Senior White Two is interested in the egg. If he successfully tames King Kun, we'll surely benefit.\" Song Shuhang replied.","Beast taming? King Kun scoffed inwardly.","Tyrannical Song's biggest mistake was not killing it. Its essence remained intact. Given a little time, it could regain its peak strength in just a few months!","No matter who Senior White Two was, King Kun planned to return to the sea within months.","As King Kun pondered this, Song Shuhang extended his hand and transferred it into his Inner World. Then, using the Inner World as a gateway, he sent King Kun into the world of the black lotus, where Senior White Two's true form resided.","\"Take care, Senior King Kun,\" Song Shuhang said as the Kun egg was caught by a pair of slender hands.","King Kun's consciousness expanded, eager to see who dared to claim they could tame him. But the next moment, he saw the figure he least wanted to encounter.","More handsome than Yuan Zi, with an even more terrifying and profound strength. This was...","The ruler of the Netherworld?!","\"Senior White Two is the ruler of the Netherworld?\" King Kun's heart churned with shock.","Who in the universe could have foreseen this?!","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was actually allied with the ruler of the Netherworld, and their relationship was evidently close.","Wait a minute.","Hadn't the current Heavenly Dao collapsed? Why was there still a ruler of the Netherworld?","Moreover, King Kun vaguely remembered that the person who had vied with the Scholarly Sage for the Heavenly Dao wasn't this individual!","\"Two? Hehehe.\" Senior White Two chuckled, gripping the egg firmly.","In that moment, King Kun felt true despair.","\"My lord, when did you take an interest in beast taming?\" asked the hamster, puzzled.","\"Not really interested,\" Senior White Two replied while tossing King Kun aside. \"But I've suddenly become intrigued by the study of immortal culinary techniques.\"","\"Oh,\" the hamster said, its mouth watering. \"It should be very delicious.\"","But if Master wasn't interested in beast taming, why did he accept this King Kun egg from Tyrannical Song?","..","On the other side, after handing over King Kun to Senior White Two, one of the karmic traces on Song Shuhang's wrist faded away.","\"I feel much lighter,\" Song Shuhang remarked.","Being free of debt indeed lightens the soul, doesn't it?","Not far away, the black-skinned Soft Feather, Fairy Creation, and the virtuous lamia gathered all the treasures King Kun had scattered to save his life, delivering them to Song Shuhang.","With King Kun's wealth now his, Song Shuhang's assets had reached an unprecedented peak!","\"Let's head back to the world of the golden lotus and check on Yuan Zi's condition,\" Song Shuhang decided, transferring his wealth to his Inner World.","Then, with the three fairies in tow, he ventured into the world of the golden lotus."]},{"number":2489,"title":"Chapter 2489 Madness Indeed!","paragraphs":["\"Wine emboldens the meek, and wealth emboldens the hero.\"","King Kun's desperate act of hrowing his wealth to escape' had yielded not only a variety of treasures but also an abundance of spirit stones, all of the Ninth Stage – not a single one of Rank-8!","It went without saying that Senior King Kun definitely had a mine, and not just one, but several spirit stone mines.","Song Shuhang transferred all the treasures to his Inner World and carefully hid the spirit stones in various places.","Afterward, he boldly began planning how to repair the bracelet of the Sacred Shadow Land. This was something he wouldn't have even dared to contemplate before. But now, with just a small portion of King Kun's treasures and spirit stones, he could restore the Holy Land of Shadow.","A single coin could stump a hero, but sometimes, a hero's valor grows with wealth!","\"Let's go to the world of the golden lotus and see how Daoist Ziwen and the others plan to handle King Kun's consciousness hidden in Yuan Zi's body,\" Song Shuhang declared majestically with a wave of his hand.","Then, the virtuous lamia shrank in size as her hands reached from behind Song Shuhang's ribs to lift the noodle-like weak Song Shuhang and transported him to the Confucian Golden Lotus world.","The heroic spirit that Song Shuhang had just mustered instantly shattered, leaving no trace behind.","After all, not everyone could maintain their suaveness like Yuan Zi, regardless of their state.","..","After entering the world of the golden lotus, the virtuous lamia's flat imperial hat gently swayed, her power of virtue retracting as she exited her empress state.","Pavilion Master Chu suddenly asked in confusion, \"Huh? Where did @#%× Fairy's little feet go to?\"","Before, the virtuous lamia, in her 'flat imperial hat empress mode,' had evolved to have two legs. But once she exited this state, her feet disappeared?","Pavilion Master Chu was quite curious about the state of the virtuous lamia's body – perhaps because she herself was nearing the development of a slender waist, she paid more attention to such changes.","Upon hearing this, Song Shuhang weakly raised his head and attempted to turn and see the virtuous lamia's current form.","But due to his weakened state, he struggled to catch his breath, his head trembling for a long time without any response.","Pavilion Master Chu couldn't bear to watch. She gently lifted Song Shuhang's head. At the same time, she tilted his head back to a nearly 180-degree angle and made his head hang back like a steel helmet.","\"It's breaking, it's breaking. Senior Pavilion Master Chu, it's going to break,\" Song Shuhang protested.","At the same time, Song Shuhang managed to see the virtuous lamia's current appearance. Compared to before... there was no change!","Her waist was wrapped by a pair of wings, and beneath the wings was her long snake tail.","\"Did the evolution fail?\" Song Shuhang asked, puzzled. After so much effort and virtue power, the virtuous lamia had entered a cocooning and evolving stage but still hadn't succeeded?","Hearing this, the virtuous lamia smiled smugly and declared, \"Virtuous Fairy has evolved~\"","The next moment, the tip of her tail started to wiggle.","\"She can change?\" Song Shuhang, Pavilion Master Chu, the White Dragon, Fairy Creation, and the black-skinned Soft Feather all stared curiously at the tip of the virtuous lamia's tail.","\"Like a mermaid,\" Black-skinned Soft Feather suggested. \"Can her tail transform into legs at any time?\"","While they were speaking, the tip of the virtuous lamia's tail had already completed its transformation.","It split!","Originally having only one sharp tail, it had now branched into two!","\"Evolution ~ Super Virtue Fairy!\" the virtuous lamia announced proudly.","Her two sharp tails swayed agilely and performed all sorts of difficult poses. They could even imitate feet and simulate walking.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Madness!","She had evolved by cocooning, but only to develop a forked tail?","\"Hahaha!\" The virtuous lamia let out a string of bell-like laughter as her forked tail flapped. She carried Song Shuhang, who was hanging his head, and traced a beautiful path in the sky above the Confucian golden lotus world.","A lunatic's shining trajectory!","At that moment, Song Shuhang was immensely grateful for the mask on his face... At least it somewhat covered his embarrassment.","After a moment of thought, Black-skinned Soft Feather and the White Dragon exchanged glances and then quietly distanced themselves from Song Shuhang—to avoid their style being influenced by this madness.","...","Elsewhere, in a pavilion designated for hosting guests within the Confucian golden lotus world, a young scholar anxiously asked, \"Gone? How could such a big person just disappear?\"","\"I don't know. The golden-haired girl who fell out of Senior Tyrannical Song's Inner World was sleeping here, but when we turned around, she was gone,\" a Confucian disciple said, clearly upset.","\"I'll immediately ask my father to lock onto her location. You all search the nearby area; maybe the golden-haired girl is wandering around,\" the young scholar said while rubbing his temples.","His name was Su Wenqu, the only son of Senior Eternal Fire. His Daoist name was Jade Sword Scholar, but the outside world often called him by another name: Saber Wielding Scholar.","Su Wenqu stood up and rushed to Venerable Eternal Fire's location. At the same time, he took out his phone and dialed Song Shuhang's number.","After a long wait, Song Shuhang was finally answered.","\"Gu gu ~ Hello ~\" Song Shuhang's voice sounded strained.","Su Wenqu pondered for a moment and said, \"Senior Tyrannical Song... I am Su Wenqu.\"","\"Fellow Daoist Saber Wielding, just call me Shuhang,\" Song Shuhang replied while his voice returned to normal with a laugh.","\"I couldn't possibly, Senior Tyrannical Song, you are...\" Su Wenqu started but then hesitated.","Senior Tyrannical Song was likely a Sage reincarnated!","\"Do you need something?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"It's like this... Before you went out to confront Senior King Kun and that liquid metal ball, an unconscious golden-haired girl fell out of your Inner World. We didn't know her relation to you, so we temporarily placed her in the guest pavilion. But when we turned around, she was gone,\" Su Wenqu explained with a bitter smile.","Before confronting King Kun, Tyrannical Song had left a Sage Seal Wooden Saber in place to maintain an exit to the Inner World, just in case. A blonde girl had fallen out of that exit.","\"Golden-haired girl? Are you sure it's not the black-haired girl Sixteen?\" Song Shuhang asked, confused.","\"Blond hair,\" Su Wenqu confirmed.","\"There's a golden-haired girl in my Inner World?\" Song Shuhang mused while momentarily delving into his memories.","\"Oh my goodness, there really is a little blonde girl. How did she fall out?\" Song Shuhang suddenly remembered the origin of this golden-haired girl.","She was the semi-mechanical blonde girl who had taken his core reactor. After using a resurrection coin, she had fallen into a deep sleep."]},{"number":2490,"title":"Chapter 2490 Reunion with the Ten Thousand Saint Mountain","paragraphs":["In the beginning, the mechanical girl had been forcefully inserted into the core reactor. As the core reactor's level rapidly increased, she was compelled to summon the heavenly tribulation. If she were to face the heavenly tribulation alone, her fate would be sealed.","To save her life, Song Shuhang had handed her a precious resurrection gold coin and urged her to hold onto it tightly, even in death.","Then, at a moment when the heavenly tribulation was distracted, he decisively ended the mechanical girl's life and removed the core reactor from her body to forcefully interrupt the heavenly tribulation.","Unfortunately, the golden-haired mechanical girl, who had clung to the resurrection coin until her demise, did not resurrect within ten seconds or ten days. In other words, in the coin toss of luck with the resurrection gold coin, she had drawn the short straw. It would probably take ten years before she could complete the resurrection process.","If Song Shuhang had been wealthy enough, he could have placed the golden-haired mechanical girl in the Time City to expedite her ten-year resurrection process. However, Song Shuhang did not possess that many spirit stones.","He wished he could split each of his spirit stones into two pieces and use them all efficiently. Of course, he would not squander them on the lavish Time City, which consumed spirit stones voraciously.","Song Shuhang had already prepared himself to welcome the awakening of the golden-haired mechanical girl in ten years.","But today, this golden-haired mechanical girl inexplicably fell out of the Inner World and vanished from the guest pavilion of the scholarly faction.","Had she somehow completed her resurrection prematurely?","Had she experienced some unexpected stroke of luck?","\"Senior Tyrannical Song, I'm enroute to my father's location. I'll enable him to use the authority of the world of the golden lotus to pinpoint the location of that golden-haired girl. Once we have her location, I'll inform you,\" Su Wenqu said.","\"No problem. In truth, I'm also on my way to Senior Eternal Fire's place. We'll catch up later,\" Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","After ending the call with Su Wenqu, Song Shuhang's consciousness delved into his Inner World.","\"Core assistant, where are you?\" Song Shuhang called out.","\"Responding: I'm tallying and marking the locations where you buried the spirit stones.\" The core little assistant appeared alongside Song Shuhang's consciousness and responded with a serious demeanor.","The Inner Assistant was a clone of the Little Assistant Dragon Channel of the Black Dragon World. In addition to overseeing the Inner World, Song Shuhang also managed the Dragon Channel of the Black Dragon World. Therefore, every time it provided serious answers to Song Shuhang's inquiries, the Little Assistant Core would employ the title of Tyrant Dragon Administrator to respond to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Calculating and marking the location of the spirit stones. What exactly are you doing?","\"Um, why did that golden-haired mechanical girl suddenly exit the Inner World?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"Around the time you wielded the Karma Blade, the golden-haired guest awakened and rose from her bed. She made her way to the Inner World exit and eventually tumbled out of it,\" the core assistant disclosed while clutching a booklet.","She was only tasked with managing Song Shuhang's small world, and she refrained from restricting the guests' activities in the small world. Except for a few off-limits areas in the Inner World, she refrained from interfering with the guests' activities.","The golden-haired mechanical girl wasn't a magical or spirit beast. She was free to leave, and the core assistant didn't impede her.","\"During this period, I attempted to greet the blonde guest, but it appears she couldn't see me or hear my voice,\" the core assistant added while closing the booklet in hand.","\"Perhaps it's because she's an ordinary person and can't perceive your presence? In that case, let's close the previous exit,\" Song Shuhang speculated.","His half-daughter, Li Yinzhu, was still in hibernation within the Palace of Winter in the Inner Small World.","\"Execute the order. The temporary exit to the Inner World is now closed,\" the core assistant affirmed.","\"Thank you for your diligence. Also, please keep an eye on Su Clan's Sixteen, Soft Feather, Lady Onion, and the others. If they lose consciousness, inform me,\" Song Shuhang instructed.","The core assistant nodded.","Song Shuhang's consciousness swept over the living spring and confirmed the condition of Su Clan's Sixteen and the others. Satisfied, he departed from the Inner World.","\"We've arrived,\" Pavilion Master Chu, who had been lost in thought, announced.","The virtuous lamia took hold of Song Shuhang, and they descended gracefully from the sky.","Throughout the journey, the disciples of the scholarly faction regarded Senior Tyrannical Song, who appeared as pliable as a noodle, with reverence.","Upon landing, Song Shuhang gently adjusted the mask on his face.","\"Shuhang.\" Senior Eternal Fire waved at him nearby.","\"Senior Eternal Fire, concerning the young girl who emerged from my Inner World, I need you to locate her for me,\" Song Shuhang, supported by Virtue and Fairy Creation, approached Senior Eternal Fire.","\"After receiving Wenqu's message,\" Senior Eternal Fire began, \"I've already utilized my administrative authority to search for that golden-haired girl. However, I couldn't ascertain her location.\"","\"Even you can't pinpoint her location? Has she left the world of the golden lotus?\" Song Shuhang was taken aback.","Senior Eternal Fire possessed the authority to oversee the world of the Golden Lotus. It would be effortless for him to locate someone within it. He merely needed to concentrate his thoughts to lock onto the target.","\"No,\" Senior Eternal Fire shook his head. \"There's no sign of the golden-haired girl departing.\"","\"So, the golden-haired girl is still within the world?\" After contemplating for a moment, the black-skinned Soft Feather inquired, \"Senior Song, besides the Inner World, does the world of the Golden Lotus have connections to other worlds?\"","\"There's also Senior White Two's world of the Black Lotus,\" Song Shuhang replied. \"It is a small world that corresponds to the world of the Golden Lotus. However, the passage between the world of the Black Lotus and the world of the Golden Lotus has been sealed!\"","\"Could she have accidentally wandered into some restricted area of the scholarly faction?\" Pavilion Master Chu speculated.","Since the entire scholarly faction had relocated to the world of the Golden Lotus, some restricted areas had likely been transported there as well.","\"Restricted areas usually have disciples guarding them... Moreover, even if she entered a restricted area, I should have sensed it,\" Senior Eternal Fire furrowed his brow in contemplation.","Unless... it was that place!","\"Holy Mountain.\"","\"Holy Mountain, the Still Pond of Wisdom?\" Song Shuhang questioned.","The Holy Mountain, with its Artifact Spirit capable of performing handstands, and the concealed Still Pond of Wisdom within it... It was the greatest secret concealed within the scholarly faction.","\"Shuhang, please wait for a moment. I'll go confirm it right away,\" Senior Eternal Fire said solemnly.","In the next moment, he disappeared from his position.","\"Let's go and investigate,\" Song Shuhang decided.","The Ten Thousand Saint Mountain was a truly fascinating saint mountain.","He wondered if the thin arm that had been severed during its handstand antics had regenerated."]},{"number":2491,"title":"Chapter 2491 Niu Family’s Law","paragraphs":["The most unique forbidden place within the Confucian faction was the Holy Mountain of Myriad Books, a sacred mountain with its own consciousness. It had existed since the time when the Confucian Sage founded the Confucian faction.","However, prior to last year, while the Mountain of Myriad Books was indeed a forbidden place within the Confucian faction, it wasn't considered the most crucial one. During that period, no one knew what was concealed within the Mountain of Myriad Books, and even the mountain itself was ignorant of its own contents.","But last year, after Profound Sage Tyrannical Song arrived at the Confucian faction for filming purposes, Venerable Eternal Fire relocated the Mountain of Myriad Books to the world of the golden lotus and placed it under tight security. It became the focal point of the faction's restricted areas.","When Song Shuhang was in the world of the Golden Lotus, he was unable to employ his spatial jumping ability. He had to rely on Fairy Virtue and Fairy Creation to assist him in flight, which resulted in relatively slower travel.","Upon finally reaching the vicinity of the Mountain of Myriad Books, he discovered that the mountain had once again performed a somersault.","The massive Mountain of Myriad Books had flipped over, its two bandaged thin arms quivering as it propped itself up, with its hefty legs raised skyward.","From a distance, Song Shuhang could hear the Mountain of Myriad Books' thin arms straining under the weight, and it seemed as though its bandaged arms might snap once more.","However, Senior Eternal Fire was nowhere in sight.","\"Hey there, Mountain of Myriad Books, we meet again,\" Song Shuhang waved at the Mountain of Myriad Books from a distance.","\"I'm going to topple over, I'm going to fall~\" the Mountain of Myriad Books wailed in discomfort.","Standing at a height of 600 to 700 meters, the Mountain of Myriad Books collapsing would be catastrophic. Fortunately, Venerable Eternal Fire had the foresight to place the Mountain of Myriad Books in a spacious area and left ample room for it to 'perform its somersault.'","\"Fear not, I'm here!\" Song Shuhang declared heroically. With his current strength, he could easily withstand the falling Mountain of Myriad Books!","But just as Song Shuhang's heroic spirit surged, he suddenly felt his legs give way... Both Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia, who were beside him, simultaneously released their grasp.","The bold Profound Sage Tyrannical Song fell to the ground like a limp noodle and resembled a beleaguered damsel.","Pavilion Master Chu, who was observing, was rendered speechless.","On the other hand, Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia swiftly moved into action.","Fairy Creation extended her hand and sketched in the air. Diminished versions of scholarly scriptures materialized in her palm and rapidly transformed into a ten-thousand-word essay.","Song Shuhang couldn't help but envy her ability to conjure ten thousand words with a mere gesture. The scholarly disposition and combat style had always been something he admired but couldn't attain. Furthermore, if the power to generate ten thousand words could be utilized for earning spirit stones, it would undoubtedly be an explosive endeavor.","The diminished Confucian texts expanded in mid-air and formed an extensive barrier spanning several hundred meters, blocking the area where the Mountain of Myriad Books was descending.","In this setting, Fairy Creation's abilities seemed to have been bolstered. She displayed greater combat proficiency than her usual state.","Boom!","The Mountain of Myriad Books descended onto the expanse of Scholarly Texts. The barrier exhibited remarkable elasticity and prevented the Mountain of Myriad Books from plummeting further.","Subsequently, the virtuous lamia clasped her hands together and her form ascended higher and higher.","In a matter of seconds, she reached a height equivalent to that of the Mountain of Myriad Books. Her lengthy tail stretched out, its tip forming a forked shape, which provided support for her body.","With determination, the virtuous lamia stepped forward, rolled up her sleeves, and then... she brandished the Virtuous Lightning Tree like a club and delivered a powerful strike to the Mountain of Myriad Books!","\"Ugh! Ugh! Ah!\" The Mountain of Myriad Books flipped back and emitted pained cries.","If one were to slow down the motion, it would reveal the intricacies of the Mountain of Myriad Books nearly collapsing under the blow.","Song Shuhang could only shake his head.","He had assumed that the virtuous lamia had expanded her size to aid the Mountain of Myriad Books, but he hadn't anticipated her resorting to such a violent approach. She hadn't shown her gentle side to the Mountain of Myriad Books.","After the blow, the Mountain of Myriad Books, which had been on the verge of toppling over, was instead forcibly returned to an upright position.","\"The effectiveness of that strike is utterly baffling,\" Black-skinned Soft Feather commented. How should one strike the Mountain of Myriad Books with a cudgel, for it to be as effective as the virtuous lamia's blow?","\"Newton is probably crying in the bathroom by now,\" Song Shuhang concurred.","\"In the cultivation world, the strong do as they please. As long as you possess enough power, you can even reshape the laws of nature!\" Sword's voice faintly resounded.","In the realm of cultivation, one could manipulate the natural laws as long as one had enough strength!","...","...","Boom!","The Mountain of Myriad Books was set aright, and its stout legs landed steadily on the ground. However, its bandaged thin arm had contorted into an awkward position once more, and it appeared to be in agony.","\"Fellow Daoist Mountain of Myriad Books, your arm is twisted,\" Soft Feather reminded him.","\"Ah, I know, little black girl,\" the Mountain of Myriad Books responded while gazing at its twisted arm with a regretful expression.","\"Eh? Mountain of Myriad Books, didn't you want to perform a handstand yourself?\" Song Shuhang inquired, baffled.","The Mountain of Myriad Books shook its twisted arm and retorted, \"Do you think a mountain with bandaged arms would voluntarily attempt a handstand?\"","In reality, ever since its arm had been fractured while attempting a handstand, the Mountain of Myriad Books had been traumatized by the idea of doing handstands.","\"I don't believe ordinary mountains would consider performing a handstand, to begin with. More precisely, regular mountains lack arms,\" Song Shuhang clarified.","The Mountain of Myriad Books was rendered speechless.","This youngster had essentially labeled it as abnormal!","\"By the way, have you seen Senior Eternal Fire and a young blonde girl around the Mountain of Myriad Books?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"The golden-haired girl, yes! I saw the golden-haired girl from a distance,\" the Mountain of Myriad Books replied through clenched teeth. \"My body inexplicably became restless, and an unprecedented urge to display my","abilities surged within me when I spotted that golden-haired girl. Her presence affects my intelligence.\"","The golden-haired girl emitted an intelligence-reducing aura, undoubtedly.","\"It appears that things are heading towards the worst possible scenario,\" Song Shuhang sighed.","From the golden-haired girl falling out of the Inner World, Senior Eternal Fire's inability to pinpoint her location, to her connection with the Mountain of Myriad Books, Song Shuhang felt an unsettling sense of foreboding.","\"Is there something amiss with the girl's background?\" Pavilion Master Chu inquired, perplexed.","\"I'm uncertain... However, even if there is an issue with her, I have methods to counter it,\" Song Shuhang calmly pressed against his original dantian.","Among his seven minor dantians, one had been transformed from the core reactor of the golden-haired girl. Through this, a Ball Shuhang clone had been created.","In essence, the other party's 'nucleus' was in Song Shuhang's possession!"]},{"number":2492,"title":"Chapter 2492 One Step Forward, One Step Back","paragraphs":["And now, this 'core reactor' had already become Song Shuhang's 'little golden core'. No matter what its surname was before, it was now surnamed Song. Song Shuhang's numerous deaths were not in vain. He had great confidence in this regard.","Meanwhile, he silently transformed his Dantian into a smoky mode, then quietly extended his braided palm into his own core reactor, attempting to perform the Nurturing Saber Technique on the 'core reactor' little golden core thirty times in a row.","Confidence was one thing, but having a backup plan was necessary.","Lately, he had been reminding himself to be cautious and not take unnecessary risks. After all, the immortal powerhouses from various realms were watching him. If he wasn't careful enough, he might find himself in a tough spot against those immortal powerhouses.","After silently completing thirty rounds of the Nurturing Saber Technique, Song Shuhang felt... that it had no effect.","After all, the 'core reactor' was now his little golden core, an inseparable part of his body. Using the Nurturing Saber Technique on himself yielded almost no sensation.","White Dragon happened to witness this scene and recorded it for broadcast to Su Clan's Sixteen, Soft Feather, and Lady Onion in the Living Spring.","Someone had too much free time on his hands...","At this moment, the Mountain of Myriad Books, on the other side, had finally managed to straighten its twisted arm. The curve of its twisted arm was slightly less noticeable. Then, it looked at Song Shuhang. \"By the way, do you know that blonde girl?\"","\"I guess I do,\" Song Shuhang replied.","The Mountain of Myriad Books stomped its foot. \"It's good that you know her. Then, this time, you'll have to reimburse me for my arm injury!\"","Song Shuhang was startled","\"If you don't have money, you can pay with your life!\" The virtuous lamia replied in Song Shuhang's place—using Song Shuhang's voice. Clearly, this line was something Tyrannical Song had said before.","\"Actually, I might still have some money, for the time being,\" Song Shuhang said.","Fairy Creation turned her head. \"No, you don't,\" using a soundbite from an online video.","\"Assets = Liabilities + Owner's Equity. You should settle your debts first,\" The Sword reminded him.","\"That's true. I owe Senior White so much money. Before the next wave of microtransactions, I'll figure out a way to clear Senior White's debt,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","This Song Shuhang, who was so financially aware, truly tugged at one's heartstrings.","Indulging in microtransactions was fun for a while, and it was even more fun for an extended period. He couldn't stop.","Who would be the next formidable foe worth Song Shuhang sacrificing King Kun's entire treasure for the pay-to-win attack?","The Mountain of Myriad Books glanced at Song Shuhang and sighed.","\"It seems like you're quite broke,\" the Mountain of Myriad Books remarked.","\"Poor isn't the right word; I'm just constantly short on spirit stones,\" Song Shuhang replied honestly.","\"How pitiable,\" the Mountain of Myriad Books said. \"Forget it, I won't ask you for reimbursement this time.\"","As they conversed, the Mountain of Myriad Books discreetly glanced at the virtuous lamia, who was standing on her snake's tip. She matched its height while wielding the virtuous lightning tree in her hand. It hurt. It even had the ability to discharge electricity from heavenly tribulation and cause its entire body to go numb.","\"By the way, where did that blonde girl go?\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet inquired.","\"She entered my body,\" the Mountain of Myriad Books replied.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet turned to Song Shuhang. \"Then, let's go inside as well. Which entrance should we use?\"","\"Uhh.\" Song Shuhang glanced at the Mountain of Myriad Books. \"If I remember correctly, we have to flip the Mountain of Myriad Books over to get in.\"","The Mountain of Myriad Books, now toppled, revealed the Still Pond of Wisdom.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","The White Dragon was speechless.","\"So, we have to flip it over again?\" Red Heaven Sword asked.","\"Yes,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","Upon receiving Song Shuhang's confirmation, everyone's attention turned to the Mountain of Myriad Books.","Mountain of Myriad Books: Σ(°△°|||)_","Wait, what do you want to do to me?","Don't tell me you want to flip me over again?","\"Calm down. I'm injured now.\" The Mountain of Myriad Books hastily exclaimed. This was deja vu all over again.","It was indeed the same last time. After its arm broke due to a handstand mishap, it had been forcibly planted into the ground by a group of demons.","History was indeed a tape recorder, a vast void. What had happened would happen again in the future. There was nothing new under the sun.","So, as expected... it was better to escape.","Thinking this, the Mountain of Myriad Books raised its thick legs and prepared to flee.","\"Senior Mountain of Myriad Books, no need to panic. This time, we have a large group, so flipping you over won't be so troublesome. I guarantee a smooth process throughout the journey,\" Song Shuhang reassured.","\"I'll do it.\" Pavilion Master Chu offered. She leaped down from Song Shuhang's head and flew toward the Mountain of Myriad Books.","With her strength, she only needed to set up a few levitation and anti-gravity formations on the Mountain of Myriad Books, and then she could forcibly grab the Mountain of Myriad Books and insert it into the ground.","\"I'll help too.\" The White Dragon's body shifted while transforming into a hundred-thousand-foot-tall dragon body that wrapped directly around the Mountain of Myriad Books.","From start to finish, Song Shuhang only needed to sit silently on the side and observe. The pendant on his body could handle the rest of the tasks.","In fact, if he were too lazy to speak, the two fairies, Virtue and Creation, could speak on his behalf. Or, if he removed his mask, he could speak for himself.","\"It's rare that you're not crippled under such circumstances,\" Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet remarked to himself.","\"What?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"It's nothing. You just need to quietly stand on the side and play the handsome guy.\"","Amidst a wave of rumbling sounds, the Mountain of Myriad Books was once again flipped over.","Seeing the Mountain of Myriad Books looking like it had lost all hope, Song Shuhang felt quite embarrassed.","Furthermore, his nickname was 'Stressed by a Mountain of Books,' and he always felt that he was destined to be closely associated with the Mountain of Myriad Books. When the Mountain of Myriad Books was flipped upside down, he suddenly had the illusion that he was also being forced to stand upside down.","Afterwards, he went to ask the various big shots and seniors if there was any way to equip the Mountain of Myriad Books with a pair of strengthened arms. At that time, the Mountain of Myriad Books could do handstands and somersaults whenever it wanted.","Just as he was in deep thought, the Mountain of Myriad Books changed just like last time.","Its body split open to reveal a scroll of the \"Self-Cultivating Prose Poetry of the Sage.\"","This \"Self-Cultivating Prose Poetry of the Sage\" was one of the keys to entering the Still Pond of Wisdom.","Other than this Self-Cultivating Prose, he also needed to master the \"Sage's Health Prose Poetry.\" Only by combining the two essays could he enter the space of the Still Pond of Wisdom in the Holy Mountain.","\"Everyone, return to my body first. I'll bring everyone into the Still Pond of Wisdom.\" Song Shuhang took action and began to write the \"Prose Poetry of the Sage on Health\" from memory.","He had already entered the Still Pond of Wisdom once, so he was very familiar with the process.","As the two Saint's Essays were written, the entrance to the Still Pond of Wisdom opened.","\"Let's go!\" With the help of the two fairies, Song Shuhang flew into the space of the Still Pond of Wisdom.","At the same time, just as Song Shuhang entered the Still Pond of Wisdom, a golden-haired figure came out of the space of the pond.","As they entered and exited, Song Shuhang brushed past her.","Neither of them noticed the other."]},{"number":2493,"title":"Chapter 2493: Don’t Even Think About Blaming Fate!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang smoothly entered the space where the Still Pond of Wisdom was located.","Soon after, he spotted Senior Eternal Fire, who had arrived before him.","At that moment, Senior Eternal Fire was seated in the spot where the Extraordinary Sage had previously been while wearing a stern expression.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Why was Senior Eternal Fire occupying this seat?","He glanced around once more.","However, the golden-haired girl was nowhere to be found.","The Still Pond of Wisdom, which had transformed into the appearance of the Scholarly Sage after biting off a portion of the Heavenly Dao Ball’s existence, was also absent.","The last time Song Shuhang and the others had entered, the true form of the Still Pond of Wisdom had taken on the appearance of the Scholarly Sage while sitting cross-legged there. It had been narrating the extraordinary life of the Scholarly Sage and shouldering the heavy responsibility of the Sage’s inheritance.","Now, this position had been taken by Senior Eternal Fire.","Song Shuhang’s liver couldn’t help but throb in pain—this was a hereditary ailment in his family. His father, Papa Song, had suffered from it as well. It was a genetic condition with no cure.","Whenever one felt that reality had become slim enough, with no further room for thinning... reality would inexplicably shrink further and become even more skeletal.","Song Shuhang continued to touch his liver as Senior Eternal Fire observed him with a serious demeanor.","“Senior Eternal Fire, so, um, where is the Still Pond of Wisdom?” Although he had some suspicions in his mind, Song Shuhang needed to confirm them with Senior Eternal Fire.","At the same time, he mentally instructed the virtuous lamia to exit the space of the Still Pond of Wisdom and return to the Mountain of Myriad Books to search for the golden-haired girl.","If he spotted the golden-haired girl, he would immediately lock onto her and prevent her from leaving the world of the golden lotus within the Scholarly Faction. This world belonged to the Scholarly Faction, and it wouldn’t be so easy for the golden-haired girl to escape!","The virtuous lamia nodded slightly and withdrew from the space of the Still","Pond of Wisdom to search for any traces of the golden-haired girl.","This was a matter of great importance, and she could sense Song Shuhang’s anxious emotions. Therefore, she conducted her mission seriously without any frivolity.","“So, it’s you.” At that moment, Senior Eternal Fire spoke, using a weathered tone. “Unfortunately, you have no connection to inheriting the Sage’s legacy, and your connection with the Scholarly Faction is also fleeting.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Could we please have a regular conversation?","Can we refrain from mentioning my lack of connection with the Scholarly Faction?","Furthermore, Senior Eternal Fire’s tone... Could it be that the Still Pond of Wisdom had possessed him?","Why did the Still Pond of Wisdom merge with Senior Eternal Fire?","What had transpired here before his arrival at the Mountain of Myriad Books?","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","“Yes, due to rather complex reasons, I am currently temporarily using the body of this Scholarly Faction successor to manifest myself,” Senior Eternal Fire explained in his weathered voice.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He reached up to touch his own face. The mask was still in place. Therefore, this was not a form of physiognomy reading, but rather a mind-reading technique that violated privacy laws!","“While I may not understand what’s happening, it’s good that you’re still here, Senior Still Pond of Wisdom,” Song Shuhang remarked while finding some relief from the throbbing in his liver.","The golden-haired girl had ended up in the world of the golden lotus due to his actions. If anything were to happen to the most important entity of the Scholarly Faction, the Still Pond of Wisdom, because of her, Song Shuhang couldn’t fathom how guilty he would feel. Additionally, the Still Pond of Wisdom was an incredibly valuable item, likely beyond his means to compensate for.","“Senior, have you seen a golden-haired girl?” Song Shuhang inquired further.","“She has departed. She reclaimed what was rightfully hers from me and left,” Senior Eternal Fire, currently possessed by the Still Pond of Wisdom, solemnly replied.","“Something that belonged to her?” Song Shuhang’s brain began to work hard. Unfortunately, the aftereffects of the Karma Saber Technique hadn’t completely subsided, and the symptoms of his brain malfunctioning were still in the process of recovery. His brain’s efficiency wasn’t at its peak.","Why was the golden-haired girl connected to the Still Pond of Wisdom? What concealed identity did she possess? And what was the item that rightfully belonged to her?","Song Shuhang pondered and speculated.","Pavilion Master Chu, with her keen senses, detected that Song Shuhang’s cranial temperature had risen.","She gently tapped Song Shuhang’s head and said to the Still Pond of Wisdom, “Fellow Daoist, can you share with us what happened after the golden-haired girl entered here?”","“In simple terms... Not long ago, I suddenly sensed her presence. She, too, sensed my presence. Although we’ve never met before, there’s a kind of affinity between us that began to brew. She attracted me, and I attracted her. In the end, fate brought her to me,” the Still Pond of Wisdom explained.","“I see. In conclusion, it’s your fault,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet commented.","“Don’t even think about shifting the blame onto fate!”","“You’re mistaken. Her arrival in front of me is truly fate! Because my mission has already been fulfilled,” the Still Pond of Wisdom responded solemnly.","The moment the Heavenly Dao collapsed, its mission had come to an end.","If the Heavenly Dao ceased to exist, the portion of existence ‘devoured’ by the Sage from the Heavenly Dao Ball lost its significance.","It no longer needed to remain hidden within the Mountain of Myriad Books. It was free.","Just as it was no longer restricted, fate brought this golden-haired girl to it. This was the guidance of fate.","While the Still Pond of Wisdom spoke of fate, affinity, and mission, a scene suddenly appeared in the hall, projecting itself onto a screen.","In the image:","The golden-haired girl stood in the hall while wearing a confused expression.","Meanwhile, the mighty Sage, transformed from the Still Pond of Wisdom, sat cross-legged in front of her.","“What place is this?” the blonde girl asked. “Am I dead? The shop... Where’s the manager?”","“This is the space within the Mountain of Myriad Books, the Still Pond of Wisdom’s domain,” the Sage, transformed from the Still Pond of Wisdom, replied with a deep voice. “And who are you?”","“I am...”","“I’m here to retrieve my things.” Suddenly, a mechanical voice emanated from her.","Although the blonde girl’s left eye appeared lifelike, it was a mechanical structure.","In fact, most of her body had been subjected to mechanical modifications.","“I want to reclaim the ‘existence’ that the Scholarly Sage took from me.” The golden-haired girl couldn’t help but move closer to the Still Pond of Wisdom’s body.","The Still Pond of Wisdom attempted to resist her, but its resistance was ineffective.","Eventually, the golden-haired girl’s hand successfully touched the Still Pond of Wisdom’s body.","From within the Still Pond of Wisdom, a liquid metal substance was extracted","and merged into the golden-haired girl’s body. Even the physical body of the","Still Pond of Wisdom was plundered.","Not only did she want to take back the existence that had been devoured by the Heavenly Dao Ball, but she also aimed to take the legacy of the Scholarly Sage.","“No, no, I don’t want to be further modified. Shop Manager, save me!” The golden-haired girl cried out.","But she couldn’t stop it.","The Still Pond of Wisdom was powerless.","A few breaths later, just as the Still Pond of Wisdom was about to be completely absorbed...","“Where’s the core? Where’s my core?” The metallic voice suddenly expressed confusion. “I clearly sensed its presence when I woke up.”","After pausing for a few breaths, suddenly, the golden-haired girl turned around and abandoned the Still Pond of Wisdom, which had been sucked dry.","She seemed to have sensed the aura of the core.."]},{"number":2494,"title":"Chapter 2494: This Is Humanity","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As the golden-haired mechanical girl turned and left the Still Pond of Wisdom during the loading process, another figure entered the Still Pond of Wisdom within the mountain.","It was Senior Eternal Fire!","When Senior Eternal Fire entered the Still Pond of Wisdom, he immediately saw the true form of the pond, which had been drained. He hurriedly walked forward and reached out to catch the weakened Still Pond of Wisdom and continuously infused it with his spiritual energy. The Still Pond of Wisdom was a relic of a Sage, and its significance to the scholarly faction was immense. It couldn’t afford to be lost.","The projection ended here.","The subsequent part of the plot should involve Senior Eternal Fire merging with the Still Pond of Wisdom, followed by the scene where Song Shuhang entered with his pendants.","After the projection dissipated, Song Shuhang remained silent.","He recalled how the golden-haired mechanical girl had once shouted, “Store Manager, save me!”","It was clear that she had been fatally stabbed by Song Shuhang the last time they met... Yet, at this critical moment, her first call for help was still directed at Song Shuhang, the restaurant manager.","After the projection dissipated, Senior Eternal Fire, now possessed by the Still Pond of Wisdom, had an awkward expression on his face.","“Sympathy? Fate?” Song Shuhang turned around and looked at it while offering a genuine smile.","Even though the golden-haired mechanical girl had lost an important core, the Still Pond of Wisdom would likely have been completely absorbed if she hadn’t. There would be nothing left, right?","Indeed, it was fate...a cruel fate!","Pavilion Master Chu pondered for a moment and asked, “Is this girl in the projection related to the Heavenly Dao Ball?”","With Song Shuhang’s brain currently experiencing a meltdown, complex questions were left to Pavilion Master Chu to contemplate. She raised essential questions on Song Shuhang’s behalf.","“To be precise, it should be the mechanical part of this girl’s body that is related to the departed Heavenly Dao. Although I don’t know what happened to the mechanical part, it became so weak that it had to attach itself to a human...However, based on my experience, the mechanical parts on that girl’s body are likely at the level of a Dao Artifact.” The Still Pond of Wisdom spoke in a deep voice and used its ancient, majestic voice to restore its image.","“A Dao Artifact.” Song Shuhang raised his head and gazed at the sky.","Song Shuhang had already encountered several Dao Artifacts that other cultivators would never encounter in their entire lives...the big-eyed planet boss, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, the golden-haired mechanical girl, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, considered a semi-Dao Artifact, and the world of the black lotus, golden lotus, and core that exhibited Dao Artifact characteristics.","Pavilion Master Chu Dumb Hair pondered for a moment, then knocked on Song","Shuhang’s shoulder. “Is the core of that golden-haired girl with you?”","“Yes, that’s correct,” Song Shuhang nodded. That strange core reactor had already become one of his small golden cores!","Now, the core reactor had become an inseparable part of his body. It was one of the basic facilities of his cultivation chat talent and an indispensable part of the overall framework of Song Shuhang.","“So, could she have rushed out of the Still Pond of Wisdom to look for you?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet reminded him.","The Still Pond of Wisdom added, “That blonde girl left this space just as the loading bar ended, and Tyrannical Song, you came in. You both entered and left almost simultaneously, without any time gap.”","The White Dragon wrapped her arms around Song Shuhang’s neck and yawned.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Did he have to be in such a hurry?","He had just defeated King Kun and the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, and he was as weak as a mollusk. It didn’t hurt at all.","There was still a break in the action.","“Don’t panic,” Pavilion Master Chu comforted him. “It’s time to use the treasure of King Kun that you concealed in the Inner World. The locations of the spirit stones you buried in batches have already been marked by the core assistant. You only need to think about it, and the core assistant can dig them out instantly, sacrifice them, and convert them into the power of a strike.”","“Are you guys demons?” Song Shuhang widened his eyes.","No wonder the core assistant had marked the places where he had hidden his treasures.","Was it easy for a man to hide some money? Was it easy?","It hadn’t been easy for him to reach the peak of his life and inherit the wealth of Senior King Kun. Was he going to spend it all away?","Moreover...the golden-haired mechanical girl wasn’t a complete entity. She was divided into two parts, the physical body and the mechanical body. With a single blow, the golden-haired mechanical girl’s physical body would definitely die. This was something Song Shuhang didn’t want to see.","After thinking up to this point, Song Shuhang turned his head and looked at Senior Eternal Fire, now possessed by the Still Pond of Wisdom. Other than spending money, did the Still Pond of Wisdom have any other alternatives? If he really had to spend money, would the scholarly faction reimburse him for the expenses?","Seemingly reading Song Shuhang’s thoughts, Senior Eternal Fire, now possessed by the Still Pond of Wisdom, smiled faintly and said, “Dealing with that golden-haired girl, who is the embodiment of a Dao Artifact, is actually not that complicated.”","“Still Pond of Wisdom, please go on,” Song Shuhang quickly sat up.","Fairy Creation and the black-skinned Soft Feather sat in a row with him and pretended to listen attentively.","“It’s very simple. If you want to deal with her, you just need to push her out of the Golden Lotus World and transfer her to the main world,” the Still Pond of Wisdom said slowly.","“Transfer her to the main world?” Song Shuhang had wanted to ask the virtuous lamia to keep her in the Golden Lotus World and prevent her from escaping.","“She retrieved a portion of the Heavenly Dao Sphere that the Sage had devoured from me. However, due to the lack of a core, the Heavenly Dao Sphere that she had retrieved had nowhere to be placed. In this environment where the Heavenly Dao has collapsed, there is only one possibility for her to step into the main world.” the Still Pond of Wisdom performed a double fist pump.","If her core were still intact, she could transfer the existence of the Heavenly Dao Ball into the core and evolve herself into a perfect Dao Artifact.","Unfortunately, she had lost her core.","Song Shuhang sat up straight and asked, “If it explodes, then the golden-haired girl...”","“Of course, she would explode too,” the Still Pond of Wisdom replied.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment, organized his words, and asked, “Although I’m thinking a bit too optimistically...l still want to ask, Senior, is there any clever way to allow the golden-haired girl to survive or give her a chance to ‘resurrect’ and only blow up the part of the Heavenly Dao Ball and the mechanical body?”","“You already know that it’s wishful thinking, yet you still ask?” The Still Pond of Wisdom sneered.","“I’m merely hoping,” Song Shuhang said with a sigh.","“I’m sorry, I’m not human, so I can’t understand your feelings,” the Still Pond of Wisdom replied coldly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“I don’t have a plan that can help you. If you really want to hope, then try it yourself. However, you have to be prepared to pay a huge price. If you don’t pay, you won’t get anything in return,” the Still Pond of Wisdom waved its hand at Song Shuhang to come forward. It seemed that it wanted to pass on something to him.."]},{"number":2495,"title":"Chapter 2495: My Story Isn’t Over Yet!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2495: My Story Isn’t Over Yet!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Is Still Pond of Wisdom going to pass on a legacy to him with this pace?","Even though he didn’t have a chance at the Confucian Sage’s Legacy, there had to be more than just one type of legacy within Still Pond of Wisdom! The Sage had thirteen Transcendent Tribulation experts as his disciples!","The last time he had visited, Still Pond of Wisdom had even given Dao techniques and supernatural abilities to the members of the Nine Provinces","Number One Group who had entered. Song Shuhang’s Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha was one of the four great techniques he had obtained from Still Pond of Wisdom.","This time, Still Pond of Wisdom had mentioned that there was no plan that could assist him, and he could only rely on himself to attempt it. So, if it wanted to pass on an inheritance at this moment... The most likely scenario was a knowledge inheritance!","Song Shuhang was currently craving knowledge.","Therefore, with the support of Fairy Creation, Song Shuhang arrived in front of Senior Eternal Fire, who was possessed by Still Pond of Wisdom.","Senior Eternal Fire extended his hand and gestured for Song Shuhang to sit beneath him.","Fairy Creation blinked her eyes and then arranged Song Shuhang in his position.","The broad palm of Still Pond of Wisdom pressed down on Song Shuhang’s head.","This was indeed an inheritance ceremony!","“Wonderful.” Song Shuhang felt like he had finally overcome all the hardships.","At the same time, Pavilion Master Chu’s hair quickly ran to the head of the White Dragon to avoid affecting Song Shuhang’s inheritance.","The White Dragon stretched out her small claws to scratch the top of her head, but her claws were too short to reach her head due to her shrunken body.","“Ahem.” Senior Eternal Fire, possessed by Still Pond of Wisdom, coughed lightly. Then, he said with a dignified expression, “Tyrannical Song, you want to destroy the Dao artifact left by the Heavenly Dao Ball and also save the golden-haired girl. You need a plan that works perfectly for both scenarios.","Unfortunately, my wisdom isn’t enough to provide you with a feasible plan. But I believe that as long as you are willing to take action and pay the price, there will be a way to achieve both objectives in this world!”","As he spoke, the aura of Still Pond of Wisdom began to rise!","When Song Shuhang heard the words ‘perfect for both scenarios,’ he suddenly recalled the Dual System Virtue Technique that the virtuous lamia had been practicing.","Was Still Pond of Wisdom about to teach him a similar supernatural ability?","“Therefore, here, I can only offer you my best wishes.” The palm of Still Pond of Wisdom pressed down firmly on Song Shuhang’s skull, as if it wanted to use all its strength to press down on Song Shuhang’s head.","“I wish you the best. Everything you do from now on will go smoothly!","“I wish you the best. You will have enough wisdom to achieve both!","“Luck will always be on your side, wisdom will accompany you, and you will find hope in the impossible to turn the impossible into the possible! You will do what ordinary people cannot!","“Go, believe in yourself. You will surpass your limits and surpass yourself!” Still Pond of Wisdom roared loudly, and the veins on its palm bulged.","In the next moment, it waved its hand forcefully... It forcefully slapped Song Shuhang out of the Still Pond of Wisdom’s space.","Outside the Still Pond of Wisdom’s space, beneath the toppled mountain, Song Shuhang floated out with a bewildered look on his face.","Fairy Creation, Black-skinned Soft Feather, and Song Shuhang’s ghost fairy acted together and supported Song Shuhang, who had become as flexible as a noodle.","Pavilion Master Chu used all her strength to jump up from the White Dragon’s head and back to Song Shuhang’s head. “What inheritance did you receive?” she asked.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The White Dragon observed Song Shuhang and then looked at Fairy Creation. She finally confirmed that Song Shuhang was quite talented in using peculiar languages.","“Let’s go. We absolutely cannot allow her to force her way into the main world. Senior Pavilion Master Chu, Sister White Dragon, Fairy Creation, let’s advance at full speed!” Song Shuhang pointed at the 7 0’clock position, where the golden -haired mechanical girl was.","If they allowed the golden-haired mechanical girl to enter the main world now, her body would explode!","The White Dragon shook her body and transformed into a ten-meter-long dragon body. “I’m fast,” she said. “I’ll take you guys flying.”","Pavilion Master Chu Daofou smiled faintly and said gently, “Shuhang, make your preparations. You’ll soon become a true dragon knight. Imperial Dragon Flight.”","As soon as Pavilion Master Chu finished speaking, the White Dragon’s tail curled up and wrapped around Song Shuhang and his pendants and dragged them in the 7 0’clock direction.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Senior Song, have you come up with a plan that can satisfy both sides?” Soft Feather asked in a low voice. At this moment, she, Fairy Creation, and the ghost spirit were tied up by the White Dragon.","“He’s still dazed,” Pavilion Master Chu reminded.","“We’ll cross that bridge when we get there. We’ll act according to the situation. In any case,” Song Shuhang said in a deep voice, “keep her here for now. Don’t let her enter the main world. As long as we keep her here, we can study her mechanical body’s structure thoroughly. Maybe there’s a way to remove the mechanical parts.”","Right, Senior White Two might be interested in the Dao artifact left behind by the Heavenly Dao Ball. He could report this matter to Senior White Two! While they were talking, the White Dragon had already led everyone to where the virtuous lamia and the golden-haired mechanical girl were.","“Is this the end? It’s too soon! My story isn’t over yet!” The metallic voice came from the golden-haired mechanical girl. “It will continue!”","On the other side, the virtuous lamia expressionlessly recited, “My name is Song Shuhang, and I’m a student of Jiangnan University. I’m panicking right now. Today is the last time I’m going to show my divinity in front of others, and it’s also the day I officially become a Profound Sage. These are two very beautiful things. It’s the time for me to reach the peak of my life. But suddenly, the Heavenly Dao exploded.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Why did the virtuous lamia know this line?"]},{"number":2496,"title":"Chapter 2496: Who Are You?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2496: Who Are You?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Clearly, he hadn’t even spoken these lines aloud at that time; they had only crossed his mind in silence.","Wait a minute, perhaps... maybe... was it because he was so shocked that he unintentionally vocalized the lines in his thoughts? Hence, the virtuous lamia recorded them in her lines library?","In any case, the virtuous lamia wasn’t bringing up this dialogue to flaunt a “Tyrant Speech” but to convey a crucial message—the external Heavenly Dao had already collapsed!","The golden-haired mechanical girl had remained within Song Shuhang’s Inner World all along. Upon her emergence, she found herself within the world of the golden lotus of Confucianism and hadn’t been in contact with the outer world. It was highly likely that she was unaware of the current state of the external Heavenly Dao.","The mechanical left eye of the golden-haired mechanical girl cast a cold glance at the virtuous lamia. She didn’t trust her one bit.","Then, she turned her head in the direction from which the White Dragon was approaching. Her mechanical left eye’s pupil constricted as she observed a figure wearing a mask perched on the dragon’s tail.","Despite the mask concealing their face, the figure’s physique and the benevolent aura they exuded seemed oddly familiar.","“Manager! Manager!” The golden-haired mechanical girl exclaimed joyfully. “Manager, I’m here!”","She clung to him like a drowning victim grasping at a lifeline.","In the airspace above, even though Song Shuhang didn’t have a concrete plan in mind, he maintained an appearance of calm assurance. He softly reassured, “Don’t be afraid, I’m here. You’ll be safe.","The golden-haired mechanical girl nodded in happiness, even though it baffled everyone why she would place her trust in someone who had once fatally wounded her.","“Strange aura,” the metallic voice emanating from the golden-haired mechanical girl’s body sounded puzzled. She could faintly sense the presence of the core reactor in Song Shuhang’s body, but upon closer examination, it didn’t seem to be her core reactor. Furthermore, there was no connection between the core and her.","“Trap her... Don’t allow her to escape to the outer world,” Song Shuhang cautioned.","Don’t let her Dao Transformation dissipate.","The virtuous lamia waved her fingers, and golden threads descended from her fingertips, covertly weaving a vast net around the golden-haired mechanical girl. This was the web of virtue.","“Spatial Imprisonment!” The White Dragon extended her small claws and sealed the space in the vicinity. While the world of the golden lotus inherently possessed the power to imprison space, the golden-haired mechanical girl, as a ‘Dao artifact’ carrier, might possess unique abilities to breach the world of the golden lotus. So, precautions had to be taken.","Simultaneously, the White Dragon unfurled her tail to release Song Shuhang and his pendants.","Fairy Creation took a step forward, her hand sweeping to conjure another 10,000-word ‘abridged version of Confucian texts’ to form a circular sealing array around the golden-haired mechanical girl.","Black-skinned Soft Feather silently supported Song Shuhang and gently lowered him from the sky.","“Who are you?” The golden-haired mechanical girl’s mechanical left eye stared at Song Shuhang.","“It’s the manager!” she responded in a girlish voice tro her own question.","As a result, Song Shuhang once again missed a valuable opportunity to recite his lines.","“You have something I want, ” the golden-haired mechanical girl declared. She wasn’t certain if the core within the ‘manager’ was hers, but she was currently lacking a core. So... regardless of its ownership, taking it and making up for her loss was definitely the right move!","Having said that, she suddenly reached out and aimed for Song Shuhang. Her fingers transformed into claws that closed in with force!","Seeing this, Song Shuhang remained unperturbed. Knowing that the core reactor was the heart of the Dao artifact, he had taken precautions to prevent any advantage on her part.","“Skeleton!” Song Shuhang called out lightly and squeezed out the spiritual energy that had recently recovered within his weakened body.","A half-skeleton giant materialized beside him to shield him and Soft Feather at its core.","Subsequently, the half-skeleton supported itself with both hands on the ground and swiftly moved away.","After a considerable distance, the half-skeleton came to a halt and observed the golden-haired mechanical girl from afar.","At the same time, Song Shuhang inspected the status of his golden core reactor.","When the golden-haired mechanical girl reached out and clenched her fist, there was a slight response from the core reactor. However, it was merely a faint reaction that had no further developments.","Moreover, upon closer examination, even that slight response did not seem to be the mechanical girl’s control over the core reactor. Instead, it appeared as if the core reactor had been stimulated and instinctively moved. It was akin to...","the reaction of wanting to devour the other party upon encountering a delectable meal?","Could it be that it wished to consume the existence of the Heavenly Dao Ball?","Better not to risk it.","The Heavenly Dao Ball was enigmatic and unpredictable, and Song Shuhang was unwilling to let its existence enter his small Dantian for fear of any mishaps.","“At present, it seems that the other party is no longer capable of controlling the core reactor merged with me, ” Song Shuhang contemplated while floating within the half-skeleton.","However, he remained cautious. He still had three layers of protection for the core reactor!","“Huh?” The golden-haired mechanical girl attempted to grasp Song Shuhang a few more times, but there was still no response.","Consequently, the golden-haired mechanical girl fell into silence.","Had she malfunctioned?","Meanwhile, on Spirit Butterfly Island across the sea, the Celestial Thearch furrowed her brow. She reached out and firmly suppressed Song Shuhang’s steel clone.","Moments later, a bright smile graced her face.","However, no matter how many backup plans he had, it was futile!","The Heavenly Dao had already collapsed, and the outcome was sealed.","After her laughter, her expression momentarily revealed pain. This was the sensation of death transmitted from her original body, the ghost spirit Soft Feather.","“Are you watching Tyrant Speech, Soft Feather?” the Celestial Thearch quickly surmised the answer.","Naturally, she had watched the speech.","As the ruler of the Heavenly Court, this level of pain meant nothing to her. However, she lacked Song Shuhang’s tolerance for pain. To her, pain was simply pain, and she couldn’t derive any enjoyment from it.","Compared to Senior Song, Soft Feather was even more challenging to handle. The Celestial Thearch rubbed her temples and heaved a long sigh.","“Capture failed, change of plan...” the golden-haired mechanical girl emerged from her silence.","If cunning wouldn’t suffice, then she would resort to brute force!","She will seize it forcefully!","She began to shift her form, and a liquid-metal-like ‘blood’ started to flow through her body. This was the part of the Heavenly Dao Sphere she had retrieved from the Still Pond of Wisdom.","In the blink of an eye, the golden-haired mechanical girl’s body began to melt and transformed entirely into a liquid-metal state as she activated the ‘Liquid","Golden Body Technique.’","Opposite her, Song Shuhang’s body seemed to react to a stimulus and transformed. The Mutated Steel Hands Technique, Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha, and Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique successively appeared, turning his body into a pitch-black metallic form.","Immediately after, he activated the Liquid Golden Body Technique he had just learned.","Song Shuhang’s body also entered the state of liquid metal.","The golden-haired mechanical girl stared at Song Shuhang in confusion.","The liquid Song Shuhang calmly gazed back at her.","“Who exactly are you?” The golden-haired mechanical girl couldn’t help but ask once again.."]},{"number":2497,"title":"Chapter 2497: There’s Nothing That Explosions Can ‘t Solve","paragraphs":["Chapter 2497: There’s Nothing That Explosions Can ‘t Solve","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As the golden-haired mechanical girl posed this question, a strong sense of déj? vu washed over Song Shuhang. Not long ago, the fat ball’s clone had grappled with a similar doubt and ultimately deceived itself into a crippling situation.","Could he now employ his silver tongue to hoodwink the golden-haired mechanical girl before him?","He didn’t need to maintain the ruse for long; his objective was simply to keep her quietly within the scholarly faction for a brief period.","While Song Shuhang pondered, the virtuous lamia suddenly broke into song, “I am who I am, fireworks of different colors","Song Shuhang was taken aback.","“Don’t play around. Let me see if I can hoodwink her.” he transmitted this thought to the virtuous lamia.","However, as he transmitted his thoughts, the virtuous lamia swiftly moved her fingers. The threads of virtue on her fingertips tightened and ensnared the golden-haired mechanical girl securely.","Simultaneously, the White Dragon waved her tiny claws to reinforce the spatial lock.","“Benevolence, righteousness, propriety, wisdom, faith, forgiveness, loyalty, filial piety, fraternal love!” Fairy Creation used her finger like a pen and quickly wrote a ‘weakened version of the scholarly language.’ At the same time, she emitted a clear and delicate cry.","The barrier formed by her Ten Thousand Words Confucian Script was fully activated. Each scholarly word morphed into a binding force that forcefully immobilized the target.","The three fairies acted in unison, and Song Shuhang instantly grasped that the situation was evolving. The golden-haired mechanical girl had inquired, “Who are you?” while likely engaging in some clandestine activity.","“She’s secretly preparing to escape,” Pavilion Master Chu remarked, her tone dazed. “Although she’s profoundly perplexed about your condition and seeks answers from you, her primary objective is to escape from the world of the golden lotus.”","Within the multiple restraints imposed by the three fairies, a complex series of formulas suddenly appeared on the golden-haired mechanical girl’s body. These formulas consisted of various symbols and runes from different languages—Song Shuhang even recognized fragments of ancient languages among them.","The intricate calculations covered the golden-haired mechanical girl’s body.","Some of these calculations concealed hidden laws.","Even at Song Shuhang’s current cultivation level, he felt a slight dizziness. It wasn’t a matter of inadequate spiritual awareness but rather his lack of expertise in cultivation knowledge. He felt overwhelmed, as though an underachieving student were attempting to comprehend the analysis of an exceptionally challenging problem by a top performer.","“She’s calculating the changes in the three fairies’ spells and formations before breaking them,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet commented. “Her processing speed is astonishing. Truly deserving of having once contested the Scholarly Sage as the Heavenly Dao Sphere.”","In any field, computational ability held great significance.","Cultivators couldn’t neglect calculations in battle.","The virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and the White Dragon constantly adjusted their spell frameworks and formation layouts. Meanwhile, the golden-haired mechanical girl engaged in relentless calculations that deciphered changes in the spells and formations based on her computations and systematically undid the constraints on her body.","Though the three fairies and the golden-haired mechanical girl refrained from making overt moves, the data and information standoff between them reached an explosive level. Countless invisible data had already saturated the space between them.","This advanced invisible confrontation surpassed the complexity of direct combat.","Simultaneously, after transforming into liquid metal, the golden-haired mechanical girl fused with the essence of the Heavenly Dao Ball and mobilized a portion of the former Heavenly Dao Ball’s power.","As her fusion progressed, her physical strength surged. The restraints imposed by the virtuous network and spatial lock upon her weakened progressively.","Furthermore, some of her Dao Artifact capabilities were unlocked!","Song Shuhang’s once-sharp mind had long struggled to keep pace with the calculations involved in the showdown between the three fairy maidens and the golden-haired mechanical girl.","“Don’t worry. As your cultivation level rises, your spiritual awareness will strengthen, and your brain will become more adept at handling such intricate calculations. With some tricks under your belt, most cultivators can handle ordinary calculations, formations, and dispelling them,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet consoled him.","“If all else fails, there’s always the method of overpowering skill with sheer might. As long as we give it our all, we can overpower anyone who challenges us. Regardless of their calculations, we can subdue them with a single punch.” Song Shuhang found himself speechless.","At this juncture, Black-skinned Soft Feather inquired, “Between Big Sister White Dragon and the golden-haired mechanical girl, who currently holds the upper hand?”","“They’re evenly matched,” Pavilion Master Chu replied.","The golden-haired mechanical girl contended with three adversaries solo, yet she didn’t seem at a disadvantage.","Calculation was the fat ball’s forte.","At that point, Pavilion Master Chu’s hair began to stand on end and readied herself for the worst. If the golden-haired mechanical girl truly managed to break free of the formation, Pavilion Master Chu would be there to confront her directly.","“Later, we’ll figure out a way to disrupt the golden-haired mechanical girl’s calculations,” Song Shuhang stated, stroking his chin.","Simultaneously, he contacted Senior White Two mentally, “Senior White, do","you have any interest in the Dao weapon left behind by the Heavenly Dao Ball’s","big shot?”","However, this time, Senior White Two didn’t respond.","“Is Senior White preoccupied?”","As the ruler of the Netherworld, Senior White had no shortage of responsibilities.","“Senior Song, how should we disrupt the other party?” Soft Feather inquired.","Song Shuhang opened his eyes and said, “Answer her question. Doesn’t she want to know who I am? Then let’s give her an answer.” “Good idea, ” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet concurred.","“Do you need a sound amplification spell?” The sword inquired.","Pavilion Master Chu was bewildered. “Don’t waste any more time. Give her an answer now.”","Song Shuhang nodded, and his liquefied form began to melt. Then, from a distance, he gazed at the golden-haired mechanical girl and spoke in a deep voice, “Do you want to know who I am?”","Amidst her rapid calculations, the mechanical girl cast a quick glance at Song Shuhang with her left eye.","Under her gaze, Song Shuhang’s body began to assume a rounded form and swiftly transformed into a liquid metal ball.","The mechanical girl was rendered speechless.","“That’s right. Just as you suspected,” Song Shuhang’s voice began to alter. He had once dreamt of the Celestial Thearch, and when the Celestial Thearch was still a fragment of a ghost god, he had been studied by the Heavenly Dao Ball.","Song Shuhang was emulating the voice of the Heavenly Dao Ball.","The Heavenly Dao Ball’s voice bore similarities to the fat ball, but there were subtle differences in tone.","At this moment, the ball of liquid metal, which Song Shuhang had become, flawlessly replicated the temperament and tone of the Heavenly Dao Ball.","“Impossible,” the mechanical girl retorted, but her frigid tone couldn’t conceal the tumultuous emotions roiling within her.","Boom!","Amidst the surge of emotional turbulence, the mechanical girl’s calculations momentarily faltered.","Her liquid metal form suddenly erupted.","The net of virtue, spatial restraint, and scholarly boundaries that ensnared her detonated like explosives.","The multiple explosions caused the entire world to quiver.","This segment of the Confucian Golden Lotus World grew increasingly unstable!"]},{"number":2498,"title":"Chapter 2498: Perhaps... Maybe... I Might Need One","paragraphs":["Chapter 2498: Perhaps... Maybe... I Might Need One","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang was thrown out along with his giant skeleton.","With Song Shuhang, Black-Skinned Soft Feather, and Daoist Stone Tablet within its ribcage, they group tumbled in all directions.","Black-Skinned Soft Feather cried out, “Senior Pavilion Master Chu, this script isn’t right! It never mentioned that interfering with the mechanical girl would cause an explosion.”","“Agreed!” Senior Pavilion Master Chu replied as her hair stood on end due to the shockwave.","In the midst of the explosion, Senior Pavilion Master Chu straightened up like an arrow and shot out like a rocket. She headed straight for the golden-haired mechanical girl at the center of the explosion.","She could sense that the golden-haired mechanical girl hadn’t been destroyed by the explosion. At that moment, how could she let her escape?","If she let the other party escape, where would her and Senior White Dragon’s dignity be?","Swoosh! Senior Pavilion Master Chu pierced into the center of the explosion.","There, the liquid golden body of the golden-haired mechanical girl was rapidly reassembling.","At the same time, a red light burst from her left eye, and a massive set of calculations once again appeared all around her. At that moment, she entered a state of overclocked calculations, and the instant calculation burst she produced was approaching the level it had been when Heavenly Dao Ball was complete.","Ding-","Just at this moment, Senior Pavilion Master Chu expanded and turned into a spear. She impaled the golden-haired mechanical girl in the abdomen and directly nailed her to the ground of the Confucian Lotus World.","From the girl’s abdomen, silver liquid metal flowed out slowly like blood.","The golden-haired mechanical girl paid no attention to the injury to her abdomen. She continued to chant some formulas, and the massive calculation formulas turned into runes that constantly projected onto her body.","The space in the Confucian Lotus World became unstable during the previous explosion.","This was a perfect opportunity.","Furthermore... since she had assimilated a part of the Heavenly Dao Ball’s existence, she naturally inherited its terrifying self-healing ability and tenacious constitution.","Back then, the Heavenly Dao Ball had relied on its selling points of being unkillable, having unlimited stamina, and strong recovery to wear down the Confucian Saints.","The self-healing ability and vitality of the Heavenly Dao Ball at that time were the best in all the heavens and worlds.","The injury to the golden-haired mechanical girl’s abdomen was of no concern; it would heal on its own very quickly.","“Shuhang!” Senior Pavilion Master Chu called out. “Engage her in an information battle!”","“Hey, Senior Chu, you’re on the same wavelength as me.” Song Shuhang, who was standing in the distance, just happened to remove his mask and reveal his full forehead.","On his forehead, the third divine eye had already opened.","The previous calculation battle was too high-level, and Song Shuhang didn’t have the qualifications to participate. But if it was just a pure information battle, he had his own methods!","The light of the third divine eye burst forth and forcibly linked Song Shuhang to the golden-haired mechanical girl.","The next moment, Song Shuhang, who had already prepared for this, forcefully poured a huge amount of garbage data toward the golden-haired mechanical girl.","Since experiencing the sweetness of garbage data injection attacks last time, Song Shuhang had collected and categorized all kinds of giant gossip, daily life of giants on the ‘artificial planet,’ eating, drinking, defecating, useless love experiences, vulgar language, and reproductive knowledge.","At that moment, while taking advantage of the golden-haired mechanical girl’s concentrated mental calculations, Song Shuhang forcefully injected this massive amount of unquantifiable garbage information into her.","“What a dirty move,” his sword sneered.","The golden-haired mechanical girl, who was in the midst of frantic calculations, suddenly grimaced. She was already in an overclocked calculation state. Suddenly being force-fed a huge amount of garbage information was too much.","One bizarre expression after another appeared on her small face.","Raised eyebrows + flaring nostrils + smile + sticking out her tongue...","All kinds of difficult expressions, constantly changing.","At that moment, the golden-haired mechanical girl reached the peak of facial artistry.","“Nicely done!” Senior Pavilion Master Chu praised.","“Ah ah ah ah- I’ The golden-haired mechanical girl clutched her head with all her might, painfully kneeling on the ground.","“Manager, it hurts so much, it hurts-” The voice of the young girl Ling Xiao rang out.","The voice of the little girl was heart-wrenching.","Boom-","Machine oil gushed out from the golden-haired mechanical girl’s body—everything that sprayed out was liquid metal.","“Not good, she might explode,” Black-Skinned Soft Feather said.","Stone Tablet Dao Friend reminded, “Prepare the resurrection magical treasure! ”","“I don’t have any spare resurrection magical treasure in my hand,” Song Shuhang said.","The Senior Pavilion Master Chu Crystal Figurine resurrection magical treasure he had was a ninth-grade special-made magical treasure, which was currently bound to him and couldn’t be directly given to someone else.","“In my original body, I have resurrection gold coins. I’ll transfer the information to my original body. She’s willing to lend Senior Song a gold coin first,” Black-Skinned Soft Feather reminded.","These resurrection gold coins were originally given by Song Shuhang, and she didn’t expect them to come in handy today.","“Ah-” At this moment, the golden-haired mechanical girl suddenly propped herself up with both hands.","The massive data runes surrounding her were pushed aside by her.","The next moment, a pitch-black spatial rift suddenly appeared under her feet—the previously unstable Confucian Lotus World, under the overclocked calculations of the golden-haired mechanical girl, had finally opened a small exit.","At the same time, her body autonomously utilized the special ability of the Dao Artifact: Wall-Breaking.","This was a spatial barrier-breaking function attached to the Dao Artifact when it was complete, and it was now being used by her in conjunction with her frenzied calculations. It successfully opening a small exit in the Confucian Lotus World.","The golden-haired mechanical girl’s body fell out of the Confucian Lotus World and slipped into the real world.","Senior Pavilion Master Chu quickly wrapped her waist to forcibly pull her back.","However, the golden-haired mechanical girl’s waist suddenly turned into liquid and broke in two. She fell into the real world.","Her determination to return to the real world was unshakable.","As long as she returned to the real world, she could use the means left by the Heavenly Dao Ball within the Dao Artifact to merge with the Heavenly Dao and become the true complete Heavenly Dao.","This was her purpose of existence.","“Senior Song!” Black-Skinned Soft Feather called out.","Song Shuhang reached into his core world and two resurrection gold coins appeared in his hand.","Both Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather handed one resurrection gold coin to him.","Daoist Stone Tablet chanted some motivational lines. “Don’t give up until the very end! ”","WIthin the ribcage of the giant skeleton, Song Shuhang charged forward and landed at the exit of the portal opened by the mechanical girl. Then, a liquid Song Shuhang squeezed out from this narrow exit.","The Fate Stone followed closely behind, wriggling out.","After the two of them squeezed out, the narrow exit was automatically closed by the Confucian Lotus World.","The rest of Song Shuhang’s equipment was locked in the Confucian Lotus World.","Outside, in the real world.","The mechanical golden-haired girl stood silently at the spot where Song Shuhang had wielded the Karma Blade and looked up at the sky.","The sky was densely covered with clouds.","The moonlight, shining through the gaps in the clouds, fell on the mechanical girl.","Just like a vampire bathed in sunlight, the mechanical girl’s body began to disintegrate and turned into stardust.","Song Shuhang took on human form and held two resurrection gold coins, but didn’t take any further action. He knew in his heart that a magical treasure of this level couldn’t resurrect the current mechanical girl.","Even if he transferred the Senior Pavilion Master Chu Crystal Figurine permission to the mechanical girl, it would be of no use.","Her current disintegration was because the incomplete Dao Artifact was about to harmonize with the Heavenly Dao. However, because the Heavenly Dao was already gone... she would naturally only dissolve into the Dao.","At this level of dissolution, it was beyond the capabilities of a resurrection magical treasure to bring her back.","“Heavenly Dao, collapse.” A metallic voice sounded from the mechanical girl.","“Manager, am I going to die again?” Ling Xiao looked at Song Shuhang, expectantly asking, “After I die this time, can I come back again like last time?” Her desire for survival was very strong, it had always been strong.","When she first came out of the laboratory, it was because she wanted to live freely. Then, she wanted to see the colorful world outside the laboratory.","So, she wanted to live.","The golden-haired girl looked at Song Shuhang with anticipation and a hint of panic—she hoped Song Shuhang could give her a positive answer, but at the same time, she was afraid of receiving an answer that would make her despair.","“Of course!” Song Shuhang replied.","He gently took off half of his mask, revealing his eyes.","At that moment, his left eye was charred black and empty. However, his right eye was as beautiful as a gemstone. It made people want to collect this glazed gemstone eye.","Behind him, Fairy Creation understood. She stretched out her hand and pressed it on Song Shuhang’s left eye to heal his charred eye socket with a healing technique.","Fairy Creation skillfully placed the Scholarly Sage’s eye into Song Shuhang’s eye socket.","“Just like last time.” The Scholarly Sage’s eye in Song Shuhang’s left eye lit up.","A dazzling light tore through the night sky and landed on the golden-haired mechanical girl.","The golden-haired mechanical girl did not resist and allowed herself to be hit by the dazzling light.","The Impregnating Gaze had no effect on her. After fusing with the existence of the Heavenly Dao Ball, her realm was already immune to Song Shuhang’s Impregnating Gaze.","Moreover, even if the Impregnating Gaze was effective, she had no intention of avoiding it.","Song Shuhang felt a sharp pain in his left eye.","Fairy Creation hurriedly took off the Sage’s eye and pressed it on Song Shuhang’s left eye while continuously casting healing techniques.","“Embryonic Gaze!” Song Shuhang’s right eye lit up, and the second ray of light fell on the golden-haired mechanical girl.","Let’s take a gamble.","Could the combination of the Impregnating Gaze and Embryonic Gaze produce a miracle at this time?","The light of the Embryonic Gaze wrapped around the golden-haired mechanical girl.","A lotus flower tattoo appeared on her body, quickly growing and blooming.","However...This time, there was no fruit in the flower bud.","“Song dumb dumb.” Fairy Creation called out.","“Don’t panic, it’s not over yet.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pressed on his abdomen.","The core reactor in his body, the small golden core, had previously transmitted a craving of delicacies to him.","At that moment, Song Shuhang’s mind moved, and he drew out the power of the core reactor.","On the core reactor, the four-panel comic of the Golden Core Formation, the Star of Creation and Destruction, lit up.","The golden core composition was projected, and Song Shuhang’s golden-haired mechanical girl was wrapped within it.","In the flower bud where the embryo was staring...Some seeds began to condense.","An enormous light bloomed, illuminating the night sky of the scholarly faction as if it was daytime.","After a long time, the huge light dissipated.","The golden-haired mechanical girl had already disappeared without a trace.","Song Shuhang grabbed the mask with one hand and covered half of his face. His remaining right eye revealed a complicated expression.","Fairy Creation muttered, “Song, dumb, stupid?”","“I’m fine, I’m fine.” Song Shuhang replied.","He gently touched his abdomen and had a strange feeling in his heart.","She looked at him with confusion.","“I think... maybe... I might need a pregnancy test?” Song Shuhang said in a hesitant tone.."]},{"number":2499,"title":"Chapter 2499: Today, I’m Still Freaking Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 2499: Today, I’m Still Freaking Out","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Fairy Creation tilted her head, and for a moment, she couldn’t quite grasp what was happening.","A moment later, Fairy Creation was left utterly speechless.","She was so shocked that words failed her. Even if she combed through the entire script library, she couldn’t find a script that fit this peculiar scene.","Another few moments passed. The Golden Core’s composition retracted, and the radiance dissipated entirely. The soft moonlight pierced through the clouds and cast its glow upon Fairy Creation and Song Shuhang.","Fairy Creation still hadn’t recovered from her shock. She might as well have turned pale.","On the other side, Song Shuhang extended his hand and placed it on his abdomen. His partially exposed face displayed a complex expression. The moonlight enveloped him and gave him an indescribable aura of affection.","After another dozen heartbeats or so, a scream sounded.","“No, it’s not mine!” Fairy Creation finally realized while waving her hands frantically. This was her authentic voice! However, at this moment, her melodious tone was tinged with panic.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Fairy, did you misplace your lines’ roles? And what exactly are you panicking about? Are you afraid I’ll hold you accountable?","After a sigh, Song Shuhangs consciousness once again swept across the location of the small golden core’s core reactor.","Just now, after the light enveloped both him and the golden-haired mechanical girl, a cultivation reaction had occurred between the core reactor and the mechanical girl.","Simultaneously, with the assistance of the Impregnating Gaze and Embryonic Gaze, everything that belonged to the mechanical girl had transformed into a seed that was absorbed by the core reactor.","All of this included the mechanical girl herself and Ling Xiao.","Now, inside Song Shuhangs core reactor, an otherworldly baby embryo was taking form. He could faintly sense the auras of the golden-haired mechanical girl and Ling Xiao.","This wasn’t a Nascent Soul Stage Cultivator; this was a bona fide human embryo! There was even an umbilical cord connecting it to Song Shuhangs small dantian.","The only difference between this embryo and a human one was that certain parts of it consisted of metallic mechanical structures.","“What should I do now?” Song Shuhang gazed up at the sky.","My name is Song Shuhang, and I’m currently 18 years old. In two months, I’ll be turning 19.","Just last year, I was a regular student in Jiangnan College Town. Now, I’ve become a professional cultivator.","It’s late at night on January 2nd, 2020.","Yesterday, I was in a complete panic. Today... I’m still in a state of turmoil.","Following the explosion of the Heavenly Dao early yesterday morning, today... I might be pregnant.","A baby embryo is forming within me, and I have absolutely no idea how to handle it.","Although I’ve experienced the process of pregnancy numerous times, I’ve never experienced the real act of giving birth, and I lack any experience whatsoever.","No, that’s not the most important issue here.","The crucial point is that I lack the ability to give birth.","So, what should I do next? I’m awaiting responses online from the bigwigs, and I’m genuinely anxious!","Fairy Creation approached Song Shuhang, extended her delicate hand, and gently patted his head. Finally, she found a fitting phrase in the script library and tried to console him. “A woman is at her most beautiful when she’s pregnant! ”","After a pause, Fairy Creation added in her authentic voice, “The same goes for men!”","Song Shuhang was rendered speechless.","Fairy, you might want to reconsider your comfort strategies. They really don’t suit you.","“Thank you for your comforting words, Fairy, but I feel like what I need right now is a solution.” He sighed while lifting his mask to fully obscure his face, “In any case, let’s return to the world of the Confucian Golden Lotus for now,” he said.","Fairy Creation nodded in agreement.","Then, she suddenly recalled something else and spoke in the voice of Senior Eternal Fire, “Luck will always be by your side, wisdom will accompany you on your journey, and you’ll find hope in the most unlikely places, turning the impossible into the possible! Do what ordinary people can’t!”","This was the blessing bestowed upon Senior Eternal Fire by the Still Pond of Wisdom.","Song Shuhang was taken aback.","Finding hope in the impossible?","Turning the impossible into a possibility?","Doing what ordinary people can’t?","“This feels like a curse,” Song Shuhang asserted.","This had to be the effect of the curse that the Still Pond of Wisdom had placed on him in the end.","Its final blessing was rather poisonous.","“Let’s go. We’ll need to find the Still Pond of Wisdom,” Song Shuhang said in a somber tone. At this moment, he needed someone to share the panic in his heart.","Fairy Creation clenched her fists and chanted, “Holy Boom Boom Pond!” The two of them turned around and prepared to return.","Song Shuhang asked, “Fairy Creation, can you open the entrance to the world of the Golden Lotus?”","Fairy Creation shook her head.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Alliance Army, Aura-2.","“Right, thankfully, I still have the Cultivation Chat function,” Song Shuhang said, extending his hand and opening his friend list. He then accessed the private chat box with Senior Eternal Fire.","He typed a few words. “Senior Eternal Fire, the door is open!’","[Stupid User [Envious Style] Venerable Eternal Fire is currently in a special secret realm and may not be able to receive the message. Please resend it later.]","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","The Still Pond of Wisdom’s space was incredibly unique. It seemed that not even the Cultivation Chat function could penetrate it!","Song Shuhang gazed up at the sky. “Is this why I have such an incompatible relationship with the scholarly faction every time I visit? Perhaps, I’m destined to clash with the scholarly faction?” he pondered aloud.","Fairy Creation, standing by his side, sensed that Song Shuhang was feeling down and a bit irritable. After a moment’s thought, she reached out and retrieved a magical treasure book. Flipping it open to the 33rd page, she handed it to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang lowered his head and read the title: “Pregnant Mom’s Handbook: Pay Attention to Psychological Guidance to Prevent Prenatal","Depression.”","Many young mothers who had just become pregnant tended to have temper issues, which were linked to hormonal changes... During pregnancy, women often lacked a sense of security. This lack of security could lead to suspicion, overthinking, anxiety, and other emotional obstacles...","This would increase the chances of miscarriage.","“l suggest you do something you enjoy and maintain a positive mood. It’s better for the baby,” the book advised.","Song Shuhang raised his head, his face behind the mask reflecting a mixture of emotions.","Fairy Creation clenched her fist, making a ‘cheering’ gesture towards Song","Shuhang.","Maintaining a beautiful mood to reduce the chances of miscarriage!","Song Shuhang let out a deep sigh.","“I don’t even know how to tell everyone the news of my pregnancy... No, I can’t tell the seniors about this,” Song Shuhang said calmly.","With the personalities of the pendant fairies, if they knew that he was pregnant, they would definitely use this topic to strike him hard.","No one could tell anyone about this.","As soon as Song Shuhang finished speaking, the entrance to the world of the Golden Lotus suddenly opened.","The White Dragon, Pavilion Master Chu, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Scarlet Heaven Sword, the virtuous lamia, and the other pendants all looked at him in surprise.."]},{"number":2500,"title":"Chapter 2500: Nourishing The Body","paragraphs":["Chapter 2500: Nourishing The Body","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","From the astonished expressions of the fairies, it was evident that, at the very moment the Core World opened, they had chanced upon the news of Song Shuhangs pregnancy.","Not just them, but the four Tribulation Transcenders of the Confucian faction gazed at Tyrannical Song with their mouths agape in disbelief.","A group of teachers from the Confucian Academy, stationed a bit farther back, also wore faces etched with surprise.","The academy teachers, responsible for educating the disciples of various Confucian academies, were aware of this development. This meant that soon, the entire Confucian faction would be privy to this news!","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","Why had the door to the Confucian Golden Lotus World suddenly opened? Who had opened it? Since Senior Eternal Fire’s messages were blocked, he hadn’t received any updates about the door opening.","At that moment, Song Shuhang wished he had the authority over the Golden Lotus World. If so, he could have immediately closed the entrance to the Confucian Golden Lotus World.","Unfortunately, he lacked such authority... So now, Song Shuhang seriously contemplated whether he should employ the Earth Escape Technique Physics to blast a hole in the ground and jump in.","Behind him, Fairy Creation covered her eyes, unable to witness the unfolding story.","After several moments, the silence was broken.","“Pregnant?” Pavilion Master Chu, with her bewildered look, inquired.","“Shuhang?” the White Dragon added.","“Pregnant?” The virtuous lamia propped open her left eye. “What is filial piety? What is love?”","Sword joined in. “Can you tell me what exactly happened? What’s going on here?”","“Senior Song, did you drink the waters of the Mother-Child River?” Black- skinned Soft Feather asked.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, with his keen vision, spotted the contents of the book in Song Shuhang’s hands – “Pregnant Mothers’ Handbook: Pay Attention to Psychological Counseling, Avoid Prenatal Depression.” Being a stone tablet, he didn’t need eyes to see things; his vision was 360 degrees without blind spots, and he was exceptionally quick to notice details.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet exclaimed in shock, “Prenatal depression already?","That fast?”","Song Shuhang remained silent.","He quietly handed the book back to Fairy Creation and then looked up to the sky.","Song Shuhang was unable to utter a word due to distress.","Behind him, Zi Wen, the second senior brother of the Confucian faction noticed Song Shuhangs reluctance to speak and quickly stepped up to lighten the atmosphere. “Come in first, let’s talk inside. Don’t stand at the door; it’s cold outside. Everyone else, please disperse for now.”","True to his name, Senior Brother Ziwen was warm and considerate. He first dispersed the curious teachers of the Confucian Academy behind him, then welcomed Tyrannical Song into the Golden Lotus World.","This time, Second Senior Brother Zi Wen led Song Shuhang and the fairies into the cave abode where the four of them resided. Yuan Zi, possessed by King Kun, was also sealed in this cave abode at the time.","Fairy Creation, playing the role of a dutiful junior sister, proactively went to brew celestial tea and served everyone present.","Song Shuhang clutched his teacup, his palm pressing against it, greedily drawing in the warmth from the cup.","Pavilion Master Chu, with her hair falling gently back onto her head, asked,","“Do you need me to check your body?”","Pregnancy was a private affair. Therefore, before examining Song Shuhangs body, Chu Daifa sought his consent first.","“Ah,” Song Shuhang replied.","Resigned, his heart began to accept reality.","Avoidance wouldn’t solve the problem. Since everyone was aware of it, it was better to lay the matter out in the open and discuss a solution.","Pavilion Master Chu gently tapped the ground, beginning a thorough scan of Song Shuhangs physical condition and started continuously reporting his physical data.","“No issue with the head, no injuries.","“The energy within has started to recover. The weakened state brought by the Karma Blade is beginning to fade. Also, your spiritual power has been strengthened again? How did you do it?”","The White Dragon speculated, “Could it be due to the Karma Saber Technique?","That slash summoned ten terrifying strands of karmic power. Upon entering Song Shuhangs body, they must have also fortified his physical and spiritual strength, right?”","“No problem with the dantian, ready to advance at any time. By the way,","Shuhang, when do you plan to level up again?” asked Pavilion Master Chu.","Song Shuhang took a sip of tea and sighed. “At least... let’s address the embryo in my stomach first. Otherwise, if I advance with it, I might be judged for group tribulation transcendence’ again.”","Is there any fairy in the cultivation world who has transcended tribulation while pregnant? If so, does a pregnant fairy undergoing tribulation count as one or two people(","“Yes, I found it. There’s an abnormal reaction in the ‘core reactor’ in his fifth dantian,” Pavilion Master Chu announced.","Song Shuhangs fifth dantian was also quite special.","After the ‘little golden cores’ in the other small dantians advanced to the Seventh Stage, they turned into Nascent Souls.","Once the ‘core reactor’ in the fifth dantian became a Nascent Soul, the shell of the ‘core reactor’ remained and sank into the fifth dantian. the ‘core reactor’ remained and sank into the fifth dantian.","At this moment, a small life was developing inside this ‘core reactor.’","This little life was still in the form of an embryo. It looked like an alien from a film – a large head, equally large eyes, and a small body, curled up. The only difference from a normal human embryo was the presence of some mechanical structures within this tiny embryo.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair gently curled, projecting this scene.","“So, the question is, Shuhang, whose child is this?” the White Dragon asked everyone had already guessed upon seeing the mechanical structure on the embryo, but they still needed confirmation from Song Shuhang.","“Just as the seniors thought,” Song Shuhang replied, holding his teacup. “Senior Song, don’t be disheartened. In fact, if you think about it, you should be happy,” Black- skinned Feather comforted him at that moment.","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","“Senior Song, consider this – if you ascend to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage","Realm, you might become sterile. But now, you already have your own child... You don’t have to worry about sterility anymore,” Black- skinned Soft Feather consoled.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","At this point, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet redirected the conversation. “l think Tyrannical Song needs a solution for the fetus.”","“Yes,” Song Shuhang said, energized.","Pavilion Master Chu, perplexed, suggested, “A solution? Why not give birth to it?”","“The problem is, I don’t have that capability,” Song Shuhang reminded her.","“C-section?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“In any case, take good care of your pregnancy for now. Meanwhile, we’ll figure out a solution as you nurture the baby,” the White Dragon suggested, considering Su Clan’s Sixteen’s feelings and willing to think of a way to resolve this issue.","“Senior Song, do you want to nourish your body first?” Black- skinned Soft Feather inquired. Nutrition is crucial for pregnant individuals, right?","Her words sounded like a call to a meal.","As soon as she mentioned it, Song Shuhang felt a pang of hunger in his stomach.","Then, he subconsciously opened his Core World and took out a Ninth Stage spirit stone – a legacy from Senior King Kun.","Under the astonished gazes of Black- skinned Feather, the White Dragon, and Pavilion Master Chu, Song Shuhang bit into the Ninth Stage spirit stone.","With a crunch, the spirit stone was shattered and chewed by Song Shuhang.","The teeth he had honed while eating spirit beast crystals now came in handy once more.","The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Innate Qi Technique’s Defiant Whale Chapter’s supplementary method, the Whale Swallowing Technique, was instinctively executed, instantly digesting the Ninth Stage spirit stone.","After finishing the spirit stone in a few bites, Song Shuhang took out a piece of","Ninth Stage ‘immortal tree’ material.","After pondering for a moment, he stuck out his tongue to taste it. Then, nodding in satisfaction, he bit into it.","His appetite seemed quite hearty.","“Considering this pace of consumption, will King Kun’s treasure last until the day Shuhangs pregnancy ends?” the White Dragon quietly discussed with everyone.","King Kun’s treasure hadn’t been consumed by the Krypton Gold Strike.... But if the current situation continued to develop, would Song Shuhang end up consuming the entire treasure trove?"]}]);
